window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2401,"title":"Chapter 2401: The Emperor’s Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 2401: The Emperor’s Heart","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After killing the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect, Chu Yunfan finally heaved a sigh of relief. For so long, the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect had been giving him a lot of pressure.","Before he advanced to the King Stage, his life was even in danger.","After he became a King, the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect suppressed him all the time.","His strength was even above Chu Yunfan, who had just advanced to the King Stage.","He was also one of the top Kings in the world.","It was impossible for this pressure to be small!","In fact, no one in the current world thought highly of him.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had no other choice but to bury his head in bitter cultivation. Now, he could finally kill him and completely remove this shadow from his head.","He was completely freed from this shadow.","After killing the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect, the Demon Tempering Gourd was no longer under the control of its master. Naturally, it was no longer a match for the Mountain River Diagram.","The Demon Tempering Gourd itself was in a broken state and could not be compared to the Mountain River Diagram.","Naturally, there was no way to trap Chu Yunfan.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already appeared in the Emperor’s tomb again.","He was holding a bronze cauldron in his hand. It had an ancient design, but half of its body was broken, and the remaining half was full of cracks.","Even in such a broken state, it still had a lot of power. It could only be said that an Emperor artifact was indeed impressive.","Chu Yunfan sealed the Demon Tempering Gourd into the Mountain River Diagram, sealing it with countless seals.","Although it was broken, it was still an Emperor artifact. Naturally, it had its own magical aspects.","Suddenly, at this moment, he saw that the Emperor’s tomb was already in a state of chaos.","He discovered that the Emperor’s tomb had become a complete killing formation.","The human king must have activated the killing array buried in the Emperor’s tomb, wanting to kill these King demons.","To be precise, this killing formation almost did not differentiate between friend and foe. As long as one entered it, they would enter the range of the killing formation.","The entire sky of the killing formation was surging with terrifying killing intent.","To be more precise, there was already an astonishing killing array in the Emperor’s tomb. It was destroyed by the blood sacrifice of the demons before, but it had now been revived.","The terrifying killing intent condensed into countless attacks that fell like raindrops.","Some of these murderous attacks turned into divine arts, some turned into martial arts, and some directly manifested a terrifying figure to attack into the distance.","All kinds of killing intent appeared.","Under the attack of this killing intent, even Kings were in a sorry state, let alone half-Kings.","There were Domains dying almost every second, and there were even half-Kings dying from time to time.","Even the Kings were in a sorry state. There was no lack of existences at the fledgling King Stage who were heavily injured because these Kings had also become the main targets of this killing array.","“You guys are crazy!”","In the distance, the number one King of the demons, King Purple-Robe Demon, no longer had the calmness and composure he had at the beginning. It was as if he had been driven crazy and forced to the extreme.","Because in just a short period of time, two King Demons had already been killed by the killing array. Even his body had many injuries.","He wanted to go and save them, but he was stopped by the human king in front of him.","The human king was wearing a Golden Dragon Emperor Robe. He was truly an invincible King. Even King Purple-Robe Demon could not escape from his grasp.","“Even if we are going to be destroyed here, you humans will be destroyed too. Do you think that the marine folks, the Hus, and barbarians outside will let you go?”","King Purple-Robe Demon roared repeatedly. This time, the demons could be said to have sent out all their experts.","Not only the demons, but also the monsters, the Hus, the marine folks, and the barbarians had sent a large number of experts.","The human king was unmoved and only looked at King Purple-Robe Demon coldly.","There were also many wounds on his body, and these wounds were constantly deepening. In the killing formation, there was almost no place to hide. Even the Kings would be injured, but the degree of injury was different.","“That’s not something you should care about!”","The human king continued to shoot out golden dragons. These were the golden dragons of fate of humanity. Only in this way could he severely injure King Purple-Robe Demon.","King Purple-Robe Demon roared as two King demons flew over from afar. The three of them pincered the human king, who was calm and unperturbed as he continued to face the attacks from the others.","Chu Yunfan could see that in the distance, the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia, the old dean of Virtuous Academy, the old cult master of the Great Change Faith, and other top Kings were all engaged in bloody battles.","This battle was a helpless choice for them. However, it was the only way to destroy the demons.","Otherwise, the humans would have no way of resisting the demons.","Of course, this trap was just a trap, but it was also not just a trap. If it was not fake, how could it deceive the demons into coming in?","Demon armies were being annihilated everywhere.","The elite demon army outside had almost died in batches. It looked incomparably terrifying.","Chu Yunfan was also surrounded by countless murderous intents. The Mountain River Cauldron above his head spun, constantly spraying out light to protect him.","“Human, die!”","At this moment, a King demon swept over from afar. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he was instantly furious.","“Get lost!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. Behind him, eight gods appeared and turned into a shocking fist force that tore through the sky. With one punch, the King demon who had just stepped into the fledgling King Stage was smashed into pieces.","They were simply unable to contend against Chu Yunfan. The difference in strength was too great.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even turn his head and flew towards Emperor’s Heart’s tomb.","It was a heart. To be precise, it was a heart that was completely constructed from energy. It was expanding and contracting, as if it was inside someone’s body.","“An Emperor’s Heart!”","Chu Yunfan recognized the heart. This was the reason why the demons were fooled. The Emperor’s Heart could be said to be the essence and core of an Emperor’s cultivation. Only with the Emperor’s Heart could one easily break through and even obtain the power of some Emperors.","Even if King Purple-Robe Demon and the human king were already top-tier Kings, they would have a certain chance of becoming an Emperor if they obtained the Emperor’s Heart.","Although the probability wasn’t high, it was enough to make any King go crazy.","If a King could only be considered a duke, then an Emperor would be a nuclear weapon that could end a long war.","No matter which side had an Emperor, the appearance of an Emperor human, an Emperor demon, an Emperor monster, an Emperor barbarian, an Emperor Hu, or an Emperor marine folk, they would have the strength to rule the world."]},{"number":2402,"title":"Chapter 2402: Sweeping the Way, Caught in a Dilemma","paragraphs":["Chapter 2402: Sweeping the Way, Caught in a Dilemma","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was precisely because of this that the Emperor’s Heart had driven many King demons, including King Purple-Robe Demon, insane.","This was especially true for King Purple-Robe Demon. He was only one step away from becoming Emperor Purple-Robe Demon. If he did not have a special opportunity, he might not be able to cross this step in his entire life.","And now, it was a special opportunity!","No demon could resist such a temptation.","At the same time, in the sky, countless killing intents materialized and began to attack Chu Yunfan. Their numbers were as large as a torrential rain.","Chu Yunfan roared and his body flashed. Although he couldn’t tear the space, the lightning wings on his back flapped and his speed wasn’t slow at all.","However, the closer they got to the Emperor’s Heart, the more intense the battle became.","The closest ones were naturally the human king and King Purple-Robe Demon.","The strength of the two of them could be said to be one against ten. The others could not reach here at all and were each restrained.","“Roar!”","Suddenly, a loud beast roar was heard. A bloody mouth with a sky full of laws was about to devour Chu Yunfan.","It was a King demon. Seeing that Chu Yunfan was not being stopped, he decided to attack.","Many Kings were tied down here, and no one could get close to the Emperor’s Heart.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan’s appearance almost broke the balance.","“Kill them!”","Chu Yunfan was also in a frenzy. His black hair flew in the wind, and his entire body was submerged in golden light as if he was made of gold.","He held the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand and used it as a weapon. He suddenly smashed it down toward the King demon.","“Boom!”","A loud explosion turned into a terrifying tide that exploded in all directions, forming a huge mushroom cloud that quickly rose.","“Ah!”","This King demon was hit, and more than half of his head was smashed.","Although the Mountain River Cauldron was essentially a magic weapon refined by an Alchemy Emperor when he was in the King Stage, after he attained Dao, he had refined it many times.","However, it was almost invincible among the Emperor artifacts. To be precise, it was simply unmatched.","Coupled with Chu Yunfan’s terrifying cultivation, at this moment, he erupted with unimaginable terrifying power.","Almost as soon as the cauldron smashed down, it hit more than half of the King demon’s head.","The King demon was heavily injured and retreated frantically.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let him go? The power of lightning in his hand gathered crazily. In just a moment, it had already turned into a terrifying giant sword that was more than 10,000 feet long.","The giant sword instantly swept across the sky like a bolt of lightning and slashed down.","The King demon wanted to dodge, but its huge body was completely locked by Chu Yunfan. It had no way of escaping from Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Slice!","This King demon was split into two halves in the air. Blood sprayed out, and his divine soul was destroyed. It was impossible to recover.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the King demon in his hand and pulled it into the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan held the terrifying giant sword that was more than 10,000 feet long in his hand. He looked like an ant waving the giant sword. It looked very out of place.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a god who would kill anyone in his way.","As Chu Yunfan advanced, there were King monsters, King demons, King barbarians, and so on who tried to stop him.","Chu Yunfan was in a frenzy. He didn’t even know how many King demons, King monsters, King barbarians, and other terrifying existences he had killed.","He had no other choice but to keep killing. Anyone who dared to stand in his way was killed by him.","Soon, Chu Yunfan arrived near the Emperor’s Heart.","Suddenly, he felt a terrifying aura enveloping him.","In the void, an incomparably huge hand appeared in an instant. This hand was formed by countless demonic laws. It looked dense with demonic energy and grabbed down from the sky, almost wanting to kill Chu Yunfan on the spot.","If he hadn’t become a King yet, even if he had just become a King, he wouldn’t have been able to resist this huge hand. This was a terrifying power that could severely injure him.","If he hadn’t become a King yet, he would have been killed even with the protection of the Mountain River Cauldron.","It wasn’t that the Mountain River Cauldron wasn’t strong enough, but that he himself was too weak. The opponent he was facing was too strong. Even if it was only a hundredth or a thousandth of the power of the Mountain River Cauldron, it was enough to kill him.","However, things were different now. Chu Yunfan’s terrifying giant sword slashed down from the sky.","Boom!","This terrifying sword light split apart in the air and shattered the huge hand.","In an instant, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked!","Chu Yunfan was expressionless. Although he easily took the attack, he knew that this was not the full strength of King Purple-Robe Demon. To be precise, most of King Purple-Robe Demon’s strength was on par with the human king, and it could be said that the ones who attacked him were not even ten percent.","An attack of this level was naturally unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","“In the end, you still appeared!”","When the human king saw Chu Yunfan, he had a complicated expression.","“What do you know?” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“I know. He went to kill you. Now that you’ve appeared, it’s obvious that he’s already dead!” the human king said with some emotion. “There will be a battle between the two of you sooner or later, and only one of you will survive. I knew this long ago!”","“He has been fighting with me for many years. Although I don’t agree with what he did, I won’t help you either. Similarly, you are the future of the humans that I think highly of. Even if I don’t help you, I won’t help him either!” The human king sighed. “I really hope that the two of you can stand side by side and face the catastrophe of the humans together. However, I know that it’s my own wishful thinking. Therefore, I can only let the two of you decide the winner. No matter who wins or loses, I won’t pursue it!”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he finally understood that the human king had seen the grudge between him and the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","On the contrary, the human king saw all of this, but due to various reasons, he could not make a choice.","The grudge between the two of them had already reached a point where even the human king could not reconcile it.","The old sect leader of the Destiny Sect couldn’t let him grow up and become a fatal threat to the Destiny Sect in the future.","And Chu Yunfan would not surrender and be killed. There would be a battle between the two sides sooner or later. If it was not today, it would be tomorrow. It was better to take this opportunity to finish them all."]},{"number":2403,"title":"Chapter 2403: Obtaining the Emperor’s Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 2403: Obtaining the Emperor’s Heart","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although the human king was conflicted, in the end, he chose to watch from the sidelines and not interfere in the battle between Chu Yunfan and the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect.","It was not appropriate to help either of them. The only choice was to remain neutral!","The human king looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “I was the one who chose to watch from the sidelines. Now, it’s time for you to choose. Are you going to choose to fight for the humans and yourself?”","The human king looked expectant. He was also afraid that Chu Yunfan would become angry at the critical moment and choose to give up, completely killing the hope of the humans’ rise.","Chu Yunfan sighed and said, “Your Majesty, although I can’t accept your method, I can understand it. There’s no doubt that we should kill him first!”","Chu Yunfan was obviously referring to King Purple-Robe Demon. Although he was unhappy, he could understand why the human king had made such a choice.","In fact, the fact that the human king did not choose to help the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect was already biased to a certain extent.","After all, the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect had fought with him for many years, and they had a closer relationship. Chu Yunfan was obviously a new King, and they couldn’t even be called comrades in the past.","However, he wasn’t so clueless as to not know what was important and what was important.","The grudge between him and the old sect leader of the Destiny Sect had nothing to do with the human king.","“Very good!” The human king nodded in relief. He was not wrong about Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, King Purple-Robe Demon kept unleashing terrifying attacks in an attempt to defeat the human king and obtain the Emperor’s Heart.","The conversation between Chu Yunfan and the human king seemed long, but it only lasted for a moment. The speed of communication was naturally very fast.","“You don’t have to worry about me. Go and take the Emperor’s Heart!” the human king said.","“Your Majesty, you should go and take the Emperor’s Heart and end this war completely!” Chu Yunfan pondered for a while and said.","It was undeniable that the Emperor’s Heart was extremely attractive to him. Once he obtained the Emperor’s Heart, his cultivation would be able to break through again in a short period of time. It was even possible for him to break through and become an Emperor.","However, he also knew that if he wanted to rely on the Emperor’s Heart to break through and become an Emperor, there was no hope in the short term.","He hadn’t even cultivated to the peak of the King Stage, let alone an Emperor.","But the human king was different. He had the foundation to break through to the Emperor Stage.","Once the human king reached the Emperor Stage, the invasion of the Demon Realm would be completely over. The Demon Realm would be powerless to resist an Emperor.","Over the years, the Central Plains had regressed greatly from the ancient times.","In ancient times, there had been an endless stream of Emperors, but now, they could no longer be seen in the Central Plains.","But it wasn’t just the Central Plains that had fallen back. The Demon Realm was the same. In ancient times, the Emperors of the Central Plains had led armies to attack it, and those who had the hope of becoming Emperors had long since been killed.","In all these years, the Demon Realm had never produced a single Emperor. Otherwise, they would have invaded the Central Plains long ago.","It was impossible to wait until now.","Therefore, to a certain extent, whoever could reach the Emperor Stage would determine which side would obtain absolute victory.","“It’s useless!” The human king shook his head. “The Emperor’s Heart is incomplete. Do you think I would be so arrogant to leave the Emperor’s Heart intact for King Purple-Robe Demon?”","“It’s incomplete, so although I’ve known about the existence of this Emperor’s Tomb many years ago and even entered it, I didn’t take the Emperor’s Heart away. Although it’s useful to me now, it’s not enough for me to have the absolute strength to defeat King Purple-Robe Demon!” the human king said frankly.","This time, they had planned to use the Emperor’s tomb as a trap to destroy the many King demons. This plan had been in place for a long time, but they had been preparing for it.","The reason for this plan was that the human king had been here a long, long time ago.","“You’re different. If I’m not wrong, you’re at least at the late King Stage!”","“Otherwise, you wouldn’t have been able to kill him. With his cultivation, he’s only one step away from reaching the peak of the King Stage!”","“With the Emperor’s Heart, you can advance to the peak of the King Stage. At that time, there will be two peak Kings among the humans. We will have more confidence to face the other races. Even if I die here, you will be able to suppress the humans and not let the humans become slaves and food for the other races!”","The human king looked at Chu Yunfan seriously. He really saw Chu Yunfan as the future of the humans, an existence with more potential than him. He might even have the hope of becoming the first Emperor in the future.","At that time, it would be the era of the humans’ true revival.","“Besides, can you stop King Purple-Robe Demon?” The human king smiled and said, “This is also the will of the heavens. The heavens allowed you to obtain the Emperor’s Heart!”","“You don’t have to be so wishy-washy anymore. There’s not much time left!” the human king berated.","“I understand. Your Majesty, please help me stop King Purple-Robe Demon!”","Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. He wanted to break through to the peak of the King Stage in one go and become the most powerful existence in the world. At that time, unless an Emperor suddenly appeared, he would be invincible.","“Yes!” The human king nodded.","In an instant, a dragon’s roar came from his body. The golden light shone brightly and transformed into a huge Luck Dragon that directly pounced toward King Purple-Robe Demon.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan flew toward the Emperor’s Heart.","King Purple-Robe Demon didn’t know what Chu Yunfan and the human king had just communicated with their divine wills, but he knew what they were planning.","It was obvious that the two of them had already completed the distribution. The human king would stop him and let Chu Yunfan go and seize the Emperor’s Heart.","“Don’t even think about it. Emperor’s Heart is mine!”","King Purple-Robe Demon roared in rage. In an instant, two figures actually split out from his body.","The two figures instantly attacked Chu Yunfan from both sides.","Each of these two figures was not much different from an ordinary late King.","This was also the ultimate technique of King Purple-Robe Demon. However, every time he transformed into such clones, it would hurt his vitality greatly.","Therefore, unless it was absolutely necessary, he would not use it.","He had originally planned to use it to attack the human king and catch him off guard. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would suddenly appear halfway and try to cut him off from the Emperor’s heart?","Boom!","The attacks of the two clones caught up in an instant and directly blasted the place where Chu Yunfan was into nothingness, causing chaos to appear.","However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already rushed out of the aftershock of the attack. At the critical moment, Chu Yunfan hid in the Mountain River Diagram.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan reached out and grabbed the Emperor’s Heart."]},{"number":2404,"title":"Chapter 2404: Peak of the King Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2404: Peak of the King Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","The moment Chu Yunfan grabbed the Emperor’s Heart, a terrifying energy was released from it. The two King Purple-Robe Demons who were chasing after him were instantly sent flying.","Immediately after, the energy turned into a cocoon of light, and the cocoon of light sucked Chu Yunfan into it. In an instant, a cocoon of light that was hundreds of feet tall formed in the air.","“Damn it!”","King Purple-Robe Demon saw that he was a step too late and was instantly furious.","He had already paid such a high price in order to become an Emperor demon. Now that the opportunity had been snatched away by Chu Yunfan, he was furious.","“It’s all your fault!”","King Purple-Robe Demon pointed in the direction of the human king, his eyes filled with killing intent.","As for the human king, he did not move at all. A golden dragon protected his body and roared toward the sky. It grew bigger and bigger, protecting the entire cocoon of light within, preventing King Purple-Robe Demon from touching it.","A terrifying battle erupted once again. Under the rain of killing intent, the two Kings of the two races erupted into an even more terrifying conflict.","In the cocoon of light, Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying energy rush into his body, improving his physical body.","That was the imperial law, the real imperial law, the imperial law that only Emperors could cultivate.","Compared to King path laws, there was a fundamental difference.","A large amount of imperial laws contained more origin power than King laws, and it was gradually improving Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan’s physical body was improving at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan could feel that he was improving at an astonishing speed.","Suddenly, he felt endless memories and comprehension of the Great Dao surging into his mind like a flood.","In that instant, even with Chu Yunfan’s highly developed brain, he felt like he was going to turn into an idiot.","Immediately, Chu Yunfan hurriedly circulated the Emperor Method. At the same time, the godhead in his mind began to crazily absorb the insights of these Great Daos.","He transformed these insights and integrated them into his Great Dao.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan deeply felt how profound the Great Dao of an Emperor was.","Just like the Alchemy Emperor’s Great Dao, Chu Yunfan only had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. Many of the Imperial Dao’s laws were still at a stage where he only knew how they were, but he did not know why they existed.","Otherwise, he could directly ascend in broad daylight.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, it could save him a lot of comprehension effort. But if his own strength could not reach it, then he could not reach it.","There was no way to take shortcuts.","However, it was different now. This huge, unconscious enlightenment directly poured into Chu Yunfan’s mind. Although many of them were broken, it was enough for Chu Yunfan.","If someone could see Chu Yunfan’s current state, they would be able to see that Chu Yunfan was currently in a state of transformation.","Almost every cell in his body was boiling, and there was a powerful energy pushing his transformation.","After an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan felt that he had completely absorbed these insights.","Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes. In his eyes, there were powerful stars that were born and destroyed, just like the real universe.","“What a pity, I’m still one step away!”","Chu Yunfan sighed.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had already broken through to the peak of the King Stage.","This wasn’t difficult in itself. Cultivation from the Domain Stage was completely dependent on one’s comprehension of the Great Dao. The deeper one’s comprehension, the deeper one’s cultivation would naturally be.","This was why Alchemy Emperor could rely on Alchemy Dao to vindicate Dao. As long as his comprehension of Great Dao and cultivation level kept improving, then there would not be any hidden dangers in the improvement of his cultivation strength.","Being able to directly vindicate dao with alchemy was the best proof.","This time, Chu Yunfan had absorbed the Emperor comprehension, and his comprehension of the Great Dao could be said to have improved drastically. It was only natural for him to break through to the peak of the King Stage.","In addition to the energy contained within the Emperor’s Heart, all breakthroughs were carried out unknowingly.","However, just as the human king had said, the Emperor’s Heart was flawed and could not help people break through to the King Stage.","Many of the most crucial steps were missing. More importantly, the energy contained in it had been weakened to a shocking level after countless years. There was no way for him to break through to the Emperor Stage.","However, even so, Chu Yunfan was already very satisfied. He had originally estimated that it would take some time for him to advance to the peak of the King Stage.","Not all Kings could advance to the peak of the King Stage. In the vast human race, there was only one peak King.","The others, including the old sect leader of Destiny Sect, were all at the late Kings. They could not really push their cultivation to the peak of the King Stage.","The peak of the King Stage was the realm of cultivating the King Stage to the extreme, the realm of perfection.","Now that Chu Yunfan had completed this step with the help of the Emperor’s Heart, there was no doubt that he had gained a lot. If he didn’t have any fortuitous encounters, he would have to waste at least decades.","“It’s time to go out and settle the score!”","Chu Yunfan sneered.","Boom!","In the next moment, the cocoon of light turned into a rain of light that filled the sky.","Only then did Chu Yunfan see that he was protected by a golden dragon. At the same time, many Kings were crazily attacking the golden dragon, trying to break through it.","At the same time, the human king was also resisting the crazy attacks of the various Kings.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan saw the old sect leader of the Great Change Faith bleeding. His body was blown up in the air.","Several other imperial family members were also dead. Chu Yunfan saw their corpses floating in the air. They had been killed.","In this battle, the humans suffered heavy losses. Even the remaining people suffered heavy losses.","Of course, the other races’ Kings also suffered great losses. However, they all attacked the humans crazily in an attempt to break out of the cage, which increased the number of casualties.","Especially the Kings of the demons!","Chu Yunfan saw King Purple-Robe Demon pierce through the human king’s chest with his spear.","The human king’s protective golden dragon had already been used to protect Chu Yunfan. At this moment, under the siege of the group of Kings, it was heavily injured.","Chu Yunfan started seeing red. Although the human king was protecting the future of the humans, Chu Yunfan was touched that he could do this.","“You guys are courting death!”"]},{"number":2405,"title":"Chapter 2405: Slaughter, Invincibility","paragraphs":["Chapter 2405: Slaughter, Invincibility","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Chu Yunfan saw the human king being pierced through by the spear, his eyes instantly turned bloodshot, and endless power of disaster surged within them.","In the distance, a King demon who was attacking the human king suddenly felt a terrifying power tearing at his body.","It was as if all the disasters had erupted in his body in an instant.","“Ah!”","This King demon only had time to scream before his body was torn apart on the spot.","He died instantly!","The Disaster Star Eyes was the supreme divine power of the Calamity Emperor. It instantly killed a King demon in one move. Although it was only a King demon who had just entered the King Stage, the power of this move was still shocking.","“Kill him! I want to refine Emperor’s Heart from his body!” King Purple-Robe Demon roared in anger. With his two clones leading the way, a group of King demons charged forward.","“Just in time!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold. In the next moment, he appeared in front of a King demon in a flash. He clenched his fist and punched out.","Boom!","The earth shook and the mountains shook. Even the Emperor’s tomb seemed to be on the verge of collapsing. One could imagine how shocking this punch was.","This punch pierced through the King demon like a spear sweeping across.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already caught the King demon he had killed and put it into the Mountain River Diagram. Then, a long halberd of the demons appeared in his hand.","The weapon spirit of this halberd instantly erupted.","These magic tools with artifact spirits were very powerful. When they were used at full power, they would not be inferior to the full power of a King.","However, it was useless. Even its original owner could not block Chu Yunfan’s move, so how could it escape from Chu Yunfan’s hands?","Boom!","In the next moment, the weapon spirit of the halberd was erased and refined by Chu Yunfan in an instant.","When one’s cultivation reached this level, it could be said that there was a huge difference.","Chu Yunfan’s current state was almost invincible. It was completely different from before.","After all, he had already stepped into the peak of the King Stage.","“Buzz!”","Chu Yunfan hacked down with his halberd. As the halberd fell, a series of metallic sounds erupted, and terrifying demonic energy raged.","Although he had just been subdued, Chu Yunfan’s strength was too terrifying. The power he displayed was even more shocking than when the halberd was in the hands of the original owner.","Slice!","A King demon was unable to dodge in time and was pierced through by the halberd.","He was directly killed!","Chu Yunfan was expressionless. Even though he had just killed a King, he did not show any signs of emotion. There was only endless killing intent in his eyes.","Kill!","Kill!","Kill!","Only after killing all these King demons did he stop!","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took an instant for the two King Purple-Robe Demons to arrive in front of Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","These two clones had already reached the late King Stage. Even Chu Yunfan would have a headache if he encountered them, but that was the previous Chu Yunfan.","Not the current him.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and an alternate dimension appeared in an instant. He actually absorbed the attacks of the two clones into the alternate dimension.","Then, at the same time, he brandished his halberd. In an instant, it was like a long dragon sweeping through the sky, erupting with eternal light.","Slice!","One of the incarnations was unable to resist in time and was directly slashed into two halves.","Although he had combat strength equivalent to the late King Stage, his defense was not as good as an ordinary late King. They did not even have a reliable King artifact.","This clone was destroyed and turned into a rain of blood. Although it was only a clone, it was not an ordinary clone. It was made of flesh and blood. Otherwise, King Purple-Robe Demon would not have been able to split apart after suffering a great loss in vitality.","The other clone finally showed some horror on his face, feeling how terrifying Chu Yunfan was at this moment.","Rumble!","In an instant, the attacks of the various King demons, including some King monsters, King barbarians, King marine folks, King Hus, and Kings of various races fell on Chu Yunfan like a tide.","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram flew out and spun. It emitted imperial laws and suppressed the surroundings.","Before these attacks could land on Chu Yunfan, they were all neutralized.","These attacks were the ultimate attacks of a King. To resolve them, it would consume a lot of energy each time, but Chu Yunfan could afford to do so now.","In an instant, he had completely recovered.","At this point, Chu Yunfan was only a step away from the Imperial Path. It was not as difficult as before to support these consumption. He had calculated everything.","At this stage, life and death were only a matter of an instant. There was no such thing as a battle of thousands of moves. One move could finish the other party off.","Chu Yunfan slaughtered his way into the crowd of Kings. He went crazy, and the halberd in his hand was like a long dragon as he began to slaughter.","In an instant, he killed the other King Purple-Robe Demon clone.","He was no match for Chu Yunfan at all.","Although the King Purple-Robe Demon clone was impressive, it was not a match for a peak King. At this moment, the King Stage was vividly displayed in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","From afar, Chu Yunfan’s body was covered in golden light. From afar, he looked like a god cast in gold.","However, this god was a god of death, and he launched an endless slaughter.","A single halberd could kill a King.","These Kings had to put in a lot of effort to resist the killing intent of the Emperor’s tomb, but Chu Yunfan had the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, so he didn’t have to worry about this. He could just attack directly.","In comparison, these king tiers had not even used half of his strength, but Chu Yunfan could use more than 100% of his strength. One could imagine that the gap between the two sides would be widened to an even more terrifying level.","Chu Yunfan’s casual attack had turned into a terrifying attack. He could even kill people without using the halberd.","The Eight Astonishing Punches, the Seven Violet Thunder Swords, the Nine Netherworld Stomps, the Flying Celestial Seal, the Calamity Star Eyes, and other absolute arts were used almost at the same time.","Every moment, there would be Kings dying.","Chu Yunfan’s slaughter was much more terrifying than the Emperor’s tomb.","Even the strongest King had no chance of winning against such attacks.","Finally, when Chu Yunfan’s eyes regained their calmness, all the Kings who had rushed over had been killed. All the Kings of the demons, monsters, marine folks, Hus, and barbarians were dead.","In particular, the demons had the most numbers, but they also had the most deaths. All of them were wiped out by Chu Yunfan in one breath.","” You’re courting death! I’m going to kill you!”","King Purple-Robe Demon kicked the human king away and roared angrily. His eyes were red like a bloodthirsty beast."]},{"number":2406,"title":"Chapter 2406: The Great Battle Against King Purple-Robe Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2406: The Great Battle Against King Purple-Robe Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","King Purple-Robe Demon’s eyes were red like an injured beast.","Not far away from him, the human king was already on the verge of death. It was the human king who had helped Chu Yunfan stall King Purple-Robe Demon at the critical moment, allowing Chu Yunfan to successfully kill all the foreign kings.","However, he was already pierced through and could be said to be seriously injured. Even with his strength, he was already injured to the point of being on the verge of death.","He was at the end of his rope!","If King Purple-Robe Demon continued to attack, the human king would only be able to last ten moves before dying at the hands of King Purple-Robe Demon.","However, at this time, King Purple-Robe Demon had already turned his gaze to Chu Yunfan. To be precise, Chu Yunfan had locked his divine will on him after killing those King demons.","He had no choice but to turn around and deal with Chu Yunfan first. Otherwise, not only would he not be able to deal with the human king, but he would also fall into a state of being attacked from both sides.","King Purple-Robe Demon stared at Chu Yunfan. It was this man in front of him who had caused the demons to suffer heavy losses.","This time, the humans suffered heavy losses. In total, other than the Elder Princess who was in seclusion, Chu Yunfan, the human king, the Great Xia Grand Marshal, the old dean of Virtuous Academy, and a King from the royal family, there were only five Kings left. This loss was the greatest in history.","It was also the weakest state the humans had ever been in.","However, the demons suffered even greater losses. Other than King Purple-Robe Demon, all the other King demons who came this time had been killed.","This already accounted for eighty percent of the King demons who had invaded the Central Plains.","Originally, the demons had an overwhelming numerical advantage over the other races, but now, they had been reduced to a certain level and were in danger.","One could imagine how crazy King Purple-Robe Demon would be. The strength of the demons could be said to have been weakened to the most miserable degree in history.","He did not expect that the humans, whom he had originally regarded as a dish that he would eat sooner or later, would erupt with such terrifying strength. Even their race was dragged into the water.","He regretted even more that he had been able to obtain the Emperor’s Heart.","The demons originally had an overwhelming advantage in strength. As long as they fought steadily, it would only be a matter of time before they destroyed the humans and even swallowed the entire Central Plains.","However, they were now crippled.","The more he thought about this, the more he could not suppress the anger in his heart.","“You will definitely die!”","King Purple-Robe Demon held pointed the spear in his hand at Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying pressure sweep over him, like a long spear that was about to pierce through his brain.","This was a true peak King, not an ordinary King!","He was even more terrifying than all the Kings that Chu Yunfan had killed before. There were not many of them in the world.","“Is that so?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “I think the same as you, but the one who will die will definitely not be me, but you!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. The aura on his body erupted, sweeping out like a terrifying divine mountain, suppressing the surroundings.","If it was the previous him, he would have no chance of winning against such a terrifying existence. However, it was different now.","“Die!”","King Purple-Robe Demon immediately attacked, his terrifying demonic spear sweeping across the sky. The demonic energy within this demonic spear was extremely dense. If this spear was stabbed into a large province in the Central Plains, it would probably take less than ten years to completely transform this large province into an environment suitable for the demons to live in.","One could imagine how shocking the demonic energy contained in it was.","The long spear tore through the sky in an instant, destroying the sky in an instant, and then bombarded in front of Chu Yunfan.","King Purple-Robe Demon used all his strength without any hesitation. One could imagine how much he feared Chu Yunfan. It could be said that he had never feared Chu Yunfan before.","Because he could already see that although the breakthrough was unbelievable, Chu Yunfan had actually broken through to the peak of the King Stage and could be on par with him.","Clang!","The spear pierced directly into Chu Yunfan’s body. To be more precise, the attack was blocked by the light screen hanging down from the Mountain River Diagram.","It couldn’t pierce through the thin light curtain at all.","However, Chu Yunfan could still feel how terrifying it was. At that moment, the divine power he used to maintain the Mountain River Diagram was ten times more than when he was attacked by so many Kings.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s divine power recovery rate, he could still feel that in an instant, his divine power had been greatly reduced.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold, and the killing intent in his eyes was strong. The long halberd in his hand swept across the sky and shattered the chaos of the universe. In an instant, it hit King Purple-Robe Demon.","Terrifying divine power surged from King Purple-Robe Demon’s body, and a battle robe actually appeared. It was unknown what material this battle robe was made of, but from afar, it was covered in all kinds of cracks. It was obvious that it had experienced terrifying battles.","And this battle suit actually had the pressure of the imperial path.","“It’s an Emperor artifact!”","Chu Yunfan instantly determined that this was an Emperor artifact. It should be a defensive Emperor artifact, which was ten times more difficult to obtain than an offensive Emperor artifact.","It could even be said to be rare on normal days. With such an artifact in hand, one could almost be said to be invincible.","It was even more troublesome than Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram.","However, Chu Yunfan immediately saw the flaw. This Emperor artifact was already riddled with wounds and seemed to be on the verge of shattering at any moment.","Although Chu Yunfan knew that it wouldn’t break anytime soon, this was undoubtedly an opportunity.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you’re the only one with an Emperor artifact?” King Purple-Robe Demon laughed loudly. The demonic spear in his hand swept through the sky and began to fight with Chu Yunfan again.","This was his greatest trump card. With this trump card, he could fight with a human king who had the Luck Dragon and even injure the human king at all costs.","Even though the human king had the protection of the Luck Dragon, it could only cause a few cracks on his battle armor. It was basically the limit.","After using the Luck Dragon to protect Chu Yunfan, he became even more fragile. The human king couldn’t even destroy his battle armor.","Chu Yunfan’s expression remained unchanged. He held the halberd in his hand and fought with King Purple-Robe Demon.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Terrifying attacks raged. Every moment, Chu Yunfan and King Purple-Robe Demon could exchange tens of thousands of blows. Ordinary people could not see the traces of this exchange at all. Even the Great Xia Grand Commandant and the others could not see it clearly. They could only guess instinctively.","Only the human king could clearly see the fight between the two sides!","Bang!","Just when everyone thought that this battle would last forever, a loud explosion sounded and a figure was sent flying out of the battle.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was none other than King Purple-Robe Demon."]},{"number":2407,"title":"Chapter 2407: I Can Kill You Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 2407: I Can Kill You Too","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","King Purple-Robe Demon was sent flying. His Emperor battle suit was full of cracks, or rather, it had already been shattered. Only a few pieces of it were hanging on his body.","It was very difficult for a King to destroy an Emperor artifact. This was true. Even a peak King might not be able to destroy an Emperor artifact with all their might.","However, the prerequisite for this was that the Emperor artifact was not damaged or the damage was not serious.","For example, the battle armor that King Purple-Robe Demon was wearing was very, very severely damaged.","Therefore, after this series of attacks, it completely collapsed.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t have an Emperor artifact to protect him, he would have been defeated by King Purple-Robe Demon before he could even break through his armor.","This was because it was equivalent to being beaten up on the spot.","Now, both sides were only attacking and not defending. It was obvious who could last until the end.","King Purple-Robe Demon was sent flying backward, blood splattering all over his body. He staggered and was severely injured by Chu Yunfan. The halberd in Chu Yunfan’s hand almost pierced through him.","Even though he managed to dodge the fatal blow, he was still heavily injured.","King Purple-Robe Demon steadied himself. Disbelief flashed across his eyes. Ever since he had mastered his divine technique, it had never been so difficult.","He was invincible in the face of anyone. Even when fighting with a human king, he was never at a disadvantage.","He had even used the opportunity when the human king moved the Luck Dragon to protect Chu Yunfan to severely injure the human king and almost kill him.","It could be said that he had never suffered such a huge loss. As the number one expert of the demons in the Demon Realm, he could almost be said to be an invincible existence in today’s world.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. Above his head, the Mountain River Diagram kept spinning, but Chu Yunfan kept it away.","King Purple-Robe Demon was also stunned. He didn’t know what Chu Yunfan was doing.","“Now that you don’t have an Emperor artifact to protect you, I’ll put away my Emperor artifact. I don’t need an Emperor artifact to kill you!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","King Purple-Robe Demon was furious. He had already understood Chu Yunfan’s intention. He was clearly planning to use him as a whetstone.","Defeating or even killing him in an invincible manner could accumulate his invincible heart.","He would use his invincible heart to accumulate invincible momentum and break through to the Emperor Stage in one breath!","This was what he thought. If he wanted to break through to the Emperor Stage, he had to do this. Who wouldn’t be invincible all the way to the top?","After experiencing defeat, he could still fight despite being defeated. Such people were really too few. They were almost as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Even among the many Supreme Youths, there were not many who had such a breadth of mind and boldness.","King Purple-Robe Demon had planned to use the human king as a whetstone. Who knew that he would turn into a whetstone the moment he turned his head? The difference between them was huge without a doubt.","“You’re too conceited. Without the protection of an Emperor artifact, you’ll definitely die!” King Purple-Robe Demon roared.","Even without an Emperor artifact to protect him, how could he, an old peak-stage King, be inferior to a new peak-stage King like Chu Yunfan?","“I can kill you even without an Emperor artifact!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold, with a hint of indifference.","King Purple-Robe Demon laughed coldly and shouted, “Demons’ Extermination!”.","He roared, and in an instant, the world froze and became still. Terrifying divine power boiled within him, and his body instantly grew several dozen feet tall. Only now did he truly reveal his appearance as a demon. His body was covered in scales, and his face was green with fangs. At a glance, he was completely different from the Divine Spirits of the Central Plains.","In this state, King Purple-Robe Demon’s strength was also increasing at an astonishing speed.","As he chanted an ancient curse, he burned all the blood in his body to its peak.","In the next moment, he was already in front of Chu Yunfan. His terrifying blood boiled like an ocean and flew out, wanting to kill Chu Yunfan.","“You want to kill me? Do you have the ability?”","Chu Yunfan also shouted and slapped down with the Flying Celestial Seal.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s surroundings became a universe. In an instant, countless stars lined up in the sky and earth.","It was as if he was really in a universe. It was impossible to tell that this was just the martial will that Chu Yunfan had evolved.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan directly collided with King Purple-Robe Demon.","The two sides were like two colliding planets. In an instant, the world was destroyed. The terrifying collision even caused the entire Emperor’s tomb to tremble.","Spurt!","King Purple-Robe Demon coughed up blood again, falling into a disadvantage in the collision.","He couldn’t believe it at all. How could he be at a complete disadvantage in a collision of the same stage? This was something that even a human king couldn’t do.","What he didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had several emperor physiques at the same time. Every time he advanced, it was more difficult than ordinary people, but he was also much stronger than ordinary people.","He was completely indignant. Who was Chu Yunfan?","When he first met Chu Yunfan, he didn’t take him seriously at all.","Chu Yunfan was talented and had the potential to become an Emperor, and he might be able to become a powerful cultivator.","However, by the time Chu Yunfan had fully grown up, they would have already conquered the Central Plains and used the power of providence from the two worlds to break through to the Emperor Stage.","This was also what King Purple-Robe Demon had been planning all along. Otherwise, he would not have insisted on leading the Demon Realm to invade the Central Plains. Even if he suffered heavy losses and might even be defeated by the other races, he would not back down at all.","It was because the prospects were too tempting!","However, he never expected Chu Yunfan’s growth to be so shocking. In his estimation, Chu Yunfan, who should have reached the intermediate King Stage at most, had already reached the peak of the King Stage.","Now, the situation had completely reversed. It was completely beyond his imagination!","“Chu Yunfan, even if I die, I will drag you along with me!”","King Purple-Robe Demon had completely recognized the fact that he was inferior to Chu Yunfan and admitted it.","His entire body was burning, but he kept muttering an ancient curse.","His appearance was aging at an astonishing rate. With every breath, he would age by a hundred years, to the point where even the naked eye could see him.","“Demons’ Sacrifice!”","King Purple-Robe Demon shouted. Chu Yunfan suddenly felt that the surrounding heaven and earth had turned into an altar, and he was on the altar, about to be sacrificed to heaven and earth.","A sacrificial power seeped out from the void. It was a power of heaven and earth. It could completely sacrifice Chu Yunfan to heaven and earth like a tribute."]},{"number":2408,"title":"Chapter 2408: King Purple-Robe Demon Dies!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2408: King Purple-Robe Demon Dies!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A terrifying power spread out from the world, almost tearing Chu Yunfan apart.","This was a terrifying power, a terrifying power released from heaven and earth!","It was King Purple-Robe Demon who sacrificed Chu Yunfan to heaven and earth at the cost of his own life!","This was an extremely ancient curse, but very few people knew it. Even if they knew it, they would not use it, because this was killing 1,000 enemies and losing 800 of themselves.","There were no direct benefits.","However, King Purple-Robe Demon couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan now. He could only use this method, hoping to use the power of heaven and earth to sacrifice Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan felt that every pore on his body was spewing out a kind of flame. This kind of flame could not be extinguished.","It was a flame called karmic sin flames!","There was no way to extinguish this kind of karmic sin flames. They were formless and invisible.","And what the karmic sin flames burned was karmic power!","Everyone had karma, but the difference was how much they accumulated.","Chu Yunfan had killed countless powerful enemies along the way, so his karma was naturally extremely shocking.","Normally, this negative karma would not be visible and would not affect Chu Yunfan. However, as time passed, the negative karma would become more and more serious, and sooner or later, it would become a disaster.","For example, right now, Chu Yunfan could feel an invisible force of karma spewing out from his body, causing the karmic sin flame to burn fiercely.","There was no way to avoid it. The karmic sin flame came from Chu Yunfan’s body. There was no way to avoid it, no way to escape. He could only let the karmic sin flame until the karma in his body was completely burned out.","King Purple-Robe Demon coughed up blood while chanting the curse. He watched as Chu Yunfan was completely surrounded by karmic sin flame and almost burned into a man of fire.","The human king at the side kept coughing up blood. He wanted to help, but he couldn’t move at all. There was a big hole in his chest, and it was difficult to keep his injuries from worsening. He also had to deal with all kinds of killing intent that fell from the sky.","He couldn’t help Chu Yunfan at all.","He could only see Chu Yunfan’s body burning inch by inch. He was about to be burned into ashes and charred.","“Hahahaha, Chu Yunfan, die!” King Purple-Robe Demon laughed loudly.","He watched as the karmic sin flame on Chu Yunfan’s body grew stronger and stronger, and a sinister smile appeared on his face.","But suddenly, the karmic sin flame in the world disappeared. To be precise, it disappeared bit by bit from Chu Yunfan’s body.","“How is this possible?”","King Purple-Robe Demon couldn’t believe it.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan was almost burnt to a crisp. However, after the karmic sin flame dissipated, the charcoal was peeled off inch by inch, revealing his fair and tender skin. It looked as if he had been reborn.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a cold smile. “It’s all thanks to you. With this karmic sin flame, you’ve cleansed all the negative karma from my body!”","Chu Yunfan’s mind was now clear as if a black cloth had been pulled away from his eyes.","It was as if he was not afraid of the clouds blocking his vision!","The deeper the negative karma a cultivator had, the harder it was to truly sense the Heavenly Dao.","The Heavenly Dao in his eyes was unprecedentedly clear.","If it were anyone else, this would be a matter of nine deaths and one life. However, he knew that this was a path that he had to take. If he wanted to become an Emperor in the future, he would have to take this step.","Among the three calamities of vindication to becoming Emperor, there was this karmic sin flame. If ordinary people could not survive it, they would die.","Chu Yunfan was almost burned to death by the karmic sin flame. At the critical moment, the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix that he had fused into his bloodline played an important role.","Although the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a variant of the phoenix, it was still a phoenix. It had the phoenixes’ innate magical ability, rebirth.","Chu Yunfan had just completed his rebirth. All his bloodlines had become purer after this rebirth, and his future path would be smoother.","Therefore, this encounter was not a bad thing for Chu Yunfan. It could be said to be a blessing in disguise.","After this transformation, it would be much easier for him to vindicate his Dao and become an Emperor in the future.","To ordinary people, the karmic sin flames were too terrifying. There was no way to avoid them at all. Only one in a hundred could successfully pass through this calamity.","Ordinary people did not even have the qualifications to trigger karmic sin flames.","“How is that possible?” King Purple-Robe Demon couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan had passed the fire calamity.","The Demon Realm was also a world with a deep foundation. It had once produced an Emperor Demon, so he also knew the so-called three calamities. Among the three calamities, the most terrifying was not the lightning calamity or the wind calamity, but the fire calamity.","This fire was a karmic sin fire that could not be avoided at all. It would spew out from every pore in the body and ignite the body from every cell.","The deeper the negative karma, the harder it was to escape the burning of the karmic sin flames!","At the very least, he did not have the confidence to do so!","He couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan had passed this stage. This was already his trump card, but it still couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Almost immediately, King Purple-Robe Demon retreated repeatedly, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan’s attack, but how could he block Chu Yunfan’s attack?","After completing the transformation and rebirth, Chu Yunfan’s entire body was emitting a faint light.","“Flying Celestial Seal!”","Chu Yunfan’s palm slammed down, turning into a huge seal. The entire world turned into a universe.","Bang!","This attack directly hit King Purple-Robe Demon. King Purple-Robe Demon only had time to scream before half of his body was smashed into pieces.","King Purple-Robe Demon coughed up blood as he retreated. He was horrified to find that Chu Yunfan’s strength had clearly become stronger.","“Run!”","At this moment, King Purple-Robe Demon no longer had the ambition to kill Chu Yunfan. The only thought in his mind was to run.","King Purple-Robe Demon turned into a stream of light and flew into the distance, wanting to escape from the Emperor’s tomb.","However, he couldn’t outrun Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan spread his lightning wings and caught up with King Purple-Robe Demon in an instant.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan stomped down.","Bang!","King Purple-Robe Demon was stepped on, and his body exploded in the air. Blood splattered everywhere, and his flesh and bones flew everywhere.","Then, Chu Yunfan took out a lightning sword and pierced through King Purple-Robe Demon’s primordial spirit.","“Ah!”","King Purple-Robe Demon’s primordial spirit screamed. He wanted to escape, but there was no way. Under the attack of this sword, he was killed and evaporated bit by bit in the air.","A moment later, even King Purple-Robe Demon’s primordial spirit was killed.","At this point, the King demon who ruled the Demon Realm had come to an end."]},{"number":2409,"title":"Chapter 2409: The World Was in an Uproar, the Demons Retreat","paragraphs":["Chapter 2409: The World Was in an Uproar, the Demons Retreat","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The news shook the entire Central Plains.","The battle of the Emperor’s tomb had come to an end. Everyone in the world thought that they would hear the final announcement of who would win the Emperor’s Heart in the Emperor’s tomb.","However, it wasn’t until the news spread that everyone realized that this so-called Emperor’s Heart was a trap, a bait used to attract Kings.","A shocking trap set up by a human had killed 90% of the King demons, as well as many Kings from other races.","Not many details were revealed in this battle because most of the survivors were human experts.","However, the result was that most of the Kings who had gone there had been wiped out in one battle.","This battle could be said to be the most earth-shattering battle since the invasion of the demons. In one battle, 90% of the King demons were buried.","Not to mention the losses of the other races, even the humans only had a few Kings left, and all of them were injured, extremely severely injured!","When many people received this news, they could not help but be shocked. They even did not dare to believe it. They even felt that this must be fake news.","How could the humans have the ability to ambush the demons and even bury the Kings and elites of the demons?","What a big deal.","In addition to these King demons and demon elites, there were also various martial arts masters, half-Kings and Kings who had died. However, they did not lose as many Kings as the demons.","At first, everyone was in disbelief. However, they saw that the demons who were still wreaking havoc in the hinterland of the humans seemed to have received some urgent order overnight and retreated overnight. Not a single one of them remained.","All of them were gone!","At this point, all the people who were still in disbelief were now convinced. It was indeed similar to the rumors before. The humans had successfully killed the vast majority of the King demons.","Otherwise, it was impossible for the elite army of the demons to retreat overnight. If they did not leave now, they might not only face the counterattack of the humans, but also the collective counterattack of other races.","After all, almost everyone liked to beat up a fallen dog. No one was willing to let go of such a piece of fat meat.","On the other hand, the demons had already left with their troops at lightning speed. This made many people who had other thoughts in their hearts feel quite regretful at this time.","He didn’t manage to gain any advantage!","After confirming that this news was true, everyone went crazy, especially the humans.","After fighting against the demons for decades, although it had only completely collapsed, in fact, it had already hurt its vitality. In this process, countless well-known experts and young heroes had all fallen in the war with the demons.","Even though the humans was the overlord of the Central Plains, they had been pushed to their limits in the successive wars and were only a step away from collapse.","This was also the reason why the human king had chosen to take the risk to initiate this plan. If he did not take the risk, the humans would probably collapse before those ancient prodigies of the humans could grow up.","Once it collapsed, there would be no chance to save it.","In these decades of war, the strength of the humans had decreased by more than 50%, and the losses were countless. The accumulation and foundation of many years had been exhausted in the war with the demons.","The human army was on the verge of collapse!","Now that the fiend race army had suddenly retreated, this was no different from letting out a sigh of relief for the entire human race!","However, no one had the time to celebrate. To be precise, every household was in extreme sorrow.","For so many years, the humans had suffered huge losses. Almost every household had people who died in the tide of resisting the demons.","It was just that there was no time to be sad before. They fought day and night. If they did not fight, they might be killed by the demons.","Under the pressure of survival, no one had the time to grieve. However, at this moment, everyone could not hold back the grief in their hearts and cried out.","Not only did they feel pain for the people who had died in the past, but they also felt pain for the heroes of the humans who had died in this battle. More than half of the Kings had died. Some of these Kings were familiar to everyone, but some had died before they even knew their names.","As for the half-Kings, their losses were uncountable.","This battle could only be said to be a lose-lose situation. Although the losses of the demons were far greater than those of the humans, it had to be admitted that the foundation and strength of the humans were far inferior to the demons.","After such a huge loss, the remaining experts of the demons were not necessarily less than the current humans. In terms of strength, they were even above the humans if not the king.","Then, a shocking piece of news came. The human king was severely injured in the Emperor’s tomb and had to go into seclusion for at least a hundred years.","Everyone knew that the human king was the number one expert of the humans. His strength was unfathomable. Even he had no choice but to announce that he was going into seclusion. One could imagine how bad his injuries were.","The few remaining Kings seemed so weak in this chaotic world.","Even the non-humankind was shocked by the humans’ astonishing generosity this time. The Kings who didn’t go to the Emperor’s tomb were all extremely glad.","Due to various reasons, they didn’t choose to go to the Emperor’s tomb in the end. However, this had now become the best decision they had made in their lives.","Although not going to the Emperor’s tomb had cut off a path to becoming an Emperor, it had also saved their lives.","According to the insider information they had obtained, the Emperor’s Heart was incomplete, and it was not enough for someone to break through to become an Emperor. This was a trap.","They were even more shocked. The human king’s heart was so poisonous, and his methods were so ruthless.","“The human king has such powerful means. I don’t think he’s just targeting the demons. He’s even scheming against us. If I hadn’t resisted the temptation back then, I’m afraid I would have been buried in the tomb now!”","“What a powerful scheme. It’s going to include all the heroes in the world!”","“Does the human king really regard us as nothing?”","Many people were shocked by the human king’s astonishing generosity. He had calculated all the heroes in the world and bet on the future of the humans.","Even though they knew that they had no choice, they were still shocked by the consequences.","However, before everyone could sigh, a King monster said, “The humans has killed many of our Kings. A debt of blood must be repaid in blood. A tooth for a tooth, blood for blood!”","After that King monster, there were many Kings from the Hus, the barbarians, and the marine folks who made the humans pay with blood.","Just as the shadow of the demons dissipated, the humans once again faced the disaster of extinction."]},{"number":2410,"title":"Chapter 2410: All Races Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 2410: All Races Meeting","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Countless people in the human race were filled with grief and indignation. If it was when the human king was at the peak, these Kings would not dare to say a word. The human king was a rare peak King.","But now, the human king was severely injured and had no choice but to go into seclusion for a hundred years. For a time, all the ghosts and monsters appeared.","In the eyes of many people, this was clearly a robbery!","Many people realized that a storm was brewing!","During the decades of war, both the humans and the demons had suffered heavy losses. However, the other races had preserved enough strength during the decades of war.","Although there were losses, compared to the humans, the losses were still considered small.","Originally, the Grand Xia Empire was able to suppress these restless foreign races.","But now, the remaining King humans and other human experts were obviously not enough to stop the prying and restless movements of these foreign races.","The humans were in a state of chaos. At the same time, they were relaxed on the outside and tight on the inside, guarding against a sudden attack from these alien races.","The humans had no other choice!","They couldn’t give up just like that and submit to the outsiders!","Many people lamented that the heavens had no eyes. The other non-humankind races had been lying low for the past dozens of years, just to see both the humans and the demons suffer heavy losses. Then, they would try to catch the oriole behind the mantis stalking the cicada.","But now, as they wished, they were given the chance to become orioles.","Just as the humans were nervously preparing for war, the demi-humans suddenly announced that they were going to hold a meeting of all races to discuss the distribution of the Central Plains’ resources and territories.","One stone caused a thousand ripples. Although it was said that there were ten thousand races, there were still ten thousand races. Most of them were races from the monsters and the marine folks.","Among them, the most important ones were naturally the humans, the monsters, the Hus, the barbarians, and the marine folks. These five races ruled the world.","However, in fact, the fundamental division was the struggle between the humans and the non-humans. The human forces included the humans, the Hus, and the barbarians, while the non-human forces included the monsters and the marine folks.","Even though the Hus and the barbarians were independent, they were still human beings in essence.","However, the humans , who was supposed to have the advantage, had become the weaker side because the Hus and the barbarians had split up and stood on the side of the monsters and the marine folks.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the other four foreign races were wary of each other and couldn’t attack the Human Tribe with their full strength, the humans wouldn’t have been able to suppress the other four foreign races.","That was simply impossible!","Everyone knew that this All Races Meeting was actually targeted at the humans.","The monsters’ slogan was to divide the territory according to their current strength. The powerful races could ask for more territory, while the weak races naturally did not have the right to ask for such a large territory.","The first to bear the brunt was the humans, whose strength had greatly declined. It was not even half of its peak, and only one-third of the humans had undoubtedly become targets.","It was like a giant beast that was staggering forward. Everyone was waiting for this giant beast to fall and then take a piece of meat from this giant beast.","There was no lack of knowledgeable people in the humans. Of course, they could see this. Therefore, they were even more furious. This was clearly forcing the humans into a dead end.","When the demons had invaded the Central Plains, it had been the humans that had risen up with all their might and bore the brunt of the damage. Now, the various races were demanding that the humans’ territory be divided. This was undoubtedly a stab in the back for the humans. How could the humans, who had always been used to being domineering, accept this?","Soon, the messenger of the monsters was sent to the humans. It was said that the human king did not appear to meet the messenger of the monsters, confirming that the human king was seriously injured.","The one who finally stepped forward was the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia.","The Grand Commandant of the Grand Xia, who had been guarding Zhenyao City all year round, had no choice but to return to the imperial capital to guard against any accidents.","The other races all expressed that they would definitely go there personally.","For the sake of fairness, the venue of this All Races Meeting was set in the void of the universe, in the ruins of an ancient zenith sect.","This was once the base of a powerful sect in ancient times. Later, over a long period of time, the sect was destroyed and the base was abandoned.","It was only now that the monsters took it out again and used it as the venue for this All Races Meeting.","The representative of the humans was soon chosen. It was none other than the old dean of Virtuous Academy. He led a group of humans to the venue of the All Races Meeting.","After all, this meeting was recognized by the other four races. If the humans was not present, it would be equivalent to automatically giving up the right to speak.","If that was the case, it would be a disaster for the entire human race.","However, compared to the other races, the humans, which was alone, seemed extremely deserted.","No matter how one looked at it, the humans was simply too weak, yet they still had to guard against the outsiders in all directions, so they had no choice but to leave behind enough people to guard the Central Plains.","“The huge human race actually has such a day!”","“Hahaha, the humans only has this kind of strength. What right do they have to occupy the most fertile land of the Central Plains?”","“It’s time for the humans to hand over the hegemony in their hands!”","Many of the outsiders ridiculed them without restraint. The humans was in an unprecedented state of decline. Originally, the humans had been powerful and at the peak of their military power. Being at the center of the Central Plains meant that they could attack everywhere and take the initiative.","And now, the humans in the center of the Central Plains were being beaten up everywhere. This was not because of a change in geography, but because the strength of the humans had fallen from their peak to an underestimation.","As for the humans, they were extremely embarrassed and angry. The fact that the humans only had one King was enough to explain many things.","Powerful Kings came to the All Races Meeting one after another, bringing with them a terrifying pressure that made everyone in the All Races Meeting look sideways.","“The ancient prodigies are here!”","Suddenly, at this moment, someone was shocked to find that many ancient prodigies who were in seclusion in this All Races Meeting had run out one after another. Not only the monsters, but also the Hus, the marine folks, the barbarians, and even the humans had many ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths.","Although many of them were only at the half-King Stage, many people came one after another when this concerned the rise and fall of the race.","Powerful Supreme Youths came one after another. Some even speculated that it was not impossible for some of them to have already advanced to the King Stage.","Without a doubt, this had brought about a change in the All Races Meeting."]},{"number":2411,"title":"Chapter 2411: Two King Great Golden Rocs","paragraphs":["Chapter 2411: Two King Great Golden Rocs","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without a doubt, this was a meeting that would change the entire world.","A melodious bell rang out from the mountain gate, and powerful existences arrived one after another.","“Today’s All Races Meeting will be the day we become famous!” a Supreme Youth said solemnly.","This resolute and cold attitude also made many human experts very worried.","The humans was currently most worried about the fact that there were experts from the non-humankind who had become Kings.","This was different from the Kings of the older generation. Many of the Kings of the older generation were top-notch prodigies who had been tempered over time to become Kings.","However, there were many Supreme Youths among the ancient prodigies of the younger generation.","Just looking at Chu Yunfan was enough to know how terrifying these Supreme Youths were.","Ever since Chu Yunfan attained Dao, he had killed many Kings in such a short time. It could be said that he had shocked the world.","Everyone used Chu Yunfan as a standard to look at the future Kings and current Supreme Youths.","It was completely conceivable that these young Kings would make things difficult for the humans during the All Races Meeting, and the humans would probably have no way at all.","If they didn’t go, they wouldn’t even have the right to speak. But if they went, they would inevitably be targeted. There was no shortcut. In today’s world, the various races competed for power, and each had their own strength to speak.","Humans had been able to occupy the central regions of the Central Plains because of their tyrannical strength. They were the leaders of the various races, able to suppress all experts.","However, after many years of chaotic warfare with the demons, in terms of strength alone, they were probably the last of the various races.","“These foreign races are clearly taking advantage of the situation!”","“That’s right. It would be great if the human king was safe and sound. All the races would not easily bully each other on account of the human king!”","“I wonder how King Chu is doing now. If King Chu was here, we wouldn’t be in such a sorry state!”","Outside the sect ruins, the human experts discussed animatedly. However, they knew that even Kings did not have much say in this meeting, let alone them.","Powerful Kings from all races came. The old dean of Virtuous Academy was the only King among the humans. He seemed to be alone.","According to the different races, everyone was divided into different parts of the base.","Suddenly, as everyone was discussing, a tyrannical pressure pressed over. It was a peerlessly beautiful man who strode into the base without restraining his aura.","His aura was extremely terrifying, and it was not inferior to the Kings.","However, there was a hint of arrogance on his face, and even a hint of ferocity.","“Prince Roc! It’s actually him!” someone exclaimed as he recognized the tall and handsome man.","Everyone carefully began to discuss. Prince Roc was not an ordinary Supreme Youth. It was said that he was the legitimate son of one of the Ten Ferocities, the Great Golden Roc. He was later sealed and only appeared in this life.","Compared to ordinary Supreme Youths, his bloodline was closer to that of an Emperor, and it was also more terrifying.","It was said that after he hatched from the egg, he had become a King not long after. With the lifespan of the Great Golden Roc species, it was almost equivalent to a human becoming a King tier before the age of 20.","His cultivation and talent could be said to be earth-shattering.","“I heard that there’s also a Great Golden Roc among the humans?” Prince Roc said as he walked toward the human camp. “Today, I’m here to kill this bastard!”","Prince Roc’s expression was extremely cold, and his eyes flickered with killing intent. Ever since he found out that there was a Great Golden Roc among Chu Yunfan’s followers, he could not hold back his killing intent.","The Great Golden Roc Clan was extremely noble. That Great Golden Roc wasn’t pure-blooded, but a mixed-blooded descendant. Later on, after slowly purifying its bloodline, it returned from acquired to innate, turning into a Great Golden Roc.","There was already a gap between him and the innate Great Golden Roc, which made him feel unhappy. This was tarnishing the bloodline of their Great Golden Roc species.","Moreover, the other Great Golden Roc had actually followed a human and become his follower. This made him feel that the bloodline and dignity of his species had been trampled on the ground.","He had never placed the humans in his eyes. When their race was unhindered in the Supreme Ancient Immortal Realms, the humans was only a weak race. Later on, after a group of ferocious beasts died, they rose up.","In his eyes, the humans was still the same as countless years ago.","Many people couldn’t help but exclaim when they heard this. This was a battle between two Great Golden Rocs. One was an innate while the other was an acquired who had reversed their bloodline.","“You want to kill me?” A figure strode out from the human camp. It was none other than the Great Golden Roc.","At this moment, his face was sinister. Looking at Prince Roc in front of him, he could feel a power awakening in his bloodline.","Almost instantly, a shocking killing intent was instinctively produced.","Even if he was facing a pure-blooded Great Golden Roc, he was not afraid at all. Although he had advanced from Acquired to Innate, he was able to cultivate to this extent and was not inferior to a pure-blooded Great Golden Roc.Y0u can read sh0rt, t0uching, and r0mantic st0ries ab0ut c0uples, as well as children’s st0ries f0r free 0n sitest0rys(.)c0m","In terms of form, there was a difference between Innate and Acquired, but only in terms of bloodline, there was no difference.","“You bastard, you dare to taint the bloodline of the Great Golden Roc!”","Before Prince Roc could attack, a mountain-like figure behind him attacked. His cultivation was terrifying, and he was already a half-King.","Such an expert was extremely powerful, yet he had become Prince Roc’s servant.","However, the Great Golden Roc did not hesitate at all. It only attacked with its pair of iron fists.","The Great Golden Roc might seem ordinary in front of Chu Yunfan, but in reality, it was not inferior to any other powerful beings of the same level.","Boom!","This pair of iron fists burst out with golden light. It was as heavy as a divine mountain and directly shattered the sky. This punch directly shattered the vacuum and smashed into the body of this half-King.","Bang!","Without a doubt, this half-King was smashed into pieces. It was just a simple punch, but his primordial spirit was injured and his flesh was ripped apart.","“A King!” someone exclaimed.","He could finally tell that this Great Golden Roc was already at the King Stage.","For a moment, everyone was shocked. This meant that there were already two King Great Golden Rocs in the world.","According to the Great Golden Roc’s violent personality, both sides would probably fight to the death to determine a victor.","“So strong. As expected of a Great Golden Roc. It’s so powerful after becoming a King!”","Many people were shocked by the strength of the Great Golden Roc.","Meanwhile, the entire humans was inexplicably surprised. The Great Golden Roc was Chu Yunfan’s follower. Didn’t that mean that the humans had another King?"]},{"number":2412,"title":"Chapter 2412: The Intimidation of the Foreign Races","paragraphs":["Chapter 2412: The Intimidation of the Foreign Races","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although the Great Golden Roc wasn’t a human, it still belonged to the humans.","In the current precarious situation of the humans, another King was extremely precious.","Facing Prince Roc, the Great Golden Roc was fearless. Other than submitting to Chu Yunfan, he was also a Supreme Youth. In terms of bloodline, he was not inferior to any Supreme Youth in the world, so he naturally had nothing to fear.","“A mere servant to be impudent in front of me!” the Great Golden Roc said with a cold expression.","Even when he was still at the half-King Stage, killing this servant would only take a few moves. Now that he had become a King, he could crush the other party with a single finger.","“You still dare to resist!” Golden light burst out from Prince Roc’s eyes. His entire body was emitting a powerful light.","“Do you think you can do whatever you want and decide my life and death just because you have pure blood? You’re not worthy!” the Great Golden Roc said coldly,","“Your existence has already tarnished this supreme bloodline. Today, you will definitely die!”","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure walked out from the void in the sky. It was an old man with white hair and beard. His terrifying aura was firmly locked onto the Great Golden Roc.","Even the Great Golden Roc, who had already become a King, still felt the hair on its body stand on end. This was not an ordinary King. It was at least a terrifying existence at the late King Stage.","But now, this terrifying existence had become Prince Roc’s slave. This bloodline was truly astonishing, and its foundation was unimaginably deep.","Boom!","A huge hand smashed down fiercely, actually wanting to grab the Great Golden Roc to death in midair.","Suddenly, at this moment, a large golden word, break, appeared in the air. This word turned into an endless sharp light that tore the world apart. The large hand was also broken.","“Dao brother, this is the matter of the younger generation. Don’t interfere!”","Everyone heard an old voice. They could tell that it was the voice of the old dean of Virtuous Academy.","“Humph!”","The old man snorted coldly. Just as he was about to attack again, Prince Roc spoke.","“You don’t have to interfere. I can handle it!” Prince Roc said coldly.","Prince Roc was filled with killing intent. His entire body was flickering with golden light. He held a long sword in his hand, and the tip of the sword seemed to be able to crush the heavens.","“Just in time. Let’s fight!” The Great Golden Roc laughed coldly.","“Perfect, I’ll kill you to prove my Dao. Just as you thought, there’s only one Great Golden Roc in the world. I don’t need anything else!”","In the blink of an eye, the two of them directly killed their way into the void of the universe. It just so happened that they were in the void of the universe. There was no need to specially choose a battlefield. They could fight here.","Everyone understood that as the two Great Golden Rocs began to fight in the air, the curtain had finally been lifted on this All Races Meeting.","The two of them charged into the void of the universe and were at least a hundred thousand miles away. However, the aftershocks of the battle still made them feel extremely terrifying fluctuations.","Moreover, the fluctuations of their battle were very similar. They were both fluctuations unique to the Great Golden Roc species and were extremely shocking.","Although everyone was in different places, they were not ordinary people. Their primordial spirits intersected in midair.","This was no different from meeting face to face.","“The humans should give up the land they occupied!”","At this moment, a King of the Hus said.","“That’s right. The humans doesn’t have the qualifications and strength to occupy so much land now!” Immediately, a King marine folk echoed.","The expressions of the humans changed. It was exactly as they had expected. The various races had joined forces to attack the humans.","“There aren’t that many Kings among the humans. They shouldn’t occupy so much land!” a Supreme Youth stood out. His body emitted a faint pressure of the King Stage, announcing his identity as a young King.","Behind him, powerful Supreme Youths stood out one after another. Ten of them joined forces and threatened the human camp.","They wanted to use the absolute number of Kings to force the humans to give in.","At the convention, they would directly establish the status of the various races and kick the humans out of the five powerful races. At the very least, they would have to make the humans cede enough territory.","In the human camp, when the old dean of the Virtuous Academy was about to make a move, he realized that he had been locked on by several powerful Kings. There was a faint warning.","Regardless of whether it was the new generation or the older generation, all races were far above the humans.","Even he could not act rashly.","However, just as the humans felt as if the sky was collapsing and the earth was collapsing, the auras of Kings were released.","More than a dozen powerful auras belonging to Kings were released.","Everyone looked closely and saw that these people were not unknown. The three people in the lead were the Gushe Princess Tang Siyu, Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the others. They were all Supreme Youths related to Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, wasn’t the Great Golden Roc related to Chu Yunfan?","He was also Chu Yunfan’s follower!","The entire human race was pleasantly surprised to find that so many Kings had gathered in the human race without anyone noticing.","Every single one of them was not easy.","Indeed, there were many other Supreme Youths among the humans.","However, at that moment, when the humans needed them the most, they were only at the half-King Stage and could not be used. What difference was there from not having them?","Or rather, there was no difference.","For a time, the number of young King humans was not at a disadvantage. In fact, they even won.","This was something that the entire human race had not expected.","“Since when did our human race have so many hidden experts!”","“Yeah, they hid it too well!”","“And did you see that? They are all directly related to King Chu. I’m afraid King Chu has some means to directly break through. Otherwise, why haven’t I seen the other Supreme Youths improve?”","The human experts discussed animatedly, but some of them thought of Chu Yunfan’s pills.","Chu Yunfan seemed to have relied on that pill to advance into the King Stage, but they still could not believe it.","This was because it was very obvious that making such a pill required a huge price. In theory, the higher the grade of the pill, the more difficult it was to make. Similarly, it was almost impossible to make it in batches.","It was because of this that the breakthroughs of the people around Chu Yunfan were so magical. One or two breakthroughs could be considered a coincidence, but the breakthrough of a group of people could not be described as a coincidence."]},{"number":2413,"title":"Chapter 2413: Forced to Kneel, Loud Slap","paragraphs":["Chapter 2413: Forced to Kneel, Loud Slap","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone present was one in ten thousand smart people, so they naturally immediately thought of the only possibility.","That was, Chu Yunfan had a method that could allow a half-Kings to become Kings.","As soon as this speculation came out, everyone’s breathing immediately quickened.","If such thoughts could only be regarded as guesses before, then now, these could no longer be considered guesses.","To be precise, this was confirmed!","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t already displayed his amazing strength, someone might have come to kill him.","No one could resist the temptation of a technique that could increase one’s cultivation in large quantities.","The young Kings who couldn’t force them out changed their expressions. They didn’t expect that there were so many experts hidden among the humans. Although many of them weren’t human, they were all on the humans’ side.","The foundation of the humans was not as weak as imagined. Even if they had ambushed and killed the monsters once, resulting in both sides suffering heavy losses, there were still many hidden experts.","A hint of doubt flashed in their eyes. With Tang Siyu and the others’ strength, if they had broken through, under normal circumstances, they should have immediately announced it to the world.","However, Tang Siyu and the others were willing to hide it and did not choose to announce it. This was the most surprising thing.","However, it was precisely because of this that there was a collective outbreak this time, so that the various races did not dare to underestimate the humans.","“A mere dozen new Kings want to change the situation?” A cold, elderly voice was heard.","Everyone saw an old woman slowly walking over from the void. This old woman was dressed in beast skin and looked quite wild. However, her figure and footsteps were extremely agile, making her seem extraordinary.","Lady King Hu was extremely domineering. She had suppressed Tang Siyu and the others’ momentum by herself.","Soon, an older human expert recognized Lady King Hu. She was the mother of the khan of the Hus, who had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","After all the human experts understood this, their expressions turned cold. Without a doubt, this female King Hu was clearly here to take revenge.","“When Chu Yunfan killed my son, I was in seclusion. Today, I heard that Chu Yunfan’s wife is present. He killed my son, so I’m going to kill his wife. We’ll be even then!”","Lady King Hu’s expression was extremely cold. In terms of strength, she was much stronger than the Khan who had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","She was even much stronger than these new Kings. She was not inferior to the old dean of Virtuous Academy. She had already stepped into the late King Stage and was clearly one of the top experts in the world.","Other than peak Kings, she could not meet any opponents at all.","Lady King Hu slowly walked over with her cane. She looked at Tang Siyu and obviously recognized her.","Tang Siyu didn’t give in at all. She grabbed at the air with her white palm, and a long sword appeared in her hand. Her body was slender, and her body emitted a jade-like color. A faint luster enveloped her body, and she fought against Lady King Hu.","“The intermediate King Stage?” Lady King Hu looked at Tang Siyu in surprise. She did not expect Tang Siyu to have such a cultivation.","As far as she knew, this batch of Kings should have just reached the King Stage not long ago. How could their strength increase so quickly?","However, the more this was the case, the more fierce the killing intent in her eyes became.","The more powerful and talented Tang Siyu was, the more she would become a threat to her.","Just Chu Yunfan alone was already a huge threat to the Hus, let alone Tang Siyu.","She absolutely could not stay!","“Humph!”","Lady King Hu snorted coldly, and a terrifying aura pressed down. Other than Tang Siyu, Chu Hongcai and the others could not help but take a few steps back, barely resisting Lady King Hu’s aura.","The difference between the early King Stage and the late King Stage was extremely huge. Even though they were all Supreme Youths and their strength far surpassed ordinary early Kings, under the absolute difference in strength, it still made them take a few steps back before they could stabilize their footing.","The others had already fled thousands of miles away before finally stopping. They were really scared out of their wits.","Lady King Hu’s eyes flashed with a terrifying light. She swung her cane at Tang Siyu, causing the world to tremble.","If a late King attacked, they would be almost an invincible existence in the world today!","The only person who could contend against her was the old dean of Virtuous Academy. However, he was being targeted by several people at this time and had no way to resist at all.","Tang Siyu grunted. As if she had broken through some boundary, she slashed out with her sword. In an instant, an astonishing sword light swept across the universe.","Boom!","The two sides collided fiercely. In an instant, the victor had already been determined. Tang Siyu was at a disadvantage. In just an instant, she had already been defeated by the sword light.","A terrifying pressure pressed down on Tang Siyu.","Blood trickled down the corner of Tang Siyu’s mouth. In an instant, a rainbow light barrier around her body boiled.","It had to be said that this female King Hu was indeed an extremely terrifying existence.","Just by relying on her cultivation that was stronger than Tang Siyu’s, hse was actually able to force Tang Siyu, who had a stronger aptitude, to such an extent. Clearly, she was probably only a step away from the peak King Stage.","“Go!”","At this moment, Chu Hongcai let out a roar. His entire body was emitting a golden sword light, which turned into a shocking sword light. In an instant, he directly slashed toward Lady King Hu.","At this moment, other than him, everyone else also attacked.","Although they were all new Kings, their aptitude was extraordinary. They were all Supreme Youths. They worked together to break through Lady King Hu’s attack and were on par with her.","“Very good. You want to save her? It’s a pity that you can’t. All of you will die!” The ferocity in Lady King Hu’s eyes grew. “I want to see how capable you are!”","“Kneel!” Lady King Hu shouted.","Tang Siyu and the others instantly felt a huge pressure pressing down on them, almost forcing them to kneel down.","Everyone was shocked. Killing someone was just a simple matter, but this female King Hu clearly did not intend to do so. She was not satisfied with this.","She wanted to humiliate everyone and make the new Kings kneel before her, breaking their invincible hearts. At that time, even if they survived, it would be difficult for them to break through.","Many people felt chills run down their spines when they thought of this.","It seemed that Lady King Hu hated Chu Yunfan to the core, so she had to humiliate the people related to him like this.","Suddenly, at this moment, when everyone thought that the new Kings would not be able to escape kneeling down...","A palm appeared in the air and landed on the face of Lady King Hu."]},{"number":2414,"title":"Chapter 2414: Killing a Late King Like Killing an Ant","paragraphs":["Chapter 2414: Killing a Late King Like Killing an Ant","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Smack!","A slap landed on the face of Lady King Hu.","This slap was so loud that everyone trembled.","Everyone had seen the old woman’s strength, but they had never thought that she would actually be slapped in the face.","Everyone looked in the direction of the palm and saw a woman in a bright yellow dress striding over.","“Elder Princess, it’s the Elder Princess!”","A human expert instantly recognized this woman. Wasn’t she the Elder Princess of Grand Xia?","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They did not expect the Elder Princess to actually appear here, and her cultivation had actually advanced to such a level.","The old woman was also stunned by the slap. Her face was covered in blood. This slap was not light at all.","She was even more depressed. It wasn’t that she hadn’t fought with the Elder Princess before. In fact, as one of the top experts in the Hus, she had fought with the Elder Princess more than once.","However, there was not much difference in their strength. Although it had been a long time and she could already accept the fact that the Elder Princess’ strength had increased very quickly, she was originally her junior, but in a very short period of time, she was comparable to her.","And now, he had actually surpassed her.","She was extremely fearful of the Elder Princess!","“Greetings, Master!” Tang Siyu’s expression relaxed when she saw this.","Although she was now a King, she did not show any disrespect to the Elder Princess. She respected the Elder Princess greatly in her heart.","Because she knew very well that she was different from Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had his own system. Even if no one guided him, he could still reach the peak.","She was able to reach this step because of many fortuitous encounters, but in the end, it was all because of the Elder Princess’ nurturing at all costs.","She was truly being nurtured like her last disciple. It could be said that she was truly like a teacher and a mother.","“Siyu!” When the Elder Princess saw Tang Siyu, her eyes lit up. She was especially happy that Tang Siyu was already a King.","This was because she had indeed treated Tang Siyu as her successor. Now that she saw that Tang Siyu’s cultivation had improved greatly, she was instantly happy.","“Let me deal with this old woman first!”","The Elder Princess then asked Tang Siyu and the others to retreat to the back.","“You’re quite bold to attack my disciple!”","“So what if she’s your disciple? Her husband killed my son, so why can’t I kill her?” Lady King Hu said coldly.","“You just can’t kill him, so you target Siyu! Who do you think you are? You’re just an old woman who has one foot in the grave!” the Elder Princess said coldly, “Back then, you chased after me. After I attained Dao, you hid in the depths of the grassland. I couldn’t find you. Now that you dare to come out, let’s settle our old scores!”","The old woman’s expression changed when she heard the Elder Princess mention the past. The Elder Princess had risen very quickly back then, just like Chu Yunfan today, so she had secretly suppressed her.","This was also the norm for the various races. They suppressed the newly risen prodigies of their opponents.","However, the Elder Princess’ growth speed became faster and faster, and she actually broke into the King Stage. In less than a hundred years, she was already on equal footing with her.","Since then, in order to avoid the Elder Princess, she hid in the depths of the grassland.","There was an evil god guarding the depths of the grassland. Even the Elder Princess, who had advanced her cultivation, did not dare to go too deep.","However, she originally thought that the strength of both sides should be similar. Even if the Elder Princess was stronger than her, she should not be much stronger.","They were all at the late King Stage. Who could be much stronger than the other?","Although her cultivation was similar to the Elder Princess, she had to avoid the Elder Princess’ sharp edge because she was already old and the Elder Princess was in her prime.","If they really fought, no matter how long she could hold on, she would definitely be the one to lose in the end.","Moreover, her bodily functions were starting to decline, and it was difficult for her to regenerate her energy and blood. Every battle could be said to be a loss of her lifespan.","Of course, she wasn’t willing to risk her life with the Elder Princess for nothing.","“Old scores?” Lady King Hu said coldly. “I’m afraid you don’t have the ability!”","The Elder Princess said coldly, “Not only do you want to kill them, but you also want to humiliate them and break their invincible Dao heart. How vicious. Today, I will give you two choices. Either you commit suicide or kneel. I will let you live!”","Lady King Hu’s expression was extremely ugly. The Elder Princess’ words were clearly humiliating her. If she knelt today, would she still have the face to face others in the future?","At her current stage, there was no hope for her to advance any further. She had already reached the second half of her life, and she already had one foot in the grave.","She lived for her reputation.","“You’re going too far!” Lady King Hu was burning with rage. She had a high status in the plains, but she had never been humiliated like this.","“So what?” the Elder Princess said faintly. “You non-humankind are bullying my brother, who is in secluded cultivation to recuperate. You came here to bully us. Do you really think that there is no one left to guard the human race?”","At this moment, a hint of anger flashed across Lady King Hu’s face. She was already regretting being the one to stick her neck out.","“Kneel down or commit suicide!” the Elder Princess repeated, her expression extremely cold.","“You’re too much!” Lady King Hu was furious. “Kill me if you dare!”","“Since you want me to kill you, then I’ll do as you wish!” the Elder Princess said lightly.","Lady King Hu immediately retreated, her face showing a hint of vigilance. In an instant, her body was covered in endless light, enveloping her within. Then, she took the lead to attack, the cane in her hand smashing down in the direction of the Elder Princess.","In an instant, it was as if a star had smashed down in front of the Elder Princess, not a cane.","The Elder Princess looked at her coldly and made a decisive move. She stretched out her white palm. In an instant, she was like a god in myths and legends, easily holding the falling star in her hand.","The star formed by the cane could no longer advance.","At this moment, the Elder Princess seemed to have an astonishing aura. She held the sun, moon, and stars in her hands. There was no one like her in the world.","While everyone was still immersed in this terrifying scene, the Elder Princess’ figure swayed and in the next moment, she had already arrived in front of Lady King Hu.","Lady King Hu’s domain was useless. It was like a hot knife cutting through butter and was directly broken by the Elder Princess.","Then, her white palm hit the chest of Lady King Hu.","Boom!","Lady King Hu’s chest was pierced through and her body exploded. Her primordial spirit did not even manage to escape before she was killed by a palm strike.","Then, the Elder Princess took away the body of Lady King Hu.","The body of a top-notch King was like a supreme medicine to many people, priceless.","The scene was deathly silent. Everyone stared at this scene with their mouths agape. They felt as if their breathing was about to stop.","This was a late King. She was actually killed just like that!"]},{"number":2415,"title":"Chapter 2415: A Peak King, King Flood Dragon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2415: A Peak King, King Flood Dragon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone seemed to be stunned by the Elder Princess’ shocking methods.","Lady King Hu was killed just like that.","The scene was silent, and everyone held their breaths!","The Elder Princess killed without holding back. This was enough to shock many people.","After all, in the world, the late King Stage was already considered a top-notch existence, and those at the peak of the King Stage were extremely rare.","The strength that the Elder Princess had displayed had already made everyone understand that she was already a peak existence at the peak King Stage.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to kill Lady King Hu so easily.","Among the humans, another peak King had appeared after the King humans. This was undoubtedly crucial to improving the current situation of the humans.","“What do you monsters want to do in today’s so-called All Races Meeting? You want to divide the territory of our humans? Do you think you’re worthy?” The Elder Princess’ gaze passed through the crowd and landed on the monster camp. Her eyes were as sharp as knives as she looked at them coldly.","The entire monster race immediately felt a powerful pressure, just like how they had ganged up on the humans just now.","In an instant, the Elder Princess made a powerful move. Her entire body was surrounded by divine light. In an instant, she pierced through the sky and tore through space.","He grabbed a King monster from the void and crushed it into pieces.","Domineering!","She was too domineering!","In the eyes of many people, the Elder Princess was even stronger than the human king.","It was truly terrifying.","Everyone in the human race knew that the Elder Princess could not give in at this time. Once she gave in, it would be a disaster for the humans.","At this moment, there was only a bloody battle. It was impossible to give in!","The humans had achieved its current status through bloody battles. Only through bloody battles could it establish its current status.","Seeing that the Elder Princess was about to attack again, all the Kings moved, releasing terrifying auras.","The Kings were the rulers of this world, not some random cat or dog. How could they allow the Elder Princess to treat them like this?","Suddenly, at this moment, a terrifying figure slowly walked out. It was an expert with a dragon’s head and a human body. He slowly walked over, his entire body wrapped in dazzling light. He was the only one standing in front of the Elder Princess.","It stopped the Elder Princess from attacking again.","“A peak King!” someone cried out in surprise, but many people immediately recognized this dragon-headed expert. He was actually the King of an extremely powerful monster race, the Flood Dragons.","The Flood Dragons were one of the top experts among the many royal families of the monsters that had Kings. If one traced their bloodline back, they were a branch of the true dragons.","The true dragons were a royal clan that had truly produced an Emperor. Since ancient times, they had been famous in the heavens and the earth.","Later on, after the true dragon clan suddenly disappeared, the flood dragon clan became a top clan among the many royal clans.","“Elder Princess, you are too overbearing. You kill people just like that. Do you not put us monsters in your eyes?”","King Flood Dragon slowly spoke, but there was a terrifying pressure wreaking havoc. It was the pressure of a peak King, and it was invincible.","King Flood Dragon was more than ten feet tall and looked extremely majestic. He had an unfathomable might.","When he appeared, he immediately stopped the terrifying power released by the Elder Princess.","“King Flood Dragon, aren’t you going to purify your bloodline in your Dragon Transformation Pool? Are you planning to interfere in the current world?” The Elder Princess stared coldly at King Flood Dragon.","Everyone held their breaths.","Everyone knew that there was a Dragon Transformation Pool in the ancestral land of the dragons. The Dragon Transformation Pool was left behind by the true dragons back then.","It could allow alternative dragons to remove the impurities in their bloodline and completely transform into true dragons.","Now that it was occupied by the flood dragons, no one had heard of any success so far. It seemed that they were lacking some important steps and treasures.","The flood dragons were a royal race. However, if they could transform their bloodline and become true dragons, they would have a chance to advance to the Emperor Stage.","This probability was much higher than the other races.","Therefore, the flood dragons had always been a relatively low-key royal family among the monsters. Although they were powerful, they rarely interfered with the world.","That was because they did not think much of it. The flood dragons had placed most of their energy on repairing the Dragon Transformation Pool.","Once it succeeded, all the flood dragons might be able to purify their bloodline and become legendary true dragons.","At that time, the flood dragons would become the rulers of the Central Plains, perhaps even the ruler of the world.","There was no need to compete with the various races in the world!","Because the flood dragons did not have the strength to conquer the world before becoming true dragons, once they became true dragons, they could sweep the world.","Ordinary struggles for hegemony were meaningless to them.","It was a secret that the various races in the world controlled the flood dragons. However, after so many years, they had never seen the flood dragons succeed. All the races understood that there was probably some fatal flaw that could not be repaired.","Therefore, they were not worried!","“As the saying goes, the divine weapons of the world belong to the capable. Since the humans is no longer qualified to rule the world, you should hand over most of your territory. You can also be allowed to survive as a secondary race. It’s the best choice for all races. There’s no need to cause a bloody storm!” King Flood Dragon spoke slowly, his tone filled with arrogance.","Even though the humans were an overlord race, it was nothing in the eyes of King Flood Dragon. As long as they transformed into true dragons, the mere humans were nothing.","The Elder Princess’ eyes flashed with a cold light. In the Central Plains, the five great races were the so-called five hegemonic powers, and the humans was the most outstanding of them all.","As for the second-class races, they were like the flood dragons among the monsters. They belonged to the second-class races. It seemed that they were only one level apart, but in fact, the status of the two sides was thousands of miles apart.","“Beat us humans into a secondary race? Do you think you dragons are worthy?” the Elder Princess said coldly.","“Stubborn!” King Flood Dragon said coldly. “However, I still lack a princess. With your strength and bloodline, you are qualified to be my princess. It’s just nice that I’ll beat you into submission today and marry you into my flood dragon clan!”","When everyone heard this, they were in an uproar.","They knew that King Flood Dragon wasn’t joking because the flood dragons were the descendants of the true dragons with a mottled bloodline. Therefore, they weren’t afraid of marrying other races. After all, the final offspring would be a flood dragon.","“You’re courting death!” The Elder Princess’ face turned ashen as she looked coldly at King Flood Dragon."]},{"number":2416,"title":"Chapter 2416: Unprecedented Despair, Hope!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2416: Unprecedented Despair, Hope!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Elder Princess’ anger burned on her face and could not be hidden.","She was at the peak of the King Stage, one of the strongest experts in the world. King Flood Dragon actually wanted her to be his princess. Wasn’t he courting death?","This was undoubtedly humiliating her, treating her as an accessory and not a peak King that could be treated equally.","“You want to kill me?” King Flood Dragon said coldly. “I think you probably haven’t figured it out yet, Elder Princess!”","“Do you think today’s All Races Meeting is just a meeting?” King Flood Dragon said indifferently. “I’m asking you to marry me and become the princess consort of the flood dragons. This is to protect you and prevent the bloodline of your Grand Xia royal family from being destroyed here. After all, I’ve met the founder of your Grand Xia once when I was young. He’s a hero of the world, and even I can’t help but yearn for him!”","When everyone heard this, they could not help but gasp.","No one expected King Flood Dragon to reveal such a shocking secret. He had actually met Grand Xia’s founder.","Grand Xia had been founded for many years, and the people of that generation had basically withered.","Even if it was the human king, there was still a considerable distance between the Elder Princess’ generation and the generation that founded the country.","It was an era that many people couldn’t even remember. After all, even if a King had a much longer lifespan than an ordinary person, there was still a limit.","It was impossible for them to survive indefinitely!","King Flood Dragon was actually from the same era as Grand Xia’s founder. This left countless people dumbfounded. Even though King Flood Dragon was still young at that time, it was still very shocking.","The founder of Grand Xia had passed away many years ago, but King Flood Dragon was still in his prime. Even though ordinary monsters had longer lifespans than humans, the dragons were famous for their longevity.","However, this was too terrifying.","But soon, someone thought of it. It was very likely that it had gone through multiple hibernations. During the hibernation period, the passage of time could be reduced to the minimum.","Otherwise, it would be impossible for him to survive until now!","In ancient times, the Emperors also had such a method of hibernation. It should be a method passed down from the true dragons. Otherwise, it might not be possible for an Emperor to be born in 100,000 years. It was impossible for the Emperors to stand side by side.","However, everyone quickly realized what King Flood Dragon meant.","Sure enough, a suspicious expression immediately appeared on the Elder Princess’ pretty face.","“I might as well tell you directly that today’s All Races Meeting is just to disperse the strength of your humans and prevent you from being desperate!” King Flood Dragon said indifferently. His words were filled with absolute confidence.","The purpose of this All Races Meeting was to attract human experts and then capture them all in one fell swoop.","It could greatly weaken the strength of the humans.","After all, if they fought in the territory of the humans, the hinterland of the humans would be scorched, which would hinder their future plans to take over.","More importantly, in the hinterland of the humans, human experts could borrow the power of the humans’ Luck Dragon and increase their strength greatly, even if they had far more Kings than the humans.","However, they might have to pay an astonishing price!","The Elder Princess instantly understood and knew where the problem was.","A plan to lure the tiger away from the mountain!","The experts of the humans immediately understood that this was a plan to lure the tiger away from the mountain. Or rather, it was an open plot.","They had no choice but to attend this meeting. If they didn’t come and waited for the various races to reach an agreement, it would be a disaster for the humans.","Therefore, this was a grand event that would be a disaster for the humans in the end, whether they came or not!","Even if the human experts did not appear, after the various races reached an agreement, they could still form a trend of extermination against the humans.","“Let’s go!”","The Elder Princess was about to tear open space and leave the All Races Meeting.","However, when the melodious sound of a bell rang, the sound waves of the bell actually froze the space, making the Elder Princess’ thoughts of tearing the space into nothingness.","“The Ocean Emperor Bell!”","The Elder Princess immediately reacted. Sure enough, a blue ancient bell was constantly striking in the distance.","Under the Ocean Emperor Bell, a middle-aged man from the marine folks wearing a dragon robe had a cold expression. He faintly used a terrifying aura to freeze the Elder Princess.","“It’s been a long time since I’ve tasted human flesh, hehe!”","At this moment, another figure slowly appeared in the void. It was a blood-colored figure with a red face and sharp fangs. His entire body carried an extremely terrifying aura.","Another top-notch King!","This terrifying blood-colored figure was none other than the evil god that the Hus, who guarded the depths of the grassland, believed in.","It was these evil gods who had taken away a portion of humans countless years ago and developed into the Hus that dominated the grasslands.","However, these evil gods usually didn’t appear in front of people, as if they were pursuing the Great Dao.","But now, in order to surround and kill the humans, he actually appeared here.","The entire humans naturally understood that this was a trap.","Other than the three peak Kings who were threatening the Elder Princess, there were also many experts from various races who were also approaching the human experts.","With the Ocean Emperor Bell holding the void in place, they couldn’t move even if they wanted to.","For a moment, the terrifying auras of all kinds of Lings were released, almost causing the world to collapse. All kinds of lights flashed in the sky, and the world trembled.","The situation instantly became extremely bad. Everyone had to face the siege of several experts of the same cultivation level.","There were so many human experts gathered here. Once they were destroyed, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Everyone felt as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over their heads.","With so many Kings unleashing their auras, the large group of half-Kings and Kings found it difficult to even breathe.","After the war with the monsters, the humans suffered too heavy a loss, pulling apart the gap in strength with the other races.","“Kill! I would rather die in a bloody battle!”","“Die!” a human expert shouted. However, he was instantly grabbed by a huge hand and killed by a King Hu.","“Die in a bloody battle? Just you guys? Stubborn!”","The Hu King only had a cold expression on his face. He simply treated the entire humans as ants.","“Today, I’ll say this. The humans will be destroyed here today. Even if the Grand Xia Founder revives, he won’t be able to save you. I said it!” the King Hu roared, his voice shaking the heavens. His terrifying aura threatened to collapse the world.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, a terrifying lightning bolt tore through the void and instantly turned into a spear that pierced through him. His figure suddenly plunged into the ground.","Boom!","For a moment, a huge wave of dust rose.","“Who do you think you are?”","A mocking voice slowly sounded."]},{"number":2417,"title":"Chapter 2417: Beat Them to Our Hearts’ Content and Kill Our Way Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 2417: Beat Them to Our Hearts’ Content and Kill Our Way Out","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone’s gaze turned over. In everyone’s eyes, a man in green strode over. He seemed slow but was actually fast. In just a moment, he had already arrived in front of everyone.","His appearance stirred the hearts of everyone, especially the humans. Almost everyone was roaring in their hearts.","During this period of time, they were really too aggrieved.","The dignified humans, the leader of the five great races, had now fallen to such a state, surrounded by various races!","In the past, they had never thought that the humans would end up like this.","When they saw this person, everyone was shocked. Not everyone liked people who came, but when they saw him at this moment, it was as if they saw hope.","“King Chu!”","“King Chu is here!”","Many human experts were skeptical. In their impression, Chu Yunfan was just a new King and seemed to be useless in such a battle.","However, the scene of Chu Yunfan sweeping through the crowd as soon as he appeared was too shocking, and it really made everyone look forward to it.","Chu Yunfan strode over with his body held high, exuding a supreme elegance.","He was completely different from the thin youth from back then. He was like a pillar that supported the sky, enough to support the humans.","Tang Siyu’s eyes reddened when she saw Chu Yunfan. She was prepared to die here, but Chu Yunfan appeared at the critical moment.","“King Chu!”","“King Chu, King Chu!”","The human experts shouted at the top of their lungs. It was unknown who would start first, but they sounded a little crazy.","The experts of the other races also looked at Chu Yunfan. They were no strangers to Chu Yunfan. Among the younger generation, he was the first to become a King. He had previously made a huge name for himself.","His strength was considered extremely powerful even among Kings.","“Chu Yunfan? Instead of staying in Zhenyuan City, you actually appeared here. It’s just nice that I’ll kill you too!”","An extremely powerful King Hu strode over and looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “Perhaps you will be an earth-shattering King in the future, but you will never have that chance again. The humans is destined to perish here today!”","“Kill me?” Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at him. “Do you think you can do it?”","At this moment, the King Hu attacked. His entire body was enveloped in golden multicolored light, and he looked extremely terrifying.","He did not make any unnecessary movements, but a spear appeared in his hand.","The spear pierced through the sky and headed straight for Chu Yunfan’s head.","This was a terrifying massacre!","In an instant, the space was pierced through by the spear, leaving a huge hole.","Clang!","Just as everyone was watching, they saw Chu Yunfan simply extend two fingers and caught the terrifying spear between them.","This terrifying attack could no longer advance an inch.","“How is that possible?” When the King Hu saw that his attack had been easily blocked by Chu Yunfan, he turned pale with fright.","However, he didn’t hesitate. The divine power in his body boiled. It was the power law. Under the enhancement of the power law, the power of the King Hu was enhanced to a terrifying level.","However, he found that he was still unable to move Chu Yunfan’s finger.","It was as if his two fingers were two divine mountains pressing down on his body, making him unable to move at all.","Thousands of rays of law light and streaks of light burst out from his body, interweaving into a divine mountain that pressed down on Chu Yunfan.","This was a supreme technique, a technique that truly belonged to a King!","It was a supreme divine power manifested by his laws!","However, Chu Yunfan’s eyes were filled with a terrifying aura of disaster. In an instant, he tore apart the divine power of the King Hu.","It turned into a terrifying power of disaster and directly acted on the body of the King Hu. It tore the King Hu into pieces in the air and turned into a rain of blood that filled the sky. Chu Yunfan grabbed the King Hu’s body pieces and poured it on the Brahma Tree.","Instant kill!","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took a few breaths for the outcome of the battle between the two sides to be decided. The King Hu, who was enough to shake the entire world and make all the experts in the world look at him, was actually torn apart by Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes.","“Didn’t you want to fight?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “Then let’s beat them to our hearts’ content and kill our way out!”","Everyone was shocked. Chu Yunfan’s declaration was earth-shattering!","However, the entire human race was united against a common enemy. At this moment, no one still had any hope of luck.","The various races’ intentions of encircling the humans were already clear.","Previously, the various races had chosen to stay put and not stab the humans in the back when they were fighting the demons.","But now that the demons were heavily injured and had retreated, the various races had no future troubles and could attack with their full strength.","Everyone understood that since the various races had already shed all pretense of cordiality, they would definitely not let the matter rest so easily.","“Kill all the humans and uproot them!” a King Barbarian roared.","“King Fire Cloud Barbarian has already gone to the capital to kill the human king. Today is the day of humanity’s destruction!”","When the humans heard this news, their faces changed drastically. King Fire Cloud Barbarian was the number one King barbarian among the many King barbarians in the Shiwan Mountains. He was also the one with the highest possibility of becoming an Emperor barbarian.","Many human experts thought of a terrifying consequence. If the Imperial Capital was breached and the human king who was recuperating in the Imperial Capital was killed, it would be a disaster for the entire human race.","Although not all the humans were willing to submit to Grand Xia, Grand Xia was undoubtedly the leader of the human faction.","If Grand Xia was destroyed, then the essence of the humans would be destroyed as well.","“King Fire Cloud Barbarian? Are you talking about him?”","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan grabbed out from the void and pulled out a bloody head.","All the barbarians’ expressions changed when they saw the head. It was the head of King Fire Cloud Barbarian.","Although his appearance could be faked, the residual fluctuations of the laws on his head could not be deceived.","Everyone’s aura was completely different, and no one could impersonate anyone else. Because of this, they immediately understood that it was the King Fire Cloud Barbarian.","It was obvious that their previous plan had failed. King Fire Cloud Barbarian had gone all the way to the Imperial City to kill the human king, but he had been killed in the end.","The fate of this army was naturally unquestionable.","“Surround and kill humans? Just you guys?” Chu Yunfan grinned coldly."]},{"number":2418,"title":"Chapter 2418: Heavily Wounding the Evil God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2418: Heavily Wounding the Evil God","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The twists and turns! What did they mean by the twists and turns? This was the twists and turns!","Previously, the humans were afraid that the other races would go straight to the imperial capital and destroy the humans’ inheritance.","However, they did not expect that the head of the commander of the other team was already here.","It could be said to be great joy and great sorrow!","They had thought that they had already fallen into a desperate situation. Who would have thought that they could actually turn the tables?","King Fire Cloud Barbarian had been beheaded!","Until now, even if the situation was still very dangerous, it had not reached that kind of dangerous situation!","“Today, we can only fight a bloody battle to kill our way out and for the future of the humans!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan made his move. In an instant, endless universe stars appeared around him. Then, Chu Yunfan slapped out, turning into a Flying Celestial Seal, and slapped a powerful King to death.","The battle instantly began again!","When she saw Chu Yunfan coming to her aid, the Elder Princess could not help but heave a sigh of relief. Three peak Kings had attacked her, and she had almost lost.","At this stage, everyone was about the same. The difference in numbers was definitely enough to determine life and death.","“Kill her first, I’ll go kill Chu Yunfan!”","At this moment, the evil god that came out of the grassland shouted and charged straight toward Chu Yunfan.","A terrifying evil power was released in an instant, almost turning the entire world into a domain of evil gods, enveloping Chu Yunfan within.","“It depends on whether you can kill me!”","Chu Yunfan was fearless.","Boom!","The two of them had yet to fight directly, but the laws of both sides had already begun to collide in the air.","This was a technique that belonged to the peak King Stage!","Only now did everyone finally confirm that Chu Yunfan had definitely reached the peak of the King Stage.","Previously, everyone had only vaguely suspected that Chu Yunfan might have reached the peak of the King Stage.","Now, this news was finally confirmed. Chu Yunfan was indeed at the peak of the King Stage!","For the humans, Chu Yunfan’s sudden rise made the humans’ disadvantage in terms of top-notch experts less obvious.","As the two sides collided, divine light shook the world.","The evil god’s aura was extremely evil, but Chu Yunfan’s aura was righteous and righteous.","Especially Chu Yunfan’s thunder law, which was the most pure Yang power in the world. It was completely the nemesis of the evil god’s power.","Although at this stage of cultivation, there was no longer the problem of complete restraint, it still depended on one’s cultivation.","In a situation where their cultivation levels were about the same, there was naturally still a restraint.","In the collision of the laws, dazzling brilliance splashed out.","In the instant of the collision, it became the source of destruction, and at the same time, the victor was determined.","Chu Yunfan’s thunder law directly broke through the evil god’s evil god law.","Chu Yunfan’s attack shattered the surrounding space in an instant.","The group of experts also avoided the two people who were fighting, not daring to approach at all.","“I didn’t expect a figure like you to appear among the descendants of the humans. However, your outcome will be no different from that of the human king of Grand Xia. If he hadn’t run away quickly that day, I would have skinned him and him!” The evil god laughed hideously.","The evil god’s words revealed a terrifying aura. He was actually a supreme existence that had existed since the founding of Grand Xia.","His lifespan was a little terrifying.","It was truly terrifying.","Everyone present was the most powerful expert of the Central Plains, so they naturally knew some things about the founding of the Grand Xia.","At that time, Grand Xia Founder and a group of Kings swept across the world and destroyed the previous dynasty. It could be said that he was in high spirits and wanted to sweep across the world and unify the Central Plains. He directly led his army into the grasslands, but he encountered an unprecedented defeat in the grasslands.","Not to mention the loss of ordinary elites, even the loss of Kings in the depths of the grasslands was not just one or two. It could be said that a large number of experts had been lost.","That battle had caused unprecedented losses to Grand Xia. Ever since then, the power of the nation of Grand Xia had changed from an offensive to a defensive position.","To the experts of the humans, this was a humiliation.","They had originally been able to make a name for themselves in the Central Plains, but because of this crushing defeat, they had no choice but to acknowledge the existence of the other races.","It was related to this evil god in front of him!","This made the humans’ expressions turn ugly. There wasn’t just one evil god in the depths of the grassland. It could even be said that there was an entire race. It was these evil gods who created the Hus and tore the humans apart.","“Hmph, who do you think you are!”","Chu Yunfan grinned. In an instant, he moved. A pair of lightning wings on his back directly blasted in front of him.","This attack was directed at the evil god!","“Kill!” the evil god roared. He felt a terrifying aura ravage him, almost wanting to kill him.","“Evil God Domain!”","The evil god roared and chanted an ancient incantation. No one knew what language it was using, but every word had great power. It shook its own laws and exploded with unprecedented power.","Chu Yunfan’s movement was blocked and slowed down, but he still punched the evil god.","Bam!","The terrifying attack set off an earth-shattering tide. The evil god was sent flying thousands of miles away by the punch.","Spurt","The evil god spat out a mouthful of blood. His body was almost shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","He still couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan could be so strong.","If it wasn’t for his domain blocking Chu Yunfan’s attack, his body would have been shattered on the spot.","Although they were both at the peak of the King Stage, Chu Yunfan was a little too powerful. He even almost ignited his primordial spirit with a punch and blew it up.","But after a while, the evil god’s injuries were mostly healed.","This recovery ability was much faster than the recovery speed of ordinary creatures.","However, in the next second, his body was once again shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","It was so fast that he couldn’t even react in time!","Chu Yunfan stepped on the halos formed by laws.","This was the law of speed that he had evolved and comprehended from thunder laws. He had unleashed the path of speed to the extreme.","This was also the magical part of these laws. As the saying went, one principle was connected to a hundred principles. One law could evolve into thousands of different laws.","There were three thousand Great Dao, and Dao gave birth to one, one gave birth to three, three gave birth to ten thousand, and ten thousand was infinite.","Now, Chu Yunfan had finally reached this realm.","“It’s useless. You can’t kill me!”","The evil god looked at Chu Yunfan coldly with regret in his eyes.","Back then, he was awakened from his deep sleep. Someone sacrificed living beings and summoned him to fight the enemy.","However, he was killed by someone. It was none other than Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2419,"title":"Chapter 2419: Sealing the Evil God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2419: Sealing the Evil God","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, at that time, he did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes at all. He even chose to sleep and did not wake up.","Chu Yunfan was just a half-King. To an ancient Evil God like him, even if Chu Yunfan was a King, so what?","In his life, he had seen too many Kings, countless of them. His origin was very ancient, even before the founding of Grand Xia.","In their eyes, the war between the Hus and the humans was just child’s play. Only the founder of Grand Xia’s invasion of the grasslands had caused them to go to war.","Since then, the humans had basically not made any moves.","No matter how powerful the half-King Stage was, they were only ants. He was not even interested in waking up for them.","In his opinion, even if Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary genius, he would probably need a hundred years or even hundreds of years to become a King.","As for being able to cultivate to the peak of the King Stage and be on par with him, the possibility was also very small.","After all, there were so many Kings, and there were very few who could reach the peak of the King Stage.","It was a threshold.","Who would have thought that in less than a hundred years, not only had Chu Yunfan become a King, but he had also reached the peak of the King Stage.","Now, his combat strength had completely surpassed his. This made him feel that he had miscalculated, completely miscalculated.","Or rather, he did not expect a monster like Chu Yunfan to appear. It was far beyond his imagination!","Ever since Chu Yunfan started his cultivation, he had constantly broken everyone’s understanding of cultivation.","“Can’t kill you? I don’t believe that there’s anyone who can’t be killed!” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fists, and terrifying divine power boiled in his body. In an instant, he called upon the eight gods and suppressed the Evil God.","The eight heavenly deities suppressed all the evil in the world. No one could resist them.","Boom!","This punch almost caused the Evil God to collapse.","Every punch caused the world to collapse and space to shatter.","The Evil God was sent flying and kept coughing up blood.","He was getting weaker and weaker. Each of these Evil Gods was special. They weren’t normal life forms. Their life forms weren’t normal flesh and blood creatures.","If it was a normal living being, they would have collapsed long ago. However, the Evil God could persist until now and recover.","It was as if there was some mysterious substance in his body that could continuously heal his injuries.","The Evil God had been beaten to the point of losing its temper. As soon as it recovered, it was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“Aaah!” The Evil God kept roaring.","“Impossible!” The Evil God couldn’t believe that he had been beaten up by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. He didn’t kill the Evil God directly. His eyes flickered with light. It was the Eye of Heavenly Dao that could see through everything.","Even though the Evil God was nothing in front of him, he was still at the peak of the King Stage.","What interested Chu Yunfan the most was that this Evil God obviously didn’t rely on normal methods to advance, but relied on a secret method to advance. It was more like a modified species.","He was no stranger to this kind of transformation. He had seen it many times when he was in the Federation.","The Monster Cult relied on this method to transform many humans into human-shaped weapons in their hands. The essence of the Evil God, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, was like this modified weapon.","However, it was obvious that the people who modified them were not as powerful as the scientists in the Federation.","It was actually able to modify a King living being. This in itself was very shocking.","Because of this, countless years had passed since the founding of Grand Xia, but this Evil God had not made any progress.","Even a pig would have a chance of breaking through to the Emperor Stage if it could live that long.","Chu Yunfan was using his Disaster Star Eyes to examine their nature, so he wasn’t in a hurry to kill them.","The Evil God also saw through Chu Yunfan’s goal and was even more furious.","He was furious!","He was once so arrogant that he even chased after the Grand Xia founder. Now, he was actually treated like a plaything by others.","“How dare you underestimate me!”","The Evil God was furious and kept roaring.","“So what if I underestimate you?” Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold.","“If I’m not wrong, you’re just a modified creature created by someone, right? Tsk tsk, you haven’t made any progress in all these years. You’ve really lived a miserable life all these years!” Chu Yunfan said.","The Evil God was shocked because ever since they appeared, no one could tell that they were man-made.","In other words, their strength was too strong. There were not many people in the world who could stand shoulder to shoulder with them. Such people were rare in every era.","Such existences were very wary of each other and generally would not easily start a war. After all, each of them was a top figure in the world. No one was willing to fight to the death for some meaningless things.","Ever since the Grand Xia founder’s battle, no one dared to venture deep into the grasslands anymore. Although Grand Xia was at its peak, in terms of the strength of its experts, it was not as strong as when it was founded.","Thus, all of Grand Xia knew very little about them. They only knew that there was a group of Evil Gods in the depths of the plains.","However, Chu Yunfan had seen through them in the first exchange.","“I’ll kill you!” The Evil God was even more furious when he heard Chu Yunfan’s words.","The Evil God roared and chanted an ancient spell. It wanted to kill Chu Yunfan directly. A mysterious power turned into runes and fell on Chu Yunfan’s body, wanting to melt him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s body instantly emitted a golden light that directly destroyed these runes.","A punch landed directly on the Evil God’s body!","The Evil God screamed and its entire body exploded. At this time, Chu Yunfan saw that there was a mysterious substance in the Evil God’s body that reassembled him.","“Seal!” Chu Yunfan reached out with his hand, and his five fingers turned into the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermillion Bird, Black Tortoise, and Golden Qilin. The power of the five spirits in the world sealed the Evil God’s body in an instant.","To be more precise, he had sealed his physical body in this state.","It remained in a state of being torn apart and was suppressed by the five spirits. Then, it was grabbed by Chu Yunfan into the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan did not even have the intention of killing him. Instead, he wanted to capture him and study the secrets in his body.","In Chu Yunfan’s heart, the Evil Gods in the depths of the grassland were undoubtedly his future enemies. Now that he had a chance to study them, he naturally wouldn’t let it go.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, less than fifteen minutes had passed. Other than Chu Yunfan, who had already ended the battle, the other battlefields had already gone crazy."]},{"number":2420,"title":"Chapter 2420: The Dead King Marine Folk","paragraphs":["Chapter 2420: The Dead King Marine Folk","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan had defeated his opponent and sealed the Evil God!","Looking around the battlefield, they were still in the middle of a heated battle.","Although Chu Yunfan had joined, the difference in strength between the human and the other races was very obvious.","They were almost forced to retreat step by step, but there was nowhere to retreat because experts from various races were everywhere.","However, Chu Yunfan’s arrival had greatly motivated the humans and allowed them to see the light.","Especially when Chu Yunfan had defeated the Evil God and sealed it.","This undoubtedly boosted the morale of these humans, while the other races could not help but worry. They could only use 80% of their strength at most.","Everyone knew that the most important thing in today’s battle was the outcome of the battle between the few peak Kings.","Now, one of them had already been defeated by Chu Yunfan. This caused the attacks of the experts of the various races to stagnate.","“Come and help me!” The Elder Princess was overjoyed when she saw this. She was in a rather sorry state under the joint attack of King Flood Dragon and the King marine folk, and she was in imminent danger.","If it wasn’t for the fact that she was extraordinary, she would have been defeated and killed long ago.","However, the other two people were unable to kill the Elder Princess in time. Now, she really had a helper.","“Damn it, she got a helper!”","The King marine folk roared and pounced on Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","A great battle instantly erupted. The Ocean Emperor Bell suppressed down from top to bottom. Its terrifying might suppressed the heavens.","Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge. He clenched his fist and threw a punch.","Boom!","The punch landed on the Ocean Emperor Bell, causing the sky to tremble and the space to explode.","At the same time, the King marine folk flew down and shouted, “Chu Yunfan, it’s useless even if you come today. The humans will be destroyed today!”","The King marine folk waved his fists and instantly turned into a giant of the sea, charging toward Chu Yunfan.","This attack shook the entire world!","However, Chu Yunfan did not give in. He took a step forward and a terrifying collision erupted.","Boom!","A terrifying collision erupted once again, and fresh blood swept out along with the tide.","The King marine folk was sent flying. The muscles on his arms exploded. When he collided with Chu Yunfan, his fist shattered the muscles on his arms.","The King marine folk retreated repeatedly, and the muscles on his arms almost immediately recovered. In a pure physical competition, he was completely at a disadvantage.","A look of disbelief flashed across his eyes. His physique was not ordinary either. He could fight with the strongest physique in the world without falling into a disadvantage.","But now, just the difference in physical strength was already so great.","He didn’t know what kind of physique Chu Yunfan had to be able to unleash such astonishing power.","Almost in the next moment, the Ocean Emperor Bell flew out and pressed down on Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, it was as if what was suppressed was not the Ocean Emperor Bell, but a world of water.","This was a true Emperor artifact. It was once an Emperor artifact of an Emperor marine folk. Later, it fell into the hands of this King marine folk.","He was only able to force the Elder Princess into such a sorry state by relying on an Emperor artifact.","Chu Yunfan’s reaction speed was even faster. The Mountain River Diagram flew out from above his head.","The two Emperor artifacts burst out with extremely dazzling light in the sky.","Clang!","In the instant of the terrifying collision, the trembling sky erupted with the light of the Great Path. A terrifying imperial pressure was released.","The group of Kings and other experts were sent flying.","“Emperor artifacts! This is a collision between two Emperor artifacts!”","Many people were shocked. Emperor artifacts were something that many Kings could only dream of.","Because Emperor artifacts could only be refined by Emperors, they were extremely rare.","There were even fewer intact ones.","Because the decline of the ancient era was due to the war between the Emperors, even the Emperors had to do their best.","In such a battle, many Emperor artifacts were destroyed or even completely destroyed.","Those who could survive could be counted on one’s fingers.","Circles of terrifying Great Dao laws spread out like terrifying halos.","The space shook and shattered, and the chaos within poured out.","However, this confrontation only lasted for an instant before it ended.","To be more precise, the outcome of the battle had already been decided. The Mountain River Diagram had already defeated the Ocean Emperor Bell. It had enveloped the Ocean Emperor Bell and suppressed it within the Mountain River Diagram.","Spurt!","The King marine folk hurriedly retreated, his entire body trembling as if he had seen something extremely unbelievable. He simply could not believe it.","Chu Yunfan had suppressed the Ocean Emperor Bell with just one move.","Ever since he had obtained the Ocean Emperor Bell, he had never been in such a situation. Even when he was fighting against other Emperor artifacts, he had never been at a disadvantage.","There was no difference between Emperor artifacts and King artifacts.","That was because to the King Stage, that was too far away from them.","The only thing that could determine the winner in the shortest time was the difference in strength between the users.","In other words, his strength was instantly suppressed by Chu Yunfan, and he was completely at a disadvantage in an instant.","“Impossible!”","The King marine folk could not accept that he was so much weaker than Chu Yunfan.","They were both at the peak of the King Stage, but the strength he displayed was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s attack was launched. His fist shattered the sky and blasted into the universe, directly blasting toward the King marine folk.","The King marine folk waved its fists in an attempt to block.","On one side were eight golden gods that suppressed heaven and earth, and on the other side was blue ocean giant that shattered the sky.","However, the battle between the two sides was decided in an instant. The ocean giant was instantly defeated and directly shattered into pieces.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s fist didn’t slow down and directly hit the King marine folk.","The King marine folk only had time to scream before his body was blasted into pieces.","Blood splattered out, and bone and blood flew everywhere.","In an instant, the King marine folk suffered a crushing defeat and died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","His physical body collapsed, and the primordial spirit hidden in it was ignited by Chu Yunfan’s fist force. It burned in the air and was burned to nothing in a moment.","Another peak King had been defeated. At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked extremely terrifying!","It was as if he was an Emperor!"]},{"number":2421,"title":"Chapter 2421: Calmly Killing the Flood Dragon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2421: Calmly Killing the Flood Dragon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the shortest time possible, Chu Yunfan had already killed the King marine folk and ignited the King marine folk’s primordial spirit with one punch.","The speed was so fast that many people did not even have time to react before everything was over.","Seeing this scene, the Elder Princess was pleasantly surprised, while King Flood Dragon was shocked and angry. Chu Yunfan’s killing speed was too fast. Two powerful opponents that even he was extremely afraid of had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“I’ll help you deal with King Flood Dragon. You go kill the others!”","Chu Yunfan entered the battlefield.","The Elder Princess was finally freed. Although they were both at the peak of the King Stage, compared to an old monster like King Flood Dragon, the Elder Princess was undoubtedly much more immature.","Facing such an existence, she was not confident.","Although he could remain undefeated, defeating King Flood Dragon was too difficult. It was basically impossible.","Now that Chu Yunfan had taken over, it was naturally a good thing.","“Don’t go!” King Flood Dragon roared and threw a punch, trying to stop the Elder Princess from leaving.","However, Chu Yunfan stopped him.","Boom!","His attacks were all blocked by Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram.","Seeing that the Elder Princess was gradually disappearing from his sight, King Flood Dragon could only give up on chasing after him. He stared at Chu Yunfan and said, “Among the humans, there are actually several peak Kings. It’s really impressive. But do you think you humans can still defy the heavens?”","“So what if we go against the heavens? All of us cultivators go against the heavens!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Cut the crap. The flood dragons are known as the royal family of the monsters. Let me see how many punches you can take!”","“How many punches can I take? You’re too arrogant!” King Flood Dragon said coldly. “Do you think you have won for sure? I think you underestimate me. Do you think you can defeat me just because you defeated them? In terms of bloodline, you are no match for me!”","“Bloodline? Hahahahaha!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. “You are still obsessed with bloodlines. This is why you can only become the royal family of the monsters despite being close to the true dragons. However, we humans have our own bloodline and are the leader of the five great races in the world!”","Chu Yunfan then added, “You are obsessed with the glory of your bloodline and ancestors, but we believe in our own hard work! At this point, even if I’m only a mortal, I can still kill you!”","“A mortal? Ridiculous!” King Flood Dragon roared and instantly launched an attack.","In an instant, all the attacks turned into thousands of beams of light that swept toward Chu Yunfan like mercury.","“Petty tricks!”","Chu Yunfan reached out with his hand and grabbed the light. After a while, it disappeared without a trace.","A halberd appeared in King Flood Dragon’s hand. There was a true dragon carved on the halberd. As he waved it, it came to life and transformed into a true dragon that pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","This was a terrifying attack that could turn mountains into dust and evaporate the sea.","It was extremely terrifying.","At this moment, the Mountain River Diagram above Chu Yunfan’s head spun continuously and absorbed all the energy into the Mountain River Diagram. It could not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan at all.","Chu Yunfan’s hands tore open the terrifying azure dragon in front of him in an instant.","Then, Chu Yunfan launched an attack. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and endless golden light condensed in his hand. With a punch, the sky collapsed and the earth shattered.","The eight gods transformed into eight heavenly dragons and swept out, shaking the entire world.","Immediately after, the eight gods pressed down in King Flood Dragon’s direction. King Flood Dragon kept roaring angrily and continuously blasted out terrifying attacks, wanting to shatter the eight gods in the air.","However, it was useless. The eight gods were unstoppable.","King Flood Dragon transformed into his true form, a terrifying flood dragon that was more than 30,000 feet long. The flood dragon roared as it attacked the terrifying attack.","Boom!","A terrifying collision occurred. In an instant, a terrifying light bloomed and spread in all directions like a tidal wave.","When the energy wave dissipated, everyone saw that King Flood Dragon, who was at the center of the explosion, was covered in blood.","Chu Yunfan’s punch had severely injured him.","When many people saw this scene, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. This was unprecedented. One had to know that the physical strength of the flood dragons was one of the best among the monsters.","In the same level, the flood dragons’ physical body had never fallen into a disadvantage.","King Flood Dragon had never been afraid of anyone!","The humans had always been inferior to the humans in terms of physical divine arts. This was not something that had happened in just one or two days.","But now, the outcome was King Flood Dragon suffering a huge loss, while Chu Yunfan had the upper hand.","“Roar!” King Flood Dragon let out an angry roar. Terrifying demonic energy surged into the sky from all over his body. It was like chaos as it charged up.","At the same time, a powerful domain was released around his body. In this domain, he was the true king.","However, Chu Yunfan held the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand. Terrifying immortal light surged from the cauldron, and endless terrifying aura surged out.","In the next moment, the Mountain River Cauldron was like a divine mountain as it smashed down on King Flood Dragon.","Boom!","The attack landed on King Flood Dragon’s body, shattering the horn on his head.","This strike landed, causing King Flood Dragon to feel dizzy and to bleed.","“Your body is very strong, you live up to your reputation!” Chu Yunfan held the Mountain River Cauldron and said indifferently.","However, in King Flood Dragon’s ears, it was a huge humiliation.","Chu Yunfan seemed to be praising the physical strength of the Flood-dragon Race, but no matter how strong their physical bodies were, they were still beaten up by Chu Yunfan like ants.","“Roar!” The King Flood Dragon roared repeatedly and was about to attack.","However, Chu Yunfan flapped his lightning wings and appeared in front of King Flood Dragon in an instant.","The domain in front of King Flood Dragon could not block him at all. Chu Yunfan was like a sharp knife that instantly stabbed into King Flood Dragon.","However, Chu Yunfan stabbed the long sword in his hand into King Flood Dragon’s body, causing blood and flesh to fly everywhere.","“Roar!” King Flood Dragon screamed and roared repeatedly.","He wanted to escape, but he found that there was no way at all. His body was actually overlapped by Chu Yunfan’s domain, directly covering him.","Chu Yunfan calmly held his sword and chopped off King Flood Dragon’s head.","King Flood Dragon was dead!"]},{"number":2422,"title":"Chapter 2422: Killing Everything, the Great Battle Ends","paragraphs":["Chapter 2422: Killing Everything, the Great Battle Ends","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","From the beginning to the end, Chu Yunfan was very calm.","King Flood Dragon was no match for Chu Yunfan at all!","It was a crushing and sweeping sweep!","King Flood Dragon was already an extremely terrifying existence among peak Kings.","However, in Chu Yunfan’s hands, he was like a child. He was easily killed. The entire process was as easy as a chef dismembering a cow.","The Elder Princess, who was watching from afar, had just killed a King demon. She had just started a massacre and had only killed a few Kings when Chu Yunfan had already killed King Flood Dragon.","The Elder Princess had been watching the battle between the two of them.","When she saw Chu Yunfan easily kill King Flood Dragon, she could not help but reveal a shocked expression.","From the looks of it, Chu Yunfan had easily caught King Flood Dragon, trapped him, and killed him.","Those who didn’t know would even have the illusion that King Flood Dragon was easy to kill!","However, only she knew how terrifying King Flood Dragon was. He could completely suppress her in a one-on-one battle. At most, she could only protect herself. It was impossible for her to defeat King Flood Dragon.","It was because of this that Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying!","Unknowingly, the talented junior in her eyes had completely surpassed her.","It could even be said that the two of them were not on the same level. If it was not for the fact that Chu Yunfan did not have the pressure of the Imperial Dao, she would have thought that Chu Yunfan was already a legendary Imperial Dao expert.","After Chu Yunfan killed King Flood Dragon, all the experts of the four races collapsed. Their last hope had disappeared.","In particular, Chu Yunfan had easily killed a peak King. In their eyes, it was simply terrifying.","It was as if they were looking at a monster. If Chu Yunfan could kill three peak Kings so easily, then there was no need to say anything about killing them.","All of them collapsed at once.","Everyone’s first reaction was to escape.","On the other hand, the human experts ‘morale soared. Everyone knew that the critical moment had arrived.","Originally, they were being suppressed and each of them had to face several experts. It could be said to be very difficult.","But now, the situation was reversed. Every expert of these races wanted to run, so the pressure on them was greatly reduced.","“Stop them! We can’t let them escape!” someone among the human experts shouted.","In an instant, all the human experts tried their best to stop the experts from escaping.","“You’re courting death!”","The experts of the various races only wanted to escape at this moment. When they saw that the human experts actually wanted to stop them from escaping, they were instantly furious and attacked with all their might.","However, these human experts were basically on par with them. Although they were at a complete disadvantage in terms of numbers, it was more than enough to delay them for a short period of time.","At this moment, the Elder Princess could finally let go and start killing.","As a peak King, once the Elder Princess completely unleashed her slaughter, how terrifying was it? She could almost finish off a King in a few moves.","There was a huge gap between her and the other Kings.","What made countless people even more terrified was that after taking King Flood Dragon’s corpse, Chu Yunfan also joined the battle.","“Seven Violet Thunder Swords!”","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand, and a ball of purple lightning kept spinning in his hand. In an instant, it turned into a long sword.","The sword light shot out like a beam of light.","Immediately after, this sword light turned into a sword light that filled the sky in the air and directly flew toward the experts of the various races.","These sword lights were too fast. Those experts of the various races were hit in almost an instant and killed in an instant.","Bang!","Bang!","Bang!","The experts of the various races were struck by the sword light, and their bodies exploded into pieces.","In an instant, hundreds of peak Domainians and even half-Kings from various races died under the sword light. Those who were not at the King Stage could not even withstand Chu Yunfan’s sword.","One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan was now. The number of people was meaningless to him.","“Kill them all, really kill them all!”","Many of the Kings were shocked. Chu Yunfan’s actions had made it clear that he would not forgive anyone. Everyone who came would die, and no one would be able to escape.","This in itself was a clear statement.","Of course, when they had the upper hand, they had never thought of letting the humans live. Today, they were going to completely destroy the human experts here.","Perhaps due to the large number of humans, the humans could be allowed to exist as a vassal race. However, the glory of being the leader of the five major races could only exist in the past.","Thinking of this, they no longer had the calmness and brutality they had at the beginning. They all wanted to escape.","However, the King humans were all holding them back. Be it Chu Hongcai, Huangfu Longhao, Tang Siyu, or even the old dean of Virtuous Academy, all of them were engaged in a bloody battle.","They had to buy time, even if it was just one more second. With one more second, they would be able to kill one more non-human King, and the pressure on the humans would be greatly reduced.","After this incident, everyone understood that the idea of the humans coexisting with other races was impossible.","Unless it was a state of balanced strength. Once the strength was not balanced, everything would change completely.","Boom!","A terrifying scene occurred. Chu Yunfan killed his way into the crowd of Kings, just as many people had guessed.","Chu Yunfan held a huge cauldron in his hand and smashed it down.","One of the King marine folks was directly hit. Of course, his body exploded and his primordial spirit was instantly shattered.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop after his attack. He continued to kill without stopping. In just a short time, more than ten Kings had died at his hands.","Chu Yunfan, who was holding the Mountain River Cauldron, was simply a god of slaughter. The intensity of his slaughter was simply terrifying.","In addition, the Elder Princess, the King humans, and the other top human experts were working together.","Fifteen minutes later, all the Kings of the other races were killed. Some died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, some died in the Elder Princess’s hands, and even the old dean of Virtuous Academy and the others had killed some people.","However, other than Chu Yunfan, the others were more or less in a sorry state.","However, everyone was extremely excited. The results of this battle were really too rich.","When news of this battle spread, and the world was shocked."]},{"number":2423,"title":"Chapter 2423: An Earth-Shattering Change","paragraphs":["Chapter 2423: An Earth-Shattering Change","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The results of this battle quickly spread throughout the Central Plains.","When all the races received this news, it could be said that the world was in an uproar. It was like boiling water.","Especially for the humans who had been worried and afraid during this period of time, it was simply unprecedented good news.","One battle to rule the world!","If one were to say that the original situation of the five great races dominating the Central Plains had been completely changed by the invasion of the demons.","The humans had fallen from the top of the five races to the bottom of the five races.","Many people were even sighing with emotion. The world changed too quickly. The decline of the humans had suddenly happened in just a few decades, which was something that no one had expected.","The status of the humans among the five great races was in jeopardy. It was as if the humans had the possibility of going extinct overnight.","The various races joining forces to deal with the humans was not even a surprise attack. It should be said that it was an open scheme. The various races even kept clamoring to make the humans withdraw from their current territory.","They even wanted to completely exterminate the humans!","Such comments were everywhere, and the humans naturally had their own channels to know!","The humans were furious, but they could not resist. In the battle with the demons, the humans had already lost too much strength and foundation.","Their entire strength was not even a third of their peak.","They were already at the bottom of the five great races.","Many people of insight had even begun to suspect that the survival of the humans in the future would become a problem.","However, who would have thought that the tables had turned overnight?","The humans, which had been in imminent danger, had once again become the number one faction in the Central Plains.","The experts of the four races were killed overnight.","Not only did the humans stop King Fire Cloud Barbarian from attacking the Imperial City, but they also successfully killed the experts of the four races.","Chu Yunfan’s reputation flourished even further. This King of the younger generation was originally seen by many as the hope of the future and the pillar of the future.","However, no one had expected him to grow up in such a short period of time and become the pillar of the entire human race.","“What? Three peak Kings have actually appeared among the humans?” Many people were shocked by the sudden appearance of two other peak Kings among the humans.","One of them was naturally the Elder Princess. This was within the expectations of many people and was also acceptable.","This was because the Elder Princess’s strength had always been rumored to be the number one expert of the royal family. In many rumors, her strength was even stronger than the human king.","Now, it seemed like nonsense. However, the Elder Princess was still the number one expert below the human king. It was very reasonable for her to become the second peak King of the human race.","However, the other, which was Chu Yunfan, was beyond what many people could accept.","Chu Yunfan’s growth was too fast, especially for those of his generation. Even now, they still had no way to decide the direction of the war, but he could already decide the direction of the five great races of the Central Plains.","“I heard that those peak Kings were killed by King Chu!”","“King Chu is so strong. He’s simply the number one genius since ancient times!”","“Since ancient times, apart from the Emperors of antiquity era, I have never seen anyone who could reach this stage at this age!”","Everyone in the human race was clamoring, and so were the other races. At first, no one dared to believe it, and they were unwilling to believe it. However, as more and more news spread, none of the experts who had been reported to have died stood up to refute it. The four races fell silent.","Originally, the four races had been stationed at the border. It seemed that they were waiting to ambush and eliminate the human experts at the All Races Meeting before they began to march into the human territory.","However, now that a group of Kings had been killed, especially a few peak Kings, it made the various races boil.","They immediately turned from an offensive to a defensive position. Even after the army retreated to their respective territories, they immediately took up a defensive position.","At this moment, there was no intention of attacking. In fact, they did not dare to attack at all. At this moment, as long as the human race did not find trouble with them, it was already very good.","The situation was instantly reversed!","The speed at which the situation in the Central Plains was reversed left many people gasping in amazement!","Even many ancient geniuses were dumbfounded. When only a small number of them entered the King Stage, Chu Yunfan had already dominated the King Stage and become the top master of the world.","There was no doubt that they were very clear about the difference between an ordinary King and a peak King.","What was even more terrifying was that the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed seemed to be one of the best among the peak King Stage.","According to the rumors, the four peak Kings who had died at the hands of the humans had not died at the hands of others, but at the hands of Chu Yunfan.","First, he killed King Fire Cloud Barbarian and stopped the armies from attacking the imperial capital.","Then, he went to the All Races Meeting alone and killed the Evil God, King Flood Dragon, the King marine folk, and the others, completely reversing the situation of the All Races Meeting.","It could even be said that this series of actions had completely reversed the situation of the five great races of the Central Plains.","To be able to do this alone, even in the ancient times, when the Emperors were all present, he would still be seen as a peerless prodigy.","To be able to leave his name in history, he had already surpassed the level of ordinary ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths.","Chu Yunfan’s strength made them feel despair. Even with their firm willpower, they couldn’t breathe.","Everyone was born with potential, but not everyone could shine.","Since they were born in this world, why would there be such a powerful existence like Chu Yunfan?","Almost by himself, he had successfully made everyone forget that this was a golden era. Countless ancient geniuses and Supreme Youths had risen in this era.","They turned into the stars in the sky. No matter how many stars there were, they could only set off the brilliance of the moon.","“It’s not like there’s no chance. The humans has many powerful cultivators, but the strongest one is still the human king. Now that Chu Yunfan has risen so powerfully, is he willing to submit to the human king?”","There were inferences that the foreign races had ulterior motives.","This was also what the humans was most worried about. As the saying went, one mountain could not accommodate two tigers, let alone two peak Kings.","If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary King, he might be able to submit to a human king. But now, his strength was above the human king and not below the human king. The world was so big that it was difficult to accommodate two supreme masters.","Just as everyone was guessing how Chu Yunfan would get along with the human king, Chu Yunfan, who had just returned, immediately announced that he would organize an expedition to the Hus’ territory."]},{"number":2424,"title":"Chapter 2424: Expedition to the Hu’s Territory","paragraphs":["Chapter 2424: Expedition to the Hu’s Territory","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people had thought that the humans would take advantage of the victory to pursue!","After all, speed was the most important thing in war!","However, that should have been something that would happen after a period of rest. No one had expected that Chu Yunfan would immediately announce his decision to organize an expedition against the Hus after returning to the Central Plains.","This made everyone’s jaws drop. After Chu Yunfan returned, he did not participate in the struggle for power. Instead, he directly organized an expedition to the Hus.","One had to know that in many people’s imagination, two peak Kings could not coexist, and it would be difficult for one mountain to accommodate two tigers.","However, the reality was not as many people had thought. There was no power struggle between the two sides.","What Chu Yunfan was doing now was something that only human kings had the authority to do in the past, but at this time, there was no conflict.","In the imperial capital, the human king’s order was passed down, asking all parties to fully cooperate with Chu Yunfan’s expedition.","Under the human king’s command, the elite troops of Grand Xia were mobilized one by one. In less than half a month, a million troops had gathered at the border.","At this moment, the foreign races finally realized that the humans was not trying to scare them. They were truly planning to attack the Hus.","All the foreign races were watching. Although they knew that the lips were gone and the teeth were cold, it was obvious that they did not intend to fight the humans head-on.","Especially since they were unable to resist Chu Yunfan, this meant that if they rashly jumped out, they might end up suffering the wrath of the humans.","Everyone could see that the entire human race was holding back a stomach full of anger.","They had fought against the demons alone for decades and suffered heavy losses. Every family was wearing mourning clothes. However, after they finally drove away the demons, they were stabbed in the back by the four foreign races and almost exterminated.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t risen to prominence, the entire humans would have been wiped out.","At this moment, the anger of the entire human race had to be vented in a certain direction. However, since the Hus had been chosen, they naturally had no intention of taking the bullet for the Hus.","At this moment, the entire Hu clan was mobilized.","This was a completely different concept from when Chu Yunfan organized his first expedition to the grasslands.","At that time, Chu Yunfan was only a peak half-King. Although he was strong, he only took advantage of the fact that the main force of the Hus was delayed at the northern border of Grand Xia to take advantage of the situation.","At that time, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan couldn’t exterminate the Hus. He didn’t have the strength, and neither did the External Army he led.","But now, everything was completely different. Chu Yunfan was already at the peak of the King Stage and truly had the ability to threaten the survival of the Hus.","At the border of the northern plains, Chu Yunfan stood in front of the million strong army.","“It’s time to remove this malignant tumor that has harmed the humans for countless years!” Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the million strong army followed.","Ever since the Antiquity Age, the history of the humans had been inseparable from that of the Hus. Even when the humans was strong, the Hus was still a great threat to the humans living in the north. When the humans was weak and the dynasties changed, it was even worse. The humans was almost exterminated several times.","It could be said that although the humans and the Hus came from the same origin, both sides had a life-and-death feud.","As countless bugle horns sounded out, the army of a million covered the sky and covered the earth as they headed toward the plains.","These were the elite troops of Grand Xia. Even if they were ordinary soldiers, they were all martial arts experts. The aura of millions of experts soared into the sky.","Not long after, they ran into the defense line that the Hus had set up at the border of the grassland.","However, this thin line of defense was unable to stop the million-strong army of Grand Xia.","The Hus was used to attacking. The Hu cavalry came and went like the wind. Asking them to defend was naturally making things difficult for them.","Those layers of defense lines were destroyed in just a moment.","The humans pushed all the way into the depths of the grassland.","At this moment, terrifying figures appeared from the depths of the grassland. They were the powerful Kings of the grassland. Even though most of the Kings had been killed, there were still many Kings in the grassland. However, most of them were old and were sealed Kings of the past.","But now, when the grassland Hus were in danger, they were all awakened and ignited their blood essence in a short period of time in exchange for a temporary return to their peak combat strength.","On the human side, there were also many powerful auras flying out. They were Tang Siyu and the others, although there was a gap between them and these old Kings at their peak.","However, these old Kings were already old. Each attack would consume a considerable amount of blood essence. It could be said that each attack would weaken them a little.","As long as the results were at the initial stage, they would be able to hold on until these old Kings collapsed on their own.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan did not stop them. On the contrary, this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for Tang Siyu and the others to hone themselves.","Among the King Hus, there were a few who had just ascended. They were promoted by the Supreme Youths of the Hus.","At this moment, it was the crucial moment when the Supreme Youths of the Hus were about to explode and become Kings.","The four races had surrounded the humans because they saw that this was an unprecedented period of weakness for the humans. They did not intend to give those prodigies of the humans a chance to cultivate to the King Stage.","But now, it was easy to attack and defend!","It was their turn to lament that there was not enough time. There was too little time left for the Supreme Youths and ancient geniuses of the Hus. There was simply not enough time for the Hus to produce enough Kings.","A great battle instantly erupted!","It was directly divided into two battlefields. The battlefield where the ordinary elite army fought, and the battlefield where many Kings fought deep in the sky.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was expressionless. He crossed his arms and stared at the depths of the grassland.","In the next moment, he made his move. The Mountain River Cauldron above his head spun and then swelled up with the wind. When it swelled up to ten times the size of a mountain, the Mountain River Cauldron suddenly smashed down.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion like a nuclear bomb suddenly erupted from the depths of the grassland. A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose.","Chu Yunfan’s attack directly shattered atoms!","Suddenly, the Mountain River Cauldron, which had been falling down, was swept back at an even more astonishing speed and landed on Chu Yunfan’s head.","“Human, you are courting death!”","A hoarse voice came from the depths of the grassland.","Then, a figure slowly walked out from the depths of the grassland.","“An Evil God! It’s an Evil God!”","“That’s great! The Evil Gods will bless us and kill all these humans!”","“The Evil God is invincible!”","This was actually another Evil God!"]},{"number":2425,"title":"Chapter 2425: Killing Evil Gods Instantly, Observing All Secrets","paragraphs":["Chapter 2425: Killing Evil Gods Instantly, Observing All Secrets","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked at the evil figure in front of him. The evil aura was monstrous.","It was another Evil God. It was almost no different from the previous Evil God!","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change when he faced the Evil God.","“Looks like they really are a race!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the Evil God. It was almost exactly the same as the previous Evil God, and it seemed to be a member of the same race.","If it was really a race, after so many years, even if the fertility rate was low, there should be a lot of them.","However, these Evil Gods didn’t have any descendants that roamed the plains. Their divine wills would only appear occasionally during the Hus’ grand sacrifices.","This in itself did not make sense!","In addition, Chu Yunfan had studied the Evil God he had captured during this period of time. Chu Yunfan was certain that those Evil Gods were just some modified evil creatures.","However, the person who had modified it was extremely terrifying. They were able to modify such a terrifying evil creature.","This ancient Evil God did not waste any more time talking to Chu Yunfan. The Evil God’s body erupted with an extremely evil aura, shaking the laws in its body and sweeping toward Chu Yunfan like a tidal wave.","In an instant, it was about to engulf Chu Yunfan and the human army.","If they did not stop it, the human army would probably suffer heavy losses.","In front of an expert of this level, numbers really did not mean much. Even ordinary Kings could not resist.","However, when this wave of extreme Yin and evil swept halfway, it was blocked by a huge light curtain and could not continue to sweep over.","It was Chu Yunfan who took out the Mountain River Cauldron to resist the tide.","“Roar!”","The Evil God let out a loud roar and tore the sky with both hands. In an instant, the space around Chu Yunfan was torn apart.","However, this tear only lasted for a moment before it was fixed again by Chu Yunfan’s divine power.","In the next moment, the Evil God pounced on Chu Yunfan and roared.","“Evil God Domain!”","A huge domain spread out and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","However, to everyone’s surprise, Chu Yunfan did not resist at all in the face of such an attack and was wrapped up in it.","“Human, you are too arrogant. Even the founder of Grand Xia did not dare to let my domain corrode him so easily!”","The Evil God laughed loudly. Although Chu Yunfan had underestimated him, it made him very angry. However, at this time, the more Chu Yunfan looked down on him, the better.","Back then, the Grand Xia founder was the only expert he had ever seen, so he naturally used Grand Xia founder as a measure.","Even the Great Ancestor of Grand Xia did not dare to look down on them, so what right did Chu Yunfan have?","Sure enough, the protective divine light around Chu Yunfan was corroded by an extremely evil force.","“Do you really think I’m not prepared at all?” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. Suddenly, a ball of lightning power was released from his body. When the domain of extreme yin and evil came into contact with Chu Yunfan’s lightning power, it immediately melted like a hot knife cutting through butter.","It did not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan at all.","“Impossible!”","The Evil God was in disbelief. His Evil God Domain could be said to be extremely powerful, and he wouldn’t lose to any King of the same level.","If Chu Yunfan had only broken through his Evil God Domain, it would still be within his understanding. But now, Chu Yunfan could completely ignore his Evil God Domain.","His Evil God Domain seemed to have been completely seen through. All the rules were seen through, which was why Chu Yunfan could easily walk in it.","The Evil God’s pupils contracted slightly!","Chu Yunfan knew what was going on. It was as he had expected. These Evil Gods were man-made products created from the same batch.","If one cultivated normally, even if they were from the same race and cultivated the same cultivation technique, their personality, comprehension ability, and different experiences would definitely cause everyone’s domain to be different.","However, the domains of these Evil Gods were exactly the same. This was the strangest part, and it also verified Chu Yunfan’s thoughts.","Chu Yunfan had already found out everything about the Evil God he had captured.","Chu Yunfan had the help of the godhead. All this might be impossible for others, but it was not impossible for him.","That was why he couldn’t wait to launch the northern expedition.","He wanted to verify his thoughts. Even if his thoughts were wrong, with his strength, he could at least protect the million strong army and return to Grand Xia. Even if his guess was wrong, these Evil Gods were a race and not man-made creations. With his absolute strength, he could suppress them. There was no difference in essence.","But now that his guess was proven, everything was even simpler. Facing an Evil God whose secrets he had seen through, wouldn’t he just take care of them one by one?","Chu Yunfan directly tore open space and charged forward. The Evil God Domain did not have the slightest effect in stopping him.","Chu Yunfan was even more at ease in the Evil God Domain than the Evil Gods.","“Flying Celestial Seal!”","Chu Yunfan’s large hand suddenly turned over and slapped down. Endless galaxies extended out with Chu Yunfan as the center. In an instant, they expanded and connected to the endless sky.","Boom!","That strike was like a cosmic explosion, blasting right into the Evil God’s body.","Without the protection of the Evil God Domain, the Evil God, who only had the protective divine light, could not block it. It was hit and its body was shattered.","The Flying Celestial Seal seemed to have seen through all of the Evil God’s defensive arrays and formations, directly shattering them.","A heavy blow!","Before the Evil God could escape Chu Yunfan’s attack range or escape, Chu Yunfan cut off its head with a sword.","His head was directly cut off and sent flying.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only been a few breaths. The spiritual pillar of the entire grassland Hus, the Evil God, had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Instant kill!","A simple attack had killed the Evil God instantly!","Chu Yunfan was expressionless. Of course, it was because he was much stronger than these Evil Gods, but more importantly, he had seen through their secrets.","If one looked closely, they would see that there was no blood spurting out from the Evil God’s neck. It was a seal that sealed even the primordial spirit in his body, rendering the Evil God’s powerful recovery ability useless."]},{"number":2426,"title":"Chapter 2426: A Half-Emperor Evil God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2426: A Half-Emperor Evil God","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Quick!","It was simply too fast!","Chu Yunfan’s speed of killing Evil Gods was too fast, so fast that no one expected it.","“This is the Evil God of the grassland? Isn’t he a little too weak?” Chu Hongcai muttered to himself.","Everyone else had similar expressions. This was completely different from the Evil Gods they had imagined. In the legends passed down by the human elders, the grassland Evil Gods were extremely terrifying existences.","Even Grand Xia’s founder, who had brought a group of heroes to sweep through the grasslands, was beaten out.","From the looks of it, the Evil Gods of the grassland were not as terrifying as the legends said!","Everyone felt a little strange!","“No, that’s not because the Evil Gods are too weak. It’s because Junior Chu has seen through everything about the Evil Gods, which is why it’s so smooth!” Huangfu Longhao said.","“However, everyone needs to be careful. The bitter battle will only begin next. If the records in the sect are correct, that is a nest of Evil Gods. We have poked a hornet’s nest!” Huangfu Longhao said slowly.","Everyone’s expression was solemn. They knew that what they were going to face next was the greatest test. That group of Evil Gods had beaten Grand Xia founder and the others back.","But before that, no one dared to describe those Evil Gods as a nest.","As expected, at this moment, with the fall of this Evil God, boundless pressure boiled out from the depths of the grassland, sweeping in all directions like a tidal wave.","“They’re finally here!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t change his expression at all. In an instant, he had already left the army and killed his way into the depths of the grassland.","In the depths of the grassland, a huge temple that looked like a city appeared in front of Chu Yunfan.","This temple was different from ordinary temples. It was filled with an extremely evil aura.","Countless shamans were jumping up and down, awakening the Evil Gods sleeping in the temple.","In just a moment, 15 powerful Evil Gods had awakened from their long slumber.","Their bodies were still a little stiff, and their movements were still a little slow.","However, they soon discovered Chu Yunfan in front of them.","From Chu Yunfan’s body, a terrifying aura was boiling. Powerful blood and energy were like a vast ocean, sweeping wantonly.","At this point, Chu Yunfan no longer held back.","“Roar!”","“Roar!”","“Roar!”","These Evil Gods let out beast-like roars.","At this moment, they had just woken up and had no rationality at all. There was only boundless anger.","“Just in time!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. His body shook slightly and tore open space. In an instant, he was in the middle of these Evil Gods.","These Evil Gods were immediately excited. They chanted ancient spells and shook the laws in their bodies. Terrifying power surged, and all kinds of terrifying power instantly drowned Chu Yunfan.","“Rumble!”","A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose.","All kinds of terrifying attacks accumulated together and instantly turned into a terrifying shock wave.","The energy tide blocked all senses, and no one knew what was going on.","However, before everyone could react, a terrifying hand suddenly grabbed out.","The hand instantly grabbed the neck of an Evil God.","The divine light protecting the Evil God was unable to stop the hand. It was instantly torn apart at the neck.","The Evil God’s body immediately erupted with a vast evil aura. The thick evil aura burst out but was immediately suppressed.","Chu Yunfan’s body erupted with even more terrifying mana fluctuations. Under the control of Chu Yunfan’s will, it turned into a seal and directly sealed the Evil God.","He had spent very little time and didn’t even give the Evil Gods time to react.","In just an instant, he sealed an Evil God.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even kill the Evil God. Instead, he sealed it in the Mountain River Diagram.","The Evil God wanted to struggle, but it couldn’t.","“That takes care of one!”","Chu Yunfan was completely fearless. He charged into the Evil God Domain.","With the Mountain River Diagram above his head, Chu Yunfan was fearless. No attack could hurt him.","Clang!","An ancient cauldron flew out from the Mountain River Diagram. In an instant, it rippled with ancient ripples and instantly froze an Evil God.","Chu Yunfan followed closely behind and chased after him on the spot. He formed the Flying Celestial Seal with his palm and severely injured the Evil God. In an instant, he directly grabbed the Evil God into the Mountain River Diagram.","Another Evil God was sealed!","Seeing that their two companions were sealed, these Evil Gods went crazy and attacked Chu Yunfan with all their might.","However, the advantage in numbers was useless against Chu Yunfan.","With the protection of the Mountain River Cauldron above his head, Chu Yunfan would not be in any danger even if he was attacked by a group of Evil Gods. He could attack at will.","The Evil God Domain that the Evil Gods used was not a threat. To Chu Yunfan, who had seen through all the secrets of the Evil God Domain, the Evil Gods were much easier to deal with than ordinary peak Kings.","However, at this moment, he also understood why Grand Xia’s founder had retreated from the grasslands.","There were so many Evil Gods in the depths of the grassland. No wonder the Hus had been standing on the grassland since ancient times and could not be wiped out.","With so many Evil Gods behind them, even if they faced the entire world, it would be hard for them to fail.","Only if they had the strength of the demons could they forcefully wipe out the Evil Gods in the depths of the grassland.","This was the huge difference in strength.","However, these Evil Gods had met their nemesis. Chu Yunfan was much more terrifying than Grand Xia’s founder.","Three!","Four!","Five!","Not long after, ten Evil Gods were captured and sealed by Chu Yunfan. There were only five left from the overwhelming number of Evil Gods.","At this moment, these Evil Gods finally knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","They looked at each other and roared. Then, they flew together. Then, Chu Yunfan saw all of them merge together.","In the end, it fused into a huge Evil God that was more than 30 feet tall.","The aura of extreme yin and evil instantly soared, and it was unknown how much stronger it was compared to the original situation.","“HeYou guys actually have such an ability!”","Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. After these Evil Gods gathered, their strength increased by a lot.","It also proved that they came from the same source, which was why they could be reassembled at will.","The strength of the Evil God in front of him had clearly surpassed the peak of the ordinary King Stage and could be called a half-Emperor."]},{"number":2427,"title":"Chapter 2427: The Evil Gods Are Finished! The Hus Are Finished!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2427: The Evil Gods Are Finished! The Hus Are Finished!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This figure was tall and strong. It stood in the sky, and its blood-red eyes looked extremely terrifying.","The terrifying aura was much stronger than before.","Back then, the Evil Gods had relied on this move to defeat Grand Xia founder and many of the top King humans.","There was no doubt about the difference between the peak of the King Stage and the half-Emperor Stage. It was not a problem for one to fight many.","“Finally, something decent!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud, not minding it at all.","The Evil God had already moved. Its terrifying attack was like a divine light that could shake the heavens and earth.","Boom!","A peerless attack swept across the sky. A shocking evil aura was released from the Evil God’s body, turning into a surging flood that swept directly toward Chu Yunfan.","This time, the losses of these Evil Gods were unimaginable. Ever since they were created, they had never suffered such a loss.","This punch was filled with anger, and almost the entire grassland shook.","Chu Yunfan didn’t retreat at all. He also punched out. In almost an instant, the entire world was about to turn upside down.","It was only at this moment that Chu Yunfan truly erupted with his true strength. He was no longer at the peak of the King Stage, but had taken a step further and reached the half-Emperor Stage.","This was nothing to him. With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, the many mysteries of the Emperor Stage were no longer secrets to him. They were completely displayed in front of him.","To him, advancing to half-Emperor Stage was almost like pushing a boat with the current.","It was precisely because of this that those peak Kings were not his match at all. They were defeated almost in an instant!","At this moment, the fists of both parties collided. It did not seem like a body of flesh and blood at all. It was as if two incomparably huge celestial bodies were colliding in the sky. With a raise of their hands, it was as if the entire world would collapse.","Boom!","The fists of both parties collided directly, and a clear cracking sound erupted. Fresh blood flowed.","However, it wasn’t Chu Yunfan’s fist that was shattered, but the Evil God’s fist that was directly shattered and drenched in blood.","The Evil God had pulled his arm back at the critical moment. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable. The powerful fist force would have followed his arm and swept into his body, blowing him up.","The Evil God’s blood-red eyes, which were filled with hostility, revealed a puzzled expression. It probably never expected that even though it had already merged, it still did not have the upper hand when facing Chu Yunfan.","“No, how is this possible? You’re just a human. How can you be so powerful?” the Evil God roared.","“You’re just a man-made object. It’s fine if you bully a peak King. Within those of the same level, you’re trash!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","These Evil Gods looked powerful and terrifying.","However, in his eyes, it was nothing.","The reason why these Evil Gods were as terrifying as demon gods in the ancient legends of the humans was largely because there were no powerful half-Emperors among the current humans.","Back then, Grand Xia’s founder might have broken through to half-Emperor Stage, but he was defeated by the Evil Gods and fled. His aura dissipated and he was unable to break through.","That was how they became famous.","However, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, these Evil Gods were nothing. They were at the bottom now that they were at the same level.","The Evil Gods’ reputation for countless years was a complete joke. It was just that there was no tiger in the mountain, and the monkey called itself king.","“Roar!”","The Evil God roared. He had never been humiliated like this before.","“Even the Grand Xia founder is not my match, let alone you!”","The Evil God was even more furious, and he wanted to burn Chu Yunfan alive.","“The Grand Xia’s founder was not your match, but that doesn’t mean that I’m not. I can chop off your head to pay my respects to the founder!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“What do you take me for?” the Evil God roared, and the entire grassland shook.","Chu Yunfan’s disregard for him was simply a humiliation. He thought too highly of himself and had long forgotten the original purpose of his creation.","But now that Chu Yunfan had looked down on him to this extent, he was naturally extremely crazy and immediately pounced on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t pay attention to him. He just kept throwing punches.","Every punch shook the grassland several times, and the terrifying pressure it triggered directly affected the soldiers on both sides.","“Is that Junior Chu’s true strength? It’s really too terrifying!”","Huangfu Longhao was shocked and felt terrified. With his strength, he was only at the intermediate King Stage. However, even if he had advanced to the late King Stage, he would probably not be able to escape death in front of this terrifying pressure.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Each strike was like a nuclear bomb exploding.","In such an intense collision, it only took a few dozen moves to determine the winner.","Chu Yunfan only attacked and didn’t defend. Even so, the Evil God couldn’t break through Chu Yunfan’s defense. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s every attack was extremely terrifying. When it landed on the Evil God’s body, it caused serious injuries.","Both of his arms were broken in the process of fighting against Chu Yunfan. There were huge fist marks on the Evil God’s chest, and the fist marks pierced through his body. Every punch was fatal to an ordinary King.","The fact that the Evil God could last until now was basically all he had.","“This is the last move. I’ll settle it once and for all!”","Chu Yunfan roared. His entire body was glowing and bathed in holy light.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan’s fist blasted out, and eight powerful gods appeared behind him. The eight gods suppressed everything, and in an instant, they had already bombarded the Evil God.","Bam!","The Evil God was hit by the punch and couldn’t resist anymore. His body exploded and split apart, turning back into five inferior Evil Gods.","Chu Yunfan reached out with his hand and it grew bigger and bigger with the wind. It turned into a huge seal and sealed the five powerful Evil Gods in an instant. Then, it was instantly put into the Mountain River Diagram.","In the distance, the shamans in the Evil God’s temple were all prostrating on the ground, trembling.","They saw things that made their faith crumble. Many people had served these Evil Gods their entire lives.","But now, these Evil Gods that they had worshipped for their entire lives had been killed and sealed by Chu Yunfan.","“The Evil Gods are finished! The Hus are finished!”"]},{"number":2428,"title":"Chapter 2428: The Hus’ Destruction","paragraphs":["Chapter 2428: The Hus’ Destruction","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Some shamans trembled and tears fell like rain!","Even the Shaman who had a fervent belief in the Evil Gods knew that it was really over this time!","Since ancient times, such a thing had never happened before.","From today onwards, the Hus would be removed from the Central Plains.","There was no turning back!","Although the Hus still had tens of millions of soldiers and trillions of tribesmen, it was still difficult to turn the tide. Without enough experts to hold the fort, it was impossible to turn the tables no matter how many people there were.","The news of the Evil Gods’ destruction quickly spread to the front lines of the grassland battlefield.","The grassland alliance army that had always believed in Evil Gods collapsed. They didn’t believe in the news at the start, that was until another Evil God’s head fell from the sky onto the battlefield.","All kinds of news came from behind, and the grassland alliance army collapsed in an instant.","The Hus on the plains worshipped the Evil Gods so much that ordinary humans could not imagine it.","After receiving the news of the Evil Gods’ destruction, other than most of them collapsing, there were also many Hus that charged forward after their faith was destroyed.","However, in front of the King humans who were waiting for them, it was meaningless.","All their counterattacks were futile.","Chu Yunfan didn’t interfere in this process. He only trained Chu Hongcai and the others.","After defeating the grassland alliance army’s final counterattack, the human army launched the final siege on the grassland alliance army.","Be it young adults, women, children, or children, they were all killed.","Even Chu Yunfan had no objections to this. The Hus that believed in the Evil Gods was no longer their kind. They were beastmen who led beasts to eat people. Their thoughts could not be changed at all. They were just beasts that walked on two feet.","Even infants and young children were instilled and brainwashed at a very young age. Only by completely exterminating them could they prevent them from becoming a disaster for the humans in the future.","Although it was cruel, this was the only way to ensure long-term stability.","As for Grand Xia, the moment they received the news, they immediately started to organize the migration into the grasslands, building cities and plowing the grasslands, completely integrating the grasslands into the territory of Grand Xia.","Chu Yunfan watched from the side, clearing out some of the evil lands on the grassland from time to time. Some places had been occupied by Evil Gods for too long, and evil energy was everywhere. Ordinary people could not survive at all.","Only a top-notch expert like Chu Yunfan could change the world and make it a place for the humans to flourish.","This news could not be hidden. Although the various races suffered heavy losses, they still sent people to the grasslands.","Very soon, they received the news. For a moment, they were incomparably shocked!","Chu Yunfan had actually led his army to destroy the Hus. This was something that even the Grand Xia founder had not been able to do.","But Chu Yunfan did it!","This was completely beyond everyone’s expectations.","Before this, the other races were indifferent because they thought that Chu Yunfan could not really destroy the Hus. At most, he could only severely injure the Hus.","If it was only this extent, it was not enough to make them go to war.","After all, it was the other three foreign races’ idea to make both races suffer and weaken each other.","It was not easy to direct the anger of the humans to the Hus. No one wanted the anger of the humans to be poured onto themselves.","After all, the blood debts of the humans were no less than that of the Hus, especially the monsters. On the border between the humans and the monsters, countless people were eaten alive by the monsters every day.","They were all planning to let the humans deal a heavy blow to the Hus so that the Hus would be well-behaved for a period of time.","The humans were satisfied and left the grassland.","After all, everyone knew that there were Evil Gods in the depths of the plains. No matter how chaotic the Central Plains was, the existence of those Evil Gods in the depths of the plains was enough to ensure that the Hus would not be wiped out.","Both sides suffered heavy losses and were hostile to each other. This was the plan of the various races.","And what no one had expected was that Chu Yunfan had actually destroyed the Hus in one go. The vigor of his aura caused the other races of the Central Plains to feel a chill run down their spines.","Especially the higher-ups of the various races. The moment they heard the news, they felt a chill run down their spines.","Although the Hus was not the strongest among the four tribes, they were not the weakest either.","But now, they were completely no match for the humans and had been easily destroyed. The Evil Gods that had intimidated the Central Plains for countless years had actually been defeated and sealed one by one.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength had caused all the races of the Central Plains to be wary of him. Such tyrannical strength had clearly exceeded the limits that the various races could accept.","He had destroyed the balance of the Central Plains!","Ever since the collapse of the Antiquity Era, it had been countless years. The situation of the five great races standing side by side had never changed. Now, one of them had been destroyed.","It undoubtedly caused the various races to be in a state of panic, afraid that they would become the next race to be destroyed.","“The Hus were annihilated? How is that possible? Is this a joke?”","“I don’t believe it. There are hundreds of millions of Hu clansmen, and there are many Kings. They also have the protection of the Evil Gods. How can they be destroyed just like that?”","“The Chu King human has done something that even the Grand Xia founder could not do!”","“The situation of the world is about to change!”","Countless people exclaimed in the darkness. This news spread throughout the world at an astonishing speed. Many people woke up in the middle of the night and could no longer sleep after receiving the news.","There was no doubt that this would be a major event that would affect the entire Central Plains.","Before this, no one had expected that the humans could actually erupt with such terrifying power.","As time passed, more and more information was made known to everyone. Only then did many people realize that it was not because the humans’ strength had increased so much in an instant that they could even destroy the Hus.","It was because there was King Chu among them.","This new King had erupted with a terrifying strength that no one had expected. He had fought alone and even killed the Evil Gods who had ruled the Central Plains for countless years and were famous throughout the Central Plains.","It was Chu Yunfan’s existence that broke the balance between the humans and the Hus.","Without the Evil Gods’ leadership, the Hus had completely lost the right to be one of the five great races.","The entire clan, men and women, old and young, were slaughtered. All the experts were destroyed, and the weak were killed.","The massacre lasted for a month before it came to an end.","After this round of cleansing, all traces of the Hus’ existence on the grassland were uprooted in a short period of time.","All the cities of the Hus were destroyed, and the temples of the Hus’ Evil Gods were uprooted one after another.","Although there were still some remnants of the Hus outside, the Hus as a whole had been completely eradicated. Not a single blade of grass was left."]},{"number":2429,"title":"Chapter 2429: The Marine Folks Are So Bold","paragraphs":["Chapter 2429: The Marine Folks Are So Bold","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It had been a month since the Hus had been completely wiped out!","Although the grassland was very large, it was much larger than the entire Earth in the future.","For ordinary people, it would be difficult to finish walking even if they walked for a lifetime.","However, the human elites who participated in the encirclement were not ordinary people. Each of them was comparable to the legendary land immortals.","These people were attacking with all their might. They could no longer form an alliance army, and the grassland races that could not form a decent defense basically had no ability to resist.","Although the Hus were completely destroyed a month later, the various races knew that this was only a matter of time.","Without a King holding down the fort, the Hus had long lost the possibility of turning the tables!","Especially Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai, and the other King humans who were hunting the King Hus.","This made it impossible for the King Hus to escape.","The entire human race cheered, but at the same time, they were also very afraid.","If the four foreign races had succeeded, the consequences would have been unimaginable. The fate of the humans would have been the same as the fate of the Hus.","All the Hus had been slaughtered, and all their inheritances had been wiped out. There was no possibility of them surviving at all.","Perhaps there would still be a small number of Hus struggling to survive, but without the protection of the race, they would only be stray dogs. They would definitely be bullied and would not have the strength to fight back.","Because of this, countless people were grateful. The person who brought about all these changes was none other than Chu Yunfan.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s sudden rise, the current situation that the humans would be facing was simply unimaginable.","Countless human elders, sect masters, and dignitaries who thought they were powerful enough came to pay their respects to Chu Yunfan.","Everyone could see that from now on, the human king would no longer be the decision-maker of humanity.","Although the human king was still the supreme leader of the humans, Chu Yunfan’s authority was probably not inferior to the human king’s.","If Chu Yunfan was willing, he could even establish his own kingdom and set up a border. Even Grand Xia might not be able to do anything about it.","This was the situation that the humans was most afraid of seeing. It was not easy to see the opportunity for the humans to rise and prosper, but it would be interrupted by this division and pattern.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan and the human king seemed to have some tacit understanding. They did not fight, and there was no quarrel.","Chu Yunfan wanted to organize an army to attack the Hus in the north, and the human king ordered them to cooperate with him.","After pacifying the Hus, Chu Yunfan also put down his military power and returned to Zhenyuan City. It seemed that he had no intention of competing with the human king.","Both sides maintained a tacit understanding that no one could understand.","However, after a long time, some people who understood what was going on.","“Our horizons are limited. We only thought that the authority of the humans was supreme, which was why we thought that a great war would break out. However, the two supreme kings had long left the small pond of humanity. It’s no longer the situation where the east wind prevails over the west wind or the west wind prevails over the east wind!","Only now did many people finally understand that the reason why the two of them did not have the conflict that many people imagined was because the structure of the two sides had already surpassed the small pool of power within the humans.","For a whole year, Chu Yunfan stayed in Zhenyuan City and did not make any big moves.","No matter how much the outside world was talking about it, Chu Yunfan never showed up. Even the elders, sect masters, and other important figures who came to visit him did not get to see him.","They simply bowed to Chu Yunfan from a distance and left.","In Chu Yunfan’s mansion in Zhenyuan City, countless powerful figures had arrived.","Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion and did not reject the experts from all over the world.","For a time, experts from all over the world came.","There were even many dignitaries in the court who came to pay their respects. At this moment, they had already grasped the tacit understanding between Chu Yunfan and the human king. Paying respects to Chu Yunfan at this time would not arouse the fear of the human king.","For a time, experts from all over the world gathered. Even those who couldn’t come sent messengers with many precious treasures as gifts.","A gathering of heroes!","When many people entered the Chu royal residence, they realized that they had entered another world. Although the original Chu royal residence was large, it could not accommodate so many people.","It was Chu Yunfan who connected it with another space and formed a secret realm.","Many people were amazed and admired Chu Yunfan’s spatial attainments. However, when they thought of Chu Yunfan’s strength, they felt that it was normal.","After directly killing and sealing more than ten Evil Gods, Chu Yunfan had already established his title as the number one expert in the world.","There was no doubt about it!","Originally, the top expert of the humans, the human king, could barely deal with one of the Evil Gods. However, Chu Yunfan could defeat all of them and take them all down.","Thus, even those who disliked Chu Yunfan had to admit that with his strength, he was invincible in the Central Plains.","When Chu Yunfan appeared out of thin air on a throne, the atmosphere at the scene finally reached a climax.","“Greetings, King Chu!”","The tens of thousands of human leaders bowed in unison. After receiving this bow, Chu Yunfan said, “Everyone, rise!”","“Thank you, King Chu!”","Everyone stood up and toasted each other. After they were full, they drank and toasted.","Only then did Chu Hongcai step on a streak of light from outside, causing everyone to stand up and bow.","Although Chu Hongcai wasn’t as prominent as Chu Yunfan, and his strength was also far inferior, he was still one of the Kings of the humans.","“Brother Yunfan, I’ve already investigated.” Chu Hongcai cupped his hands. “One of the two King Hus is hiding among the marine folks, while the other is hiding among the barbarians!”","When everyone heard this, they remembered that more than a year ago, although the humans had destroyed the Hus, there were two King Hus who had escaped the disaster. However, since then, they had disappeared without a trace.","The entire human race had been searching for the whereabouts of these two people.","Unexpectedly, one of them escaped to the marine folks while the other escaped to the barbarians.","“We’ve already found the coordinates of the one at the marine folks’ territory!” Chu Hongcai said. As he spoke, a streak of light transformed into a jade slip. The jade slip contained the location of that King in the marine folks.","“The marine folks and the barbarians are bold! They actually dare to shield a criminal of the humans!”","“Make them hand that King Hu over! We can’t let those two King Hus go!”","“Kill one to warn a hundred, kill the chicken to warn the monkeys!”","When everyone heard this, they immediately shouted and fought.","“Hmph, the marine folks is really bold!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and tore the space in front of everyone with both hands. A crack appeared in the space in front of them. On the other side of the crack was a secret realm of the marine folks.","The King Hu who had escaped was among them."]},{"number":2430,"title":"Chapter 2430: The Annihilation of the King Marine Folks","paragraphs":["Chapter 2430: The Annihilation of the King Marine Folks","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The King Hu was in secluded cultivation. He never expected that someone could actually tear open the space of the marine folks’ secret realm and expose him in front of everyone.","“Chu Yunfan!”","The King Hu’s eyes widened, and his heart instantly faltered.","Chu Yunfan had destroyed the Hus. Even the supreme Evil Gods of the Hus were destroyed.","How could this King Hu not be frightened!","One had to know that even though he was a King, there was a huge gap between the King Hus and the Evil Gods.","Even if he became a King, he would only be a subordinate controlled by the Evil Gods. He couldn’t become the master.","Moreover, it was even more impossible for his cultivation to advance to the peak of the King Stage.","That was because even the Evil Gods who taught them martial arts was only at the peak of the King Stage. In order to prevent an existence that could stand shoulder to shoulder with them from appearing among the Hus and let the Hus escape from their control, the cultivation techniques taught by the Evil Gods were all flawed. It was impossible for them to cultivate to the peak of the King Stage.","By the time they realized this, it was already too late. Their cultivation had long been deeply rooted. Even if they wasted their cultivation and re-cultivated, it was impossible for them to break through.","After all, they had already spent an unknown amount of time cultivating to this stage. The remaining lifespan was no longer enough for them to advance further.","For countless years, the Evil Gods had used this method to control the King Hus.","Thus, this King Hu didn’t have any thoughts of resisting Chu Yunfan who could defeat the Evil Gods. He hid among the marine folks.","The marine folks was naturally willing to add a powerful expert to oversee the situation, so they took in this King Hu.","No one had expected the humans to find King Hu’s whereabouts so quickly.","“Hurry up and surrender!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","However, this King Hu was not an ordinary person. At this point, he could naturally tell that if he were to surrender now, he would probably really die.","With a loud shout, rays of light rushed out of his body. His blood and energy surged out like rolling thunder.","His eyes were like two enormous stars.","In an instant, the King laws swept out, almost flipping the entire world over.","“Hmph, stubborn!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. In an instant, a big hand grabbed at the other end of the crack.","Boom!","The King laws that erupted from King Hu’s body were instantly extinguished.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the King Hu with one hand.","It was as if he was catching a little chick.","The difference in strength between the two sides was clear at a glance. There was no doubt about it.","“What terrifying strength. Lord Chu’s strength is truly invincible!”","“I’m afraid King Chu’s strength has already surpassed the King Stage. Even if he’s compared to an Emperor, he’s only half a step away!”","“Fortunately, such an existence came from our humans. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable!”","The experts of the humans were surprised and delighted, especially when they saw Chu Yunfan grabbing the King Hu like he was grabbing a chick. Many people felt a chill run down their spines as they witnessed an extremely terrifying scene.","“Who is it?”","At this moment, furious voices finally came from outside the marine folks’ secret realm.","It was the roar of the King marine folks.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you capture someone from our territory!”","The King marine were was simply furious. This was a slap in the face.","Although they had taken in the King Hu and made themselves an enemy of the humans, they had never thought that Chu Yunfan would have such courage.","He actually dared to tear open space and rush into their secret realm.","If they didn’t care about this, how could the marine folks still have dignity in the future? How could they still stand tall in front of the humans?","The aura of the King Stage instantly swept over, trying to block Chu Yunfan’s big hand.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and then slapped down with the Flying Celestial Seal.","Bam!","One of the King marine folks didn’t even have time to dodge and was blasted into a bloody mist.","There was no doubt that compared to Chu Yunfan a year ago, Chu Yunfan, who had been in seclusion for more than a year, was a truly terrifying existence.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power was boundless. With a single palm strike, the body of the King marine folk was shattered, and the secret realm collapsed on the spot.","When the other King marine folks saw this, they couldn’t contain their anger. Chu Yunfan was too arrogant. What did he think of the marine folks? He treated them like slaves.","He did not put them in his eyes at all.","Thinking of this, the King marine folks joined forces and attacked Chu Yunfan. The monstrous waves swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and then a stream of sword light shot out from his fingertip. It grew bigger and bigger. In just a moment, it also grew to an endless size and then swept out.","Wherever the sword light passed, the King marine folks screamed and were cut into two halves. The endless seawater was evaporated, and it could not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan at all.","With one strike, the King marine folks were wiped out!","The truly powerful King marine folks had been killed by Chu Yunfan in the previous siege. The remaining King marine folks were only second-class King marine folks, and the strongest was only a late King.","Most of the remaining marine folks were only at the intermediate King Stage or the fledgling King Stage. How could an existence at this level be Chu Yunfan’s current match?","It was just a single attack and they were killed!","“Pass down the order to have the marine folks submit. Otherwise, they will die!” Chu Yunfan ordered.","“We will obey King Chu’s decree!”","All the big shots of the humans bowed one after another. When they saw this scene, they only felt their entire bodies tremble. They did not even dare to dream that such a day would come.","Among the four foreign races that had been their enemies in the past, the Hus had been exterminated, and all the Kings marine folks had been killed. They could only submit. Otherwise, any King human could kill all the Kings of the marine folks.","There was no doubt that the difference in strength was so great with or without a King.","Then, Chu Yunfan issued the second decree.","“Ask the barbarians to hand over the King Hu who is hiding in the Hundred Thousand Mountains. Otherwise, the millions of humans will trample the Hundred Thousand Mountains and wipe out the barbarians from the world!”","Hearing this order, the higher-ups of the humans were even more excited. They were different from the monsters and the marine folks.","The Hus and the barbarians were both split from the humans. To the humans, it was undoubtedly a great pain in their hearts and a great humiliation.","As long as the Hus and the barbarians existed, they would remind the humans of how humiliating they had been to allow the Hus and the barbarians to exist."]},{"number":2431,"title":"Chapter 2431: Three Great Kings Suppressing the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2431: Three Great Kings Suppressing the World","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The marine folks were finished!","In the night after the news was spread, everyone realized a terrifying fact. The marine folks were done for.","There were still a large number of troops and even a large number of experts in the clan, and there were countless Domainians.","There were even many half-Kings, but what was the use? The King marine folks were collectively wiped out by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","This had established Chu Yunfan’s supreme prestige.","This kind of terrifying strength could be said to be the best in the world.","The marine folks didn’t even have a King. Even if a King appeared, it would be useless.","Any powerful clan would have countless clansmen, but the truly important ones were the top-notch experts.","They were the key to maintaining the survival of the entire race. Without a King, it was useless no matter how many clansmen they had.","There were many clansmen, and they could produce talents endlessly, succeeding generation after generation.","However, the annihilation of these King marine folks interrupted this process.","Chu Yunfan had destroyed an entire generation of marine folks.","Although there were still many ancient prodigies and Supreme Youths in the marine folks, they were in a precarious situation.","Without a King to hold down the fort, it meant that as long as a random King led the humans, it was possible to destroy the entire marine folk race.","Even if the marine folks still had some foundation and could even resist a King, it was meaningless. No matter how strong their methods were, could they stop Chu Yunfan, who was now known as the number one master in the world?","It was impossible!","In everyone’s eyes, the marine folks were finished. They could only submit. Even if they submitted, it was impossible for them to survive.","Whether they could survive or not depended largely on Chu Yunfan’s attitude.","A single thought could decide the life and death of a super clan. This was unimaginable in the past.","It made people think of the era when the Emperors stood side by side a long time ago. In that era, the differences between races were not clear. To be precise, at that time, they were all small races, especially the monsters, which was composed of many races. It was unknown how many races they had split into.","At that time, the main trend was the struggle for hegemony between Emperors. There were many races that relied on the Emperors. Many races split into different groups and relied on the subordinates of different Emperors.","At that time, the Emperors would have the power to destroy a super clan with a single thought.","And now, Chu Yunfan displayed the same trend. Although he was not like the Emperors who could destroy a race with a wave of their hands, he could still do it with the powerful strength of the humans.","The Hus were uprooted within a few months as if there had never been such a race in the world.","All traces of the Hus’ existence had been wiped clean.","The entire clan, men, women, old and young, were completely massacred.","Everyone had truly witnessed what it meant to fight for hegemony between the great clans. There was no slavery, only extermination.","To isolate all future troubles!","Other than a few martyrs, no one in the humans objected to this.","The war between the humans and the Hus had been going on for many years, especially at the northern border. Which family had not lost thousands of their ancestors to the Hus?","However, what followed was a formal warning from the humans to the barbarians. They wanted the barbarians to hand over the King Hu, who was hiding among the barbarians. Otherwise, the humans would send troops to attack the barbarians.","It was as if everyone suddenly had the illusion that the humans had not just fought with the demons and suffered heavy losses, but was at the peak of the strongest in history.","Everyone understood that the overall strength of the humans was indeed at its lowest point in history, but Chu Yunfan was enough to smooth out the gap.","This was the rule of this world. Only top-notch experts could decide everything.","A month later, the barbarians hadn’t given an accurate answer yet, but all the barbarians soldiers had gathered. Obviously, they were going to fight the humans.","The scouts within the barbarians had already given the reason. At this moment, the barbarians was determined to fight the humans.","To them, there was no way to retreat. They had to hurt the humans in this battle to dispel their thoughts.","Chu Yunfan’s attitude of exterminating the Hus had already caused great fear in the barbarians.","He was afraid that the barbarians would follow in their footsteps one day.","Besides, the barbarians knew how much the humans hated the Hus and the barbarians. Although they came from the same source, the Hus believed in the Evil Gods, while the barbarians believed in the Barbarians Gods. They had long become two-legged beasts and had plundered countless humans as slaves for thousands of years.","As long as there was a chance, even if they let the marine folks and the monsters off, the humans would never let them off easily.","The barbarians knew that they had no way out. Many people thought that Chu Yunfan’s request for them to hand over the King Hu was just an excuse. After finding an excuse, they could attack them.","The humans had also discovered this, and the million-strong army was also gathering. In addition, they had to guard against the demons. As for the marine folks, no one paid any attention to them. Anyway, they were already lambs waiting to be slaughtered. They could be cooked at any time.","Chu Yunfan’s strength had caused the entire human race to be incomparably excited. They had once again seen the possibility of unifying the Central Plains.","However, on this day, to everyone’s surprise, the marine folks produced another King. It was a Supreme Youth.","For a moment, all the marine folks who were panicking and without a backbone gathered around.","“I didn’t expect another King to appear in the marine folks. Could it be that they have turned the tables again?”","“That’s right. There are still many ancient prodigies in the marine folks. There’s more than one Supreme Youth. If they all break through, it’ll be troublesome for us!”","“In my opinion, we should eliminate the marine folks as soon as possible. We shouldn’t give them a chance to turn the tables. We should kill them all, just like we did to the Hus!”","Many people were worried, but even more were extremely optimistic.","“What’s so great about that? So what if the marine folks has another King? So what if there are ten more? King Chu can wipe them out with one strike. It’s not difficult at all!”","“That’s right. As long as King Chu is here, everything will be as stable as Mount Tai!”","“How many more years can the marine folks survive? There’s no need to fear!”","“It doesn’t matter even if the marine folks has a King. Other than King Chu, we humans also have the Elder Princess and the two peak Kings. Any one of them can suppress the world!”","The three Kings suppressed the world, giving the humans incomparable confidence.","What no one expected was that after the King of the marine folks became a King, he immediately went to Zhenyuan City with great fanfare to pay a visit to Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2432,"title":"Chapter 2432: The Marine Folks Surrender","paragraphs":["Chapter 2432: The Marine Folks Surrender","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To everyone’s surprise, this King marine folk actually came to visit Chu Yunfan with great fanfare and went deep into the territory of the humans.","This was something that no King marine folk had ever done before.","In the past, even if there were King marine folks who entered the continent, they would only circle around the border areas and basically did not dare to enter the interior of the human continent.","Above the humans, there was a powerful Luck Dragon guarding it.","Back then, that group of Evil Gods did not dare to enter Grand Xia because they were intimidated by the Luck Dragon.","Even after the demons invaded for decades, they could not completely defeat the Luck Dragon. They only weakened it a lot.","As for the foreign Kings who entered the inner regions of Grand Xia, regardless of their strength, they would be suppressed to a certain extent.","Only Emperors could transcend this world and not be affected by the Luck Dragon.","This was also the biggest difference between the King Stage and the Emperor Stage.","The strength of the King Stage still depended on the race, while the Emperor Stage was already an existence that transcended the race.","This was also why in ancient times, it was almost standard for Emperors to enslave various races.","Even the weakest Emperor was above any race.","Even the Emperors born in their own race would no longer be restricted by their race. They were completely on another level of existence.","In Zhenyuan City, Chu Yunfan received the King marine folk.","This King marine folk looked extremely young. He had light blue skin, and his figure was tall and straight. He was slender and muscular, and he had the bearing of a dragon and phoenix among men.","After seeing Chu Yunfan, the King marine folk was the first to bow.","“Great Sea of the marine folks greets King Chu!”","The King marine folk lowered his stance. Generally speaking, whether it was a fledgling King or a peak King, there might be a huge difference in strength, but in terms of status, they were all the same.","There was no difference between them. However, Great Sea’s actions now undoubtedly placed himself below Chu Yunfan.","Although in everyone’s eyes, he really couldn’t be compared to Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was impressed by his quick admission.","“You are bold, King Great Sea!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","He could see that the King marine folk’s aura was obviously unstable. If he guessed correctly, it should have been forcefully raised.","In other words, Great Sea had probably used some kind of secret technique to forcefully raise his cultivation from the half-King Stage to the King Stage after the King marine folks were wiped out.","The consequence of doing so was that he might stay in this realm for the rest of his life and not be able to advance an inch.","As a Supreme Youth, he would at least be at the peak of the King Stage in the future. He might even have a chance to become an Emperor.","Doing so was tantamount to cutting off one’s future.","However, Great Sea had done this for the sake of the marine folks. Although a King was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan, it was extremely important to the marine folks, which was on the verge of collapse.","After the appearance of Great Sea, all the major forces of the marine folks gathered under Great Sea at almost the same time. The marine folks were unprecedentedly united.","However, this kind of unity was useless in front of Chu Yunfan.","Great Sea had sacrificed himself for the sake of the reproduction of his clansmen, which was why Chu Yunfan looked up to him. Moreover, Great Sea had personally come to the hinterland of the humans, which made Chu Yunfan look at him in a new light.","With the Luck Dragon suppressing the humans, any King human could destroy Great Sea, let alone Chu Yunfan.","However, he still came. Presumably, he had also suffered a lot of pressure. Many people in the marine folks were probably unwilling.","However, he still came. This was his boldness.","There were still some figures in the marine folks, and these heroes were not inferior to the humans.","Great Sea looked at Chu Yunfan and felt extremely emotional. Once upon a time, he was Chu Yunfan’s competitor, but now, Chu Yunfan was like a great roc soaring above the nine heavens.","Even a large tribe like the Hus was wiped out just like that.","That group of Evil Gods that even the marine folks was afraid of were destroyed just like that.","Even the previous King marine folks were exterminated.","This forced Great Sea to destroy his future and forcefully advance to the King Stage!","That was because he had no other choice. No matter how weak he was as a King, it was still a world of difference whether the marine folks had a King guarding them or not.","Now that the marine folks had a King guarding them, he could come to meet Chu Yunfan and talk to him on equal terms. However, if there was not even a King, all the marine folks would probably be treated as an insignificant race. At any time, they would be exterminated on a whim.","The huge Hus was destroyed in just a few months!","Although the marine folks lived in the deep sea and were even more difficult to deal with than the Hus, the elite troops of the humans had the ability to survive in the deep sea. Fighting in the deep sea was not difficult at all.","With King humans on the attack, all the defenses of the marine folks would become a joke.","Even if they could stop the invasion of those Kings, once Chu Yunfan personally made a move, they would really be dead.","Therefore, he had no other choice but to come personally to fight for the last chance of survival for the marine folks. Though he would be cutting of his future, he had no other choice but to use the methods he had prepared long ago to send away the Supreme Youths and ancient geniuses of the marine folks and wrestle the last spark for the marine folks.","“King Chu is too kind!” Great Sea said.","“To be able to do this for the marine folks, you can be considered a hero. You’re enough to make me look up to you!” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","He was no longer an existence who had just entered the King Stage. To a King like Great Sea, speaking a few more words to him could be considered as thinking highly of him.","“Thank you for your praise, King Chu. I would like to implore that you let the marine folks live. We are willing to be vassals of the humans from now on and will not betray the humans for generations to come. We will be under the command of the humans!” Great Sea enunciated each word. One could imagine how much pain he was going through.","“If the humans had been defeated back then, would you have given us a chance to be a vassal?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“But there are no ifs in history. A victory is a victory, and a defeat is a defeat!” Great Sea said.","“What a good history without ifs!” Chu Yunfan clapped his hands and said with a smile. “70%. I want 70% of the marine folks’ annual output. Since you’re a vassal, you should act like one. The remaining 30% is up to you to distribute among yourselves!”","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hands and put up seven fingers.","“After this, us humans are preparing to take down the barbarians. I want the marine folks to send out one million elite soldiers as the vanguard. Do you have any objections?”"]},{"number":2433,"title":"Chapter 2433: The Marine Folks Sacrifice Themselves, the War to Conquer the Barbarians Erupt","paragraphs":["Chapter 2433: The Marine Folks Sacrifice Themselves, the War to Conquer the Barbarians Erupt","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The million elites Chu Yunfan wanted were not cannon fodder. If they were cannon fodder, the marine race could easily send out hundreds of millions of troops.","They were definitely elites who could fight a tough battle!","Great Sea immediately understood. This was a declaration of allegiance. If he didn’t do anything, how could he do it?","Moreover, he also understood Chu Yunfan’s deeper meaning. He wanted to use this opportunity to grind down the elites of the marine folks.","There were still too many elite warriors in the marine folks’ army, and the vassal races should have the scale and strength of the vassal races.","Being too strong was like a fishbone stuck in the throat of the humans.","Great Sea naturally understood this point. If they wanted to survive, they would have to cut their flesh. Only by cutting their flesh to the point that the humans seemed weak enough could they survive in the future.","Although it was cruel, this was the reality he had to accept.","“Sure!” Great Sea gritted his teeth. “Within a month, the marine folks’ million strong army will gather and listen to your orders, King Chu!”","“Very good, you may go!” Chu Yunfan said.","Watching Great Sea leave, Chu Yunfan revealed a cold smile. The marine folks just wanted to survive and slowly change their plans. In the future, they might rise up again.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about any of this. Once the barbarians were destroyed, the humans would occupy three-fifths of the Central Plains, and the marine folks would also occupy seventy percent of the marine folks’ resources.","When he turned around, he would deal with the demons.","The humans would occupy at least four-fifths of the Central Plains’ resources. When that time came, they would definitely welcome a massive explosion.","It was not a problem for experts to appear in large numbers!","As for the marine race, the gap in strength between them and the humans would also become larger and larger. It was simply impossible to turn the tables!","Moreover, the deep sea area was not something that humans could get involved in. Ordinary people did not have the ability to survive in that kind of place. They were far from being blessed by the marine folks.","Instead of destroying the marine folks, it was better to let the marine folks work for the humans and continuously extract resources from the sea to supply the humans.","At that time, the humans would definitely be unprecedentedly powerful.","At that time, they would become the hegemon of the Central Plains. It would be impossible for the marine folks to make a comeback!","As for those Supreme Youths and ancient geniuses who were regarded as threats by many people, Chu Yunfan did not take them seriously at all.","Even if this batch grew up, it would not be enough to cause a huge wave.","And when the essence of this generation of the marine folks that had been accumulated for hundreds of millions of years was all dead, the marine folks would be powerless.","After all, no matter what kind of genius they were, they would need to consume resources if they wanted to grow, especially Kings. It was enough to exhaust all the luck and resources of a secondary race.","This was the reason why the five overlord races were the overlord races. The fundamental reason was that they occupied a large enough territory and produced enough.","Chu Yunfan knew how much resources he had consumed along the way. It was enough to empty out all the resources of a small race.","It could be said that resources were everything!","Without resources, no matter how talented one was, it was impossible for them to grow.","A shocking piece of news came. The only King of the marine folks, Great Sea, had decided to submit to Chu Yunfan.","He also decided to organize a million troops to attack the barbarians and be the vanguard of the humans.","From now on, 70% of the marine race’s output would belong to the humans.","For a time, the world was in an uproar.","No one had expected that the only King marine folk, Great Sea, would come up with such humiliating terms after meeting Chu Yunfan.","All the marine folks were in an uproar. They had gathered together and submitted to Great Sea in order to obtain protection, but now, Great Sea wanted to send them to their deaths.","There were those among the marine folks who understood that sending a small number of people to their deaths was to ensure that the majority of their race could survive.","The current marine folks had no bargaining power in front of Chu Yunfan.","Not to mention, if they wanted to survive on this scale, wouldn’t the humans be afraid of them suddenly making a comeback?","If they wanted to survive now, the only way to survive was to reduce their strength to a level that was not enough to pose a threat to the humans.","Thus, some of the wise people of the marine folks chose to remain silent, and some of them were even willing to die.","Great Sea, who had bowed down to the humans, returned to the marine folks and unexpectedly carried out a bloody massacre and suppression.","After suppressing all those who opposed, more than ten million members of the marine folks were eliminated. All of them were elites of the race.","Although they tried their best to resist, it was meaningless in front of Great Sea.","Half-Kings were killed by Great Sea in batches. Those who had not reached the King Stage were no threat to the King Stage at all.","When Chu Yunfan had just entered the King Stage, he could easily kill a group half-Kings.","Although Great Sea’s strength wasn’t worth mentioning in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was terrifying to a half-King.","Just this round of cleansing had already caused the entire marine folks to suffer heavy losses.","When the news reached the humans, the entire human race was in jubilation. Not long ago, Grand Xia and the marine folks fought to the death in the Eastern Sea. They never thought that such a day would come.","In order to survive, the marine folks had no choice but to kill themselves so that the humans would not be afraid of them.","Chu Yunfan also learned about the purge of the marine folks, and he knew more about it than most people.","The half-Kings that were killed in batches looked spectacular, but in reality, they were all older half-Kings. These were basically half-Kings with no potential.","It was impossible for them to advance to the King Stage in the future.","Most of the others were the same, they were all relatively mediocre people in the race.","These people were dead. To the marine folks, their current strength had suffered a heavy blow. However, they still had younger descendants. There was still hope for them to maintain their strength in the future.","However, nurturing Kings was not that easy to begin with. At the very least, for a long period of time, it was impossible for the marine folks to pose a threat to the humans.","Because of this, Chu Yunfan didn’t care even if he knew that there might be something fishy going on.","In any case, he had already achieved his goal of weakening the marine folks.","Meanwhile, the barbarians and the monsters were cursing loudly because the marine folks’ betrayal had caused a huge change in the ratio of strength between the two sides.","Especially the barbarians. They had just decided to fight the humans, but who would have thought that the marine folks would defect to the humans and force the barbarians into a corner.","The battle between the humans and the barbarians was imminent. Millions of troops from both sides had already gathered at the border.","The battle began when the marine folks’ million strong army landed on the Hundred Thousand Mountains.","When the battle between the barbarians and the marine folks reached its climax, the human army finally entered the battlefield."]},{"number":2434,"title":"Chapter 2434: The Barbarian God Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2434: The Barbarian God Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","By the time the humans entered the battlefield, the marine folks and the barbarians had already started fighting. The battle had already reached a white-hot stage.","The marine folks had already lost more than 500,000 soldiers.","The commanders of the marine folks seemed to know their mission this time, so they attacked without sparing any manpower and resources.","Within a short period of time, they had already broken through several barbarian defense lines and killed more than a hundred million barbarians.","The elite army of the barbarians had never appeared. Those who appeared at the front line were just cannon fodder.","This was why the marine folks had such a shocking exchange rate.","However, the marine folks was already exhausted and their attacks had been stopped.","At this moment, the human army finally entered the Hundred Thousand Mountains.","Although the terrain of the Hundred Thousand Mountains was steep and the miasma was rampant, this obstacle was nothing to the elites and cultivation experts of the humans.","They flew across the sky as if they were walking on flat ground.","After the two-million-strong elite army of the humans appeared, the elite army of the barbarians, which had been missing for a long time, finally appeared.","Looking from afar, it was as if a dark cloud was sweeping over.","Chu Yunfan sensed powerful barbarian masters among the endless barbarian army.","Among them, there were hundreds of half-Kings, and there were also quite a few Kings.","It was obvious that the barbarians were determined to fight the humans.","It could be said that there were many elites and experts.","“They’re really patient!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. They didn’t even make a move when facing the attack of millions of elite soldiers of the marine folks. They sacrificed hundreds of millions of cannon fodder to resist the crazy attack of the marine folks.","It was to wait for the human army.","“How dare the barbarians hide a criminal of humanity!”","Chu Yunfan’s roar shook the sky.","“If you want to add a crime, why don’t you say something!”","A King among the barbarian army snorted coldly.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. There were indeed people who wanted to add crimes, but it was an indisputable fact that the barbarians had been at odds with the humans for many years. They had invaded countless times and plundered countless people.","The hatred between the two races was as deep as the sea. It was already difficult to tell who was right or wrong. There was only a dispute of interests.","“Stubborn! Men, kill all the barbarians!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","The two armies collided. The elite human army met the elite barbarian army.","In the sky, the powerful Kings stepped out of the formation one after another.","There were many Kings among the barbarians, and there were also many Kings among the humans. Especially this time, Chu Yunfan had brought Chu Hongcai and the others. In terms of the number of Kings, they were not inferior to the barbarians.","There were even a few more!","Chu Yunfan sat in the middle of the human army and watched the battle coldly. He was not moved at all. He had seen too many battles in his life.","It wasn’t like they hadn’t come into contact with extermination wars before, so it really wasn’t much.","All of a sudden, a terrifying aura spread out from the barbarians and enveloped the sky in an instant.","Even the auras of the Kings were suppressed.","A half-Emperor!","“I’ve been waiting for you!” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows.","Chu Yunfan flew out and faced the figure from afar.","He saw that it was the attire of an orthodox barbarian man.","He looked like he was in his forties and looked like a human.","However, Chu Yunfan knew that this was not a human, but the legendary Barbarian God that had been passed down from generation to generation.","Unlike the Evil Gods, there was more than one Evil God. However, there was only one Barbarian God. He created the barbarian race single-handedly and took a large number of people from the humans. Then, he created the barbarians on this basis.","However, unlike the Evil Gods, the Barbarian God was more mysterious. He was worshipped all year round and had a faint glow on his body.","It didn’t even look like a living being!","“You’re not the Barbarian God!”","Chu Yunfan glanced at the Barbarian God in front of him.","“If I’m not wrong, you’re just an incarnation of the Barbarian God!”","“You have good eyesight, King Chu !”","The Barbarian God’s identity was exposed, but he did not fly into a rage out of humiliation. He only spoke calmly.","“But you’re wrong about one thing. I am the Barbarian God. I am the Barbarian God that the barbarians have been worshipping for billions of years!”","His words made the entire barbarian army cheer. Their morale was boosted. He was the Barbarian God.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and understood what the Barbarian God meant.","He was indeed not the original Barbarian God. He was the incarnation left behind by the original Barbarian God. However, for countless years, the true Barbarian God that the barbarians worshipped was this incarnation.","His body was filled with dense power of faith.","It was this power of faith that prevented the Barbarian God from dying over time.","Otherwise, after so many years, no matter how long a living being lived, they should have died.","After so many years of development, the Barbarian God incarnation had almost become a god and had developed an independent consciousness. It was not wrong to say that he was the Barbarian God, because he was the Barbarian God that the barbarians had been worshipping all these years.","The power of faith in his body was so strong that it was almost as strong as a half-Emperor.","According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, if it wasn’t for the fact that the Barbarian God didn’t have a way to vindicate his Dao, he would have become an Emperor long ago.","Unlike the Evil Gods, the Evil Gods shared in the sacrifices of their entire race, while the Barbarian God had received the sacrifices of the entire barbarians for countless years.","That was why he looked like this. His appearance was exactly what the Barbarian God should look like in the hearts of the barbarians. He was completely different from the pure evil creatures like the Evil God.","Chu Yunfan had also come into contact with the path of faith and knew that it could quickly increase his strength, but it would also completely bind him to his believers.","If the believers were finished, they would be finished too. They could not be left alone.","Therefore, whether it was the Evil Gods or the Barbarian God, they fought until the last moment. Once the Hus and the barbarians were exterminated, they would not be far from death.","“Interesting. After countless years of sacrifice, a mere incarnation actually has such strength!” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. His figure was tall and muscular, and he was indomitable.","“King Chu, to think that the humans could give birth to such a genius like you. The humans’ fate is not destined to end. Otherwise, you wouldn’t be standing here talking to me today!” The Barbarian God looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“You and the Evil Gods divided the humans and created a division so that you would have humans sacrifice to you all four seasons. You deserve to die!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. ” The existence of the barbarians is a mistake. Today is the day to correct this mistake!”"]},{"number":2435,"title":"Chapter 2435: The Monsters Interrupt, the Elder Princess Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2435: The Monsters Interrupt, the Elder Princess Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“King Chu, how dare you. What a big appetite! The barbarians have existed since ancient times. If you want to destroy the barbarians, you’ll have to see if you have such an appetite!” The Barbarian God stood with his hands behind his back. He did not take Chu Yunfan’s words to heart.","“What do you mean eternal? It’s a race that shouldn’t have existed in the first place. The Hus is also known to have existed since ancient times, but what happened in the end? Didn’t I still destroy them?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“I’m different from those Evil Gods. They won’t be able to improve in their lives, but I’m different!” the Barbarian God said calmly. Even if he was facing an Evil God, he did not care about it at all.","Although he was an unusual life form, he was indeed very powerful. He was already in the half-Emperor Stage and was only a step away from the Imperial Path.","Moreover, he had been worshipped by the barbarians for many years, so his cultivation was extremely strong. The power of faith was also unimaginably strong. As long as there was a suitable method, it was very possible for him to break through to the Emperor Stage.","“It was true that you had a chance to advance to the Emperor Stage, but now you don’t have a chance!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “Over these years, in order to have enough people to offer sacrifices and pray for you, you’ve kidnapped so many human beings to brainwash them. I believe that I don’t need to say anything more. Each and every one of them is your original sin. Today is the day to settle the score!”","“Cut the crap and die!” the Barbarian God shouted. His aura was rising and spreading.","He was a true veteran half-Emperor.","Compared to that, the half-Emperor Evil God formed by five Evil Gods was just child’s play.","The aura of the Barbarian God was released. It was as if the entire world was about to collapse. Everything turned into chaos.","A huge axe appeared in his hand. The axe swept across the sky and slashed out a savage beast. The savage beast roared at the sky and its huge body hovered in the air.","In just an instant, it had charged down.","The void in front of Chu Yunfan had been completely destroyed.","Chu Yunfan was different. He punched out and transformed into eight powerful gods. The eight powerful gods swept across everything and crushed everything. No one could withstand such a punch.","Boom!","A peerless collision erupted. The Barbarian God and Chu Yunfan collided. The terrifying light blotted out the sky and destroyed everything.","The laws of both sides’ Great Daos were fighting. It was a battle of endless laws, and it looked extremely terrifying.","This attack, both sides were almost evenly matched!","The Barbarian God was shocked. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to fight him to this extent.","He was very powerful, even among the half-Emperors. His cultivation was so powerful that ordinary people couldn’t understand it.","There were many special methods that belonged to the path of faith and incense.","Suddenly, at this moment, another large dark cloud came from the distance. There were actually endless shouts and killing sounds coming from within the dark cloud.","Terrifying figures were hidden within.","“Monsters! Damn it! It’s the monster army!”","At this moment, everyone reacted. It was actually the monsters who had mobilized their army and were charging toward the human army.","“Why are the monsters attacking us humans? Do they want to start a war with us?” At this moment, the old principal of Virtuous Academy stepped forward and said righteously.","“You don’t have to say anything more. How can we not know the plan of the humans? If we let you destroy the barbarians, I’m afraid we’ll be the next ones. In that case, why don’t we fight to the death?” a King monster shouted from the monster army.","With the humans sweeping the world, they had destroyed the Hus, the barbarians, and the marine folks under their command. How could the monsters remain unscathed?","The monsters did not expect that the humans would actually expand to such an extent after the war.","Especially since Chu Yunfan was so powerful that the humans did not have the strength to destroy the Hus.","And the one who really decided everything was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan even used the power of his victory to force the marine folks to bow their heads and submit to the humans.","What kind of terrifying strength was this?","All the knowledgeable monsters realized that they couldn’t let the humans destroy the barbarians. Otherwise, they would be next.","In a situation where the other races were either destroyed or surrendered, how could the monsters still want to stay out of it?","Therefore, while the humans and the barbarians were preparing for war, the monsters was also preparing for war. Now, while the humans was fighting against the barbarians, they had surrounded them from behind.","The humans were extremely worried. The barbarians alone were naturally not enough to make the entire humans worry. It could even be said that it was only a matter of time before the barbarians were pacified.","However, once the monsters joined in, it would be enough to pose a fatal threat to the humans.","“The monsters aided the rebels and disobeyed their superiors. Their crimes are unforgivable!”","Suddenly, at this moment, a delicate voice came from the sky.","Everyone saw a figure stepping on a streak of light. In an instant, the person arrived in front of the monster army.","It was none other than the Elder Princess, who had not appeared for a long time.","The appearance of the Elder Princess stunned everyone.","“This is great. The Elder Princess has appeared too. With the Elder Princess holding down the fort, the monsters won’t be able to cause any trouble!”","“Our humans will definitely win this battle!”","“Even the monsters will be destroyed!”","The human army was in jubilation.","Chu Yunfan nodded when he saw the Elder Princess. He was naturally prepared for the monsters.","And the Elder Princess was the trump card he had invited.","Of the three King humans, the human king was injured and in seclusion. It was naturally impossible for him to appear at this time.","However, the Elder Princess could make a move. If the monsters didn’t make a move, it would be fine. Once the monsters made a move, the Elder Princess would personally suppress them.","Even though the Elder Princess might not be able to suppress the monsters for long with her strength, it was enough to buy him some time.","“Let’s end this quickly and take you down first!” Chu Yunfan sneered and looked into at the Barbarian God.","“End this quickly? What right do you have?” The Barbarian God couldn’t help but be furious. Chu Yunfan clearly had no regard for him.","Immediately, a terrifying aura was released. At the same time, the axe in his hand was once again ruthlessly hacked at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan sneered and punched out. He turned into eight gods and suppressed everything. In an instant, he punched through the primordial spirit in the axe, the savage beast.","The punch landed directly on the Barbarian God’s chest.","Bam!","This punch directly turned the Barbarian God’s chest into a bloody mess."]},{"number":2436,"title":"Chapter 2436: Defeating the Barbarian God and Extracting the Power of Faith","paragraphs":["Chapter 2436: Defeating the Barbarian God and Extracting the Power of Faith","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The aura of the fist force swept out. The aura was overwhelming, boundless, and dazzling.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had used his full strength. Even the five-in-one Evil God was not qualified to make him use his full strength.","The Barbarian God was sent flying and kept coughing up blood. Although he was only an incarnation, after countless years of sacrifice, he had grown flesh and blood, making him no different from an ordinary creature.","When this punch was thrown out, it could be said that the sky collapsed and the earth collapsed!","The Barbarian God was stunned by Chu Yunfan’s punch. He had not expected Chu Yunfan’s punch to be so terrifying.","They could sweep away all enemies and be invincible.","In fact, he didn’t put Chu Yunfan in his eyes at the beginning. It was really because Chu Yunfan’s rise was too short. It could even be said that he rose in the time he took a nap.","At the half-Emperor Stage, one’s strength needed to accumulate over time.","What he didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan was a fluke. To be precise, he was an unprecedented existence.","It was far beyond the comprehension of ordinary people.","The Barbarian God was roaring. Terrifying energy and blood were boiling on his body. His entire body was glowing, and his terrifying aura was pushed to the extreme.","He forcefully urged his divine power. At this point, he had no choice but to risk his life.","If he didn’t go all out, he might die at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","He was not the only one who was going to die. Even the barbarians would not be able to escape the fate of being destroyed today.","The entire Central Plains would fall into the hands of the humans.","Before this, everyone had been watching the decline of the humans, almost waiting for the destruction of the humans. Who would have thought that the humans would actually be able to turn over a new leaf?","The most terrifying thing was that once the humans made a comeback, they would destroy all the races in the world.","He had nowhere to retreat. If he took another step back, he would be at the edge of a cliff.","Boom!","The Barbarian God attacked again. His speed was too fast. Chu Yunfan could not dodge this attack. To be more precise, countless figures swept out from behind the Barbarian God.","This punch was the power of faith that the barbarians had accumulated for countless years.","The power of faith gathered on the Barbarian God for countless years had also made him extraordinary. This punch was the faith of billions of barbarians.","One or two people’s faith was nothing. A thousand, ten thousand, or even a hundred million people wouldn’t be enough to shake a half-Emperor.","However, after countless years, the faith of all the barbarians was enough to pose a fatal threat to a half-Emperor.","Although most of the power of faith was used to condense his true body, the remaining power of faith was still terrifying.","The power of faith was almost omnipotent. The wound on his chest instantly healed, as if Chu Yunfan had never posed any fatal threat to him.","“Relying on the power of faith to survive?” Chu Yunfan looked at the Barbarian God and sneered.","There was no fear at all. With just a simple punch, all the power of faith disappeared wherever the fist passed.","Wherever this punch passed, the power of faith seemed to be ignited. It burned and instantly turned into a prairie fire.","There was no way to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The punch pierced through the Barbarian God’s chest. Blood dripped from his chest, and he looked extremely ferocious and terrifying.","But in the next moment, the Barbarian God recovered. However, the light of the power of faith on his body had clearly dimmed a little.","It was obvious that he had consumed a lot of faith power just now.","“You can’t kill me. You will die today!” The Barbarian God’s fury seemed to burn in the entire sky. It had been a long, long time since he had been in such a sorry state.","It could even be said that he had always been the one who could defeat all of them. He had never been bullied like this before.","After this battle ended, even if he didn’t want to, his power of faith would be exhausted to the bottom. Every punch he threw would consume countless years of power of faith.","Even the Barbarian God felt his heart ache, but no matter how much he ached, he had to fight with his life on the line. He had no other choice but to fight Chu Yunfan to the death.","“How many more times can you revive?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes were filled with murderous intent. “No matter how many times you can revive, I will kill you!”","Chu Yunfan had never doubted his own combat strength. Even though the Barbarian God was a half-Emperor who had fought all over the world, there was nothing to be afraid of.","Chu Yunfan was one of the best.","He was fearless even against a veteran half-Emperor like the Barbarian God. He was the minority of the minority, the anomaly of the anomalies.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan threw another punch, and it exploded like a cluster of light. The eight gods suppressed the Barbarian God and severely injured him. His body instantly exploded.","The Barbarian God was beaten half to death again. Although he recovered, the power of faith on his body was getting dimmer.","He had never been in such a miserable state before. Every attack actually caused him to be seriously injured.","“That power of faith is simply wasted on you!” Chu Yunfan roared and threw a punch. It was as if the world was filled with a vast light. This punch shattered the Barbarian God’s muscles again. The Barbarian God screamed and he flew backward.","He wanted to struggle and use the power of faith to heal his injuries.","However, Chu Yunfan slapped out a huge seal and sealed the Barbarian God in an instant.","The power of faith contained in his body was actually unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. It was forcefully extracted by Chu Yunfan.","The endless power of faith was like a great river, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","Throughout the countless years, the Barbarian God had never been able to refine the power of faith for his own use.","To be more precise, only the part that he refined to create his true body was refined by him.","The rest was stored in his body, just like divine power. He took a little and used a little.","What a pity.","Now, all of them had been taken out by Chu Yunfan.","“How dare you!”","The Barbarian God was furious. He wanted to struggle, but it was useless because he had no way to break free from Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The Barbarian King was furious, and he rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","For a moment, even Chu Hongcai and the others couldn’t stop him.","“Stop him!” Chu Hongcai and the others roared.","However, it was useless. Chu Yunfan slapped down with the Flying Celestial Seal.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s palm turned into a huge star and landed on the Barbarian King.","The Barbarian King that pounced over didn’t even have time to react before his body was smashed apart.","His primordial spirit was ignited. In just an instant, he died."]},{"number":2437,"title":"Chapter 2437: The Barbarian God Is Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 2437: The Barbarian God Is Dead","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Barbarian God was killed in the air, but this didn’t stop the King barbarians who were pouncing on Chu Yunfan.","Because the Barbarian God was their faith, the King barbarians’ faith in the Barbarian God was no less than the Hus’ faith in the Evil Gods.","Otherwise, the Barbarian God would not have been able to accumulate so much power of faith in such a long time.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not panic. He suppressed the King barbarians with one hand and formed a lightning sword with the other.","The sword light slashed down and transformed into a terrifying giant sword that was thousands of feet long. As the sword slashed down, the earth shook and the mountains shook. As the sword slashed down, the four spirits of heaven and earth actually appeared. Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermillion Bird, and Black Tortoise protected the sword light.","The entire barbarian army was pierced through by the sword, and millions of barbarians were killed in an instant.","To be precise, it was vaporized by the sword light.","That terrifying aura spread out and heavily injured countless barbarians.","Under Chu Yunfan’s sword light, two King barbarians didn’t have time to dodge and were slashed on the spot. Their bodies turned into a cloud of blood mist in the air.","“Go, kill him and save the Barbarian God!”","Even though Chu Yunfan could kill the King barbarians as easily as crushing ants, the remaining King barbarians still refused to retreat.","To the barbarians, the Barbarian God was the supreme god. No one could compare to him.","“Stubborn!”","Chu Yunfan waved his hand and raised the lightning sword in his hand again. The sword light slashed down from the sky.","The four spirits of heaven and earth waved and launched an astonishing slaughter.","Slash!","Wherever the sword light passed, everything turned into nothingness, and blood mist fell from the sky.","Another King barbarian couldn’t dodge in time and was cut in half.","Even the human experts felt their scalps go numb when they saw this scene. What a heaven-defying method this was.","Not to mention those half-Kings, even those Kings were nothing to Chu Yunfan.","It was just a simple sword strike that could kill one.","Such an existence was not a decent opponent for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Hongcai and the others were especially relaxed. Chu Yunfan had already walked very far on the path of the King Stage. Even if he had not reached the Emperor Stage, in many people’s eyes, it was only a matter of time.","It was very likely that Chu Yunfan would be the first Emperor known to everyone in recent times.","Many people thought that they might be able to witness an Emperor sweep across the world and suppress all directions. They could not help but be extremely excited.","The other King barbarians charged forward fearlessly, but Chu Yunfan only attacked coldly. Every time his sword slashed down, countless elite barbarians were killed, along with the King barbarians.","His speed was extremely fast!","As a result, even though the King barbarians had rushed over, they could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. They could not even get close to him.","Every time Chu Yunfan slashed out with his sword, he could kill one or two King barbarians. The other King barbarians were also sent flying by the four spirits of heaven and earth, unable to get close to Chu Yunfan.","“Let go of the Barbarian God or we won’t let you go!”","The King barbarians were desperate. Even if this was useless to Chu Yunfan, they had no other choice.","Although the barbarians had many Kings, half-Kings, and Domainians, they could not withstand Chu Yunfan’s massacre.","In just a moment, they were all killed by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was like a magnet. All the King barbarians and half-Kings flew toward him. Although they were like cannon fodder, they all displayed amazing strength that was not afraid of death.","Even Chu Yunfan looked sideways. If the human king had been captured, there would not have been many people who would risk their lives for the human king, especially when they knew that they would definitely die.","In the end, the humans was not a theocratic world, so they did not have the deep-rooted beliefs of the Hus and the barbarians.","Naturally, they wouldn’t risk their life for a single person.","However, such a desperate fight was meaningless in the face of absolute strength.","Chu Yunfan was too powerful. He was so powerful that all the barbarians were in despair and was about to collapse.","If the Barbarian God had not died, even the barbarians armed with their divine power would have been killed.","Chu Yunfan’s sword attacks had killed at least tens of millions of barbarians.","It didn’t matter if they were in the front or the back. Chu Yunfan’s sword slashed out a terrifying sword light that was thousands of feet long and pierced through the entire army formation.","There was no way to avoid it. As long as Chu Yunfan took a fancy to it, there was only death.","“Aaarrrgggh!” The Barbarian God let out a miserable cry. The last bit of power of faith in his body was sucked out by Chu Yunfan.","All of them surged into Chu Yunfan’s body.","“Hahahaha, you actually dare to absorb this power of faith. You have to die too!” When the Barbarian God saw that Chu Yunfan had absorbed all the power of faith, he burst into laughter.","It was as if his evil scheme had succeeded!","Chu Yunfan immediately felt endless faith. All kinds of thoughts surged into his mind like a tide.","If it was an ordinary person, they would probably be instantly turned into a vegetable by these countless thoughts.","These were the thoughts of all the barbarians when they prayed to the Barbarian God for billions of years. They had mixed thoughts.","It was impossible to absorb it immediately. Otherwise, he would be turned into a vegetable by these countless thoughts.","This was also the fundamental reason why the Barbarian God had only absorbed a little power of faith after so many years.","It was because it was easy to obtain the power of faith, but it was very difficult to absorb it.","If it was absorbed without any screening, the mixed faith in the power of faith would fill the entire primordial spirit.","If he couldn’t fulfill these wishes and thoughts, he would be turned into a vegetable.","“That’s why you didn’t resist and allowed me to absorb the power of faith. You want to see me trap myself, right?” Chu Yunfan’s expression remained unchanged.","“That’s right, I want you to die without a burial place!” The Barbarian God laughed.","“Unfortunately, you miscalculated. I have a way to refine this power of faith!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about it at all. He already had a way to refine this power of faith. Moreover, he didn’t want to use this power of faith to cultivate.","Therefore, the Barbarian God’s scheme, which he thought had succeeded, was actually useless against Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan opened his palm, and the endless power of faith condensed into a ball of light that floated above his palm.","“Unfortunately, you won’t be able to see that day!”","Chu Yunfan’s sword had sent the Barbarian God’s head flying. This time, the Barbarian God was unable to recover."]},{"number":2438,"title":"Chapter 2438: Killing Two King Monsters Consecutively","paragraphs":["Chapter 2438: Killing Two King Monsters Consecutively","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan forcefully extracted the power of faith from the Barbarian God’s body. Then, the Barbarian God was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single sword strike.","Seeing the Barbarian God being killed, the entire barbarian army collapsed.","The Barbarian God was the belief of the barbarians. The entire race was founded by the Barbarian God. For countless years, the barbarians had been united by faith.","Believing in the Barbarian God was the biggest difference between the barbarians and the humans. The essence of the barbarians was the humans. Without the Barbarian God, the entire faith collapsed.","Some of them fell to the ground in pain, but there were still some who charged forward with a death wish.","However, it was meaningless. Chu Yunfan had already slaughtered all the true experts of the barbarians.","The remaining people were not enough to pose any threat to the human army.","Just Chu Yunfan and the others were enough to slaughter them all.","Chu Yunfan no longer cared about the barbarians’ matters and handed them over to Chu Hongcai and the others.","As for himself, he charged straight at the monster clan’s main formation.","At this moment, the monsters were attacking the rear of the human army. Even with the Elder Princess holding the fort, the human defense was still in danger.","That was because at this moment, the Elder Princess actually had to face two supreme martial arts masters of the monsters. They were both at the peak King Stage.","The monsters were indeed the race with the deepest foundation among all the races. Among all the races, only the monsters had experts from all races. It was a real hodgepodge.","Many experts were hidden among them, and no one knew about them.","At this stage, they were actually able to find two peak Kings. But one of them was clearly very old, looking like he had been previously sealed away and waiting for his death.","Many forces would seal some of their top experts in case of emergencies.","And these top experts were often very old, or they were seriously injured and did not have much time left.","Through the seal, they could exist for many more years. At a critical moment, they could be awakened.","One of the ancient Kings was probably sealed using this method.","And this battle was basically his last battle. Regardless of whether he won or lost, he would not be able to escape death in the end.","As a result, the old King’s attacks were even more incisive. He was not afraid of death at all because he was going to die anyway. He wanted to kill a way out for the monsters.","He was also the most active in attacking the Elder Princess. Suddenly, at this moment, a large hand descended from the sky and slapped the old King monster.","Boom!","The old King monster’s body was smashed into pieces and he died instantly. Only then did he transform into a round shape, revealing himself to be a Titan Python.","This was a senior imperial family of the monsters. There had been more than one King in the family.","However, in front of this huge hand, it was completely useless. His body was directly slapped until it collapsed.","“Old King Titan!” someone shouted, and all kinds of attacks swept out.","The phenomenon of heaven and earth turned into endless lightning and landed on this huge hand.","Many King monsters’ eyes were bloodshot with anger as they attacked the giant hand.","However, it was useless.","There was no way they could save the old King monster.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s figure appeared in the air.","When the Elder Princess saw Chu Yunfan, she was overjoyed.","Even she was in a rather sorry state under the attacks of the old King monster, who did not care about the cost.","One against two, even she was somewhat embarrassed.","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s appearance had undoubtedly greatly alleviated her predicament.","“Damn it!”","The peak King monster who was fighting with the Elder Princess saw Chu Yunfan and immediately knew that things were not good.","He knew all too well what Chu Yunfan’s appearance here meant because Chu Yunfan was fighting against the Barbarian God.","Chu Yunfan had appeared here in such a short time. Didn’t this mean that the Barbarian God was dead?","“Impossible! How could you kill the Barbarian God?” The King monster was in disbelief. He felt his mind waver.","The existence of the Barbarian God had suppressed the world for countless years, and he even had the reputation of being the greatest expert in the world.","Even if he couldn’t defeat Chu Yunfan, he shouldn’t have been defeated in such a short time.","No matter how he looked at it, it was impossible.","However, such an impossible thing happened. One could imagine the shock in his heart.","He was a King monster who wore a golden robe and looked graceful and noble. However, at this moment, the King monster’s mind was reeling.","Now, the Barbarian God was dead, and the old King he had called upon had also died under Chu Yunfan’s casual attack.","How could he resist the joint attack of Chu Yunfan and the Elder Princess? He was basically dead.","His expression changed and he retreated, but Chu Yunfan had already appeared behind him.","Chu Yunfan’s body was interwoven with different laws. In an instant, it had turned into a huge network.","This huge network instantly enveloped the King monster. All kinds of laws turned into symbols that danced in the sky, forming a strict array formation.","From afar, the King monster looked like a divine fetus wrapped in a cocoon waiting for nirvana.","However, this King monster felt an extremely terrifying aura.","Every symbol fell on his body. Although it did not seem to be very fast, it seemed slow but was actually fast. He could not dodge it at all.","Every symbol that landed on his body felt like a heavy burden.","They exploded on his body.","In a short while, he was covered in blood from the explosions and was heavily injured.","“Even if you want to kill me, it won’t be that easy!” The King monster was burning with anger, and at the same time, he was extremely shocked. He roared angrily and launched another attack at Chu Yunfan.","A law domain around him opened up all of a sudden, but in the next moment, the law domain he displayed was destroyed. The moment the law domain opened up, it had disappeared without a trace.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan rushed in front of the King monster. His five fingers clenched into fists and transformed into eight gods.","The eight gods were invincible and suppressed all powerful enemies.","The King monster had just regained his senses and wanted to resist, but it was useless.","The eight gods and eight heavenly dragons suppressed all resistance.","In just an instant, it had already shattered all the resistance of that King monster.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s fist did not slow down. His fist pierced through the chest of the King monster, creating a bloody hole.","This King monster was dead!"]},{"number":2439,"title":"Chapter 2439: Destroying the Barbarians, Leading the Army Into the Monster Region","paragraphs":["Chapter 2439: Destroying the Barbarians, Leading the Army Into the Monster Region","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With the death of the last two peak King monsters, the defeat of the monsters was certain.","Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t make a move, the Elder Princess alone could kill all the last Kings of the monsters.","The aura of the entire monster race collapsed.","They had only wanted to pincer the humans and force them to retreat. As for defeating the humans, they did not dare to think about it anymore.","They knew that it was useless no matter how many people they killed. As long as Chu Yunfan was still alive, it would be meaningless no matter how many people they killed!","With Chu Yunfan’s powerful strength, he could suppress the world by himself.","If Chu Yunfan wasn’t killed, then it wouldn’t matter how many human experts he killed.","Chu Yunfan was the pillar that had surpassed the human king.","As long as Chu Yunfan was alive, the monsters would not have a chance to turn the tables.","In contrast, the aura of the humans instantly soared.","“Destroy the barbarians!”","“Defeat the monsters and build the supreme glory of the humans!”","“Crush them!”","Countless voices were roaring. This time, Chu Yunfan did not continue to interfere. Instead, he let Chu Hongcai and the others fight against the King monsters.","The King barbarians had all died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, so they couldn’t cause any big waves. They had basically been defeated and were being chased by the human army.","Meanwhile, the monster army was still stubbornly resisting under the leadership of some King monsters.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan handed all these to Chu Hongcai and the others.","They were in charge of killing the last King monsters.","This was a rare experience for them.","“This is King Chu’s might!”","The marine folk army that was resting in the distance was dumbfounded when they saw this scene.","To them, this was an incredible battle.","Especially since they had never seen Chu Yunfan in action. The speed at which Chu Yunfan killed the King marine folks was too fast. It was so fast that many of the marine folks did not even have time to react. The battle had already ended, and the marine folks had already declined.","The older generation of experts who dared to go against the humans had all died. They were either killed by Chu Yunfan or completely wiped out by King Great Sea.","The rest of them had never fought against the humans, or rather, they had been scared out of their wits by Chu Yunfan.","When they saw how Chu Yunfan had killed the Barbarian God, who had been renowned throughout the Central Plains for a long time, as easily as a god, they finally understood what this meant.","After all, such a terrifying existence had never appeared before. Even the Barbarian God could not dominate the world.","The Barbarian God still had evenly matched opponents. As for the others, they could fight against the Barbarian God even if they had more peak Kings.","It was under such circumstances that the world maintained a strange balance.","The five great races had dominated the world for countless years.","To be precise, since the ancient times, after the war between the Emperors and the collapse of the world’s structure, this structure had gradually formed. It was only now that Chu Yunfan had broken it single-handedly.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was no different from the legendary Emperors.","What an Emperor could do, Chu Yunfan could do it too. So in their eyes, it didn’t make any difference whether Chu Yunfan was an Emperor or not.","Moreover, many people were actually guessing that Chu Yunfan was very likely to become the first Emperor since ancient times.","He had such strength!","They had never heard of someone like Chu Yunfan who had risen at such an astonishing speed and swept away his peers. Other than the ancient Emperors, there had never been anyone like him.","Because of this, in the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan was no different from the ancient Emperors.","Wasn’t the ancient Emperors like this? They almost swept away their peers and became invincible before they became Emperors.","Among them, there was no lack of Supreme Youths, but they were all defeated.","And mighty Chu Yunfan was a rising Emperor!","Such Emperors were unstoppable. All the enemies who stood in their way would be torn apart in the end.","Over the years, countless examples had proven this.","‘It’s not embarrassing to submit to a future Emperor!’ Many marine folks thought.","Many were unwilling to submit to a human, but if Chu Yunfan became an Emperor in the future, it would be normal for them to submit to an Emperor.","Which of the ancient Emperors didn’t have hundreds or thousands of followers?","That was not a problem at all!","If Chu Yunfan could become a Emperor, even the monsters, barbarians, and Hus would have to kneel on the ground and beg for mercy, let alone the marine folks.","There was no other possibility.","This battle lasted for a month. After a month, Chu Hongcai and the others joined forces to kill the remaining King monsters.","During this process, Chu Yunfan did not make a move. Even the Elder Princess did not make a move. They just let Chu Hongcai and the others make the moves.","That was how the battle finally ended.","As the King monsters were killed one by one, the monster army collapsed, following the footsteps of the barbarian army.","Next, it was the process of encircling the remaining troops. Under the interference of the Kings, the monster army was completely wiped out, and they couldn’t even escape.","As this batch of elite troops of the monsters was completely wiped out, the entire monster race was cut off from generation to generation. Countless monsters died tragically.","Then, the human army and the marine folk army began to encircle and suppress the barbarians.","Just like the Hus, all the barbarians, regardless of their gender, age, or age, were killed. Not a single one was left.","Cut the weeds and remove the roots!","It was absolutely intolerable!","It was the same to the humans. They might be able to tolerate the marine folks and the monsters, but they absolutely could not tolerate existences like the barbarians and the Hus. This was like a huge scar that constantly reminded the humans that they had once suffered such humiliation.","Their clansmen had been taken away and brainwashed into two-legged beasts. This was undoubtedly a great humiliation.","After cleaning up and being satisfied, the humans led the army into the monsters’ territory. At this moment, the monsters were in chaos.","The situation had fallen too quickly, so fast that many of them had not even reacted in time.","The various tribes of the monsters were intertwined, and the sphere of influence of each tribe was intertwined. Compared to Grand Xia, it was still a very primitive tribal alliance.","They didn’t even have a true imperial court, and they were even inferior to the marine folks.","When the human army charged into the monster region, the fighting between the monsters did not stop and continued."]},{"number":2440,"title":"Chapter 2440: Pacifying the World, the Rise of Kings","paragraphs":["Chapter 2440: Pacifying the World, the Rise of Kings","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On the day the human army entered the monster region, the monsters still did not have an accurate conclusion on whether to fight or surrender.","The human army used the marine folk elites as the vanguard to invade the monster region. Wherever they passed, they were invincible.","Many monster tribes were terrified. Not all monster tribes were royalty, and even if they were royalty, not all of them could stand out.","There were too many royal tribes in the monsters, and it was difficult to count them.","Under such circumstances, they could not organize any forces to counterattack.","Under Chu Hongcai’s leadership, the human army killed anyone who stood in their way. A month later, in the depths of the monster region, the human army defeated the last organized monster army. The monsters finally realized that things were not good.","Even though the monsters had all kinds of foundations, there were many who could temporarily resist the King humans.","However, in the eyes of a true King, it was completely meaningless. In the end, Chu Hongcai and Great Sea destroyed everything together, leaving nothing behind.","During the entire process, the marine folks army was very active. Under the leadership of Great Sea, they slaughtered crazily. In a short period of time, they caused mountains of corpses and seas of blood in the monsters.","Many young monster experts with potential died in the hands of the marine folk army. There was even no lack of Supreme Youths.","They were not given any time to grow.","Chu Yunfan was happy that the marine folks would help him. This way, the hatred of the monsters would turn to the marine folks. After all, they didn’t dare to hate the humans. They only dared to target the marine folks.","All the marine folks seemed to have gone crazy over this. They didn’t care about this at all. In any case, it didn’t matter to them whether the monsters hated them or not.","At this point, the Hus and the barbarians were exterminated, and the monster region was pacified. All the monsters submitted to the humans, and the humans agreed to the monsters’ surrender with conditions that were even harsher than the marine folks.","This was because in the boundless monster region, there were all kinds of miasma. Other than the monsters, no other race could survive here.","Chu Yunfan planned to use the monsters to mine the resources for human cultivation.","Of course, there were still elite human armies stationed in the monster region. These were all experts in the cultivation world and did not care about the miasma that pervaded the monster region.","At this point, the world was at peace!","The humans were the sole power, while the Hu and barbarians were exterminated. The remaining monster and marine folks submitted and became the source of resources for the humans. Moreover, these resources were provided to Grand Xia. For a time, the financial resources of the humans were greatly increased.","The humans was unprecedentedly powerful.","Chu Yunfan, who had accomplished all of this, could be said to be the first sacred King since ancient times. His reputation had even surpassed that of the Grand Xia Ancestor.","This was because this was the achievement of the humans for countless years. Even the Great Ancestor of Grand Xia had not been able to do it.","But it was done by Chu Yunfan.","While the humans had accomplished such a great feat, there were still undercurrents surging within the human race.","In the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan, who had made such a contribution, could already be considered to have surpassed his master.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, even the human king could not resist him. If Chu Yunfan wanted to, he could probably suppress all of humanity by himself.","The reason why the humans could have such a situation had nothing to do with the overall foundation of the humans. After spending so many years fighting the monsters, the humans did not have the foundation to suppress the entire world.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had done all this by himself.","Even if the human king didn’t take the initiative to suppress it, wouldn’t Chu Yunfan want to go up a level?","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan just couldn’t find a reasonable reason!","Just when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would make a move, he chose to return to Zhenyuan City.","After many years of construction, Zhenyuan City had become Chu Yunfan’s base camp. Its importance was even greater than that of the Flying Celestials.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation base, he had long surpassed the Flying Celestial Founder. He could be said to be the number one expert in the Flying Celestials since ancient times.","Therefore, even though he was in Zhenyuan City, there were still many disciples of the Flying Celestials who came here to seek refuge.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan did not make any moves, which disappointed many people with ulterior motives.","Everyone knew that if Chu Yunfan wanted to overthrow Grand Xia, he didn’t need to secretly prepare any schemes. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he could do it almost immediately.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t do it, it naturally meant that he didn’t have such thoughts.","As time slowly passed, Zhenyuan City became another center of humanity, just like the Imperial Capital. Countless capable people came to seek refuge, and Chu Yunfan did not reject anyone.","However, Chu Yunfan did not plan to leave Grand Xia and establish his own faction, because there was no need to.","Even within Grand Xia, there was no one who could control him. On the contrary, he could use the mature system of Grand Xia to absorb all kinds of resources to strengthen himself.","Gradually, the humans got used to the fact that there were two core members of the humans, one in the Imperial Capital and the other in Zhenyuan City.","However, with the tacit consent of Zhenyuan City, the Imperial City was still the largest core of humanity.","In the blink of an eye, twenty years had passed.","During these twenty years, all the humans had lived in peace. They had occupied the territories of the Hus and the barbarians. Cities had been built in the grasslands, and territories had been built in the mountains.","The territory of the humans had expanded several times. In addition, there were countless casualties in the previous battle with the monsters. For a time, the humans, which was usually known for its dense population, was somewhat desolate.","With the supply of almost all the resources in the world, the humans ushered in a golden period of development. Everyone discovered that their cultivation resources had increased several times in an instant.","The weaker they were, the stronger the feeling they felt now.","In particular, those Supreme Youths who were originally still in the half-King Stage welcomed an explosion. In a short period of time, they directly broke through to the King Stage.","In the past 20 years, more than 50 new Kings had been added to the humans. Not only those Supreme Youths, but even many ancient prodigies and the old experts of the current generation had also completed their breakthroughs under the supply of endless resources.","For a time, the Kings of the humans reached an unprecedented level.","There had never been an era where there were so many Kings among the humans. Moreover, they did not need to consume the humans’ foundation. It was not like the initial estimation that these ancient prodigies would consume the humans’ foundation.","For a time, the humans were unprecedentedly powerful!"]},{"number":2441,"title":"Chapter 2441: 20 Years, Power Explosion","paragraphs":["Chapter 2441: 20 Years, Power Explosion","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In just a few short decades, the strength of the entire human race had undergone an earth-shattering change. Other than Kings, the number of Quasi-Kings and Grand Dominion Realm experts had increased by at least ten times.","The strength of the human kings had also undergone earth-shattering changes in a short period of time.","Within the human race, there were two factions. One was the traditional Grand Xia faction, while the other was the Zhenyuan faction, which was centered around Zhenyuan City.","This was something that had never happened since ancient times.","Ever since Great Xia’s founding ancestor established the Great Xia Kingdom, no one had been able to do this.","This was because the royal family had overwhelming strength. No one could ignore the existence of the royal family.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance had broken this tradition.","Because his rise was too fast, so fast that before anyone could react, he was already the number one expert in the world.","In this process, not only was he not suppressed by the royal family, but he was even supported by the royal family. This was because in the face of the great power of the demons, even the human race was in danger of being destroyed.","No one expected that after breaking through to the peak of the King realm, Chu Yunfan’s strength would actually increase to such a level.","The disaster of the extermination of the human race was easily alleviated because of him. After that, he expanded his territory and destroyed the Hu and Barbarian Tribes. He directly scattered the Demon Tribe. In decades, it almost became a breeding ground for the human race.","The marine race had become the underlings and vassals of the human race, continuously collecting resources from the seabed for the human race to cultivate.","Under such circumstances, the strength of the human race had developed explosively.","This gave the entire human race the feeling of two suns.","Although the orthodox faction was in the Great Xia Dynasty, everyone understood that the reason why the human race could have its current status was because of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Even though the Monster Clan had produced a few Monster Kings and the Sea Clan had produced a few Sea Kings, they were still nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","Every five years, he still had to go to the Imperial Capital to meet the Human King, and then come to Zhenyuan City to meet Chu Yunfan.","It was like paying tribute.","One could imagine the current power of the human race.","And all of this was brought about by Chu Yunfan. Naturally, in the hearts of many people, Chu Yunfan’s prestige had risen to an unimaginable level, even surpassing the Great Ancestor of Xia and even the previous kings of the human race.","This was because it was not only the Great Ancestor of the Great Xia Dynasty. Before the Great Xia Dynasty, there were many human dynasties that had been born, but none of them had been able to unify the world.","However, Chu Yunfan had led the human race to do it. If it weren’t for the fact that there were many places in the Demon Region and the sea that humans couldn’t survive in, these two races would have been uprooted.","With such prestige, it was easy to imagine that some people already regarded Chu Yunfan as the number one king in history.","Under such circumstances, even if Chu Yunfan didn’t make any moves and didn’t show any intention of overthrowing the Great Xia Dynasty, a large number of people still came over.","In addition, Chu Yunfan already had many followers. The Ten Great Kings and the Heaven Devouring Flaming Sparrow had basically returned to their respective tribes and become the kings of their respective tribes, loyal to Chu Yunfan.","There was also the Flying Immortal Sect. Chu Yunfan didn’t fight for it, but his strength had spread all over the world.","Not to mention, one day, many people were shocked to find that among the 50 new Kings, more than 30 of them were directly related to Chu Yunfan.","Because Chu Yunfan gave lectures in Zhenyuan City all year round, with his cultivation and realm, even those arrogant supreme youths and ancient geniuses would go to listen to his lectures.","As time passed, many supreme youths and ancient geniuses would break through on the spot. There were even quite a few who directly broke through to the king realm.","Almost all the new king tiers had some sort of relationship with Chu Yunfan, and before they became king tiers, no one paid any attention to them.","Trash that wasn’t even a king tier didn’t even have the right to be cared about.","However, once they became king tiers, they would have to choose between joining the Great Xia Empire or joining the Zhenyuan City faction.","Because they realized that there was no place for them in this vast world.","The Human Tribe was not in an era of chaos and separation. On the contrary, the Human Tribe was in an unprecedented era of unification. They could not become kings by themselves.","Their strength was not enough to shake the existing system, so they could only choose to integrate into the system of the Great Xia Dynasty. Most of them chose to join the faction of Zhenyuan City.","It was not only because of the inheritance of the incense, but also because Zhenyuan City was only a loose alliance. There was no need to submit to Chu Yunfan, and Chu Yunfan did not care about these things.","This was the real reason why these high and mighty prodigies of their generation chose Zhenyuan City.","Of course, there was no other choice. After becoming a king tier, one’s cultivation did not stop. Instead, they entered a new stage. The consumption of resources was even more terrifying. If there were not enough resources, one’s future progress would completely lag behind others.","This situation among the humans made many people speechless and unable to understand at all.","Chu Yunfan clearly had enough strength to sweep the world, but he did not choose to overthrow the Great Xia Dynasty and establish himself.","It was simply unscientific. It had completely overturned the history and tradition of countless years!","On this day, in Zhenyuan City, Chu Yunfan was preaching to his closest followers and Tang Siyu.","Although he often held public lectures, he did not have any selfless thoughts. Although he had the idea of cultivating the foundation and strength of the human race, there was always a difference between close and distant.","While those former competitors had all stepped into the King realm and become king tiers, Tang Siyu and the others ‘strength had already advanced by leaps and bounds.","In just a few decades, earth-shaking changes had taken place.","The strongest among them, Tang Siyu, was already at the peak of the King realm. Chu Hongcai, the Flaming Sky-devouring Sparrow, and the others were only one step away.","The remaining Dragon-headed Fierce Crocodile and the others also successfully stepped into the late-stage King realm.","In terms of strength, the forces of Zhenyuan City had long surpassed the power that the royal family could control.","Of course, this was also inseparable from Chu Yunfan, because Chu Yunfan had given them the most important power of luck.","Ever since Chu Yunfan led the human race to conquer the south and the north, sweeping across the world, expanding the territory of the human race and helping the human race’s strength greatly increase, Chu Yunfan felt a portion of the power of faith and luck transfer from the royal family to him."]},{"number":2442,"title":"Chapter 2442: The Human King’s Breakthrough","paragraphs":["Chapter 2442: The Human King’s Breakthrough","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan saved the humans from the crisis of extinction, and then led the humans to war, establishing its current position as the overlord.","The living space of the humans had been expanded several times, and the resources they could obtain were at least ten times more than before. Even the commoners at the lowest level could obtain great benefits.","This was the so-called bonus of war!","In these twenty years, the strength of the humans had simply undergone earth-shattering changes.","Even now, according to the estimation of the entire human race, even if they encountered the peak of the monsters at this time, they could still fight and not be destroyed by the monsters.","If this continued, it would only be a matter of time before they could rival the monsters at their peak, or even surpass them.","After all, the entire Central Plains was providing the humans with resources to develop.","Under such circumstances, one could imagine how high Chu Yunfan’s image was in the hearts of the humans.","Over time, Chu Yunfan discovered that a portion of the humans’ luck and enormous power of faith had poured into his body.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t keep any of these for himself. At his level, he had already gone very far in the half-Emperor Stage.","Although this luck and power of faith were useful to him, they were not of utmost importance.","In particular, Chu Yunfan did not want to rely on the power of luck and faith to become an Emperor. In that case, his rise and fall would be firmly bound to humanity.","This was obviously in great conflict with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation path that did not rely on external things.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan decided to give these to Tang Siyu, Chu Hongcai, and the others. Everyone obtained the power of luck and faith, and their cultivation naturally advanced by leaps and bounds.","In a short period of time, their cultivation had undergone an earth-shattering change.","Just the strength of Chu Yunfan’s own direct line of descent had already far surpassed the strength of the top experts of the humans.","The strength of the entire faction was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people, not to mention the Kings who were attached to Zhenyuan City.","Although they were once Chu Yunfan’s competitors, at this point, there was no longer any competition.","Even if they had become Kings, no one would think that they were strong enough to compete with Chu Yunfan. The two of them were no longer on the same level.","In the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan had a high chance of becoming an Emperor in the future. As for the others, even if they were Supreme Youths, they only had the possibility of becoming an Emperor.","The Supreme Youths with emperor physiques did not mean that they could become Emperors. Otherwise, they could have been the heroes of their respective eras and did not have to seal themselves to this era. In fact, even if it was a Supreme Youth who eventually became an Emperor, it was only a rare sight.","To many Supreme Youths, the peak of the King Stage was the peak they could reach. Ordinary ancient prodigies were considered lucky to reach the King Stage.","Therefore, they did not have any psychological burden to rely on Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan could become an Emperor, then their future would be limitless.","Once a person attained the Dao, even their chickens and dogs would ascend to heaven!","Chu Yunfan was also carefully guiding everyone’s cultivation. He didn’t hide anything. In fact, there was nothing to hide. At this stage, every step forward could only be used as a reference.","Only by creating a path of his own could he have a broad future.","Suddenly, everyone who was listening to Chu Yunfan’s lecture turned their heads and looked in the direction of the Imperial Capital.","At the same time, almost all the experts of the Central Plains, who were at the half-King Stage and above, sensed a vast aura surging out of the Imperial Capital.","“He finally broke through!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","All the Kings present could sense a terrifying aura surging out from the depths of the Imperial Capital.","Their eyes were like torches. Through the layers of space, they saw a middle-aged man in a golden dragon robe bursting with flames.","It was the Grand Xia King!","After decades of recuperation, the human king of Grand Xia had also completed his breakthrough.","He had broken through from the peak King Stage to the half-Emperor Stage.","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar. Now, the humans was faintly divided into two factions.","Although the ruler of the world was Grand Xia in name, the strength of the Zhenyuan City was obvious to all.","The two sides weren’t at war yet, because the leaders of both sides, the human king and Chu Yunfan, didn’t publicly or privately express any intention of fighting each other.","Thus, the two factions did not clash. The Kings and factions under both sides could not help but form groups. Gradually, two factions were formed.","The pressure on Grand Xia was naturally great. Although there were two peak Kings, the human king and the Elder Princess, they could not stop Chu Yunfan even if they were tied together.","They all knew that Chu Yunfan was not at the peak of the King Stage, but a half-Emperor.","And among the experts of Grand Xia, only the human king or the Elder Princess had the strength to become a half-Emperor.","Now, the human king had finally broken through and become a half-Emperor. Although he was only a half-Emperor, he had half a body that had stepped in.","There was no need to doubt the difference in his battle prowess.","Although many people thought that even if the human king broke through, he was probably not Chu Yunfan’s match.","One had to know that Chu Yunfan had killed two half-Emperors in a row. Obviously, Chu Yunfan had gone far among the half-Emperors.","No one in the world knew the strength of a half-Emperor, so they could only guess.","At the very least, on the surface, both sides had maintained a basic balance.","While it was bustling outside, the human king and Chu Yunfan, the opponents in many people’s eyes, were having a good chat in the main hall.","“Congratulations on breaking through to the Emperor Stage. Now, there’s nothing wrong with calling yourself the human emperor!” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","The human king waved his hand and said, “Others may not know, but don’t you know? Although I’m a half-Emperor, the difference between me and a real Emperor is like heaven and earth!”","He had only guessed how powerful an Emperor was, but now that he had stepped into the half-Emperor Stage, he could roughly guess how terrifying an Emperor was.","If he claimed to be the human emperor now, that would really be a joke.","In the eyes of ignorant people, this might not be much, but in the eyes of those who truly understood, this was simply a world of difference.","If the human king claimed to be the human emperor, it would undoubtedly be a huge joke.","“Hahahaha!” Chu Yunfan laughed heartily."]},{"number":2443,"title":"Chapter 2443: Dao Discussion, Wanderers Need to Return Home","paragraphs":["Chapter 2443: Dao Discussion, Wanderers Need to Return Home","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Now, outsiders are spreading the rumor that our relationship is bad, but they never thought that the two of us could drink tea and discuss the Dao here!”","The human king bluntly mentioned the dispute between the two major factions within the humans.","“It’s just the guess of the ignorant people outside!” Chu Yunfan smiled.” Besides, it’s good to let them have some disputes. Only with competition can there be progress. This is the so-called natural selection!”","“Natural selection? Makes sense, interesting!” The human king smiled and nodded. “They all think that we have a conflict, but they are too narrow-minded. The universe is too vast. They are not even Emperors, yet they are busy fighting among themselves. It’s ridiculous!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. The reason he wasn’t interested in the hegemony of the Central Plains was that his goal was even greater.","Becoming a human king was not his ultimate goal. He wanted to complete the ultimate goal that all the previous human kings could not achieve, in order to become a god.","To live long and see everything!","He had an advantage that others didn’t have. He had a true godhead in his mind, and becoming a god in the future wasn’t just wishful thinking.","It was precisely because of this that he was not interested in these trivial matters!","As long as the Central Plains could provide him with an endless supply of cultivation resources, it would be enough. It didn’t matter whether he wanted to dominate or not.","As if influenced by Chu Yunfan, the human king was more relaxed than he had imagined.","Especially after breaking through to the half-Emperor Stage, he was only a step away from becoming a human emperor. The human king didn’t want to give up the chance to become a real human emperor and get entangled with Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, both of them were clear that the so-called two major factions were just carrying their flags and fighting for their own interests.","Other than a few direct descendants, the other Kings belonged to a loose alliance.","It was precisely because of this that the two of them were even less interested in these trivial matters.","“I’ve just broken through and become a half-Emperor, but there are still many things I don’t understand about this realm. I wonder if I can have a Dao discussion with you, King Chu!” the human king said.","“Sure!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The news that the human king was going to discuss the Dao with King Chu and invited all the heroes of the world to go with him spread throughout the world overnight.","All of a sudden, everyone in the world who had reached Domain Stage rushed to the Imperial Capital.","Although they couldn’t understand the discussion between two half-Emperors, they were still in a daze.","That stage was too profound, but this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. It was a rare event that could not be missed.","Not to mention the Kings, even those who were in seclusion came after hearing the news.","Dozens of powerful Kings had gathered in the Imperial Capital.","For a time, the wind and clouds met.","In the depths of the Imperial Capital, in a subdimension, countless experts were gathered. Thrones were laid out in the air of this subdimension.","Everyone sat down.","In the middle of this subdimension was a high platform. On the high platform, there were two futons.","Everyone was seated in a group according to their different factions and kinship.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan and the human king appeared on the futons.","Everyone’s eyes lit up as they watched.","The two of them did not say anything else and directly began to discuss the Dao.","In the beginning, the Dao that the two of them were talking about was not the half-Emperor path. It was more about the path from the Domain Stage to the King Stage. The experts were mesmerized by it.","The two experts at the half-Emperor Stage were able to talk about the most common things and point out the key points in just one sentence.","For a moment, flowers bloomed and golden lotuses surged.","Gradually, the Dao that the two of them were talking about became deeper and deeper. Domainians were the first to be eliminated. Slowly, they could no longer understand what they were talking about. Soon after, it was half-Kings. In the end, even Kings could no longer understand what they were talking about.","Ten days had passed by the time all of this was done.","These ten days were enough to make the experts feel that they had gained a lot. Even if they could not understand the later part of the discussion, they did not leave. Instead, they chose to stay.","Even if it was something they could not understand now, everyone would try to forcefully record it. This kind of Dao lecture was not a one-on-one Dao lecture, but a Dao sound.","If they could understand, they could understand. If they didn’t understand, they didn’t even know what to say. It was very difficult to remember.","That was a matter on a completely different level. It had already involved some areas that belonged to the Imperial Dao.","Moreover, even if they were speaking the same voice of the Great Dao, in reality, everyone heard it completely differently.","Later on, the two sides started to discuss the Dao. They were all discussing the cultivation comprehension of half-Emperors.","At this point, no one present could understand what they meant.","Everyone soon discovered that at the beginning, the human king could still discuss the Dao with Chu Yunfan, but as time passed, the human king no longer discussed the Dao with Chu Yunfan.","To be precise, it was Chu Yunfan’s one-sided preaching.","He was still talking about the path of the half-Emperor. Everyone was surprised. Logically speaking, both sides were at the same level. Even if Chu Yunfan was stronger than the human king, the path of cultivation was completely different.","How could Chu Yunfan have a complete understanding of the Dao cultivated by the human king?","However, the truth was that Chu Yunfan seemed to know everything about this!","The more the human king listened, the more shocked he became. Chu Yunfan’s understanding and insights were completely from a strategic point of view. It was as if he had already reached the end of this road and turned around to see everything thoroughly.","Even if it was a different path, one couldn’t see clearly what the different paths looked like during the process of walking. However, when they reached the end and looked at the small mountains, all the paths could be seen clearly.","Chu Yunfan gave the human king the feeling that he had already reached the end of this path. Everything was too clear and transparent.","After another 10 days, the Dao discussion finally came to an end. Everyone felt that they had gained a lot. Even the human king had benefited greatly from this Dao discussion.","“Now that the human king is here, I can rest assured. The Central Plains will be in your hands from now on!” Chu Yunfan stood up and said.","“What do you mean by this, King Chu?” The human king’s expression changed. He didn’t know what Chu Yunfan meant.","“I’ll be taking my wife away for a while,” Chu Yunfan said. “I’m going on a vacation. It’s time to return home!”","Everyone looked at Tang Siyu. Everyone knew that Tang Siyu was Chu Yunfan’s wife, but they didn’t know where Chu Yunfan was referring to. Could it be the Violet Thunder Prefecture?"]},{"number":2444,"title":"Chapter 2444: The Human Race Is in Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 2444: The Human Race Is in Danger","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As Chu Yunfan’s name shook the world, his background was no longer a secret. The Chu clan of the Violet Thunder Prefecture was only a very, very small family.","If it was in the past, it would probably not have attracted anyone’s attention.","However, it was a miracle that Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai had come out of such a small family.","Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai were the last two members of the Chu clan. The other members had all died in the rebellion.","This was what everyone knew about Chu Yunfan’s background.","However, if he only wanted to go to the Violet Thunder Prefecture, there was no need to mobilize so many people. Chu Yunfan only needed a thought to appear in the Violet Thunder Prefecture.","Therefore, no one knew where Chu Yunfan’s hometown was.","Tang Siyu and Chu Yunfan stood up side by side.","“Human King, I’ll leave the humans to you in the future!”","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu stood up and left together, disappearing before everyone’s eyes.","Capital City, Kunlun Realm.","The last fortress of mankind in the Kunlun Realm was also the last hope of human civilization.","A huge protective shield firmly enveloped the Capital City.","Outside, there were almost endless monsters attacking crazily!","Countless monsters were attacking crazily!","Behind this endless tide of monsters, huge factories stood on the flat ground. At the same time, the assembly lines in the factories did not produce any industrial products, but huge monsters.","These monsters were soaked in the water, and they were produced at an astonishing speed. Then, they were produced in batches and walked onto the battlefield in batches.","All the monsters had only one goal, which was the last stronghold of humans in the Kunlun Realm, the Capital City.","The roars of countless monsters covered the sky and the sun, obscuring everything.","At the same time, in the Capital City, everyone was nervous as they walked to their respective jobs.","After countless expansions, the Capital City could accommodate billions of people living in it at the same time. However, there were now tens of billions of people living at the same time.","As the other base cities were conquered, the refugees from there flooded into the Capital City.","The beams of laser weapons were flashing crazily in the sky.","Countless flying monsters swooped down, covering the sky and the sun.","There was no need to aim at the towering laser towers. A single sweep of the laser towers was enough to send out a large number of laser beams.","The corpses of the monsters that had been wiped out fell down and were quickly shattered by the barrier.","Countless monsters fell like dumplings. At the same time, blood poured down like a torrential rain.","At the same time, in the sky, many powerful Federation experts were doing their best to resist the endless number of monsters.","Compared to hundreds of years ago, the Federation’s strength had undergone earth-shattering changes.","Hundreds of years ago, under the leadership of Almighty Chu, the humans defeated the monsters and the marine folks, which had been troubling the humans for a long time, and took control of all the known areas of the Kunlun Realm.","With the supply of endless resources, the Federation had undergone earth-shattering changes in both technology and martial arts. It could be said that it was an era of explosive development.","In the past, Divines were unimaginable big shots, and the Core Stage was a level that only a few legendary existences could reach.","However, now, even the lowest level of graduates from Federal University were Divines.","Every student was a big shot.","Each generation was stronger than the previous. This was the core concept of the Federation.","They weren’t looking to retrograde in strength!","Because the Federation did not have any foundation, every step they took was creating history!","Cores were not as rare as they were two or three hundred years ago. There were many Cores within the Federation.","In fact, they could no longer be considered true experts.","Thanks to the cultivation method left behind by Almighty Chu, the cultivation system of the Federation had been greatly improved. Now, if one wanted to be an expert, they had to be at least in the Void Core Stage.","This was an unprecedented era.","Everyone believed that if the Federation was given hundreds of years, it was even possible for the Federation to touch the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage, which were only mentioned in the cultivation system left behind by Almighty Chu.","However, no one expected that just as the Federation was rising like the rising sun, an accident happened.","A terrifying force swept over from the depths of the Kunlun Realm.","In a place that humans had never stepped foot in, a place that they had never known about, an endless army of exotic beasts suddenly appeared.","One base city after another was conquered. This war lasted for ten years, and in just ten years, human civilization was on the brink of extinction.","This made the Federation realize that there was a powerful civilization behind the endless monster army. It was not a pure tribal alliance like the monsters and the marine folks.","Instead, it was a civilization that could truly rival the Federation, or even be stronger than the Federation.","A colossal creature!","And the monsters were actually just pawns of this civilization.","After the monsters were eliminated, it finally attracted the attention of this behemoth.","Such a discovery was a slap in the face to mankind. It made the Federation, who thought that they were the leader of the Kunlun Realm, extremely embarrassed.","At the same time, the entire Federation was forced to retreat, and even their civilization was about to be destroyed.","Countless refugees sat by the roadside, staring blankly at the crazy massacre above the city. No one knew when this massacre would stop.","What everyone knew was that once they stopped, the Capital City would be conquered.","The Federation had never encountered such a huge crisis before.","“I wonder how the passageway between the two worlds is doing. If the passageway between the two worlds is broken, then we’ll really have no place to go!”","“If the passageway between the two worlds is breached, Earth will probably be invaded by this monster civilization. We humans will be finished!”","“I heard that the government has a plan to completely close the passageway between the two worlds to at least protect the humans on Earth. Otherwise, all of mankind will be finished!”","All kinds of rumors continued to spread, and a sense of despair flowed in everyone’s hearts.","At this moment, two figures appeared in a corner of the Capital City without anyone noticing.","“This is the Capital City?” Chu Yunfan raised his head and saw that there were endless flying monsters coming toward him.","Endless murderous intent and evil aura pervaded the entire Capital City.","“It seems so. They must have encountered big trouble!” Tang Siyu said."]},{"number":2445,"title":"Chapter 2445: I’m Your Uncle","paragraphs":["Chapter 2445: I’m Your Uncle","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The sky was covered with flying monsters, and the dark mass covered the sky. Only when the laser beams occasionally swept past could a trace of sunlight be seen.","However, it was soon covered again!","Countless flying monsters were destroyed at every moment, but they quickly filled the world again.","The pedestrians on the road were not too afraid. After all, this was the Capital City. These monsters had been besieging them for more than a day or two, but in the end, they could not defeat them.","Chu Yunfan looked at the laser towers and suddenly became interested. He had left less than 300 years ago, but the Federation had already developed to this extent.","The energy source of these laser towers was actually the spirit energy in the void!","To be able to absorb the energy in space was a very shocking level of technological development.","It could be said that to a certain extent, the use of spirit energy in the path of technology had gradually caught up with the path of cultivation.","Drawing energy from space was something that only existed in science fiction in the past, but it had been done now.","One could imagine how amazing the progress of the Federation was during this period of time.","Although it was still not worth mentioning compared to the Central Plains, the gap in strength would only grow larger as one progressed.","Any King would be able to destroy the Federation without any difficulty.","However, this kind of progress still made Chu Yunfan gasp in amazement. In comparison, although Grand Xia had dozens of Kings in the past hundreds of years, it was actually accumulated over countless years. Moreover, it also had the benefits brought about by the explosion of resources after expanding its territory.","In reality, the progress of the country’s strength was far inferior to that of the Federation.","If the Federation was given the same amount of time to develop, its strength would probably far surpass Grand Xia. This was the difference in their systems.","The development model of Grand Xia was that even if they developed any secret techniques, they would be kept by each family. However, the Federation could announce them to the public and continuously accumulate and improve them.","Although not everyone could learn the best divine arts, martial arts, and science and technology, it was still much better than Grand Xia.","Many of Chu Yunfan’s ideas had already been set in stone during the era of the Federation. This was the reason why he did not hide his teachings many times.","The entire human race benefited a lot because of him!","This was the difference in structure and thinking!","“It’s only been two hundred years. It feels like a lifetime ago!” Tang Siyu said. “I didn’t feel anything when I was in the Central Plains. I’ve been in seclusion for decades, and there hasn’t been much change. However, the Federation hasn’t been out for decades. It’s probably been eliminated by the times!”","“This is our hometown!” Chu Yunfan sighed. No matter how long he stayed in the Central Plains, that feeling was irreplaceable.","“But now, the Federation is obviously in big trouble!” Chu Yunfan said.","Tang Siyu nodded. The Capital City had been surrounded. One could imagine how critical the situation of the Federation was.","After all, before they left, the Capital City was not the front line.","Now that the Capital City was under siege, there was only one possibility—the frontline had collapsed.","However, the two of them didn’t take it to heart. With their current cultivation levels, let alone the collapse of the Federation, they could even save the entire Central Plains with their strength.","There was nothing to be afraid of!","“Let’s check out the situation first!” Chu Yunfan said.","A moment later, the two of them disappeared from where they were.","In a manor on the outskirts of the Capital City, a little girl about four or five years old was playing by herself. She was dancing and occasionally breaking the sound barrier, revealing that this little girl was not an ordinary person.","Although she was only four or five years old, an ordinary person would probably be killed with one punch.","Suddenly, the void fluctuated, and a figure appeared in front of the little girl.","“Who are you?” The little girl was instantly alerted. She looked at the man and shouted clearly, “Who are you?”","The person who came was about twenty years old and looked extremely young. It was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at the little girl and suddenly couldn’t help but laugh. This little girl looked young, but her mouth was very clean. This was very difficult.","“What’s your name?” Chu Yunfan looked at the little girl and asked.","“Mom said not to tell strangers my name!” The little girl quickly shook her head. “You want to lie to me? I’m not a three-year-old child anymore!”","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but laugh out loud. Although this little girl was young, her thoughts were already very clear and logical.","“Then what’s your mother’s name?” Chu Yunfan said.","“I won’t tell you!” the little girl widened her round eyes and said in a childish voice.","“Even if you don’t tell me, I know. Is your mother called Chu Qingxuan?” Chu Yunfan said.","“How did you know?” The little girl opened her mouth in disbelief.","“Of course I know, because I’m your uncle!” Chu Yunfan smiled at the little girl.","“Uncle? Why haven’t I heard my mother mention you before?” The little girl obviously didn’t believe him.","“That’s because I went on a long trip a few years ago. Now that I’m back, if not for that, how could I have entered this place and even know your mother’s name?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","This manor looked nothing on the outside, but it was actually loose on the outside and tight on the inside. All kinds of hidden experts were gathered here. It was almost impossible for outsiders to sneak in here.","Of course, for Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, it was nothing. Even if he walked in openly, he had a way to make it impossible for the masters in the manor to notice.","The little girl’s expression suddenly became conflicted. Although the little girl was very intelligent, she was still a child. She could not understand slightly more complicated logic.","Chu Yunfan’s words confused her.","“I... I don’t know. I’ll call Mom to confirm!” The little girl’s eyes lit up as she thought of something. She skillfully opened her personal terminal and a beautiful woman’s portrait appeared on the virtual screen in front of her.","“Why can’t I hear Mom?” The little girl did not understand why there was no signal.","“Because some clowns are here!” Chu Yunfan frowned and his expression turned cold.","As soon as he finished speaking, the sound of fighting and killing came from outside. There was the sound of anxious firearms, and there was a powerful expert’s aura entangled in the air.","However, the invaders were very powerful. The powerful defense system in the manor was actually defeated in a short period of time.","In a short while, the invaders were in front of Chu Yunfan and the little girl."]},{"number":2446,"title":"Chapter 2446: The First Female President of the Federation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2446: The First Female President of the Federation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A group of people in blood-red robes rushed in front of Chu Yunfan and the little girl.","Each of these people carried an extremely dense smell of blood, and there was even a faint hint of demonic energy.","Humans with demonic aura?","This reminded Chu Yunfan of the Monster Cult that he had once pacified.","The aura of these people was extremely similar. They were all humans. They had cultivated the cultivation techniques improved by the demons or had been modified by the demons, becoming half-human and half-demon existences.","The leader of the group was a man wearing a blood-red robe. He looked a little evil as he strode out.","“Zheng Duoduo!” The evil man looked at the little girl next to Chu Yunfan and smiled. He revealed his sharp teeth and looked very strange.","“Really, I don’t think I can stand things like you even after all these years!” Chu Yunfan stepped forward and stood in front of the little girl, Zheng Duoduo.","“Who are you?” The evil man looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Really, another guy who doesn’t know life and death! Go, tear him apart!”","As soon as the evil-looking man finished speaking, the men in blood-red robes behind him roared and charged at Chu Yunfan like wild beasts.","However, before they could rush in front of Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan only glanced at them, and their bodies were immediately set ablaze. They were burned to ashes in a second.","“Kneel!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and all the invaders slammed into the ground on their knees.","The terrifying sound of bones breaking rang out as these people screamed in pain. Their legs were broken.","When the evil-looking man screamed, he was no longer as arrogant as before. When he looked at Chu Yunfan again, his eyes were filled with fear.","“How is this possible? I’m an Abstract! An Abstract!”","The evil-looking man couldn’t imagine that he would immediately kneel and break his legs just because of a single sentence from this young man.","This person did not seem to be a threat at all, but he had a terrifying aura at that moment.","He was already an Abstract, and he could even escape unscathed when facing the few top-notch experts of the human upper echelons. He was one of the few top-notch experts in the world, so how could he be completely defeated by a single shout from the other party?","“An Abstract?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He turned around and patted Zheng Duoduo’s little head. “Wait here. I’ll be right back!” he said.","Zheng Duoduo opened her eyes wide. This time, she did not refuse.","Chu Yunfan walked up to the evil man and reached out a hand to touch his head. All kinds of memories flooded Chu Yunfan.","This was a method to search through memories. Chu Yunfan would not use it normally, because once it was used, the person would definitely die.","Their entire brain would be turned into a mess!","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this evil man.","After reading all the memories, Chu Yunfan immediately knew the cause and effect of these things.","Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, these people were from the Monster Cult.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had pacified the chaos of the Monster Cult, and the entire upper echelons of the Monster Cult had been massacred.","However, there were still some members who survived. Of course, under the attack of the Federation, they were like stray dogs.","However, this organization had survived tenaciously. A few years ago, when this organization was about to be uprooted, it received the support of that mysterious force in the outer realm and revived.","Especially in the past few years, when the extraterrestrial forces attacked the Federation, many of the cities that fell had a lot to do with these resurrected Monster Cults.","It was them who acted as spies and caused the originally heavily guarded city to fall.","He also saw the development of the Federation over the years. Even Chu Yunfan could not help but sigh at the rapid development of the Federation.","However, when he saw that the Monster Cult was still using the same old methods to plunder the population in the city, reforming and brainwashing them, Chu Yunfan could not help but feel a little angry.","The Federation was too big and had too many people. Even if they continuously recruited police officers, it was impossible for them to control everyone.","Moreover, the Monster Cult had already begun to infiltrate the upper echelons of the Federation.","There was only one reason why these people would attack this heavily guarded manor, and that was for Chu Yunfan’s niece, Zheng Duoduo.","Zheng Duoduo was the daughter of Chu Yunfan’s younger sister, Chu Qingxuan, and Zheng Xinglong, a newly promoted general of the Federation. She was also the only daughter.","The reason why Zheng Duoduo had attracted their attention wasn’t just because her father, Zheng Xinglong, was the most dazzling general in the Federation and could be promoted to a marshal at any time.","More importantly, her mother, Chu Yunfan’s sister, Chu Qingxuan, was the current president of the Federation.","At the same time, Chu Qingxuan was also the first female president of the Federation.","When Chu Yunfan learned this news, he was in complete disbelief.","In his impression, Chu Qingxuan was still the weak girl sitting in a wheelchair.","However, in the memory of this evil man, Chu Yunfan saw a completely different side. She was the first female president in the history of the Federation.","At the same time, she was also recognized as the strongest person in the Federation. Not long after Chu Yunfan left, Chu Qingxuan graduated from Federation University and joined the army of the Federation. She began to fight for the Federation.","In just two hundred years, she had already made countless contributions to the Federation and suppressed countless rebellions.","She was known as the Valkyrie of the Federation.","Later, she chose to retire and enter politics. In a very short period of time, she became a high-ranking member of the Federation. In the last election, she became the first female president of the Federation.","The high-spirited Valkyrie in the evil man’s memory was a huge contrast to Chu Yunfan’s younger sister.","“I didn’t expect so many things to happen after all these years. My sister has actually become the president of the Federation!”","Chu Yunfan found it unbelievable. Although he had always thought that his sister was extremely talented and was not inferior to any man, he did not expect his sister to do such a big thing. It could be said that her name would definitely go down in history.","These people from the Monster Cult had learned from a high-ranking traitor in the Federal Government that Zheng Duoduo lived in a manor in the suburbs. Hence, they had organized a military raid here, wanting to abduct Zheng Duoduo and use it as a bargaining chip to threaten Chu Qingxuan to surrender.","However, they did not expect their luck to be so bad. They encountered Chu Yunfan, who had just returned, and were wiped out."]},{"number":2447,"title":"Chapter 2447: Almighty Chu’s Inheritances Are Truly Extraordinary","paragraphs":["Chapter 2447: Almighty Chu’s Inheritances Are Truly Extraordinary","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After checking these memories, Chu Yunfan could not help but sigh. Over the years, his sister had really done a great job.","She even became the first female president of the Federation.","She had created history!","If they hadn’t encountered that invincible force, it would have been enough to bring the Federation to a new peak.","Chu Yunfan had already figured out what these people from the Monster Cult were planning to do.","The Capital City was the last fortress of the Federation in the Kunlun Realm. Once it was breached, the entire human race would retreat to the passageway between the two worlds. They might even have to use the newly developed space bomb to blow up the passageway between the two worlds. At the very least, they had to ensure the living space of the humans on Earth.","Some of the traitors in the Monster Cult and the Federation had already gathered to launch the final attack and break through the last fortress of the Federation in the Kunlun Realm.","“Humph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly, and the kneeling members of the Monster Cult instantly turned into ashes.","In front of Chu Yunfan, who was already in the half-Emperor Stage, they had no strength to fight back.","“Alright, Duoduo, I’ll take you to find Daddy and Mommy, okay?” Chu Yunfan pulled Zheng Duoduo and said.","Zheng Duoduo tilted her little head and looked at Chu Yunfan. She thought about it seriously and said, “Alright, I don’t think you’re a bad person!”","Children’s minds were the most sensitive. Perhaps many of her thoughts were not mature and her thinking was very childish, but it was easier for them to distinguish who was kind and who was evil.","She could naturally sense that Chu Yunfan had no ill intentions. There was a very pure and natural aura on Chu Yunfan’s body.","The atmosphere in the presidential palace was extremely tense.","Chu Qingxuan was dressed in a regal outfit. She frowned slightly and stared at the important officials in front of her.","Compared to 200 years ago, time had not left any traces on her face, but her entire temperament had changed drastically.","She had been the president of the Federation for so many years and was the first female president in history. One could imagine how much pressure she had faced, but none of that had been able to defeat her.","She knew that in the past, she could rely on her brother. Later on, her brother left home to pursue the path of life. At that time, she had to carry this family.","She was no longer as weak as she had been in the past.","“So, you want to rebel!” Chu Qingxuan looked at these important officials in front of her and felt indignant. This was because many of them had been promoted by her.","As for the rest, although they were not her trusted aides, they were more or less related to her.","These people’s hearts couldn’t help but thump in panic at the sight of Chu Qingxuan’s authority over the years.","However, a middle-aged man in a blood-red robe appeared among the high-ranking officials.","The middle-aged man slowly walked over, but each step was extremely heavy, stepping on everyone’s hearts.","“Remnants of the Monster Cult!”","Chu Qingxuan knew very well who this person was. It was the Monster Cult that she had been suppressing all these years.","Originally, it had been suppressed to the point where it vanished into thin air. However, over the years, with the intervention of that mysterious force, many human cities had been breached. This force that had been suppressed to the point of extinction had grown crazily like bamboo shoots after a rain.","Until now, they could actually appear in the presidential palace openly and instigate so many of her trusted aides to defect.","“Remnants? Hahahaha, President Chu, do you still think that we’re just remnants of evil?” the middle-aged man said slowly. “I am the current leader of the Monster Cult, Fang Buqi. Greetings, President Chu. I’ve heard a lot about you!”","“It really is you!” Chu Qingxuan stared at the middle-aged man intently. It was the Monster Cult leader she had been searching for for many years to kill, Fang Buqi. “I didn’t expect that you would really get reinforcements that gave you a chance to turn the tables!”","“Hahahaha, President Chu, things in the world are very unpredictable. One moment, you might be a high and mighty figure, but the next moment, you might be reduced to a prisoner!” Fang Buqi burst out laughing, his voice filled with the pride of a victor. “Now that the situation is over, even if you give the order to surrender, no one will think that you did not do well enough. You have already done your best!”","A mocking smile appeared on Chu Qingxuan’s face. Did she need to be acknowledged by her mortal enemy?","“Do you think I’m as weak as you and will surrender to the alien races? My brother uprooted your Monster Cult, do you think our Chu clan will kneel and surrender to the Monster Cult?” Chu Qingxuan sneered. “Moreover, you’re too confident. You’re so confident that you dare to appear in front of me. Do you really think I can’t kill you?”","Chu Qingxuan sneered, and a terrifying aura enveloped the entire place.","“You want to force me to surrender by collecting some trash? Fang Buqi, you’re really too naive!” Chu Qingxuan thundered.","Everyone present felt the terrifying aura from Chu Qingxuan, and many people finally remembered that the woman in front of them was now the number one master in the entire the Kunlun Realm.","It was rumored that she had the cultivation inheritance left behind by Almighty Chu, which far surpassed the mainstream inheritance of the Kunlun Realm.","She was almost invincible among her peers and was often compared to her brother, who had already become a legend.","In fact, many people felt that even if the mighty Almighty Chu returned, he might not be a match for Chu Qingxuan.","She had once suppressed the rebellion of the demons and the marine folks single-handedly and established the supreme prestige of the Federation.","It was only after she became president all these years that the number of times she made a move became less and less. That was why many people had almost forgotten how terrifying she was.","“It just so happens that you rats have jumped out. I can see you catch them all in one fell swoop!” Chu Qingxuan said coldly. At the same time, a huge creature flew into the presidential palace.","When everyone saw this behemoth, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air.","They were all too familiar with this behemoth.","It was the divine beast that had once accompanied Almighty Chu on his conquests, the Thunder Winged Beast.","Over the years, relying on this divine beast, the Chu clan had also gone through many ups and downs.","In fact, they had relied on the Thunder Winged Beast to resolve many crises.","There were even rumors that this Thunder Winged Beast was even stronger than Chu Qingxuan. It was the divine beast of the Federation.","Especially since many of them were Chu Qingxuan’s trusted aides, they had seen the scene of this divine beast tearing apart the enemies of the Federation.","But now, it was their turn.","“Are these all inheritances left behind by Almighty Chu? It’s indeed extraordinary!” Fang Buqi said as he endured the terrifying pressure. “But there’s one thing that I think you will be particularly interested in, President Chu!”"]},{"number":2448,"title":"Chapter 2448: Chu Yunfan Appears, Dumbfounded Everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2448: Chu Yunfan Appears, Dumbfounded Everyone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What is it?” Chu Qingxuan frowned.","Although there were many people opposite her, she did not take it to heart.","This was not the AD era where the president was a weak scholar and needed heavy protection. Once they got too close to someone, it would be over.","In this era, even if the president was not the number one expert of the Federation, they were still one of the few experts.","Just like the Earth era, during the Han Dynasty in ancient China, only those who had rendered meritorious service could be conferred the title of marquis, and only those who were not marquises could not become prime ministers.","In the Federation, it was impossible for a non-top expert to become the Federation President.","This was also the inevitable choice of almost all forces that stepped onto the path of cultivation.","Therefore, even though she was surrounded, she did not show any fear.","“I heard that you and General Zheng have a daughter named Zheng Duoduo!” Fang Buqi grinned, his smile filled with malevolence.","“You dare?!” Chu Qingxuan was instantly enraged. She was not afraid of these traitors at all.","However, Fang Buqi was not afraid at all. There was even a hint of fanaticism on his face. Appearing for the monsters was a supreme honor to him.","Because he had been brainwashed since he was young, it was deeply ingrained. To him, sacrifice was nothing but honor.","Chu Qingxuan had completely understood that the place where she had settled her daughter had been exposed. As for how it was exposed, there was no doubt that it was directly related to those traitors.","“Why wouldn’t we dare? Calculating the time, we should have succeeded by now. I advise you not to act rashly, President Chu,” Fang Buqi said with a faint smile. “If we die, your daughter will die too! What a cute little girl, but now she has to be buried with us. Do you think it’s appropriate?”","“Are you threatening me?” Chu Qingxuan said coldly.","“That’s right, I am threatening you. You can see it that way too!” Fang Buqi said. “Our request is actually very simple. President Chu, you can set an example and take the lead so that you can avoid being killed. Wouldn’t that be good?”","“Avoid being killed?” Chu Qingxuan sneered. “Do you think I’m an ignorant woman? In the cities that you have conquered, apart from the remnants of the demons like you, which of the remaining people have not been killed and become food for the monsters?”","“That’s what they deserve for obstructing the Heavenly Army,” Fang Buqi said indifferently. “But I don’t think you are so pedantic, President Chu. I’ve already gotten permission. As long as you are willing to surrender, I won’t slaughter the entire Capital City. You can rest assured about this!”","“Then I will become your slave and be used by you?” Chu Qingxuan said indifferently.","She was all too familiar with this routine. In the AD era on Earth, this was how the barbarian armies treated civilized countries. Those who disobeyed were killed, and those who obeyed became slaves.","Of course, these foreign races were far more powerful than the barbarians of the AD era. The entire human race would probably be raised in captivity and become their nutrients.","“This is inevitable. The losing side should also bear it!” Fang Buqi said with a smile. “When Chu Yunfan defeated the demons and the marine folks, the humans was in high spirits and treated them as something important, didn’t they?”","Chu Qingxuan glared at Fang Buqi and said, “You dare to mention my brother’s name? How dare you! I failed to exterminate you back then. This is my biggest mistake since I took office. Otherwise, how could I allow you to be so arrogant?”","“President Chu, I didn’t come here today with the intention of returning empty-handed. Not only do we already know the location of your daughter, but we also know the location of your other family members. For the sake of the Federation, why should you sacrifice your own family members?” Fang Buqi continued. “I’ve already obtained my master’s permission. As long as you surrender, I can make you king. I can let you choose a part of the humans to be your tribe and become the king of that tribe. This is the highest honor!” Fang Buqi said with envy in his eyes. This was the kind of treatment he had dreamed of, but he knew that it was impossible.","Chu Qingxuan was an opponent, and a powerful opponent at that. Only then could she gain the attention of her masters. However, he was just a slave, a dog. If he wanted to be conferred the title of king, he would undoubtedly be crazy.","If it was an ordinary person, they would have long been resentful, but he would not.","He had been brainwashed since he was young. For the great cause of the Monster Cult, he was even willing to sacrifice himself.","This feeling only lasted for a moment.","“Dream on!”","Suddenly, just as Fang Buqi finished speaking, a cold shout came from the void. Then, space was torn apart, and two figures, one big and one small, appeared in the presidential palace.","Everyone looked at the little princess, Zheng Duoduo, who was the first daughter of the entire Federation.","The man looked to be in his twenties and looked extremely familiar.","“Brother!” Chu Qingxuan shouted in surprise. Although she hadn’t seen him for hundreds of years, she still recognized him immediately.","There was no mistake about that figure. It was her brother, whom she often thought of.","Especially now, when the Federation was in a precarious situation, she would often miss her brother. If it was her brother, the Federation would definitely not have ended up like this.","She even felt a little guilty. The Federation had reached its peak under Chu Yunfan’s hands, but when it was her turn to take over, there was bad news everywhere.","The Federation’s territory in the Kunlun Realm was completely lost, leaving only the Capital City.","She had failed to protect the Federation that her brother had left behind.","As Chu Qingxuan called out “Brother,” everyone instantly remembered who this familiar face was.","Wasn’t he the legendary Almighty Chu of the Federation?","Many of them had grown up listening to Chu Yunfan’s legend.","Although Chu Yunfan had been gone for hundreds of years, there were many legends about him.","In particular, all kinds of movies, dramas, novels, and so on about Chu Yunfan in the Federation would often cause a lot of craze as long as they were filmed.","The Federation was willing to use Chu Yunfan as a role model. Over the years, their understanding of Chu Yunfan was definitely not shallow.","However, no one expected Chu Yunfan, who was said to have broken through the void and left the Kunlun Realm, to return at this critical moment.","This was like a miracle.","Especially those higher-ups who had already betrayed the humans.","They remembered how decisive Chu Yunfan was in the past and how he had cleaned up the traitors in the Federation. He killed every single one of them without any scruples and did not care about the complicated relationship behind them.","In the eyes of the commoners of the Federation, Chu Yunfan was Almighty Chu.","However, in the eyes of some people, Chu Yunfan was an a killing god."]},{"number":2449,"title":"Chapter 2449: Reckless Death!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2449: Reckless Death!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people still remembered how Chu Yunfan had cleaned up the traitors and spies in the Federation.","They were also very clear about how those forces that were reluctant to get close to the Federation and even repeatedly opposed the Federation were uprooted one by one.","In fact, museums of Chu Yunfan were located all over the Federation.","It was because they knew too much that they knew how terrifying he was!","Chu Yunfan looked at the traitors of the upper echelons of the Federation and sighed in his heart.","However, before he left, he had ruthlessly purged them. Now, in less than 200 years, another batch had climbed to the top of the Federation.","One could imagine how helpless Chu Yunfan was.","To be more precise, these people might not have been traitors in the first place, but as time passed, the Federation was almost on the verge of destruction.","Many people who wouldn’t betray had betrayed them in exchange for their own survival.","In the blink of an eye, a mountain-like figure transformed into the size of an ordinary lion and pounced on Chu Yunfan.","It was the Thunder Winged Beast.","When it saw Chu Yunfan, it was so happy that it almost went crazy.","Chu Yunfan smiled as he stroked the Thunder Winged Beast. It had indeed been a long time since he last saw the Thunder Winged Beast.","He also felt a little guilty. Ever since he chose to keep the Thunder Winged Beast, it had been hundreds of years since he last saw it.","Chu Qingxuan cried tears of joy.","She did not expect her brother to return at this time, when she felt that there was no hope for her at all.","In her heart, her brother would always be the person she could rely on for the rest of her life.","Even though she was a mother, she still felt the same in her heart.","“Silly girl!” Chu Yunfan patted Chu Qingxuan’s head, just like he did in the past.","It was just that times had changed and things were already different.","The little girl who needed his protection back then had now grown into a giant of the Federation.","“We’ll catch up later. Take care of Duoduo first. I’ll take care of these people!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Chu Qingxuan quickly pulled Zheng Duoduo into her arms.","Zheng Duoduo felt much safer in her mother’s arms.","“Mom, is he really my uncle?” Zheng Duoduo asked softly.","“That’s indeed your eldest uncle that Mom has been telling you about!” Chu Qingxuan patted Zheng Duoduo’s little head, feeling a little flustered.","Earlier, when Fang Buqi used Zheng Duoduo to threaten her, she almost lost her composure.","To her, Zheng Duoduo was now her bottom line and her only weakness.","It was precisely because of this that Fang Buqi and the others went to capture Zheng Duoduo to threaten Chu Qingxuan.","However, they had miscalculated. They did not expect to meet Chu Yunfan, who had just returned.","They had hit the muzzle of a gun.","However, at this moment, she was extremely glad that she had met Chu Yunfan. If they really succeeded, even she did not know what to do.","But now, she didn’t have to worry and choose.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s gaze and attention, the higher-ups were stunned.","Instantly, the hair on their backs stood up.","“So it’s Almighty Chu. I’ve heard a lot about you. Nice to meet you!” Fang Buqi forced an awkward smile and said.","He only treated Chu Yunfan as a legendary figure. When Chu Yunfan was famous, he was just a small figure, an existence like an ant.","However, he did not expect to see Chu Yunfan in person today.","“I didn’t expect to see you here today, Almighty Chu. Even my master admires your might. If you can help me persuade President Chu to surrender, you won’t lose your noble position!” Fang Buqi said.","The others were so frightened by Chu Yunfan that they didn’t even dare to speak, but Fang Buqi didn’t think there was anything he didn’t dare to say.","There was a huge being behind him. He had seen his master fight before. Even the legendary Almighty Chu, who had improved by leaps and bounds in hundreds of years, was no match for his master. He was naturally confident.","“Persuade my sister to surrender? Who do you think you are?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. Even in the Central Plains, he was a supreme figure, not to mention in the Federation.","“Even your so-called master is nothing but an ant in my eyes, let alone you? You want us to surrender? Who do you think you are?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Fang Buqi’s expression was extremely ugly. He said, “You can look down on me, Almighty Chu, but you can’t look down on my great master. He is a living god, the invincible God of Creation. You don’t understand the power of my great master!”","Fang Buqi’s expression turned ferocious when he mentioned his master.","“A living god? What kind of thing dares to call himself a god? Even I don’t dare to call myself that. Who does he think he is?” Chu Yunfan snorted and waved his hand.","Fang Buqi felt his core explode. The power that he had cultivated for hundreds of years had completely exploded.","“You... you’re not a good person. You... You broke my cultivation?” The intense pain caused Fang Buqi’s entire body to tremble, and his entire face was twisted in pain.","What he did not expect was that with his cultivation, he could not even block a wave of Chu Yunfan’s hand.","Although he admitted that his cultivation was slightly weaker than Chu Qingxuan’s, he shouldn’t have been crippled by a single blow.","“I’ll let you live first. I’ll let you see how your so-called master perishes!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Chu Yunfan had crippled Fang Buqi’s martial arts with one strike, and even caused the high-level traitors of the Federation to lose their souls.","Now, with Chu Yunfan’s return, the situation had been completely reversed. If they fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands, the outcome would be worse than death.","“Almighty Chu, we were just muddle-headed!”","“Almighty Chu, you are wise. We were forced into this. It was Fang Buqi who forced us!”","“Almighty Chu, please spare my life!”","The group of traitors knelt down and cried bitterly.","“You’re only regretting now? You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Suddenly, at this moment, a terrifying aura pressed down from the void.","Everyone looked up.","Above the Capital City, a huge hand covered the sky and came crashing down on the Capital City.","Wherever it passed, the flying monsters exploded in the air.","Boom!","The giant hand smashed on the barrier above the Capital City. In just a moment, the barrier above the Capital City was shattered, turning into a rain of light that filled the sky and dissipated in the air."]},{"number":2450,"title":"Chapter 2450: The Mastermind Behind the Scenes, a King Monster","paragraphs":["Chapter 2450: The Mastermind Behind the Scenes, a King Monster","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The huge hand came over and crushed the defensive barrier above the Capital City.","It was just a moment!","The earth shook and the mountains shook!","The terrifying attack covered the sky and the earth, shaking the entire world. It was as if there was a strong earthquake in the Capital City.","This had never happened before!","The Capital City was built with the current technology of mankind. In order to prevent the underground from being penetrated by monsters, it was made of special alloy.","Even if there was an earthquake of magnitude 8, it would be difficult for the Capital City to shake at all. Only if it exceeded magnitude 10 would there be any shaking.","However, it only shook slightly.","The power of this attack was equivalent to a magnitude 10 earthquake!","Everyone stopped in their tracks and looked at the sky, especially since many of them were still on their way to work.","Although the war was raging outside, people still had to go to work. Life had to continue.","Now, everyone was finally panicking.","In the sky, more flying monsters swooped down.","It was as if a cloud that covered the sky and earth swept over.","At the same time, waves of aura rose into the sky. The entire Federation had been practicing martial arts for the past few years. There were also many experts among the people. Naturally, they were not people who would sit and wait for death.","At the first moment, countless people launched their own counterattack.","Shocking sword lights, saber lights, and arrows formed from energy swept across the sky.","The first wave of flying monsters that rushed up were all hit, directly turning into a bloody rain that filled the sky and fell.","Everyone’s faces revealed a look of despair.","The barrier of Capital City had been broken, which meant that they had nowhere to retreat.","Now that there was no barrier to stop these flying monsters from charging in, they could only fight a bloody battle.","Large scale battles were happening everywhere!","“Hahahaha, my great master has made his move. None of you can escape. All of you are going to die!”","When Fang Buqi saw this scene, he laughed out loud, his expression extremely ferocious.","“Brother, what should we do?” Chu Qingxuan instinctively looked at Chu Yunfan.","Normally, she would have reacted immediately, but now that her brother was back, the stabilizing pillar in her heart had returned. She was back to her teenage years.","“It’s fine. It’s just some trash!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","All of a sudden, a large hand grabbed out from the Capital City, and the endless number of flying monsters that filled the sky were all caught by this large hand.","A patch of blue appeared in the sky.","The citizens of the Capital City who were preparing to fight for their lives were all stunned. They looked at the sky in a daze, not knowing what was going on.","“How is this possible? That’s impossible!” Fang Buqi was in a daze. He couldn’t believe what he was seeing. He didn’t know what was going on.","In his opinion, there was nothing Chu Yunfan could do after the barrier of Capital City was broken.","This had already been verified in all the cities before. Once the barrier was broken, endless monsters would attack from the sky, the ground, and underground at the same time.","No matter how much the Capital City resisted, it would completely fall in a few days and become a desolate wasteland.","But now, all the flying monsters had been destroyed. It was obvious that there was a top-notch expert hiding in the Capital City.","Killing all the flying monsters with one hand was something that even Chu Qingxuan, the current number one expert of the Federation, could not do.","“There are such experts in the Federation?” Chu Qingxuan was dumbfounded. She couldn’t believe it.","She did not know that there was such an existence in the Federation.","Logically speaking, if the Federation still had such an expert, they would not have been defeated until now.","If she had discovered such an expert earlier, she would rather abdicate and let this person become the president of the Federation.","After all, the Federation was not Grand Xia. Before Grand Xia was established, it had a long history. It had experienced ancient times, medieval times, and modern times. It had also experienced countless wars, and there were countless experts who had declined and hidden.","However, the rise of the Federation had only been a few hundred years. From scratch, it was obvious what kind of experts there were. It was impossible to hide them.","Not to mention that this expert’s strength would be so high. It was simply impossible.","“That was your sister-in-law!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","The moment that big hand appeared, he already knew who it was.","It was Tang Siyu.","Previously, Tang Siyu had separated from him and gone to look for their own families.","At this time, there was no one else who would make a move and have such strength other than Tang Siyu.","“My sister-in-law?” Chu Qingxuan was stunned for a moment, but she immediately remembered who Chu Yunfan was talking about. She was surprised and happy.","“Sister-in-law is so strong. This strength...”","Chu Qingxuan was slightly amazed. She had been the number one expert of the Federation for so many years, but this was the first time she felt that she was too far away from Tang Siyu.","“Yes, it’s not a problem to deal with those b*stards!” Chu Yunfan said.","At this moment, a huge head appeared above the Capital City.","Just this head alone was like an incomparably huge mountain peak.","“Lowly ant-like humans, you have rejected my gift. Now, let me crush you!”","The enormous head opened its mouth and spat out terrifying flames.","Wherever it passed, the entire sky was set ablaze.","The terrifying flames caused the temperature of the entire Capital City to rise significantly.","“Is this the mastermind behind the rise of the monsters?” Chu Yunfan looked at the huge head with a ferocious expression.","“No wonder the Federation was on the verge of extinction in such a short period of time!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","This incomparably huge monster was actually a King monster. However, the aura on its body was very ancient. It was obvious that it had been sleeping for an unknown number of years and had awakened a few years ago.","With the strength of a King, it was indeed enough to sweep through the entire Federation.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised that such a King monster had appeared in the Kunlun Realm. The Kunlun Realm had once had a glorious martial arts civilization.","Even though the Federation continued to expand, it only occupied a part of the Kunlun Realm. There were still many unknown places.","In that vast and unknown place, it was very normal for there to be a few monsters that had fallen asleep from ancient times.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan made his move. He grabbed out with his big hand, and the flames that filled the sky were instantly turned into nothingness.","In an instant, there was a deathly silence!"]},{"number":2451,"title":"Chapter 2451: Almighty Chu Reappears, They Are Saved","paragraphs":["Chapter 2451: Almighty Chu Reappears, They Are Saved","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That ball of terrifying flames that seemed to be able to destroy the world was destroyed by Chu Yunfan just like that.","Chu Qingxuan looked at her brother in shock.","Because of the destructive aura contained in that terrifying flame, even a top-notch expert like her could feel the trembling aura.","The former president had single-handedly killed the mastermind behind the scenes. In the end, his whereabouts were still unknown. He must have fallen.","Thinking of this, the sorrow in her heart could not help but surge into her brows.","However, thinking about it, if even her sister-in-law was already so powerful, it seemed normal for her brother to be stronger. In her impression, her brother had always been much stronger than her sister-in-law.","“Who is it?” The powerful King monster lowered its head and stared at Chu Yunfan.","His gaze was as sharp as a knife. It broke through the layers of enchantments in the presidential palace and immediately saw Chu Yunfan, who was dressed in black and standing with his hands behind his back.","“Someone who wants to kill you!”","Chu Yunfan flew up into the sky and confronted the huge beast.","Two bolts of lightning shot out from the eyes of this huge beast. They were like two terrifying sword lights that slashed directly at Chu Yunfan.","However, these two terrifying lightning bolts were unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. They collided with Chu Yunfan’s indestructible body in the air and disappeared without a trace.","As for the huge beast, its huge claw fell down fiercely like a long sword.","This grab actually contained the concept of the sword. His technique of using his claws as swords had reached an extremely profound realm.","The world was split into two, and space was split into two in front of everyone’s eyes.","Looking from afar, it was as if a picture had been torn apart, and chaos poured out.","Many people were dumbstruck. This was cutting through the void. Perhaps with the help of some modern technology, one could break through the void, but that would only be for an instant. Moreover, it would require a very long time to prepare.","However, this was different. It actually easily cut through this space. One could imagine how shocked everyone was.","However, this attack was useless in front of Chu Yunfan. The space in front of Chu Yunfan seemed to be fixed by a mysterious force and was not cut open.","Chu Yunfan had only extended a finger and blocked the fatal blow.","Bam!","When the huge claw landed on Chu Yunfan’s finger, he immediately felt a terrifying power sweeping over.","The King monster screamed and retreated several steps. It was almost killed.","Only then did the King monster realize that its entire front claw had exploded on the spot.","How could he still not understand how terrifying this extremely tiny human in front of him was?","He was probably a terrifying opponent that he had never seen before.","“How is this possible? Who are you?” This King monster was in complete disbelief.","He had fallen into a deep sleep from a distant era until now due to a coincidence.","In this era, he thought it was finally his er time to shine. The creatures in this era were surprisingly weak, especially the humans who occupied many territories in the Kunlun Realm. They were terrifyingly weak.","He didn’t even need to do it himself. He only needed to command the so-called Monster Cult and use modern human technology to wantonly produce cannon fodder-like monsters.","Just when he thought that it was finally his turn to sweep the world, he suddenly encountered such a terrifying existence.","Just a simple finger could actually blow up one of his arms. What a terrifying existence.","He did not know how such a strong human could be born. It was completely illogical.","“You’re about to die. There’s no need for you to know so much!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and immediately launched an attack. In an instant, his entire body swept in front of the ferocious beast.","A long leg swept across the sky like a bolt of black lightning that tore through the sky and struck the ferocious beast.","Bam!","The ferocious beast was instantly sent flying hundreds of miles away.","In an instant, he retreated from the sky above the Capital City.","Everyone could no longer feel the huge body in the sky that seemed to be covered by dark clouds.","Only now could they see clearly that it was a slender man dressed in black.","But why did this person look so familiar?","“That looks like the legendary Almighty Chu!”","“It really is Almighty Chu! I think so too!”","“Didn’t Almighty Chu shatter the void and head to an unknown world?”","“It’s Almighty Chu! He must be back!”","For a moment, the entire Capital City was in an uproar. In the entire Federation, Chu Yunfan had the most special status.","There was no such person before him or after him.","When Chu Yunfan was still alive, he had taken care of the two mortal enemies of mankind.","It would allow humans to dominate the Kunlun Realm.","Although the subsequent developments had nothing to do with him, it was all the foundation he had laid down before.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, the current Federation wouldn’t have existed.","Because of this, when they realized that the person in the sky might be Chu Yunfan, they were instantly excited.","Especially just now, everyone felt despair. From the previous examples, there had never been a case of a city surviving after its barrier was broken.","They were almost certain to die.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan appeared and easily repelled the terrifying monster that seemed to be hundreds of miles long.","It was equivalent to saving them from the gates of hell.","Everyone couldn’t suppress the excitement in their hearts.","With the reappearance of Almighty Chu, they were saved.","“How is this possible? How can the great master not be his match?!”","In the presidential palace, Fang Buqi was dumbfounded. He couldn’t believe it.","He did not care about his injuries. He rolled and crawled as he tried to escape. However, just as he got up, a huge claw slapped him to the ground, causing him to cough up blood.","It was the Thunder Winged Beast that had attacked at the crucial moment, pinning him to the ground.","“If you want to run, you can see if you can escape!” Chu Qingxuan glanced at the remaining traitors and said casually. “You will end up like him!”","Those traitors were still in a daze. They had not recovered from the shock of Chu Yunfan’s return. How could they dare to escape? They had no chance of winning at all."]},{"number":2452,"title":"Chapter 2452: Killing the King Monster, the Humans’ Counterattack Begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 2452: Killing the King Monster, the Humans’ Counterattack Begins","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, the battle situation in the sky had changed again.","The King monster that was hit by Chu Yunfan’s kick was spurting blood all over its body. Every muscle was torn apart, and blood poured down like a rainstorm.","His body was too big. Even if it was just ordinary blood, it would form a terrifying blood storm below.","“How is that possible...” The King monster didn’t even have time to react. It was still in disbelief. Chu Yunfan was so powerful that it couldn’t even catch his kick.","He had never encountered such a terrifying existence in his life. It was just a simple attack, and it did not even bring any divine power. Just like that, it had heavily injured him.","Without a doubt, this was a terrifying opponent.","Although he had been in a deep sleep for many years, his brain had not been damaged. He immediately turned around and wanted to escape.","When he came, he probably never expected that there would be such a day where he had no choice but to escape from being chased.","However, before he could turn around and escape, he realized that his movements were getting slower and slower.","“Domain!”","The King monster reacted immediately. The other party actually had a domain. He had fallen into the other party’s domain.","It was also because there were too few experts in this era. It had been too long since he had used his domain. He had almost forgotten that there was such a move.","After falling into the other party’s domain, he felt that all his movements began to gradually slow down. It was even impossible for him to move at all.","“Roar!”","The King monster roared toward the sky. Its huge body shook crazily. Endless mist erupted from its body, and the light of the laws bloomed as if it was creating the world.","However, in the next moment, the huge ferocious beast spat out a large mouthful of blood from its bloody mouth. The moment it released its domain, it was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s domain.","It did not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan’s domain at all.","One could imagine how shocking the gap between the two sides was. They were not on the same level at all.","The King monster blinked again and saw Chu Yunfan in front of him.","Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and looked at him coldly.","The King monster was extremely familiar with that gaze. It was as cold and ruthless as looking at a corpse or an ant.","And he used this gaze to look at the humans who were being slaughtered.","In his eyes, those humans were no different from ants. They were simply a group of ants.","“I’m willing to surrender. Mysterious expert, I’m willing to be your slave!” The King monster reacted almost immediately and hurriedly knelt down to beg for mercy.","He knew that this was the only way he could preserve his life. Although this would destroy his dignity, he would not choose to surrender even if there was the slightest chance.","However, there was no other choice.","He could only choose to surrender. The other party was too strong, so strong that he was in despair.","He could not imagine what kind of existence this was and how it could be so powerful. How could such a terrifying hero appear among tiny creatures like humans?","The other party should be very happy to accept him. No matter what, although he was not as terrifying as that human, he was still a King.","No one could refuse the allegiance of a King.","As long as he could survive, everything else could be discussed.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, a sword light swept across at lightning speed, directly splitting his huge body into two halves.","Blood sprayed out like a pillar, forming a torrential rain in the air.","This was a King, after all. Every drop of blood was as heavy as Mount Tai, instantly forming a sea of blood on the ground. Before long, this place would become a mysterious place with countless heavenly resources.","“How is that possible...” This ferocious beast could not imagine why Chu Yunfan would reject the allegiance of a King monster like it.","“A King?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He didn’t care about a King at this level. Anyone who wanted to be his follower had an Emperor physique and could become an Emperor in the future.","“Use your life to repent to the countless humans who died, even though you might not have cared about them at all!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","When the King monster heard this, he never expected that he would end up like this after killing some ant-like ordinary creatures.","Why was this person so obsessed with race? This was something that was impossible in his era.","A huge hand made of energy reached out from the sky and grabbed the corpse of the beast into the Mountain River Diagram. It crushed the corpse into blood essence that filled the sky and poured it onto the Brahma Tree.","Seeing that the Brahma Fruits on the Brahma Tree were one step closer to fully ripening, Chu Yunfan’s heart was filled with anticipation.","When the Brahma Fruits fully ripened, it would be the day he attempted to break through and vindicate his Dao to become an Emperor.","This time, the Brahma Fruirs would be completely ripe. Because after hundreds of years of painstaking nurturing, the Brahma Tree had finally matured.","Only the fruits that bore this time could possibly help him vindicate his Dao and become an Emperor.","Not only did he need to reach a shocking level of comprehension to vindicate his Dao and become an Emperor, but it was also a process of rebirth. He had to reach the peak of mortals and reach a perfect level of life.","As for the Gods who were stronger than Emperors, they were not ordinary lives and could not be counted.","Now, that moment was very close.","The reason why he chose to return to the Kunlun Realm was to complete one last thing. His last wish before he became an Emperor was to come back and bring his parents and family to the Central Plains.","That was his obsession. If it continued to develop, it might even develop into an inner demon.","After this obsession was resolved, he could wholeheartedly strive to vindicate the Dao and become an Emperor.","At this moment, the Capital City saw the mastermind who had destroyed half of the Federation and almost destroyed the human civilization being killed.","Everyone cheered.","Although there were still many monsters attacking the city tirelessly outside, the biggest crisis had already been resolved. If it was just ordinary monsters, it would be impossible to do anything to the current Federation.","One nuclear bomb after another tore through the sky and landed among the endless monsters.","Every time a nuclear bomb landed, tens of thousands of monsters would be killed or injured. Even more monsters would be swept away by the shock wave and die from serious injuries.","The horn of the humans’ counterattack had been blown!"]},{"number":2453,"title":"Chapter 2453: Recovering Lost Lands","paragraphs":["Chapter 2453: Recovering Lost Lands","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without the interference of the King monster, the Federation launched a desperate counterattack.","Although the number of these monsters was endless, they were all monsters produced through biochemical plants.","The products produced would only be used as cannon fodder!","There was no way to escape the nuclear bombs.","Even after so many years of development, the nuclear bomb was still the greatest weapon in the hands of the Federation.","It was especially useful when it came to clearing the land and clearing the soldiers!","Most importantly, it was cheap!","In the AD era, nuclear bombs were very expensive to make!","However, at this point, nuclear bombs were the cheapest weapon of mass destruction!","Basically, it could be manufactured in batches at will, and there was no difficulty in manufacturing it!","Compared to other space bombs and laser cannons, they were much cheaper.","“Rumble!”","Countless nuclear bombs exploded outside the city. When everyone saw this scene, they cheered. Finally, the shadow that enveloped them disappeared.","During this period of time, even though everyone had to go to work and get off work on time, the pressure in their hearts was indescribable.","The situation was much worse than before.","The entire humans might even be completely wiped out.","Now, they had finally resolved this crisis that could lead to their demise at any moment.","There were too many monsters outside the city. Even with the use of nuclear bombs and various high-tech weapons, it still took three days to completely eliminate the endless monsters outside the city.","The army set off from the Capital City one after another. They boarded warships and began to set off for the cities that were once occupied by countless monsters.","Although these cities had already become ruins, they all had foundations. It was better than building new cities.","Moreover, the establishment of these cities had their own special meaning, so they naturally could not be easily abandoned.","One army after another started a war to reclaim their territory.","At the same time, the presidential palace issued a large number of missions. Countless freelance mercenaries were hired to go to the vast the Kunlun Realm to eliminate the remaining monsters wandering between the cities.","Originally, after so many years of cleaning up, these monsters had long been cleaned up. However, after several years of destruction, it had once again turned into a desolate world.","For the mercenary groups that hadn’t had a mission for a long time, it was undoubtedly a feast for the bounty hunters.","The head of each monster was extremely valuable, and its body had many uses.","At the same time, they also launched a hunt for the members of the Monster Cult and the settlement of the traitors who defected to the enemy.","All of this lasted until a month later before it was finally completed.","As the president of the Federation, Chu Qingxuan was constantly under high-intensity work. Fortunately, she was also a cultivation expert, so such high-intensity work was not difficult to carry out.","During this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t run around. Instead, he stayed at home to accompany his parents, whom he hadn’t seen for many years.","Although they had not seen each other for many years, it was fortunate that his parents had been cultivating diligently according to Chu Yunfan’s instructions. In addition, Chu Yunfan had left behind many ancient books and cultivation resources, so his parents’ cultivation was not shallow. They had not seen each other for more than 200 years, but they did not seem to have aged.","In terms of cultivation, they were still in their youth.","Moreover, as time passed, they would only become stronger and stronger.","In fact, the cultivation system of the Federation could have such a huge breakthrough in such a short period of time, to a large extent, because Chu Qingxuan chose to selflessly disclose the cultivation information left behind by Chu Yunfan.","In order to make it easier for his parents and sister to cultivate, Chu Yunfan left behind very detailed cultivation materials, including how to break through each stage.","After Chu Qingxuan contributed the information, it quickly became the foundation of the Federation.","After all, the Federation was different from Grand Xia. Grand Xia had many sects running rampant, so it was impossible for them to publicize the information and promote the cultivation of all the people.","In the shortest amount of time, the cultivation strength of the Federation had increased by several levels.","Chu Yunfan did nothing but stay at home with Zheng Duoduo to accompany his parents.","Anyway, Chu Qingxuan and her husband, Zheng Xinglong, were busy with various matters of the Federation and did not have time to spare.","It was not until a month later that they had the time to visit Chu Yunfan.","Zheng Xinglong, who had been promoted to the Federation’s Marshal, was very nervous when he met Chu Yunfan.","It had been more than a hundred years since he had been so nervous, especially since his wife was the first female president of the Federation. He was also in a high position. His power in the world could already be ranked among the top few. Only others would be nervous when they saw him, but he would not be nervous when he saw others.","However, at this moment, he was still nervous.","Although he was not younger than Chu Yunfan in terms of age, he was actually a few years older than Chu Yunfan.","But now, he was like a junior to Chu Yunfan.","He and Chu Yunfan were from the same generation, so he knew how famous Chu Yunfan was back then.","Back then, he was around the same age as Chu Yunfan. It was only now that he had finally become the ruler of the Federation after enduring the hardships of many seniors.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. More than 200 years ago, when they were still young, he was already a legendary figure.","More than 200 years ago, he was already on equal footing with the president of the Federation at that time. Now, he had even casually resolved the crisis that the Federation was facing.","His reputation from more than two hundred years ago had not faded. Instead, he had truly become a god-like figure in people’s hearts.","It was just that he had never thought that the legendary figure he once looked up to would actually become his brother-in-law. It was really a legend.","Facing such a person, he knew that everything he relied on was nothing. If he couldn’t satisfy Chu Yunfan, even if he and Chu Qingxuan had a child now, he wouldn’t have a good life.","Chu Yunfan was also sizing up Zheng Xinglong. He looked to be around 27 or 28 years old, and he had the unique heroic spirit of a soldier. He had strong eyebrows and starry eyes.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t go out for a month, it was still easy for him to find out Zheng Xinglong’s background based on his connections and old subordinates.","With just a phone call, all the information on Zheng Xinglong was sent to him.","Although this was classified information in the Federation, it depended on who was talking about it. For Chu Yunfan, there was naturally no such thing as a secret.","In short, Chu Yunfan was quite satisfied with this brother-in-law. He could be considered one in a million."]},{"number":2454,"title":"Chapter 2454: Taking Them Away From the Federation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2454: Taking Them Away From the Federation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Some people were born with talent and were already dragons and phoenixes among people when they were young. For example, Chu Yunfan was such a person. He started to rise in his teens and had always been the best among his peers.","He even became a legend!","And some people had accumulated a lot of experience and were late bloomers!","Zheng Xinglong was such a person!","When Chu Yunfan dominated the world and beat up all the young geniuses, Zheng Xinglong was not even qualified to enter Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","They didn’t even have the qualifications to become passers-by A or B. They were basically ants on the roadside.","However, in these hundreds of years, Zheng Xinglong had risen to prominence. With his accumulated strength, his achievements had surpassed a large number of young geniuses who had been beaten by Chu Yunfan.","Of course, Chu Qingxuan’s help was indispensable. When they were in the army, Chu Qingxuan and Zheng Xinglong were teammates of a special team. After confirming their relationship, Chu Qingxuan helped Zheng Xinglong a lot.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t think there was anything wrong with this. After all, there were too many people in the world. Even if someone helped them, they were still like mud that couldn’t be helped.","Although he was called Almighty Chu in the Federation and King Chu in Grand Xia, at this time, Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary elder brother who was examining his brother-in-law.","From the information, Chu Yunfan was very satisfied. He didn’t have any bad habits, and he didn’t flirt. He was very loyal.","Chu Yunfan didn’t mind the other party’s nervousness. He just wanted to let him know that his brother-in-law wasn’t someone to be trifled with, so he would treat his sister well.","“Brother!” Chu Qingxuan glanced at her brother. How could she not see that Chu Yunfan was deliberately trying to establish his authority for her husband?","Chu Yunfan smiled bitterly and shook his head. It was true that a woman’s age was not up to the man. When a sister grew up, she would be biased toward her husband.","“You’re not bad!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Big Brother, you flatter me!” Zheng Xinglong said.","Although Chu Yunfan said so, he did not dare to be impudent in front of Chu Yunfan. In front of Chu Yunfan, he felt no different from facing an ancestor.","The pressure was too great!","“There’s nothing to praise!” Chu Yunfan waved his hand and said, “We’re all family in the future. You don’t have to be too polite. Treat my sister well in the future. That’s better than anything else!”","“That’s what I should do!” Zheng Xinglong hurriedly nodded. If an outsider saw this dignified marshal of the Federation being like this, they would probably be scared out of their wits.","However, considering Chu Yunfan’s reputation, this was very normal.","“But since you’re here, it’s just nice. I have something to tell you!” Chu Yunfan said with a serious expression. When he saw the two of them turn their gazes over, he continued, “I want to take you to the Central Plains. I don’t know what you think!”","The two exchanged a glance. They naturally knew what sort of place the Central Plains was.","During this period of time, Chu Yunfan had frequently mentioned the Central Plains to them.","They naturally knew that Chu Yunfan’s status in the Central Plains was extremely high, and he could be said to be the number one person in the Central Plains.","Chu Qingxuan didn’t think much of it. She had always thought that her brother should have such an ability.","Only Zheng Xinglong had once lamented that his brother-in-law was indeed a rare figure. No matter what world he went to, he would be able to do well.","However, the two of them were not surprised by Chu Yunfan’s opinion. The two of them had already considered this possibility.","However, they didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to mention it so eagerly.","“You all know the environment of the Federation. It has only developed for several hundred years, and it has already reached this level. It is indeed a rare sight, but it will be difficult for it to compare to the Central Plains in a short period of time. To be more precise, before our generation dies of old age, it is unlikely that we will be able to compare to the Central Plains!”","“Your talents are not bad,” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “But if you are in the Federation, your talents will naturally be wasted. It is impossible to use them to their fullest!”","The two of them looked at each other. From Chu Yunfan’s description, they could imagine how vast the world was. It was far from what the Federation could compare to.","Especially the cultivation environment, it was like heaven and earth.","Apart from their high positions, they were also cultivators. There was no cultivator who did not want to advance further.","“Brother, I want to go with you, but there are a lot of things in the Federation. I can’t just leave!” Chu Qingxuan said hesitantly.","As the president of the Federation, she was naturally very busy and had a lot of things to deal with.","“I also know the mechanism of the Federation. It won’t be unable to operate without you. Haven’t you cultivated your successor all these years?” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Qingxuan nodded. Although the Federation was an elected government, every president had their successor. She was the successor recommended by the previous president.","The previous president of the Federation had used all the resources he had to nurture her. That was why she had been able to make so many contributions. In the end, she had relied on these contributions to succeed in the election.","Although the previous president’s ideal partner was Chu Yunfan, Chu Qingxuan was only a second-class choice.","However, Chu Qingxuan didn’t care. She knew that she couldn’t be compared to her brother, who was a genius.","All these years, she had been consciously grooming her successor. Her successor had made enough contributions over the years and had enough influence. Even if he left now, there would not be any immediate problems.","“The mechanism of the Federation is that the Earth can still rotate without anyone!” Chu Yunfan said. “Although you are important to the Federation, you are not irreplaceable figures in the Federation. This opportunity is very rare for you. If you miss it, your progress in martial arts will be very limited. Perhaps in a few years, when I return, I will see you all who have died of old age!”","At the mention of death, their expressions changed. Although they were still young, when they thought of that scene, they could not help but feel a chill in their hearts.","There was great terror between life and death, and not many people could face it calmly.","“I’ll give you half a year to complete the handover. After half a year, I’ll leave. Whether you want to leave with me or not depends on your own choice!” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Qingxuan and Zheng Xinglong.","“Brother, let us go back and think about it. We’ll give you an answer then!” Chu Qingxuan said.","“Okay!” Chu Yunfan nodded."]},{"number":2455,"title":"Chapter 2455: Our Target Is the Starry Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 2455: Our Target Is the Starry Universe","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After giving his sister and brother-in-law half a year’s time, Chu Yunfan left the house and found Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu wasn’t in the Kunlun Realm at the moment. She was on Earth and had returned to the Tang clan’s ancestral home.","Like many big families in the Kunlun Realm, the Tang clan had moved most of their people back to Earth before the Capital City was breached.","The Capital City was their last hope. Once it was breached, according to the final agreement, the passageway between the two worlds would be destroyed by the space bomb.","Other than the Tang clan, most of the Chu clan had also moved to Earth.","In addition to the families moving, there were also various scientific research materials that were originally stored in the Kunlun Realm. Now, they were all transferred back to Earth.","Even when the Kunlun Realm was in full swing, Earth was already a different scene. All kinds of interstellar warships were being built.","Man-made base cities were left on the Moon, Mars, and Jupiter.","After so many years of development, humanity’s technology in building headquarter cities could be said to be very mature.","It wasn’t just on Mars, which had a similar environment to Earth. It wasn’t difficult to build a Capital City on Jupiter, Venus, and other planets that were extremely hostile to humans.","Moreover, after hundreds of years of promotion and cultivation, the overall strength of mankind was no longer the same as that of the AD era hundreds of years ago.","It was considered a very harsh environment in the past, but it was nothing to humans now.","With the current strength of ordinary human citizens, it was a piece of cake for them to be immune to the cold and heat. They could even easily pass through burning flames.","In the past, only the high and mighty figures could cultivate to the Divine Stage. However, now, as long as the citizens of the Federation reached adulthood, they would at least be in the Divine Stage.","There was no need to mention the environment on Mars. Even the environment on Venus could allow one to live freely without any problems. One could even cross the void.","That was only a theoretical ability. With the divine power reserves in the bodies of ordinary Divines, it would be very difficult to cross from Earth to the moon. Halfway through, the divine power in their bodies would be exhausted and they would have to call for help.","However, it was enough for humans to colonize the major planets in the Milky Way.","After all, for the Federation, if the Kunlun Realm couldn’t be defended, then it was inevitable that it would develop in the direction of other planets and the universe.","After all, with the current speed of human development, if they were trapped on Earth, they would not be able to maintain such a civilization.","A world where everyone practiced martial arts required resources that ordinary worlds could not afford.","At the very least, the current Earth could not afford to support it. It had to continue to expand and develop externally.","This was also the backup plan of the Federation. However, they never expected Chu Yunfan to return at the critical moment.","The backup plan that he had prepared would no longer be useful.","However, after experiencing this incident, the Federation already had a sense of crisis. They definitely could not put all their eggs in the same basket.","They had to be prepared for both scenarios. Even if they had to develop the Kunlun Realm, they couldn’t give up on the exploration and development of the Milky Way and even the distant universe.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the Tang clan’s ancestral home on Earth, Tang Siyu brought a cute girl who was about fifteen or sixteen years old and had her hair tied into a bun to Chu Yunfan.","“This is?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“This is my new disciple, Tang Ying!” said Tang Siyu.","Then, Tang Siyu told Chu Yunfan about the girl’s background. It turned out that this girl was the daughter of a distant uncle of hers. She could be considered her niece.","Tang Ying was well-known in the Tang clan and was considered an outstanding genius. When Tang Siyu returned to the Tang clan, she was requested by the entire family to take her as a disciple.","Tang Siyu was the previous head of the Tang clan. Although she didn’t have a good relationship with the Tang clan in the beginning, after Chu Yunfan attacked the Tang clan, she had already cleaned up the dissenters.","The rest were Tang Siyu’s people. As for those who were disobedient and unwilling to surrender, they had long been killed.","Now that they had seen Tang Siyu return, they knew that there was an even wider and boundless world.","Although most of them were unwilling to leave, there was still a group of people who were willing to leave for the Central Plains, yearning for an even vaster world.","If it was an unstable and unpredictable world, the possibility of them going was not high.","However, although Tang Siyu’s status in the Central Plains was inferior to Chu Yunfan’s and was a top-notch expert below Chu Yunfan and the human king, in terms of cultivation, she was even slightly stronger than her master, the Elder Princess.","It was not difficult at all to protect a group of clansmen brought from Earth.","However, although Tang Siyu planned to bring a group of clansmen over, the only one she really wanted to take as her disciple was Tang Ying.","Among all the members of the Tang clan, only Tang Ying’s talent made Tang Siyu’s eyes light up and she could be accepted as a disciple.","It just so happened that Tang Siyu had never taken in a disciple before, so she could take her in and teach her well.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised. During the time he was at home, many people from the Chu clan came to visit Chu Yunfan. Some of them also suggested that Chu Yunfan take in a few disciples.","With Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, after that shocking battle, everyone knew about him.","The famous Almighty Chu had returned after disappearing for hundreds of years, but he didn’t disappear from the masses.","Although the Federation’s improvement speed was fast, it was still a huge gap compared to Chu Yunfan.","The gap was so great that they didn’t even know what stage Chu Yunfan had cultivated to.","Obviously, they were too weak compared to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was right to leave the Federation and cultivate in the other world.","For the Chu clan, Chu Yunfan’s strength was naturally a great thing for them.","As long as someone could get Chu Yunfan’s guidance, even a few words would be a great thing.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t very interested in this. Bringing a portion of the Chu clan to the Central Plains was a very simple matter, but Chu Yunfan didn’t intend to take in disciples. He used his divine will to scan the entire Chu clan and found out about its roots.","There was not even a single one that he was impressed by.","There wasn’t even a single Emperor-physique possessor comparable to ancient geniuses. Chu Yunfan was really uninterested.","Although there were many people who looked like geniuses in the eyes of ordinary people, Chu Yunfan, who had seen all kinds of ancient freaks and monsters, was just so-so.","This naturally disappointed the Chu clan, but they did not dare to blame Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":2456,"title":"Chapter 2456: Clearing up the Kunlun Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 2456: Clearing up the Kunlun Realm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After all, there was a huge gap between them and Chu Yunfan.","They didn’t even have any feelings of envy, jealousy, or hatred. They could only look up to him!","The rain and thunder were all thanks to the king!","“Greetings, Grand Master!” Tang Ying opened her big eyes and looked at Chu Yunfan curiously.","Chu Yunfan was a miracle in the history of the Federation. He was a myth, a legend!","Everyone in their generation had been born from listening to Chu Yunfan’s myths and legends.","Although she was Tang Siyu’s niece, there was a huge age gap between them.","If this was the AD era, Tang Siyu would be her ancestor.","Therefore, to her, Chu Yunfan was also a great senior!","Never in her wildest dreams had she imagined that she would one day be able to meet that legendary figure who had actually become her grandmaster.","No matter how she thought about it, it was unexpected.","“Yes, good child!” Chu Yunfan smiled and nodded.","The scene was very strange. After all, it seemed that Chu Yunfan was at most in his early twenties, not much older than Tang Ying.","“But since we’re leaving, we should clear some obstacles for the Federation!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan, not knowing what Chu Yunfan was planning.","“When we left, we didn’t clean it up properly. That’s why that old King monster crawled out and brought disaster to the world!”","“From now on,” Chu Yunfan continued, “you will be in charge of cleaning up the Earth and the nearby galaxies. See if there’s anything that could threaten the Federation. I’ll be responsible for cleaning up the remaining ancient existences in the Kunlun Realm!”","Tang Siyu immediately understood Chu Yunfan’s thoughts. He wanted to thoroughly eliminate the dangers that the Federation might encounter before leaving.","Although Chu Yunfan did not completely destroy the monsters, he still wanted to make an enemy of the Federation so that it would not degenerate.","As the saying goes, a country will perish without external enemies!","However, he did not expect that it would cause the Federation to be on the verge of destruction.","When they left, the Kunlun Realm was still unknown to the Federation.","In the past hundreds of years, the Federation’s territory in the Kunlun Realm had at least doubled, which alarmed the old King monster deep in the Kunlun Realm.","With Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu’s strength, even if they wanted to, they couldn’t detect the sleeping old King monster.","However, things were different now. With Chu Yunfan’s half-Emperor strength, he was a top-notch existence in the myriad worlds.","It was naturally much easier to clean up now.","Tang Siyu’s cultivation base was not much different. The strength of a peak King was enough to sweep across the world.","Before the two of them left, they could help the development of the Federation and eliminate the fatal enemies.","It would prevent the Federation from falling into the crisis of destruction after they left.","It wasn’t every time that he coincidentally met Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu who had returned.","After making up their minds, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu started to clean up the place.","Tang Siyu began to embark on the path of cleaning up the galaxies near the Milky Way. Although the distance was very far, using ordinary methods, even at the speed of light, would take a very long time.","However, Kings could directly tear through space, which was much more useful than wormholes.","This was the power of cultivation to the extreme.","Chu Yunfan began to search the depths of the Kunlun Realm.","The depths of the Kunlun Realm were desolate, with all kinds of fierce beasts and poisonous insects.","Many of them were even stronger than the strongest forces in the Federation. However, Chu Yunfan did not touch any of them.","After all, although these could pose a certain threat to the Federation, they would not pose a fatal threat.","When the Federation developed further, they would naturally be able to deal with these existences.","These were not Chu Yunfan’s goals.","But soon, Chu Yunfan found his target. He found a sleeping King monster less than 30,000 miles into the Kunlun Realm.","It was unknown from which era it had survived. The King monster was covered in black scales, and every scale had thorns on it. It looked like a huge scaled boar that had been sealed in a spirit stone mine.","However, it was emitting a faint pressure that made no monsters dare to set foot within a thousand miles.","Chu Yunfan did not hold back at all. He directly attacked and shattered the spirit stone mine. Immediately, the sleeping King scaled boar was alarmed. It let out a long roar toward the sky, and a terrifying energy pillar turned into an astonishing attack that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid at all. He just slapped the energy pillar into pieces.","The King scaled boar still wanted to struggle, but it was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan grabbed out with one hand and turned it into a huge hand. It expanded with the wind and in a moment, it was as huge as an archaic divine mountain.","Boom!","This King scaled boar was slapped to the ground on the spot, unable to move.","This time, the King scaled boar finally knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was and knew how to be afraid.","It was as if he had seen a ghost.","“Human expert, I’m willing to surrender. I’m willing to be your slave. Please spare my life!”","How could this King scaled boar not know how powerful Chu Yunfan was? It was simply seeing a ghost.","It was a King that had survived since a long time ago and was knowledgeable.","However, he had never seen such a terrifying existence before. It almost suppressed his resistance with one hand.","If such a terrifying existence wanted to kill it, it could do it with just a thought. How could it dare to be careless in the slightest?","He immediately begged for mercy.","“You beg for mercy so quickly!” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes.","He had originally intended to kill this King scaled boar. However, the King scaled boar’s surrender gave him another idea. He didn’t have to kill these King monsters. Instead, he could subdue them and give them to the Federation as national weapons.","Even in the ancient era, when Emperors were everywhere, a force with a King could be said to be very powerful.","A powerful force that could control an entire world.","Of course, there were more than just the Kunlun Realm, Earth, and the Central Plains in this world. There were many worlds added together, and the Kunlun Realm was just one of them.","In those distant times, these were all worlds ruled by Emperors.","Later on, during the war between the Emperors, the Central Plains was almost completely destroyed, and the various worlds were also freed from control. Even now, the Central Plains was only left with its own homeland, with no other colonized worlds."]},{"number":2457,"title":"Chapter 2457: An Extraterrestrial Civilization?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2457: An Extraterrestrial Civilization?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, even in the era when the Emperors ruled many worlds, a faction with a King could be considered a first-rate faction.","Although they still had to rely on Emperors to gain full protection, it could be considered that he had finally escaped the situation where they could be killed at will.","He could use this King scaled boar as the guardian of the Federation.","Although he didn’t think much of the King scaled boar with such aptitude, it was still a great killing weapon for the current Federation.","The poor King scaled boar was looking at Chu Yunfan pitifully, not daring to release even the slightest bit of its fierce might, afraid that Chu Yunfan would directly chop off its head if it released even the slightest bit of its fierce might.","He didn’t know how much Chu Yunfan despised him.","He thought that a King like him would be a rare combat strength for Chu Yunfan.","“Since you want to surrender, show some sincerity. Release your primordial spirit and let me leave a mark!” Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and then said.","This King scaled boar had no other choice. He knew that he had to take this step. Otherwise, why would this human expert believe him?","However, he still felt very aggrieved.","He was a King, but now he was no different from a dog.","It wasn’t that he wasn’t strong enough, but that the human in front of him was too terrifying.","A single hand could suppress all his resistance. If he attacked with all his strength, he even suspected that he would be instantly killed.","After the King scaled boar released its primordial spirit, Chu Yunfan left his mark on it. The life and death of the King scaled boar was in his hands.","If he wanted him to live, he had to live. If he wanted him to die, he had to die.","“You can continue sleeping, but if someone comes with my seal one day, you must listen to their command. If you don’t, your soul will be destroyed. I believe you understand!” Chu Yunfan said.","Although he didn’t like this King scaled boar, he could make this King scaled boar into a nuclear weapon of the Federation, a weapon that could be used at a critical moment.","However, they were not allowed to alarm the King scaled boar. Otherwise, the Federation would lose its original initiative.","Seeing this, the King scaled boar could only nod. The sealing light appeared on its body again, and it buried itself deep into the spirit stone mine again.","He was waiting for the next time the Federation would wake him up.","With this experience, it would be much easier for Chu Yunfan to deal with those King monsters.","As expected, it was similar to what Chu Yunfan had thought.","There were many powerful beings in the depths of the Kunlun Realm. Chu Yunfan even saw powerful half-Kings recuperating there.","However, unlike the demi-humans of the Central Plains, who had already formed a country system, they were basically tribes formed by different races. They were still constantly conquering each other, and it was unlikely that they would notice the Federation in the short term.","It was basically impossible to form a new King.","Although there were so many Kings in the Central Plains...","However, this was the result of the Central Plains’ countless years of accumulated reserves exploding together in a single era.","In an ordinary era, Kings were already top-notch combat strength. In the entire era, it was very possible for there to be fewer than five Kings.","After that, Chu Yunfan caught a King python, a King ape, and a King sea dragon. These four Kings were the only Kings left in the Kunlun Realm.","They were all sealed in the distant past through unknown means until now.","Unfortunately, when they met Chu Yunfan, they were immediately awakened from their slumber. Then, they were beaten up and forced to sign a master-servant contract so that they could be used by the Federation.","Finally, he would let them continue to sleep!","Chu Yunfan was getting more and more familiar with this series of processes!","Through this process, Chu Yunfan had thoroughly explored the Kunlun Realm.","In the past, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to explore the Kunlun Realm with his cultivation. There were too many places he didn’t dare to go.","However, he didn’t have such concerns now. Even if there were any powerful existences, he could suppress them with a flip of his hand.","Chu Yunfan had also drawn a huge map of these things, which he intended to leave for the Federation.","The land in the Kunlun Realm alone was about 500 times the size of Earth.","If they could occupy all of them, it would be enough for the Federation to develop to a shocking level, pushing the entire human civilization to an unprecedented level.","After dealing with the threat of the few King monsters, such a huge place would completely become the back garden of the Federation.","When Chu Yunfan returned to the Federation, he handed the map to the government of the Federation, which immediately shocked the entire Federation.","They only knew that the Kunlun Realm had a lot of space, but they didn’t expect it to be so big.","It contained countless resources. If it could be fully developed, the human civilization would probably complete a complete transformation. It was not impossible for it to become a legendary god-tier civilization.","Only a few high-ranking officials in the Federation knew that Chu Yunfan had also given them insurance in addition to the map.","If the Federation were to encounter such a near-annihilation incident again, they would be able to wake up the sleeping King monsters.","This was also the last bumper for the development of the Federation.","Those who knew the truth sighed with emotion. Almighty Chu had put in a lot of effort for the development of the Federation.","At the same time, Tang Siyu’s exploration on the other side of Earth had also made a huge discovery. As expected, she had discovered a civilization outside Earth. That civilization was on the Alpha Star of the Centaurus Constellation, four light years away from the Milky Way.","When they were discovered by Tang Siyu, they were organizing an extremely large fleet and preparing to migrate to the Milky Way. Their target was Earth, where humans lived.","The environment of this civilization was extremely harsh, and they were facing the crazy rampage of three unregulated suns.","Escaping their mother planet was their only choice!","Who knew that they would run into Tang Siyu, who was exploring this place.","Although this civilization had already developed an extremely advanced technological civilization, it was almost impossible to deal with an existence like Tang Siyu who had cultivated to the extreme.","In terms of technology, Tang Siyu was at least equivalent to the top civilization in the technology field. Her various offensive methods were invincible.","As a result, this huge fleet was directly destroyed. With a single palm strike, space was torn apart, and the entire fleet was destroyed by the spatial turbulence.","Only the remaining members and civilization information were brought back to the Federation by Tang Siyu. For a moment, the entire Federation was in an uproar."]},{"number":2458,"title":"Chapter 2458: The Federation’s Rapid Growth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2458: The Federation’s Rapid Growth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This extraterrestrial civilization did not place equal emphasis on science and martial arts, but on scientific progress.","In terms of technological development, it was even stronger than the Federation.","Many of the technologies in the Federation that were still in the theoretical stage had already become usable technology in the extraterrestrial civilization.","Of course, due to the different direction of development, the Federation, which emphasized both science and martial arts, would not necessarily be worse than the extraterrestrial civilization in a real fight.","However, the information brought back by Tang Siyu was still very useful to the current Federation.","Basically, it could be said that they had saved at least 200 years of exploration time.","The rapid advancement in technology would also feed back into cultivation.","After all, the scientific side would provide many tools to assist the cultivation side. The Federation had even begun to study genetic sequencing.","Different talents would have different performances in the genetic sequence compared to ordinary people. In theory, it was even possible to modify genes to make everyone a genius in cultivation.","They could also use some genetic medicine to extend the lifespan of humans, allowing them to break through stages that were originally impossible to break through.","The higher one’s cultivation level was, the more developed one’s brain would be, and the more efficient one would be in scientific research.","Ordinary scientists would be exhausted after studying for more than ten hours, but cultivators often did research for months without any problems.","The research efficiency might be several times or even dozens of times higher.","The entire Federation was greatly encouraged, especially the higher-ups of the Federation. They knew many secrets and knew the existence of those King monsters.","With Tang Siyu’s help in wiping out the extraterrestrial civilization, the development of the Federation was greatly guaranteed.","It was basically certain that their future was limitless.","In order to digest the information from the extraterrestrial civilization, a large number of scientists were mobilized to conduct research, trying to understand these technologies in the shortest time possible.","As for the extraterrestrials that were brought back, they had basically become the subject of research.","These extraterrestrials would never have thought that there would be such a ferocious existence among the Earthlings they planned to invade.","Initially, they wanted to treat the Earthlings like lab rats, but who would have thought that they would become a lab rat?","They simply wanted to cry.","Hundreds of years ago, when they received information about Earth in the Milky Way, they were ecstatic.","Compared to the extremely harsh environment of their planet, Earth was simply a paradise on earth.","They had been preparing ecstatically for hundreds of years, planning to colonize and conquer this place that seemed extremely backward in the information.","Who would have thought that they would be taught a lesson instead?","The difference was too great.","The entire civilization had been destroyed and it had become a lab rat, constantly being subjected to all kinds of experiments.","These were all things they had planned to do to the humans on Earth, but now they were being taught a lesson by the humans.","While the Federation was dealing with all kinds of messes, regaining territory and rebuilding their homes, they had to constantly mobilize various scientists to thoroughly understand the various technologies of the extraterrestrial civilization.","Chu Yunfan was not idle either. He was organizing some cultivation materials.","There was even a relatively complete cultivation system!","However, at that time, Chu Yunfan had left behind cultivation materials for personal use.","A lot of the information was more suitable for his parents and family, which was why Chu Yunfan had specially selected them and kept them.","But this time was different. Chu Yunfan would not only consider his parents and family, but also the commonality of human cultivation.","He organized the cultivation system in a targeted manner.","With such a complete cultivation system, the human cultivation world was about to usher in a period of rapid growth.","According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, with the information on the cultivation system that he had organized, coupled with the technological information of the extraterrestrial civilization, the strength of the Federation should be able to double in ten years and reach another level in thirty years.","The long-term development and influence in the future was even more obvious.","Time flew by, and half a year had finally passed.","Chu Yunfan had given Chu Qingxuan and Zheng Xinglong half a year to consider, and now it was finally time to give Chu Yunfan an official reply.","In the Chu family’s mansion.","“Big Brother, we’ve thought about it. I’ll resign and go to the Central Plains with you!” Chu Qingxuan said to Chu Yunfan seriously.","As she spoke, Chu Qingxuan even patted Zheng Duoduo’s little head and smiled happily.","Most of the reason she had made this decision was related to Zheng Duoduo. If Zheng Duoduo wanted a better future, then the Central Plains was clearly more suitable than the Federation.","At this moment, Chu Qingxuan was no different from those parents in the AD era who would do anything to get their children into famous schools.","Zheng Xinglong nodded. It was not easy to make the two of them give up their power and status in the Federation.","In comparison, they weren’t pure Dao Seekers like Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could give up his power in the Federation in order to seek the highest realm of martial arts.","This was because to him, power and whatnot were all within reach and were meaningless.","However, Chu Qingxuan and Zheng Xinglong were just ordinary people. They weren’t as determined as Chu Yunfan.","At least half of the reason they made this decision was to give Zheng Duoduo a better future.","After all, Chu Yunfan was a half-Emperor. Although they still couldn’t understand what that stage meant, they at least knew one thing. This kind of expert must be very powerful. In the future, Zheng Duoduo would be stronger than them.","As for power and authority, they had already obtained it. After this incident, they completely understood that strength was the foundation of everything.","Facing a King monster, what was the use of being the president of the Federation and the marshal of the Federation? How could they be better than ordinary people?","However, Chu Yunfan’s return took care of the terrifying monsters that almost destroyed the entire civilization of the Federation in an instant.","They had already understood that power did not necessarily bring strength, but strength could bring enough power.","“Very good, you’ve made the right decision!” Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction.","If his sister was unwilling to go to the Central Plains with him, he would still support her, even if he was not satisfied.","After all, his sister had already grown up and married into a family. She was not his doll that he could control.","“However, I have to resign and hand over my work. In addition, the Federation’s presidential election is still ongoing. I’m afraid it will take three years!” Chu Qingxuan looked at Chu Yunfan and said.","“It’s okay. I can wait for you for three years!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently."]},{"number":2459,"title":"Chapter 2459: Returning to the Central Plains","paragraphs":["Chapter 2459: Returning to the Central Plains","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The first female president in the history of the Federation chose to abdicate and resign when her term of office was short.","This news caused a huge uproar in the Federation.","After all, the rise of every president of the Federation was not as simple as being elected by the people. There were also huge interest groups involved behind it. The term of office of every president of the Federation was very long.","Chu Qingxuan’s first term of office had not even expired yet. It was only halfway through.","This was also in consideration of the fact that as the cultivation strength of the Federation continued to increase, everyone’s lifespan had greatly increased. Many projects also required a very long time.","If they were to change their terms every four years, many projects would be changed. The Federation would have to expend all their efforts just to run for the election.","However, this news was quickly covered up. After all, the Federation was still in the recovery stage, and everyone had to resume their lives.","The candidates who had already been prepared for the election had also started to build up momentum before the election, suppressing the news of Chu Qingxuan’s resignation to the lowest level.","Three years passed in the blink of an eye. After staying in the Federation for several years, Chu Yunfan finally returned to the Central Plains.","Other than his parents, sister, brother-in-law, and Zheng Duoduo, a group of people from Zheng Xinglong’s Zheng clan followed him. Chu Yunfan’s Chu clan and Tang Siyu’s Tang clan also sent a group of people.","In the past, Chu Yunfan was afraid of exposing his identity, but now he didn’t care.","He was already standing at the peak of the Central Plains, so it didn’t matter even if his origins were discovered.","After a burst of dazzling light, everyone immediately understood that they had arrived in a brand new world.","An unprecedented world.","This feeling was hard to describe. To be precise, it was like jumping from a pond into a big river.","The entire environment had undergone earth-shattering changes. Although the range of their perception was not large, the speed of water fluctuations in a small pool was different from the speed of water fluctuations in rivers, lakes, and seas.","They could sense it with their intuition.","‘Is this the world where Almighty Chu runs rampant?’","Many people had such thoughts. Everyone felt as if they were fish in the sea and birds in the sky!","Boom!","Suddenly, just as everyone was still admiring the vastness of the world, far above the Central Plains, there was a terrifying rumble in the distance.","Immediately after, a shocking shock wave swept toward them at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Facing this terrifying shockwave that covered the sky and earth like a tsunami, everyone even felt that their entire bodies could not move at all.","In fact, there were no ordinary people among them, and there was no lack of experts. They felt that even if they had come to the Central Plains, they would not be weaklings.","At the very least, they were much stronger than when Chu Yunfan left.","However, in the face of this terrifying spatial shock wave, they were powerless to fight back. They almost felt that death was right in front of them.","Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had been in front of the group, took a step forward. Instantly, the suffocating feeling that came from all directions disappeared without a trace.","The shockwave disappeared without a trace.","However, not long after, another even more terrifying shock wave shook the space and swept toward everyone.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the terrifying shock wave disappeared without a trace.","The people who had just arrived in the Central Plains all exchanged glances. Were the Central Plains all so dangerous?","Why did he have to face such a life-and-death crisis as soon as he arrived?","Based on the frequency of the shockwaves, how could they survive?","“Take care of them!” Chu Yunfan said to Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu nodded. Only she and Chu Yunfan knew what had happened.","The eyes of the Kings were like torches as they swept across the Central Plains.","Both of them could see that the terrifying shockwaves that were comparable to a tsunami came from the direction of the Imperial Capital.","Above the Imperial City, a huge Luck Dragon spiraled in the air, whistling and roaring continuously.","On top of this Luck Dragon, a figure stood on it. He kept blasting endless attacks into the sky, shattering the sky.","“That’s the human king!”","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. That was indeed the human king. In the entire Central Plains, other than Chu Yunfan, only the human king could have such a terrifying aura.","This had already surpassed peak Kings and was a true half-Emperor.","However, as a half-Emperor, the human king’s strength was basically invincible in the Central Plains, other than Chu Yunfan.","Such a person could even easily face the siege of several peak Kings.","In the Central Plains, there was no one other than Chu Yunfan who could make him feel that he was in a difficult position.","However, not only did the human king make a move, but he also used the Luck Dragon.","In the entire Central Plains, apart from Chu Yunfan, who had saved the human race from danger and obtained the recognition of the Luck Dragon, only the ruler of the Central Plains could use the Luck Dragon.","On the other hand, even with his, the human king still had to use the Luck Dragon to fight against such a terrifying existence.","The rest of the people, including the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia and the other loyal confidants of the human king, weren’t making any moves.","Had they fallen? Or was it that they could not interfere in a battle of this level at all?","The two of them looked at each other. Tang Siyu had already realized that something was wrong.","It was truly terrifying!","Chu Yunfan asked Tang Siyu to take good care of these people who had just arrived in the Central Plains from the Kunlun Realm.","He himself disappeared into thin air with a single step.","“Is Yunfan okay?” his mother, Yang Yayun, asked worriedly.","Her cultivation was not shallow, but she could not keep up with her son. Although she knew that her son was very strong now, as a mother, she was still very worried.","“Don’t worry, Mom. He’ll be fine!” Tang Siyu nodded confidently. “Even in the Central Plains, there is no one who can match him. Not a single one!”","“I’ll take you to his territory to settle down first and wait for him to bring back the news!” Tang Siyu said.","Hearing this, everyone nodded.","Then, Tang Siyu waved her hand, and everyone disappeared from where they were. In the next moment, they had already appeared above Zhenyuan City."]},{"number":2460,"title":"Chapter 2460: The Evil Gods Reappear, Mastermind Behind the Scenes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2460: The Evil Gods Reappear, Mastermind Behind the Scenes!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan appeared near the Imperial Capital.","The entire vicinity of the Imperial City had already become a huge battlefield. The Luck Dragon that was faintly discernible in the air had transformed into a barrier that protected the Imperial City and the surrounding land.","Otherwise, this battle of the half-Emperor level would be enough to blast the entire Imperial Capital into nothingness.","It wasn’t impossible for them to destroy the entire Central Plains.","Looking at the battlefield above the Luck Dragon, he saw a very familiar creature.","“An Evil God?” Chu Yunfan was stunned. Weren’t these creatures that were filled with evil aura the Evil Gods that he had exterminated earlier?","He was sure that he had killed all the Evil Gods in the Central Plains. There couldn’t be any more.","But this Evil God was indeed an Evil God. Chu Yunfan would not mistake the aura of an Evil God.","Then which little biscuit was this Evil God? Where did it come from?","In any case, it definitely wasn’t an Evil God from the Central Plains.","It was even more powerful than the previous half-Emperor Evil Gods.","His strength was clearly far above that of the human king.","Therefore, even the human king had no choice but to use his great killing weapon and use the Luck Dragon of the human race to resist this Evil God.","After all, after this series of events, the strength of the human race had increased too much, and so had their luck.","Even the Luck Dragon was several times stronger than before.","He could even fight against ordinary half-Emperors.","It was precisely because of the help of this Luck Dragon that the human king could fight against it.","However, this was also directly related to fighting in the Imperial Capital. The Evil God could attack without any fear, but the human king and the Luck Dragon had to ensure that the Imperial Capital was not destroyed.","It was impossible for him to act recklessly.","It was precisely because of this that the human king’s frequent attacks became extremely aggrieved. It was really too uncomfortable.","“How dare you destroy my master’s creations? Humanity must perish. As the king of humanity, you must come with me to apologize to my master!” the Evil God kept attacking and said.","Chu Yunfan finally understood.","It was probably just as Chu Yunfan had guessed. Those Evil Gods seemed to be a group, but they were actually man-made.","He just didn’t know who could create peak half-King Evil Gods.","Now, it seemed like the mastermind was about to surface, and another half-Emperor Evil God had appeared.","“You think you can destroy the human race with just a guy who came out of nowhere?” The human king’s cold voice was filled with anger.","It was the master behind this Evil God that created that group of Evil Gods.","It was those Evil Gods that split the human race and created the Hus, a race that tainted human civilization.","It was an insult to the entire human race!","“Stubborn!” the Evil God said coldly. As he spoke, he formed a seal and a huge seal appeared in his hand.","There were endless energy fluctuations in the seal.","Boom!","The seal fell down in an instant, causing a terrifying explosion.","An incomparably huge mushroom cloud slowly rose, and the entire space was blasted into pieces. At the same time, everyone discovered that the Luck Dragon had let out an incomparably huge roar. Half of his body had been blasted into pieces.","Even the human king was sent flying and kept coughing up blood.","In the explosion just now, he was directly hit and gained serious injuries.","Clearly, this was the true trump card of this Evil God.","The Evil God was high up and crossed his arms as if he was looking at a dead person.","In an instant, he attacked again. In an instant, the Evil God’s palm slammed down.","Just as the giant palm was about to flatten the entire Imperial City...","Suddenly, rays of light swept over from afar like a terrifying storm.","In an instant, the Evil God’s attack was turned into nothingness.","All of this, only the light that filled the sky dissipated in front of everyone in the Imperial City, without causing any fluctuation.","It was as if it had dissipated from the material origin.","“Hmm? Who is it?” the Evil God shouted. He looked over and saw a terrifying existence that stood in the air like a real god.","“King Chu! King Chu has returned!” someone in the Imperial Capital shouted.","Everyone recognized Chu Yunfan’s existence in the shortest time possible. Everyone cheered. After all, Chu Yunfan’s return was a boost to the morale of the human race, which was in danger.","“That’s great. We don’t have to die!”","“King Chu! Long live King Chu!”","Everyone shouted excitedly.","“Are you the one who killed my master’s creations?” The Evil God looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. He didn’t have any emotions when those Evil Gods were mentioned.","Even though Chu Yunfan thought that they might be a force, he didn’t have any intention of being moved by those Evil Gods.","What really made him angry was that Chu Yunfan had killed his master’s creation.","“That’s right. I killed those bugs!” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Looks like it’s as I expected. Those Evil Gods are man-made and there’s a mastermind behind them!”","“Perfect. I’ll kill you to appease my master’s anger!” The Evil God looked at Chu Yunfan with an unconcealable killing intent.","“Kill me? That depends on whether you can do it!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Boom!","The Evil God did not hold back. He immediately used the same seal as before.","The seal fell down, almost shattering the entire world. The terrifying aftershock shattered everything.","Even a half-Emperor would be severely injured.","It was as if the terrifying scene from before was about to be replicated.","Countless people in the Imperial Capital immediately set up protective barriers and defensive barriers, although such barriers were actually useless.","However, everyone did it almost instinctively.","However, the terrifying explosion did not happen. It was not what everyone had imagined.","The terrifying aftershock of the explosion was grabbed by a large hand almost immediately.","The huge hand was like a huge net, trapping all the aftershocks of the explosion within it, not letting any of them leak out.","Everything was so calm that it was terrifying.","“You’re so powerful!” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. He looked at the Evil God and said, “If this is your only trick, then I will be very disappointed in you!”"]},{"number":2461,"title":"Chapter 2461: The So-Called Strongest Is Just So","paragraphs":["Chapter 2461: The So-Called Strongest Is Just So","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Evil God’s eyes flashed with disbelief. His seal was a treasure that he had cultivated for many years.","Any seal was extremely powerful!","The seal just now had severely injured the human king and blasted the Luck Dragon into half.","The power was brutal. An ordinary half-Emperor would be killed by this attack.","However, Chu Yunfan caught it casually.","This in itself was already extraordinary.","At this moment, this Evil God completely believed that this person killed those other Evil Gods.","Although those Evil Gods were just defective products created by their master, they weren’t something ordinary people could kill.","Especially when he knew that those defective products could actually combine to form a half-Emperor Evil God.","That was even more so for the human king who hadn’t been in the half-Emperor Stage for many years.","The human king at the side quickly seized this opportunity to heal his injuries and repair the Luck Dragon.","Chu Yunfan’s return was great news for him.","He didn’t know why Chu Yunfan would suddenly return, but this was the fate of the human race.","He did not dare to stop repairing the Luck Dragon for a moment.","If he did not repair the Luck Dragon, it would probably affect the luck of the entire human race. At that time, he would be the sinner of the entire human race.","Moreover, he was also a member of humanity. The Luck Dragon of the humans was severely injured, which would greatly affect his future luck.","The greater the cultivation, the greater the influence. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan had long stripped away the influence of the Luck Dragon of the humans, so he did not care much.","This was also the reason why Chu Yunfan didn’t care about the benefits that were within his grasp. If he absorbed the fate of the human race, his cultivation would definitely increase greatly, but at the same time, he would also be bound to Grand Xia. If anything happened to Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan would also be severely injured.","“Killing my master’s creations is an unforgivable crime!” the Evil God said coldly.","He was tall and looked extremely evil. His face was covered in fog and couldn’t be seen clearly. One could only see a pair of sharp eyes.","Boom!","The Evil God attacked again, but this time, it wasn’t the seals because they couldn’t pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","This time, he personally went into battle. With a punch, an extremely shocking rainbow light immediately blasted out from his body.","His eyes were like two huge stars, and his body was like a universe revolving.","This attack was enough to burn the sky with his fury.","His punch was about to kill Chu Yunfan. This was the fury of the Evil God. It directly shattered the space and shook the entire sky.","Chu Yunfan also made his move. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and in an instant, eight huge gods evolved from his fist force.","These gods were like the gods who created the world. They swept through everything and suppressed everything.","Boom!","The entire sky was trembling. He fought with the strong without any hesitation.","The terrifying power of both sides exploded in the air, appearing extremely gorgeous.","The entire world was boiling.","When the aftermath of the explosion was about to fall into the Imperial Capital, a powerful domain appeared under Chu Yunfan’s feet. The aftermath of the explosion fell into the domain and disappeared without a trace.","The Imperial Capital, which was enveloped by the domain, was not affected at all.","Everyone in the Imperial City could not help but heave a sigh of relief. They were almost scared to death by the aftershocks of the battle between the two sides.","At this moment, the battle between the two sides was clearly a level higher than the battle between the human king and the Evil God.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The fists of both sides collided countless times in the air. It was unknown when it happened, but everyone only heard a loud collision and the clear sound of bones breaking.","Following that, blood splattered everywhere. Everyone saw the Evil God retreat hurriedly, clutching his wrist.","At this moment, his fist exploded, and blood sprayed out.","The Evil God’s cold expression finally showed some shock.","“Impossible! I’m Master’s creation! I’m the strongest! How could I be injured by a human?!” the Evil God roared. This was different from the script.","He was said to be Master’s creation, and there was no one in the world who could match him.","But now, he had met his opponent. It could even be said that in a head-on battle, he was at a disadvantage and was heavily injured.","The legend of the invincible Evil God was broken. This was a humiliation to him.","“Strongest? Haha!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “The so-called strongest is only so much. It seems that your race is just a monkey claiming to be king when there is no tiger in the mountain!”","Chu Yunfan’s words were like a needle that pierced the Evil God’s heart.","He was confident that he was invincible in the half-Emperor Stage.","Even if someone could stand shoulder to shoulder with him, that was already his limit. It was impossible for him to be stronger.","But now, Chu Yunfan had subverted and changed his worldview.","The so-called invincibility was just because he hadn’t met Chu Yunfan.","The Evil God roared again and pounced toward Chu Yunfan. His entire body was covered in extremely dense evil energy, and the Evil God domain swept toward Chu Yunfan.","This domain that belonged to the Evil Gods was extremely terrifying and evil!","At the same time, it was full of aggressiveness and directly enveloped Chu Yunfan.","“Evil God Domain? Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted and punched the Evil God’s domain.","Chu Yunfan’s fist force was like a meteor that tore through the night sky and shattered the galaxy.","The punch did not lose its momentum and directly hit the Evil God.","Bam!","The punch almost shattered half of the Evil God’s body, and blood gushed out.","He had dodged the most fatal attack at the critical moment. Otherwise, his heart would have been pierced by now.","Even so, his entire left arm was directly crippled. It shattered in the air, and blood flowed everywhere.","“How could this be? The glory of our Evil God race was given by Master. How could we fail? How could we allow failure!” the Evil God roared furiously.","He endured the pain and was burning with rage.","He didn’t allow the glory of the Evil God race to end in his hands. That was the glory that his master had given him, and he didn’t allow anything to taint it.","Evil Energy overflowed from his body, and wisps of it turned into ripples that appeared behind him, forming an incomparably huge black shadow."]},{"number":2462,"title":"Chapter 2462: Defeating the Evil God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2462: Defeating the Evil God","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Evil God kept roaring, not willing to accept his failure.","To him, his failure was equivalent to his master’s failure. This was absolutely intolerable.","The Evil God’s entire body was emitting an extremely dangerous aura.","The injuries all over his body were not suppressed. On the contrary, they were still worsening.","The human king, who had finished healing, waved his hand to restore the barrier while staring at the Evil God.","This time, the Evil God’s sudden attack caught the human king off guard.","The human king had even been forced to use a method like the Luck Dragon to protect himself. However, even so, it seemed to be useless in front of the Evil God’s seal.","He had been seriously injured by the explosion, and even the Luck Dragon had collapsed.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t returned from the otherworld at the critical moment, humanity would have been finished.","This Evil God was really strange. In fact, when Chu Yunfan killed those Evil Gods, he had mentioned his own guess to the human king.","These Evil Gods were very likely man-made.","Behind the Evil Gods, there might be a mastermind.","At that time, he did not have a complete understanding. To him, the mastermind behind the scenes was like a cloud far away in the sky.","After all, Evil Gods had existed for countless years. If such a level of Evil God had appeared back then, humanity would have been destroyed or enslaved for countless years.","In his opinion, even if the mastermind existed, he might have already fallen. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have cared about these Evil Gods for so many years.","However, he didn’t expect the mastermind to appear a few years after Chu Yunfan left.","At this moment, he realized that he had probably thought wrongly. Not only was the mastermind not dead, but on the contrary, he was probably still alive and well.","Not to mention, just one of the man-made objects and a slave already had the strength of a half-Emperor. How powerful was this mastermind? A legendary Emperor?","Thinking of this, the human king felt a chill run down his spine.","If there really was an Emperor standing behind them, then the consequences would be unimaginable!","At his current level of cultivation, he understood the shocking difference between a half-Emperor and a true Emperor.","He was only one step away from becoming an Emperor, but this step was a natural chasm.","Heaven and earth were roaring and trembling in the Evil God’s rage. It was as if the world was trembling in his rage.","Compared to before, the Evil God was at least twice as strong.","The human king’s expression changed drastically.","The Evil God was burning itself in exchange for a temporary boost in strength.","“Crazy, he must be crazy!” the human king said.","If this continued, the Evil God would definitely die.","But then he realized that this Evil God was not an ordinary creature.","It was simply a man-made object. The reverence they had for their creator was deep into their bones. It could not be compared to ordinary living beings.","Normally, living beings who had cultivated to this level would not recognize anyone as their master. They only believed that they were invincible and believed in their own Dao. That was why they could reach this step.","If there was even the slightest bit of retreat or lack of confidence, it would be impossible for one to cultivate to this stage.","This Evil God was stronger than him only because he was stronger than him, not because the Evil God’s Dao was stronger than the human king’s Dao.","Compared to the human king who had reached the half-Emperor Stage step by step, the Evil God’s Dao was not even worth mentioning.","The reason why the Evil God had such power was because of the mysterious master behind it, not the Evil God itself!","This was a completely different concept.","“You’re going to die!” the Evil God stared at Chu Yunfan and shouted, “You’re going to die for blaspheming my master!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression didn’t change at all, but he also knew that it was time to decide the outcome. The Evil God had used a secret technique to raise its strength to an astonishing level in a short period of time.","However, that was only a short-term improvement. In fact, this short-term improvement could be as short as a few short moves.","Originally, Chu Yunfan could have completely avoided the attack.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t plan to avoid the attack. On the contrary, under the Evil God’s terrifying airwaves, Chu Yunfan’s black hair scattered and his body rose from the ground.","Chu Yunfan directly collided with the Evil God.","Boom!","The entire world trembled violently and collapsed, turning the sky into a domain of death.","The Evil God’s eyes were spewing fire. In his life, he had seen countless experts. He had lived for too long and had never met an existence like Chu Yunfan.","He had seen many half-Emperors in his life, from birth, to growth, to peak, to decline, to fall.","Who knew how many people had died in his hands.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He looked very young, but he had an invincible aura.","It was unknown how many years it would take to sweep the world to cultivate such an aura. If he had a similar aura before, it would be impossible.","After this battle, Chu Yunfan had destroyed all of his pride. He was almost forced to a dead end and had no choice but to use this method to clear his master’s name.","This was also the Dao in his heart, the Dao that had supported him for so many years. He would never allow anyone to insult it.","This was an earth-shattering collision. Every collision caused the chaos in the world to splash out.","If not for the human king supporting the barrier around the Imperial Capital, the entire Imperial Capital would have been reduced to nothingness under such an attack.","The more the two sides fought, the farther they moved from the Central Plains. After a few exchanges, they had already entered the void.","It wasn’t that the Evil God was willing to avoid the Central Plains. On the contrary, he had been forced out of the Central Plains by Chu Yunfan. From afar, everyone could see that the aftershock of their battle was brighter than the stars.","Even though they were thousands of miles away, they still felt terrified.","It was rumored that the battle between Emperors could even destroy the stars!","After all, they were quite knowledgeable. Naturally, they knew that the stars in the sky were not light bulbs. They were equivalent to huge worlds.","A battle between Emperors could blow up worlds. How terrifying was this?","They didn’t even dare to think about it!","Just the battle between the half-Emperors was enough to shock everyone.","After a few moves, the Evil God who was originally undefeatable let out a muffled groan and retreated. His body exploded and Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through his body.","Victory was decided!","Even though the Evil God had already exceeded his level, the difference in strength between him and Chu Yunfan was too great. He was not a match at all!","Rumble!","The explosion of the Evil God’s body created a huge mushroom cloud in the void.","The Evil God was dead!"]},{"number":2463,"title":"Chapter 2463: Can’t Be Beaten Passively","paragraphs":["Chapter 2463: Can’t Be Beaten Passively","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now that the Evil God had died, everyone finally heaved a sigh of relief!","The battle of the Evil God was earth-shattering. At the same time, it was also earth-shattering!","It almost blew the entire Imperial Capital into smithereens.","It had forced everyone to the point where they had no way out. In fact, with the strength of that Evil God, after defeating the human king, it could easily slaughter all the humans in the Imperial Capital and even the Central Plains.","Many people had even begun to rebuild their homes.","In the depths of the Imperial Palace.","After the human king who had escaped a calamity recovered from his injuries, his complexion looked much better.","“This time, it’s all thanks to you, King Chu. Otherwise, I would have been doomed!” The human king smiled. He did not waver in the slightest in the face of today’s defeat.","A cultivator at his level had a firm will that could be said to be as firm as a rock. Even if he encountered a situation where the world collapsed, his will would not waver at all.","If he didn’t have such determination, he wouldn’t have been able to reach this stage!","Who knew how many powerful enemies he had to defeat to reach the half-Emperor Stage!","“I didn’t expect them to come so quickly!” Chu Yunfan frowned and said.","He really didn’t expect that the person behind the Evil God would suddenly appear at this time. He thought that he would be fine after going back for a few years. Who would have thought that something would happen at this time.","“There’s nothing we can do. We’re weak, so we can only be beaten passively!” the human king smiled and said.","He didn’t feel that depressed. He was weak, so he could only be beaten passively.","If he was strong enough, this would not be a problem!","If he was already a genuine human king, then it would be useless no matter when the other party came to kill him.","“How was your return to your hometown?” the human king asked.","“I brought my parents and some relatives here!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t explain much about this, but he didn’t hide it either, because there was no need to.","The human king didn’t ask too much, although he was also very puzzled. Chu Yunfan was different from the rumors. He didn’t come from the Violet Thunder Prefecture.","He came from another world!","In fact, at his level of cultivation, the human king naturally knew that there were many other worlds.","During the most glorious period of the ancient era, many Emperors ruled the myriad worlds together. No one knew how many worlds there were.","The Central Plains, the Kunlun Realm, and even the Demon Realm were all part of the system of the myriad worlds.","However, with their current strength, it was impossible for them to conquer and rule the myriad worlds like the Emperors.","But now, he could already feel the threat from the other worlds!","The existence behind this Evil God probably meant that it wasn’t just a mastermind. There might even be a huge world behind it.","Even a powerful half-Emperor Evil God had become a slave. There was no doubt how terrifying that world was.","As for the fact that he didn’t have a massive world behind him, that was simply impossible. Even Emperors couldn’t materialize out of thin air. If he hadn’t occupied a world, the Central Plains would have been conquered long ago.","However, he could just leave a few Evil Gods here and let it go.","“However, although you killed this Evil God, there’s probably a powerful mastermind behind it. The spatial coordinates of the Central Plains have already been obtained, and the other party will receive the news sooner or later. At that time, we’ll probably die without a burial ground!” the human king said worriedly.","As long as they had the spatial coordinates of the Central Plains, it would only be a matter of time before the other party arrived. At that time, the Central Plains would be doomed.","This was especially so for a half-Emperor Evil God. The mastermind behind this was very likely to be an Emperor-level existence. Even if it was just a possibility, it was still not something the Central Plains could withstand.","Even if there was only a one percent chance, it was a hundred percent chance of destruction for the Central Plains.","“That’s right. This is also what I’m most worried about. I originally thought that it would take many years for the other party to obtain the news. From the looks of it, it won’t be long!”","Chu Yunfan was equally worried. He was even worried about the Kunlun Realm and Earth. When he came to the Central Plains, he had already concealed the spatial coordinates of the Kunlun Realm and banished the entrance into the endless void.","In the future, no one in the Central Plains would be able to go to the Kunlun Realm or Earth except Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had the same worry.","He was afraid that someone would invade the Kunlun Realm from the Central Plains.","“I have an idea. Since it’s inevitable that the other party will come, why don’t you let me go to the world where the other party is and see who he is!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Even if there is a battlefield, it shouldn’t be in the Central Plains!” Chu Yunfan said.","“You want to cross the void?” the human king said in shock.","According to his understanding of the many worlds in the void, those worlds were like gems embedded in the endless void.","However, if one wanted to travel far into the void, one had to be at least a martial arts master above the King Stage.","That was because those worlds were too far apart. They were simply endless. If one wanted to cross such a void, it would take an unknown amount of time. There was no telling how many dangers they would encounter along the way. There were mysterious and powerful creatures living in the void, as well as incomparably terrifying spatial turbulence.","These spatial turbulences were even enough to easily tear a half-King into pieces. Only a King with a portion of the ability to travel through space could resist such spatial turbulences and even the spatial storms caused by them.","Even a world as close as the Demon Realm was not easy to reach. It was only because the Dmeon Realm and the Central Plains had killed each other for many years and had fought against each other that they knew each other’s location and could communicate with each other.","Or perhaps there was already a teleportation formation between the Kunlun Realm and the Central Plains, which allowed them to travel back and forth in a short period of time.","No matter what, traveling between worlds was still a very dangerous thing, even for half-Emperors.","Generally speaking, Kings would only explore the space around the Central Plains and would not venture too far away. Otherwise, they might encounter great danger.","“Being beaten up passively isn’t my style. Before the other party can react, I’ll go to the other party’s world to take a look. If possible, I’ll kill the mastermind behind the scenes and prevent future trouble!” Chu Yunfan calmly stated his plan."]},{"number":2464,"title":"Chapter 2464: Times Make Heroes, Heroes Make Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 2464: Times Make Heroes, Heroes Make Times","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“In that case, you can do it. However, I have to make my final plans!” the human king said. “I plan to break through to the Emperor Stage. If I can reach the Emperor Stage, we won’t have to be so passive!”","When the human king spoke, his expression was somewhat firm. For him, this was perhaps the only feasible method at the moment. He would try to break through to the Emperor Stage.","“I don’t think so. First of all, you don’t have enough foundation to break through to the Emperor Stage. The founder died trying to break through to the Emperor Stage, didn’t he?” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Hearing Chu Yunfan mention the founder of Grand Xia, the human king’s eyes narrowed. It was normal for Chu Yunfan to know about the founder.","After all, although the matter of the founder was a secret, it could not be hidden from those truly top-notch figures. Moreover, after so many years, many things had already spread.","In the history of Grand Xia, there had been many human kings. However, among these human kings, those with strong aptitude were at the peak of the King Stage, while those with poor aptitude were only at the ordinary King Stage.","Since ancient times, it had never changed. Besides him, the only person who had cultivated to the half-Emperor Stage was the founder.","Breaking through from the peak King Stage to the half-Emperor Stage was not something that could be done step by step. It could even be said that it was a qualitative change caused by a quantitative change.","Half of his body had squeezed into the Emperor Stage. Those who could squeeze in could squeeze in, but those who couldn’t squeeze in couldn’t.","With the resources that the royal family of Grand Xia had, it could be said that it was equivalent to the sum of the ten great sects. However, after so many years, only he and the founder had entered the half-Emperor Stage.","He knew very well that it was not because his aptitude was better than many of the previous Kings, but because he lived in a better era.","Heroes created times, and times also created heroes!","This was a process of mutual influence!","Back then, during the era of the founder, the world was in turmoil. Only then did a group of talented people like the founder rule the world.","And the human king’s era was even more glorious than the era of the founder. Countless young geniuses had revived in this era.","He could clearly feel that the fate of the Great Era had been expanded. It was like countless big fish had made a quagmire bigger so that it could accommodate even bigger fish.","After breaking through to the half-Emperor Stage, the founder was severely injured when he tried to break through to the Emperor Stage.","Although he survived with great difficulty, his foundation was injured. After he stabilized the world, he passed away in less than a thousand years.","To a half-Emperor, this was no different from an ordinary person dying at the age of 20.","At that time, it even caused a huge upheaval in the Imperial Court, almost causing Grand Xia to collapse halfway.","Since then, successive generations of King humans had faced the flames of war and died in the battle to pacify the four directions.","This was a bloody example for the human king.","If he died, it would undoubtedly cause a huge upheaval in Grand Xia.","This was especially true for the geniuses of the ancient times. The Supreme Youths would undoubtedly be a huge pressure for Grand Xia.","It might even repeat the situation after the death of the founder, causing Grand Xia to be on the verge of collapse.","“If you want to reach Emperor Stage, you need to train thousands of times!” Chu Yunfan said. “It’s just that your foundation is still far from Emperor Stage at this time. The chances of you breaking through by force are very low. Even if you do, it’ll be very disadvantageous for your future development after you break through to Emperor Stage!”","“Hahahaha, looking at you now, it’s as if I’m talking to an elder!” The human king laughed. “What you said makes sense, but this is also the only feasible path at the moment. I can’t give up, but I won’t force a breakthrough. Besides, I can’t be too far behind you. I’m afraid that your cultivation has become more and more unfathomable now, and you’re not far from breaking through!”","“Yes, I’m very close to that point.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “But that step alone will take a very long time.”","Although they were both at the half-Emperor Stage, Chu Yunfan had gone much further than the human king.","The human king could only be considered to have just stepped into the half-Emperor Stage, but he had already walked this path to the extreme. He was only half a step away from the Emperor Stage.","In a sense, if one person was at the beginning of this road, the other person would already be at the end of this road.","“How about this? We’ll each do what we want. It’s always good to be prepared!” the human king said.","“Alright, let’s do things according to our own ideas!” Chu Yunfan agreed. “However, I might need your help to take care of the relatives I brought from my hometown!”","The human king nodded. “That’s not a problem. Even without me, the forces you left behind will not let them suffer!”","The human king did not avoid Chu Yunfan’s forces. The relationship between the two was far more harmonious than ordinary people imagined.","There was not much reason. It was just that this path was too lonely. It was rare to be able to cultivate to their level since ancient times. Moreover, they were not enemies. This was even rarer.","“In that case, I’ll take my leave first. I’ll go back and prepare!” Chu Yunfan said.","The human king nodded and watched Chu Yunfan leave.","After Chu Yunfan left, he returned to Zhenyuan City to meet his parents.","“Are you leaving again?” His father, Chu Wencheng, asked.","After coming to the Central Plains, he realized how big his son’s career was now. It couldn’t be compared to the Kunlun Realm.","The business he had done in the Kunlun Realm had seemed huge at the time, but now, it paled in comparison to the business in the Central Plains.","“Yes, there’s something that I have to deal with immediately. I need some time!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t mention what exactly happened, but his family had already guessed that it was probably not a small matter. Otherwise, there was no need for an existence of Chu Yunfan’s level to personally go.","“You guys stay here. Siyu will take care of you. You can order the others around as well. If you can’t resolve any of them, you can head to the Imperial Capital to inform the human king!” Chu Yunfan said.","After he had finished explaining everything, Chu Yunfan went to Tang Siyu and gave her the details of his breakthrough to the half-Emperor Stage and even the information about his breakthrough to the Emperor Stage.","Because even Chu Yunfan himself didn’t know when he would come back, or even if he would come back.","After doing all this, Chu Yunfan entered the void. Through the Evil God’s corpse, he opened an altar and prepared to sense the world where the mastermind was."]},{"number":2465,"title":"Chapter 2465: A Brand New World, Where the Emperors Are","paragraphs":["Chapter 2465: A Brand New World, Where the Emperors Are","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the boundless void, a star path crossed countless galaxies.","It was just that this star path was invisible to ordinary people. Only martial arts masters above the King Stage could see it.","In fact, only martial arts masters above the King Stage could cross the starry sky. Ordinary people would exhaust their divine power and die halfway through.","Chu Yunfan had been flying on the star path for a whole year.","Along the way, Chu Yunfan encountered some planets with civilizations, but they were not dimensional worlds.","Planets were the lowest level of worlds. Some planets had special encounters and would be upgraded to half-dimensions. For example, the Kunlun Realm was a half-dimension.","Further up were the true dimensions. For example, the Central Plains was a dimension.","From the outside, the Central Plains did not look like a planet. On the contrary, it looked like an enormous continent.","Around the continent were countless asteroid belts.","From afar, it looked like a huge halo!","However, compared to the huge dimension that Chu Yunfan was looking at now, it was simply insignificant.","In front of Chu Yunfan, an incomparably huge continent appeared. Just the diameter of this continent was already more than ten thousand light years. In front of such a huge plane, the Central Plains could only be considered a small ant.","“We’re finally here. The Evil Gods came from this world?”","This dimension was surrounded by a huge natural barrier that protected the entire world.","To be precise, among the planets, half-dimensions, and dimensions, only the planets were truly in this universe, and only half of the half-dimensions were in the universe. Under certain circumstances, they might be observed, and under certain circumstances, they might appear in this universe.","For example, the Kunlun Realm was split open by a sword, connecting it to Earth and creating a passageway.","However, a planedimension was completely different. A dimension was equivalent to a miniature universe, but compared to a real universe, it was completely different.","However, it was a world that was already independent of this universe.","Therefore, no matter what, it would not be observed by the people in this universe, nor would it appear in this universe.","It was a place that could only be reached through the star path.","In this vast universe, the star paths that extended in all directions were built when the Emperors ruled the myriad worlds.","Through these star paths, one could connect to planets, half-dimensions, and dimensions.","Without the guidance of the star paths, even a half-Emperor like Chu Yunfan would not be able to find such a huge world accurately.","There was an Emperor in this world!","Chu Yunfan immediately made a judgment. There was no other reason than that a true dragon couldn’t be raised in the water!","Only a sufficiently large world could give birth to an expert at the level of an Emperor!","Chu Yunfan, who had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, knew very well how earth-shattering the scene would be when an Emperor was about to break through.","This was also the reason why he had not attempted to break through in the Central Plains. True dragons could not be raised in shallow waters.","The spirit energy in the Kunlun Realm and Earth alone might not be enough for his breakthrough.","If he wanted to make a breakthrough in the Central Plains, he alone would be enough to wipe out the Central Plains and turn it into an apocalyptic world.","Chu Yunfan had seen people who would sacrifice billions of lives for one person, but he was not that kind of person.","There was no need to!","He had too many tricks up his sleeve!","Now that he had come to a world as big as the sky, it was undoubtedly like a dragon returning to the sea for him!","This was also the reason why he insisted on going alone.","Thinking that there might be more than one Emperor in this macro world, Chu Yunfan felt that all the cells in his body were boiling and about to explode.","In the Central Plains, he was invincible, and there was no one who could match him. This had almost worn away his fighting spirit. He needed a world like this, an endless stream of opponents to temper him and help him break through.","Chu Yunfan leaped up and struck with his hand. A Flying Celestial Palm Strike smashed onto the world barrier.","Boom!","A small crack appeared on the world barrier, but it immediately recovered in a thousandth of a second.","The sturdiness of this world barrier was obvious.","In just a thousandth of a second, Chu Yunfan transformed into a beam of light and entered the cave.","Chu Yunfan had just entered this world and had yet to see the scenery, but he already felt an unprecedented feeling.","The feeling of a dragon swimming in the sea!","In the Central Plains, Chu Yunfan could easily break through the walls of the world with a casual blow, even knocking out the chaos. He was simply too weak.","It was like a prehistoric beast struggling in a pool. Although it was invincible, it also limited his future.","Now, he was back in the sea.","The world barrier of this world was so strong that Chu Yunfan estimated that even if he attacked with all his strength, he would only be able to make a small crack at most, and then it would immediately recover.","In the outside world, Chu Yunfan could easily tear open space. Every jump was like a wormhole jump. He could jump hundreds of thousands or even millions of kilometers away.","It would only take him about three minutes to leave the Milky Way.","However, in this place, just tearing through space required one to exert all their strength. It was difficult to jump ten thousand miles away in one go.","Even ordinary Kings below the half-Emperor Stage probably could not tear space. They had to fly by themselves if they wanted to go anywhere.","Thinking about the size of this world, it was estimated that many Kings had never really seen the full picture of this world in their entire lives.","Only an Emperor would have the ability to warp the entire world at will.","“Although it’s very restricted, this is the world I want. Hahahahahaha!” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter.","He felt that he could break through again. He could clearly sense that although the world barrier was far sturdier than the Central Plains, the laws of the world were much more relaxed.","This also meant that this world would allow even more experts to be born. Under such circumstances, there would be a hundred times, or even a thousand times more experts born in this mysterious world than the Central Plains.","‘The origin of this world is already close to that piece of heaven and earth in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories!’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself.","The world in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories was not a fragile world like the Central Plains. It was a vast world inhabited by many Emperors, and it was also a base for conquering the myriad worlds.","And now, the origin and essence of this world was already close to the world in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that had not experienced the ancient war."]},{"number":2466,"title":"Chapter 2466: Saving People","paragraphs":["Chapter 2466: Saving People","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That was the true core of the myriad worlds, and the struggle for hegemony among the Emperors also took place there.","To be able to withstand the hegemony of the various Emperors, there was no doubt about how sturdy that world would be.","Now, this world was roughly the same as that world, but it was much smaller than the world at its peak.","All of a sudden, an overwhelming number of monsters flew over from afar. These monsters looked like lions, but they had pairs of wings on their backs.","Each of these lions was extremely terrifying. They were basically at the half-King Stage, and many of them were already at the King Stage.","There were tens of thousands of them!","One could imagine how shocking it was!","If this was the Central Plains, this group of monsters would be enough to sweep through the entire Central Plains!","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid and did not take these waving hands seriously.","The Emperors and Peak-tier Kings were not on the same level, let alone ordinary Kings.","“True dragons can only be raised in the sea. A monster horde of this scale is absolutely impossible in the Central Plains!” Chu Yunfan sighed.","He could even see that in the core area of these monsters, a kingdom had actually been established. In it, there was a peak King monster that looked like a tiger.","This group of monsters was like a tornado, sweeping in all directions. There was no way to stop them.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan saw a group of young people flying over from afar. These young people were all wearing green robes and looked very elegant. They were riding on flying swords and their cultivation was very shocking.","They were all at the half-King Stage, and the leader of them was actually at the King Stage. This was very rare.","Because Chu Yunfan could see that these people were actually not old.","Don’t look at the Central Plains, where all kinds of geniuses were like an explosion. Kings of this age appeared one after another, but that was the essence of the Central Plains that had been accumulated for countless years.","Under normal circumstances, how could there be so many experts?","“Interesting!”","Chu Yunfan watched from afar. These young people were fighting on the periphery of this group of monsters and did not dare to go too deep.","This group of monsters numbered in the tens of thousands, and each of them was the size of a small mountain.","These tens of thousands of them took up a very large area.","Even if an intense battle had occurred, it had only alarmed a small portion of them.","In other words, these young people were not enough to move most of the monsters.","However, just the monsters at the edge of the area were very fierce. Chu Yunfan saw a young man being torn into two halves and swallowed by these monsters.","In the Central Plains, half-Kings were already a vassal, a mighty figure. Yet here, they were being killed like ants. One could only imagine how dire the situation was.","After the leader of the Kings attacked, everything was different.","It was not a problem for a King to casually slaughter these half-Kings.","However, very quickly, three King monsters flew out of the monster horde and led a group of monsters to surround these people.","Even this group of people did not expect such an unforeseen event to happen. Therefore, they were almost unprepared and were immediately surrounded.","Although the leader was decisive and wanted to leave immediately, he still had the urge to tear through space to escape.","However, when he wanted to escape, he discovered that the space was actually fixed by someone.","The domain released by the three King monsters directly locked the space.","The leader’s wish to escape was dashed.","Originally, their matters had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan was new here and wanted to understand the basic situation of this world.","After thinking for a while, Chu Yunfan made a decision. With a thought, cracks appeared in the space that the three King monsters had stabilized, and it began to shake.","When the leader of the group saw this, although he did not know what was going on, he immediately made a judgment and disappeared into the encirclement with the other young men.","“Roar!”","From afar, the angry roars of these monsters could be heard as they watched their prey run away from their eyes, making them burn with anger.","The group of people had just escaped from the tigers’ mouth when they realized that the place they were moving to was not the place they had expected.","Instead, they appeared directly beside a person.","Everyone looked over and saw that the person was about twenty years old. He was dressed in green and looked very young. Just as everyone was suspicious, the middle-aged man in the lead said, “I’m Lu Tianbo. Thank you for saving my life!”","The group of young men and women finally understood at this moment. The reason why they could suddenly escape from danger was related to this young man.","“Thank you, senior!”","After understanding this, these young people immediately bowed.","They did not dare to be negligent. The person in front of them looked very young, but who knew when he was an old monster who had been dormant.","After all, someone who could easily save them from a group of monsters could not be an ordinary person.","Most of these people were eccentric and temperamental. Even if a random thought wanted to kill them, they would not be able to fight back.","In the Central Plains, a half-King could be said to be a vassal, wielding great power and prestige. However, in this world, a half-King was not an impressive figure.","Only Kings could have some status. Half-Kings could only be considered elite disciples.","In front of those temperamental old monsters, they were not even ants.","“You’re welcome!” Chu Yunfan waved his hand and said. “I naturally have my reasons for saving you. I need you!”","“Senior, please speak frankly!” the leader, Lu Tianbo, hurriedly said.","In his opinion, there was only one possibility for someone to be able to save him from the hands of those King monsters. That person was at least at the peak of the King Stage.","He was very clear about the difference between a normal King and a peak King. No matter how young this person looked, he could be an old monster that he couldn’t afford to offend.","However, this also slightly alleviated the doubts in his heart. It was even more terrifying without a goal. It was much more normal if there was a goal.","“I have sealed myself for many years, but I didn’t know that the world had already become like this. I also want to ask, what is the situation in the world?” Chu Yunfan said calmly."]},{"number":2467,"title":"Chapter 2467: The Situation in the Ancient Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 2467: The Situation in the Ancient Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Yes, this time, Chu Yunfan was pretending to be a self-proclaimed senior expert.","He could tell that these people were very certain of his identity as a senior.","Of course, half-Emperors weren’t immortal. Even the Emperors weren’t immortal.","However, he had been able to survive until now through self-sealing, just like those ancient prodigies of the Central Plains in their prime.","Such methods had existed since ancient times and were not unique to the Central Plains.","That was why Chu Yunfan felt at ease pretending to be such a senior expert.","“I see!”","Everyone’s faces revealed an expression of “I knew it.” The aura on Chu Yunfan’s body was different from this era and this world.","They had already guessed it, but now it was just a confirmation. It was indeed as they had guessed. Chu Yunfan was indeed a top expert from a distant era.","“So this is what you wanted to ask, senior!”","Lu Tianbo tried his best to remain calm, but he had already guessed Chu Yunfan’s purpose.","Chu Yunfan had probably sealed himself for too long, so long that his original power had been obliterated.","Otherwise, wouldn’t Chu Yunfan know everything if he asked the descendants of his family?","But now, Chu Yunfan was asking outsiders. Wasn’t everything clear?","The power of this senior in front of them should have been destroyed. This was actually a good thing for them.","Then, Lu Tianbo began to introduce the situation of this world to Chu Yunfan.","This was the first time that Chu Yunfan knew that this world was called the Ancient Realm.","The Ancient Realm had a long history, probably even longer than the Central Plains. It was a world that truly possessed a legacy.","According to Chu Yunfan’s experience over the years, he realized that the impact of the ancient war on each world was completely different.","For example, in a world like Earth, news about the myriad worlds had almost completely disappeared, and the inheritance of civilization had disappeared completely.","The Kunlun Realm only existed in some myths and legends. There was a vague knowledge of a super-ancient civilization, but there was no further research.","As for the Central Plains, they had preserved a bit more of the ancient legacies, but only the legacies after the antiquity era had been preserved. Most of them were from the modern era.","As for the antiquity era, it was basically limited to myths and legends. Many records of the antiquity era could not be seen at all. They could only be used as references. Chu Yunfan did not know as much as he did through the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","Other than knowing that a great war had broken out in the antiquity era, causing the myriad worlds to collapse and almost destroying the world, there was no useful information.","However, in the Ancient Realm, the inheritance was very clear and complete. This was because after the ancient war, several Emperors who did not participate in the battle for the godhead joined forces to preserve the world.","To be precise, it was a fragment of the world where the Emperors lived.","That was why Chu Yunfan felt that it was very similar to the world that the Alchemy Emperor had lived in in the past, because it was just one of the worlds.","After countless years of evolution, the Ancient Realm had evolved into ten great factions. These ten great factions occupied one area and formed the current structure of the Ancient Realm.","This area was the southeast of the Ancient Realm, and it was also the border between the two forces.","To the north was Evil Gods Creed’s territory, while to the south was Magi Circle.","These two forces both had Emperors overseeing them, and their forces were unparalleled for a time. This place was one of the borders of the two forces.","They were all disciples of a large city that was tens of thousands of miles away. It was called Windy City.","The force that ruled Windy City was called Windy Sect.","Lu Tianbo was one of the elders of Windy Sect.","Tens of thousands of miles was indeed very close to a King. Even if they could only fly, it was not considered very far.","However, it was precisely because of this that Chu Yunfan was a little surprised. How could such a large group of monsters be tolerated near a sect? It was as if there were countless monsters less than a thousand meters away from the capital of the Kunlun Realm.","This feeling was definitely like a fishbone stuck in his throat. It was no different from having a knife stabbed in his back.","This was nothing more than two points. One was that although Windy Sect occupied the city, their strength was limited. The other was that in this Ancient Realm, such monster groups were very strong, so strong that even Windy Sect could not clean them up.","They had no choice but to rely on the city to protect themselves.","Chu Yunfan was rapidly analyzing the situation in the Ancient Realm based on Lu Tianbo’s words. However, when he heard about Evil Gods Creed, he could not help but raise his eyebrows.","If this Evil Gods Creed was the mastermind behind the Evil Gods that he knew, then this matter would be a little interesting.","According to Lu Tianbo, there was an Emperor behind Evil Gods Creed, the legendary Emperor Evil who suppressed the heavens.","The Evil Gods Creed was a faction established by Emperor Evil. If an Emperor were to set their eyes on it, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Although he knew from Lu Tianbo that each of the top ten forces had an Emperor overseeing them, in reality, Emperors had not been in charge for many years. In fact, there were even Emperors who had sealed themselves all year round.","The sect masters and cult masters of the various forces were basically the disciples of the Emperors after countless generations.","After all, the lifespan of Emperors was limited. If they did not seal themselves, they would have died of old age!","Having the ability to change the world but not having an endless lifespan was a pain in the hearts of countless cultivators.","The famous Emperors had the ability to capture the stars and the moon, but they had no choice but to seal themselves to avoid the harm of time. How miserable was this?","But even so, Chu Yunfan couldn’t let his guard down.","Suddenly, just as Lu Tianbo was explaining to Chu Yunfan, he saw the monsters flying directly toward Chu Yunfan.","“Not good! Those Winged Lions have discovered us!”","Lu Tianbo’s expression changed drastically.","There were tens of thousands of Winged Lions, and even he only dared to wander around the border to hunt, not daring to go deep. If it wasn’t for the protection of the city, the strength of these Winged Lions could even rival their Windy City. It wouldn’t be difficult to kill all of them.","The Windy Sect disciples behind him were so scared that their faces turned ashen.","Just now, he had almost been trapped in the midst of these Winged Lions, so he was naturally even more worried now.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and slapped down with his hand.","Boom!","With a single palm strike, 200 to 300 Winged Lions were directly smashed into dust. Among them, there was no lack of King Winged Lions."]},{"number":2468,"title":"Chapter 2468: Display of Strength, Windy City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2468: Display of Strength, Windy City","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the disciples of Windy Sect saw this scene, it was as if they had seen a ghost. They did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying and powerful.","With a casual attack, he had actually killed hundreds of Winged Lions, and there were even Kings among them.","Although Kings were not supreme in the Ancient Realm, they could still be considered figures of a region. They were no longer small fries.","For now, he was still someone they looked up to, but Chu Yunfan could easily kill him.","This senior’s strength was probably far beyond their previous imagination.","He was at least a terrifying existence at the peak of the King Stage.","What kind of level was that? He was undoubtedly a high and mighty figure that they did not even have the right to look up to.","However, Chu Yunfan’s attack did not scare the Winged Lions. On the contrary, it made them even angrier. They roared and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly once again.","Then, his figure rose from the ground and turned into a stream of light that directly killed the Winged Lions.","At this moment, these Windy Sect disciples finally experienced what it meant to be a top expert.","Chu Yunfan used the Seven Violet Thunder Swords with one hand, and the other hand slapped down with the Celestial Palm.","They had finally witnessed what killing was.","Each of Chu Yunfan’s attacks could cause 200 to 300 Winged Lions to die.","Soon, the Kings of these Winged Lions flew toward Chu Yunfan, but how could they stop him?","If one appeared, they would be easily killed. It was no different from killing ordinary Winged Lions.","Finally, when this astonishing slaughter was one-third of the way through, it finally alarmed the King of this group of Winged Lions, a completely purple Winged Lion with a huge body like an archaic divine mountain.","It roared and released endless wind divine arts as it flew toward Chu Yunfan. However, in the next second, under everyone’s watchful eyes, it was slashed by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Its huge body was split into two and fell to the ground, stirring up a shocking wave of dust.","“This is... This... This...” Lu Tianbo was almost scared to death. Chu Yunfan could casually kill a peak King. What kind of cultivation was that?","“This isn’t the King Stage, it’s the half-Emperor Stage!” Behind Lu Tianbo, a Windy Sect disciple said with his mouth agape.","If one were to say that Kings were the top-notch martial arts expert that they currently needed to look up to, then there was no need to mention the half-Emperors. In the era when Emperors were not born, half-Emperors were the rulers of the world.","In an ordinary era, it was very normal for not a single Emperor to appear for thousands of years.","Each of these half-Emperors was a powerful expert. Wherever they went, they would receive preferential treatment. They were the true ruling class of the world.","After Chu Yunfan killed a peak King Winged Lion, he began to kill again. In a short period of time, tens of thousands of Winged Lions were killed.","At this moment, Lu Tianbo and the others were so shocked that they were powerless. A powerful tribe that could threaten Windy City was actually wiped out by Chu Yunfan so easily.","Only a half-Emperor could do this!","The true ruler of the world!","“Some of their limbs are crippled. They’re just some animals who don’t know life and death!” Chu Yunfan flew back and said indifferently.","These Winged Lions were not weak and naturally had intelligence, but they still could not control their beastly nature and could not rationally judge Chu Yunfan’s strength. Therefore, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, they were no different from ordinary beasts.","They were just some animals.","“Senior, you are so powerful!” Lu Tianbo quickly said.","“There’s no need to flatter me. A horde of monsters of this scale is not worth mentioning. Why? Is this horde of monsters a great threat to your Windy City?” Chu Yunfan asked casually.","“Indeed!” Lu Tianbo said with a bitter smile. “To you, this might just be a group of monsters that you can easily exterminate, but to our Windy City, this is a group of monsters that can kill us!”","At this point, Lu Tianbo carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “Thank you, senior, for resolving such a huge threat to our Windy City. If you don’t mind and are not in a hurry, why don’t you come to our Windy City for a visit? I believe our sect leader will definitely welcome you!”","Chu Yunfan smiled. This was exactly what he wanted. He nodded and said, “Alright, I’ll come take a look. I have nothing to do now anyway!”","Under Lu Tianbo’s lead, Chu Yunfan arrived at a city tens of thousands of miles away.","From afar, it could be seen that it was an extremely huge city.","It was even bigger than the city in the Kunlun Realm.","A tall city wall that towered into the clouds protected the city.","On the mottled city walls, traces of a great battle could be seen. However, it was unknown when the battle had ended, and one could vaguely feel a powerful aura.","There were still many places where there was blood. Even after so many years, this blood still contained a powerful energy, making people feel terrified.","Chu Yunfan found that there were many people queuing at the city gate. These people were paying their heavenly treasures before they were allowed to enter the city.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. That was probably the protection fee.","It was such a harsh living environment outside the city. If one wanted to obtain the protection of Windy City, they naturally had to pay a corresponding price.","There was definitely more than just a group of Winged Lions around Windy City. There were probably other different types of monsters, and each group was extremely terrifying.","Under such circumstances, these people were not dissatisfied. They all had to pay natural treasures as protection fees.","Chu Yunfan, under the lead of Lu Tianbo and the others, did not have to pay this fee.","Lu Tianbo was very humble in front of Chu Yunfan and did not dare to be impudent. However, in front of these people, he was still very awe-inspiring.","The entire Windy City was the territory of Windy Sect. As an elder of Windy Sect, he was naturally very awe-inspiring.","After crossing the huge Windy City, Chu Yunfan entered the core area of Windy City. He finally met the city lord of Windy City, who had already received the news and was waiting here. He was also the sect leader of Windy Sect.","It was a middle-aged man who looked slightly plump. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he immediately bowed and said, “I am the sect leader of Windy Sect, Zhao Junchen. Greetings, senior!”"]},{"number":2469,"title":"Chapter 2469: Becoming the Supreme Elder","paragraphs":["Chapter 2469: Becoming the Supreme Elder","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Zhao Junchen cupped his hands in a respectful manner.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He did not find it strange. As the city lord of Windy City, Zhao Juncheng was only at the peak of the King Stage.","At most, they were on par with the leader of the group of Winged Lions from before.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. No wonder Lu Tianbo said that these monster groups could threaten the survival of Windy City.","As long as there was a half-Emperor, these beasts were nothing.","Even the weakest half-Emperor could defeat a group of peak King monsters.","“No need for formalities!” Chu Yunfan nodded and said.","As a half-Emperor, he naturally had such a style.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan didn’t take offense, Zhao Junchen couldn’t help but let out a sigh of relief. He was afraid that Chu Yunfan would turn hostile. Such situations were not uncommon.","The Emperors were so noble that they would not easily wake up from their slumber. In this case, the half-Emperors were already the most noble existences in the heavens.","They would not appear easily.","These people were the rulers of the myriad worlds, just like the old Emperors of the mortal world. In a fit of anger, 100,000 corpses floated.","Zhao Junchen had already received the news, so he had prepared a banquet. All kinds of fine wine and delicacies, immortal wind and jade dew, and all the good things that he usually could not bear to take out to eat, were all brought out at this moment.","Chu Yunfan naturally did not care about ordinary things. After swallowing them, it would cause his spirit body to be contaminated.","However, Zhao Junchen clearly knew this very well. All kinds of heavenly and earthly treasures and rare beasts had been specially cooked. Even for a half-Emperor, it was a rare enjoyment.","If consumed for a long time, it would be of great benefit to one’s cultivation.","It also made Chu Yunfan’s stomach full.","At the banquet, they toasted each other. Chu Yunfan also got to know the high-ranking officials of Windy City. Other than Lu Tianbo and Zhao Junchen, there were also a series of high-ranking officials with more than 20 Kings.","These were the higher-ups of Windy City.","After Zhao Junchen’s introduction, Chu Yunfan finally understood the situation in Windy City.","To be more precise, Windy City was an amalgamation of many forces. It was not a single force at the beginning. Later on, due to various coincidences, various forces joined in, finally forming Windy City and Windy Sect.","Basically, these Kings were from different mountains and were very loose. Although Kings were not comparable to half-Emperors, they were basically considered humans in the eyes of half-Emperors. They were not ants.","Therefore, Kings had their self-esteem and pride.","Although there were many factions in Windy City, the largest faction was still the faction of the current city lord, Zhao Junchen. This included Lu Tianbo, who was also in the King Stage. He was actually an expert under Zhao Junchen.","“Senior Chu, I have a presumptuous request!” Zhao Junchen stood up and cupped his hands.","“Tell me!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Zhao Junchen said, “I would like to invite you to become the Supreme Elder of Windy City. From now on, your status in Windy City will be equal to mine. Anyway, you don’t seem to have a place to stay. If you don’t mind, please agree!”","Hearing Zhao Junchen’s words, many Kings present could not help but change their expressions. Chu Yunfan’s strength was unquestionable. He was a half-Emperor.","It was fine to provide him with good food and drinks, but if he joined them, he would become their immediate superior.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan was powerful and not an ordinary person. At that time, their lives would probably be in Chu Yunfan’s control.","Chu Yunfan saw everyone’s expressions. Even if it was only for a moment, it was enough for Chu Yunfan to know a lot of things. However, what surprised him was that none of these people objected.","It wasn’t because they were afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength. It was as if there was some reason why they didn’t come forward to reject it.","The scene was extremely silent!","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and said, “Alright, I’ll be the Supreme Elder!”","Chu Yunfan naturally had his plans. Now that he was unfamiliar with the entire Ancient Realm, he naturally needed a foothold.","At the moment, it seemed that there was no place more suitable than Windy City.","Moreover, the experts in Windy City were all limited in strength and could not pose any threat to him. It was just convenient for him to control them.","“That’s great. Zhao Junchen greets Elder Chu!” Zhao Junchen quickly said.","“Greetings, City Lord Zhao!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “But I also have a presumptuous request!”","“Elder Chu, please speak. You are now the Supreme Elder of Windy City. This is your home. If you have anything to say, just say it!” Zhao Junchen quickly said with a sincere expression as if he was not afraid of Chu Yunfan’s excessive request.","Chu Yunfan nodded. “I would like to take a look at Windy City’s Hidden Scripture Treasury. After all, I’ve been away for too long. There are many things I don’t understand!”","When Zhao Junchen heard this, he couldn’t help but heave a sigh of relief. Although he was already prepared to agree to whatever request Chu Yunfan made, Chu Yunfan’s request was really nothing.","If it was someone else who made this request, they would probably be humiliated. Other than all kinds of classics in the Hidden Scripture Treasury, there were also cultivation techniques for them.","Although there would not be the most secret true techniques in it, there was no lack of things related to their cultivation.","After a long time, others would be able to see through some of their cultivation paths and become a weakness in the hands of others.","Of course, it was not so troublesome for Chu Yunfan. With his strength, he did not need to know who these people were. With a slap, they would die even if they did not die.","Simple and crude, it was that simple!","Therefore, he did not have such fear because Chu Yunfan had surpassed them by too much.","Zhao Junchen sighed in his heart. He was only half a step away from becoming a half-Emperor, but this half a step had taken him a lifetime. He had already walked through half of his life. Although he didn’t look old, he was already nearing the end of his life.","However, if he couldn’t cross it, he would still be an ant!","A half-Emperor could speak confidently in front of the other Emperors, but what was he to them?","They were just slightly bigger ants!","“Of course, that’s not a problem. I’ll arrange for someone to bring you to the Hidden Scripture Treasury immediately, Elder Chu!” Zhao Junchen quickly said.","Chu Yunfan nodded.","The other higher-ups of Windy City also breathed a sigh of relief. They were also afraid that Chu Yunfan would raise some extreme conditions."]},{"number":2470,"title":"Chapter 2470: The Nine Half-Emperor Stages","paragraphs":["Chapter 2470: The Nine Half-Emperor Stages","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now that they saw that Chu Yunfan did not make any more outrageous requests, they could not help but sigh in relief. It seemed that this old senior was not a temperamental person. In general, their luck was still good.","Chu Yunfan only smiled at all of this. He had seen everything, but he didn’t take it to heart.","He knew that these people were scheming, but he was also scheming. The relationship between them now was them just using each other. There was no relationship between them.","Anyway, the decision was in his hands. If he wanted to leave, it was just a matter of a thought!","These people couldn’t stop him!","In the city lord’s mansion of Windy City.","Zhao Junchen and Lu Tianbo sat opposite each other.","“You did well this time. You’ve found a half-Emperor for us!” Zhao Junchen smiled and gestured.","“It’s just that whether he’s willing to support us or not is still unknown!” Lu Tianbo sighed.","The two of them smiled bitterly at each other. They were both Kings and had equal status, but they were useless against Chu Yunfan, who was a terrifying half-Emperor.","“No matter what, it seems that this senior is relatively easy to talk to. It’s better to have hope than no hope!” Zhao Junchen said, “At my age, the chances of me breaking through to the half-Emperor realm are too low. Even if I take the risk, the chances of success are less than one in ten thousand. The only thing left is death!","“I have no other thoughts now. The only thing I want is to pass on the Dao that my teacher passed down. No one can destroy our Dao!”","At this point, Zhao Junchen’s expression was already somewhat sinister.","“Yeah, we have no other choice!” Lu Tianbo glanced at Zhao Junchen and naturally understood what Zhao Junchen meant. They were desperate and had no other choice.","At the same time, under Zhao Junchen’s arrangements, Chu Yunfan entered the Hidden Scripture Treasury deep in Windy City.","This Hidden Scripture Treasury was like an endless and incomparably huge city.","There were countless people in the city, and these people were books.","These books had been sensing the spirit energy day and night, and they had transformed into book phantoms. Every book had evolved into a world.","It had to be said that this was indeed a miracle. Even the Central Plains did not have a book phantom of this scale.","This was because there was not such a long period of time, and the laws of heaven and earth did not allow the birth of so many book phantoms.","Every day, the rules of the world would allow for something completely different!","Wherever Chu Yunfan’s eyes went, he could see through the charm of these books.","These book phantoms trembled under Chu Yunfan’s gaze and offered their most essential parts.","Some of these book phantoms had their own world, while others had evolved into many completely different worlds.","Some worlds were in endless chaos, constantly fighting and reincarnating. These were books that recorded the art of war.","In some worlds, there were people lying high in the Nine Heavens preaching, and countless people below were listening. This was the cultivation experience and origin written by a mighty figure who had fused his consciousness into it.","Every word and sentence in the book contained great principles. Only after countless years of evolution could it evolve into a mighty person preaching.","Other than that, there were many other books. For example, some books evolved into a sacred land with beautiful mountains and rivers. These were scenes of sacred lands recorded in a travel book.","It was extremely rare to be able to evolve the appearance of a sacred land under his brush.","It was extremely difficult for ordinary disciples who had not yet reached the King Stage to read books that had already become book phantoms. They needed to suppress these book phantoms in order to make them submit.","In fact, if he was forced into a corner, he would have to kill these book phantoms.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, it was nothing. Wherever he looked, all the book phantoms submitted and opened their cores for Chu Yunfan to read.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, he could see thousands of books at once and digest them in a moment.","Chu Yunfan only took a casual glance at the cultivation techniques and the like. Although it was said that stones from other mountains could be used to polish jade, most of the things recorded in these treasure vaults were useless to Chu Yunfan.","They were all Dao that Chu Yunfan had once used and eliminated.","However, there were quite a few books that recorded the techniques and skills of a half-Emperor. Zhao Junchen and the others couldn’t use these techniques and skills. If they weren’t a half-Emperor, they would be useless.","It was also a little useless to Chu Yunfan. The level and strength he knew far surpassed the divine powers and techniques recorded in these books.","However, some secrets and information about the Ancient Realm, as well as some common sense, attracted Chu Yunfan’s attention.","Chu Yunfan had a better understanding of the situation in the Ancient Realm.","It was even different from what Chu Yunfan knew from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, such as the division of half-Emperors.","To a large extent, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of half-Emperors was the same as that of the Alchemy Emperor.","In that era, there was no distinction between half-Emperors.","In fact, the half-Emperor Stage could only be considered as a transition realm!","This was because the cultivation environment in ancient times was far better than the present. The difference between the present and the ancient times was basically equivalent to the difference between the poorest and the richest countries in the world.","It was even more exaggerated than this!","For peerless geniuses who had reached the Emperor Stage, the half-Emperor Stage was just a small step. It might not take long for them to break through. There were even some talented Emperors who had directly advanced from the peak of the King Stage to the Emperor Stage.","After all, in the orthodox system, after the King Stage was the Emperor Stage, and the so-called half-Emperor Stage was just an awkward existence stuck between the two.","So in the concept of Alchemy Emperor, there was no such thing as the so-called half-Emperor division at all.","However, Chu Yunfan saw another way of saying it in these classics. It was the nine half-Emperor Stages!","It was when a half-Emperor couldn’t break through to the Emperor Stage and could only be divided into nine levels according to their strength.","From the lowest first half-Emperor level to the highest ninth half-Emperor level!","To the Emperors, there was no difference between a first level or ninth level half-Emperor. They were nothing more than ants that could be killed with a slap.","However, for the half-Emperors, this power system was very important.","The human king who had just entered the half-Emperor Stage were naturally at the first level half-Emperor Stage, which was the weakest among the half-Emperors.","Thus, even though human king had combined the fate of the human race, he was still beaten up by that Evil God.","This was because the gap between their levels was too great."]},{"number":2471,"title":"Chapter 2471: The Might of One Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 2471: The Might of One Sword","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","According to the theory of the nine levels the half-Emperor Stage, the Evil God should be in the third half-Emperor Stage. However, it should have just entered the third half-Emperor Stage, which was why it could defeat the human king who had combined with the Luck Dragon of the human race.","After combining with the Luck Dragon of the human race, the combat strength of the human king was raised to the second half-Emperor Stage.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was at the peak of the third half-Emperor Stage.","At any moment, he could improve further and reach the fourth half-Emperor Stage. In a sense, reaching the fourth half-Emperor Stage meant that he had entered the middle stages half-Emperor Stage.","That was another matter altogether.","It was a completely different understanding of the Emperor Path!","In the Ancient Realm, the Emperors were basically in a state of eternal sleep to delay the time of aging and to seek godheads in order to become gods and live a long life.","Under such circumstances, the half-Emperors were the rulers of the world.","The experts above the seventh half-Emperor Stage usually stayed in seclusion in order to break through to the Emperor Stage.","The higher one’s level was, the more unwilling they were to interfere in the mortal world.","Because they were already very close to the Emperor Stage and could break through to the Emperor Stage at any time.","Their lifespan was very precious to them. They could not waste time on the mortal world.","They were not like the Emperors who had already reached the peak of this system and could seal themselves to stall for time.","To them, not being able to break through was tantamount to death.","Those who could cultivate to the fifth or sixth half-Emperor Stage were the top existences in the Ancient Realm.","Any one of them was famous.","In comparison, the First to Third half-Emperors were much more common. However, they were still the true pillars of the Ancient Realm.","Once one broke through to the fourth half-Emperor Stage, one would be considered a first-class expert even among the half-Emperors.","“So there are so many divisions between the half-Emperors!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“However, it’s only because the descendants failed to live up to expectations and couldn’t break through in a short time that they had no choice but to divide it into the nine half-Emperor Stages!","“But overall, I’ve figured out my current level, which will provide a direction for my future breakthrough!”","He had once thought that he had reached the peak of the half-Emperor Path. Now that he had arrived in the Ancient Realm, he realized that his previous feeling was wrong.","It was not because he was not strong enough. He was very strong, but he could not walk out of the shackles!","Because the world was only this big!","The Central Plains was but a small, broken world, unable to contain even more powerful experts!","Once he broke through to the fourth half-Emperor Stage, there would only be one outcome. Chu Yunfan’s every move had the ability to destroy the world. He could tear the space in half with a casual hand.","It was because that world was too small for him. How could he keep a dragon in a water tank? It would either suffocate to death or break the water tank.","The entire world was restricting his progress!","Now that he had arrived in the Ancient Realm, everything was different. He had arrived in a brand new world.","The suppression on him disappeared in an instant.","He could already feel that a breakthrough was right before his eyes!","Such an opportunity was right in front of him!","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction after understanding his path ahead.","Suddenly, he looked up at the sky.","It had been a month since he had entered the treasury.","At this moment, outside Windy City, a large army was pressing down.","The vast and mighty army of over a million surrounded the huge Windy City.","Among the million-strong army, there were dozens of powerful Kings guarding one area.","The entire Windy City was in a state of panic.","The sounds of people shouting and horses neighing could be heard everywhere.","The city defense army of Windy City also rose into the sky at the first moment, borrowing the defensive barrier of Windy City to resist.","The higher-ups of Windy City, including Zhao Junchen and Lu Tianbo, were also on the frontline.","A great battle erupted in an instant. All kinds of terrifying attacks turned into torrents that bombarded the city walls of Windy City.","Although the enemy’s strength was far above Windy City’s, due to Windy City’s protective barrier, there was actually no way to break through it in a short period of time.","All kinds of dark battles erupted!","However, this stalemate only lasted for 15 minutes!","All of a sudden, a terrifying saber light that was over 10,000 feet long slashed down fiercely.","Boom!","After a loud explosion, everyone clearly saw the barrier of Windy City being shattered by someone. Under everyone’s dumbfounded gazes, it turned into nothingness.","The entire Windy City was speechless!","“If Windy City doesn’t know the destiny and stubbornly resist the heavenly army, today is the day the city is broken. You will pay the price in blood!”","A deep middle-aged voice came from the sky.","Countless troops surged into Windy City!","It looked like the entire Windy City was going to be drowned.","Suddenly, at this moment, an even more terrifying sword light swept across the sky like a laser cannon, evaporating tens of thousands of troops in one breath.","These tens of thousands of soldiers did not even have the time to scream before they died tragically!","There were even several top-tier Kings among them!","They probably never expected that there would be something that could pose a fatal threat to them in Windy City.","Even if they were facing other Kings, it was impossible for them to be killed so easily.","They were completely killed in one move.","Everyone was once again shocked, just like when the shocking blade light slashed down and broke through the city defense of Windy City in one strike.","This sword was too shocking. The tens of thousands of soldiers and several Kings were vaporized by the sword light.","Just as Zhao Junchen, Lu Tianbo, and the others were still in shock, a figure appeared in the sky out of thin air.","They looked at him. Wasn’t he Chu Yunfan, who had just joined Windy City?","Zhao Junchen and Lu Tianbo looked at each other, and their faces immediately revealed a smile of surprise. They had only made such a plan, but when Chu Yunfan really stood on their side and attacked, it still made them very surprised and ecstatic.","Apart from Chu Yunfan, there was no one else in Windy City who could perform that sword move.","“Thank you for your help, Elder Chu!” Zhao Junchen quickly said.","“Since I’m a part of Windy City, this is my duty!” Chu Yunfan glanced at Zhao Junchen and said.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally understood why Zhao Junchen and the others had invited him to join Windy City, while the others had agreed despite their reluctance.","It was all because of these powerful enemies in front of him!"]},{"number":2472,"title":"Chapter 2472: Killing the City Lord of Sunset City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2472: Killing the City Lord of Sunset City","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Obviously, these enemies did not appear suddenly, but had long been premeditated.","The people of Windy City were not completely unaware of the sudden appearance of these enemies. In other words, they were already prepared!","And inviting him to become the Supreme Elder of Windy City was clearly one of the backup plans.","One ring after another!","However, Chu Yunfan was not angry. It was human nature to use each other!","If the other party was so strong that they couldn’t even defeat Chu Yunfan, then they naturally couldn’t expect Chu Yunfan to fight to the death for them.","When Lu Tianbo and Zhao Junchen saw that Chu Yunfan was not angry, they heaved a sigh of relief. In the worst case scenario, Chu Yunfan would immediately turn hostile after receiving the news.","If that was the case, their Windy City would probably really be finished.","However, if they allowed the other party to continue attacking, Windy City would also die. Since they were all going to die, they could only choose to live in a place of death.","“Who are these people?” Chu Yunfan said directly.","Lu Tianbo immediately sent a telepathic message and explained everything in an instant.","It turned out that this vast and boundless area was a buffer zone deliberately left behind by Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed.","In this region, there were many cities of various sizes, and there were many cities like Windy City.","One of the cities was called Sunset City.","The overall strength of Sunset City was about the same as Windy City. They had been living in peace, but who knew that the Sunset City Lord had recently broken through to the half-Emperor Stage.","Although he had only just broken through, he immediately formed a huge pressure on the surrounding large factions.","There was no doubt that a half-Emperor could suppress a King. Even the weakest half-Emperor could easily kill a King.","In this short period of time, Sunset City had already successively destroyed or subdued several cities.","This time, Windy City was the vanguard of their Sunset City.","Although it was just a joke in front of a true top-notch expert.","Especially in the eyes of Evil Gods Creed or Magi Circle, it was like a child playing house. Any second half-Emperor could destroy the good situation of Sunset City.","However, it was still a disaster for forces like Windy City.","Using a force with a half-Emperor and a force without a half-Emperor were two completely different things!","A force without a half-Emperor was like a small boat in a storm that could be overturned by a huge wave at any time.","With a half-Emperor in charge, their ability to resist risks was much stronger.","In essence, there was an earth-shattering change!","It was completely different!","This was also the reason why Lu Tianbo was ecstatic and invited Chu Yunfan to join Windy City immediately.","This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for them.","It was also the only good opportunity to contend against Sunset City.","“We had no choice. We hope you will forgive us, Elder Chu!” Lu Tianbo said.","Chu Yunfan nodded without saying anything.","“Which fellow daoist is here?” Suddenly, a cold voice sounded.","A man wearing a red robe and long fiery red hair strode out.","He held a long saber in his hand, and the saber aura emitted from the blade seemed to be about to tear the world apart.","Only a half-Emperor’s weapon could break the space of the Ancient Realm.","The space in the Ancient Realm was unprecedentedly sturdy, and it was something that could not be imagined in the Central Plains.","Sunset City Lord looked at Chu Yunfan suspiciously.","He was sure that none of the half-Emperors he knew looked like this. Obviously, Chu Yunfan was not one of the half-Emperors he knew.","“Fellow Daoist, please give me some face, give my Sunset City some face!” Sunset City Lord said.","“Give you face? Who do you think you are?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","When Sunset City Lord heard this, his expression immediately turned ugly.","He could be said to have a high position and authority in Sunset City. When had he ever been looked down upon like this? It was simply going too far.","“In that case, don’t blame me for being impolite!” Sunset City Lord was surrounded by scarlet flames. That was the domain of his entire body that he had condensed around his body.","This was also enough to show just what kind of shocking degree his laws had already been controlled to!","It was not a fluke that he could break through to the half-Emperor Stage. On the contrary, it was entirely due to his own strength.","Boom!","Sunset City Lord instantly attacked. His confident demeanor made people look askance at him. He looked down on the world with supreme elegance.","After breaking through to the half-Emperor Stage, he had defeated many powerful enemies.","He had invincible confidence!","Boom!","The next attack was the flaming saber light that swept out. It was like mercury pouring down from the ground, engulfing everything in its path. It was extremely sharp.","Even from afar, one could still sense how terrifying it would be if that astonishing saber light slashed at one’s body.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. He punched out and directly transformed into eight gods","the Eight Astonishing Fists!","Heaven and earth were torn apart, and a punch directly smashed into the saber light that poured down.","Boom!","A huge explosion sounded, and the sound tore through the sky.","Immediately after, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s punch shatter the saber light and burst out with billions of multicolored lights.","It fell from the sky and turned into a rain of light that dissipated.","“What?” At this time, Sunset City Lord finally knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","Judging from his aura alone, he was much more terrifying than Chu Yunfan.","But in fact, it did not mean that he was strong or weak. Instead, he was far inferior to Chu Yunfan. He could not control his aura.","Chu Yunfan could easily control his aura!","This was the difference!","He couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, so he could only use his moves to test him. However, Chu Yunfan’s move displayed an almost invincible might!","A punch broke through his attack. The momentum of the punch did not decrease. Without giving him time to think, it bombarded his body.","Bam!","Sunset City Lord was hit, and a large hole appeared in his chest. Blood gushed out. With this, Sunset City Lord was heavily injured.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was extremely terrifying in his eyes, like a legendary demon.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan stood high above like a god. He executed the Nine Netherworld Stomps, and netherworld water spread out from under his feet, turning the world into the Netherworld.","This foot stomped down again!","Sunset City Lord screamed as his body was trampled into pieces. He died a tragic death!"]},{"number":2473,"title":"Chapter 2473: The Invincible War God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2473: The Invincible War God","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sunset City Lord was easily killed by Chu Yunfan.","The entire process was without any ripples.","The difference in strength between Sunset City Lord and Chu Yunfan was obvious!","Chu Yunfan was so powerful that even the people of Windy City were shocked. They did not expect a senior they picked up from the roadside to be so powerful.","To them, even Sunset City Lord, who had just entered the half-Emperor Stage, was already very powerful.","With their strength, they couldn’t tell how big the difference between the half-Emperors was.","In their eyes, any half-Emperor could easily kill them.","Therefore, when they saw Chu Yunfan easily kill Sunset City Lord, they were all shocked.","They were dumbfounded!","Even the people of Windy City were dumbfounded, let alone the people of Sunset City. They were completely frightened!","Sunset City Lord collapsed in an instant!","In the Ancient Realm, half-Emperors could usually determine the outcome of a battle. If a half-Emperor died, the battle would be considered a real failure.","Everyone was dumbfounded!","With a bang, they collapsed. Even the most elite troops had no choice but to scatter in this desperate situation.","“Go, kill them all and take revenge!”","At this moment, Windy City’s city lord, Zhao Junchen, shouted.","The people of Windy City immediately reacted and roared crazily as they launched a counterattack.","Windy City’s strength was not much weaker than Sunset City’s.","It was only because a half-Emperor had appeared in Sunset City that they had completely suppressed Windy City and become a small overlord in the vicinity.","Now, it was even whistling out.","On the other hand, Sunset City had completely collapsed, especially since there were still many troops from the forces that they had conquered during this period of time.","Originally, these armies were only used as vanguards and consumables.","They would sacrifice their lives for Sunset City to attack Windy City.","When Sunset City Lord was still around, no matter how many casualties they suffered, they did not dare to complain at all.","Because even if they had any complaints, they would not be able to defeat Sunset City Lord. The final result would still be death.","The only way to survive was to take down Windy City. Then, they would be safe and not be sent to their deaths.","But now, the situation had been reversed. The sudden emergence of such a top-notch expert in Windy City had reversed everything.","All of this caused the vassal army of Sunset City to collapse. They immediately switched sides and attacked the army of Sunset City.","Their strength wasn’t as strong as Sunset City, but they didn’t dare to resist because they lacked a half-Emperor.","Anyone who resisted was destroyed.","But now, a half-Emperor level master of Sunset City had fallen, which made Sunset City’s strength return to the same level as theirs.","In an instant, a rebellion broke out.","Coupled with Windy City’s counterattack, Sunset City’s army was routed. They could not even stand, completely defeated.","At this moment, the Kings of Sunset City were shouting crazily. They kept attacking, trying to maintain this defeated situation.","However, it was useless. They could not stop this kind of momentum.","Chu Yunfan was high and mighty. A huge bow appeared in his hand. Since he had decided to help Windy City, he naturally could not let the army of Sunset City escape and pose a huge threat to Windy City again.","In the distance, a King of Sunset City was slaughtering crazily. Every time he struck out with his hand, he would tear apart tens of thousands of elites.","Other than a portion of Windy City’s army, there were more of their own army and the original subordinate army of Sunset City.","At this time, they all rebelled.","He was maintaining the defensive line, using his own barrier to stop these defeated troops from charging into the formation.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. An incomparably huge, terrifying arrow that was hundreds of feet long swept across the sky and shattered the sky in an instant.","In the next moment, he had already appeared in front of the King of Sunset City.","The King of Sunset City didn’t even have time to resist. Before he could even react, his head was pierced through by the arrow. His huge body was brought down from the sky to the ground, and he fell heavily to the ground.","Boom!","A massive explosion sounded out, causing countless waves of dust to rise up. Before the King of Sunset City could react, he was shot through the ground. The huge arrow pierced through his head and directly sank into the ground, creating a huge pit that was dozens of kilometers deep.","The King of Sunset City tried to struggle to get up, but it was only an instinctive action. In fact, his entire head had been pierced through, and his brain had been directly stirred into a paste by the terrifying power. Even a powerful King would die without a burial place if he was hit by such an attack.","After killing one of the Sunset City’s Kings, Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. The divine power in his hand turned into a longbow, and he pulled out three more arrows.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","A few more shrill air-piercing sounds rang out.","Immediately after, another three powerful Kings of Sunset City were pierced through. One was pierced through the chest, one was pierced through the heart, and one was directly pierced through the head.","The King’s huge body landed heavily on the ground, causing the earth to shake and mountains to shake.","Their results were no different from the previous King.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was too strong. He could easily kill one with a single arrow and even kill several Kings of Sunset City at the same time.","For a time, the morale of Sunset City was on the verge of collapse. In contrast, the morale of Windy City was high.","Under the situation of rising and falling, the speed at which the army of Sunset City collapsed was clearly much faster.","“Kill him. Only by killing him can we not die. Otherwise, we will all die today!”","At this moment, the other Kings of Sunset City also noticed Chu Yunfan, who was high in the sky, shooting arrows that could kill everything.","They finally realized that if Chu Yunfan didn’t die, they definitely wouldn’t have a way out today.","“Kill me?” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a somewhat arrogant expression, and there was a hint of disdain at the corner of his lips."]},{"number":2474,"title":"Chapter 2474: Destroying Sunset City and Making a Name Through It","paragraphs":["Chapter 2474: Destroying Sunset City and Making a Name Through It","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The few Kings immediately gave up on the enemies in front of them and attacked Chu Yunfan. All kinds of terrifying attacks shook the world, forming an earth-shattering tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","All kinds of terrifying attacks swept in front of Chu Yunfan almost in an instant, forcing him into a blind spot.","But in the next moment, before everyone could worry about Chu Yunfan, a few terrifying long arrows with long tails pierced through the sky like comets, instantly piercing through the Kings.","One arrow for one!","After these powerful Kings of Sunset City were pierced through, they fell to the ground. After the terrifying arrows pierced through them, they directly sank into the ground, creating a huge pit.","These powerful Kings also fell into the deep pits, and soon, blood filled the pits.","They had no way of getting up.","The arrow pierced through their chests and tore their bodies apart.","One could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s arrow was.","This was the archery technique Chu Yunfan had learned from the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, the Shooting Sun Arrows!","According to the legends, it was a supreme technique belonging to the Bow Emperor. Every arrow could pierce through the sun in the sky and shatter it into a black hole that could devour everything.","Of course, Chu Yunfan was still far from the supreme cultivation of the Bow Emperor, but it was more than enough to deal with these Kings.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm and cold. He didn’t care about these people who were killed at all.","His expression was too cold.","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure flashed in front of him.","“Go to hell, monster!”","It was an old man in a luxurious robe. He should have been graceful and noble, but at this moment, he looked extremely miserable. His originally hunched body was filled with powerful strength.","A red flag appeared in his hand.","There was endless energy surging and fluctuating in this flag.","In an instant, it was about to explode. It was the power of a half-Emperor.","This was a half-Emperor weopan, which had the power of a half-Emperor. At the critical moment, it could burst out with the power of a half-Emperor.","This was Sunset City’s last resort, their final trump card.","It was just that they had never thought that they would use this trump card in today’s situation.","At this moment, they didn’t think about how to defeat or kill Chu Yunfan. They only hoped that the half-Emperor weapon’s self-destruction could severely injure Chu Yunfan and give their Sunset City one last chance.","Even if they were crazy, they wouldn’t have thought of killing Chu Yunfan with the half-Emperor weapon’s self-destruction.","“A half-Emperor artifact?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He even had a basic Emperor level weapon. How could a mere half-Emperor level weapon hurt him? It was really funny.","Chu Yunfan’s hand reached out and grabbed the half-Emperor weapon without dodging.","Boom!","The half-Emperor weapon exploded with a shocking explosion!","Almost everyone was dumbfounded. Before the terrifying explosion could spread out, it was suppressed bit by bit and then shrunk bit by bit. Under everyone’s eyes, the explosion was suppressed bit by bit until it was crushed and turned into nothingness.","“Impossible!”","The old man was instantly paralyzed and scared silly.","He did not expect that the explosion of the half-Emperor weapon would not only fail to severely injure Chu Yunfan, but it could not even pose a threat to him.","The toughness of Chu Yunfan’s physical body made him feel despair. The explosion of the half-Emperor weapon was even stronger than his most powerful attack, but it couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","One could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Even he, who was already prepared to die with Chu Yunfan, was completely frightened.","He was completely shocked!","“You overestimate yourself!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and reached out with his hand again. The old man in the luxurious robe was turned into a bloody mist by his palm, turning into a mass of bloody energy that surged into the Brahma Tree in the Mountain River Diagram.","The King Stage was still the King Stage!","The strength that he could display was also quite limited. If the person controlling it at this time was not this luxuriously robed old man, but Sunset City Lord, then the situation would be different.","With the strength of Sunset City Lord, he might still be able to pose a threat to Chu Yunfan, but it was only a slight threat.","The difference in their strength was too great.","According to Chu Yunfan’s current estimation, he wouldn’t be afraid even if he encountered a fourth level half-Emperor, let alone Sunset City Lord who was only at the first half-Emperor Stage.","This old man’s counterattack was the last counterattack of Sunset City.","Sunset City no longer had any ability to resist and collapsed on the spot!","Under the pursuit of all parties, they were defeated all the way to the city of Sunset City and were unable to regroup!","Windy City’s army took advantage of the situation and directly attacked the city walls of Sunset City.","Even so, the few remaining Kings in Sunset City did not surrender. On the contrary, they wanted to use the defensive barrier in the city to resist.","Since there was a King in Sunset City, the barrier was extraordinary and could block a half-Emperor for a certain period of time.","That was why they wanted to resist!","However, it was completely useless. They had indeed blocked the advance of Windy City’s army.","However, when Chu Yunfan arrived at the battlefield, he broke the defensive barrier of Sunset City with a single sword strike and killed several Kings on the spot.","They were powerless against Chu Yunfan, who was like a god.","Hence, very quickly, a white flag was hung in Sunset City!","Previously, Sunset City was famous for conquering the world. It had planned to become a small overlord in the vicinity, and the curtains had completely fallen. It had been conquered by Windy City.","Even the cities that were originally conquered by Sunset City had also submitted to Windy City.","This battle was earth-shattering. No one had expected that the situation would actually be reversed like this!","Windy City, which was originally regarded as something that was already in the bag of Sunset City, actually completed a counterattack and brought Sunset City to its knees.","Furthermore, it had swallowed up all of the forces that had originally been in Sunset City, becoming the small overlord of this region in an instant.","Although Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle nearby were worlds apart, they had clearly surpassed the scope of ordinary forces.","For a time, the world was in an uproar, and Chu Yunfan’s reputation spread in the Ancient Realm for the first time."]},{"number":2475,"title":"Chapter 2475: The Expert of Magi Circle","paragraphs":["Chapter 2475: The Expert of Magi Circle","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was the first time someone in this area knew of Chu Yunfan’s existence. Chu Yunfan’s strength made many people tremble in fear.","After Sunset City Lord broke through to the half-Emperor Stage, he had gone crazy.","He led Sunset City to battle everywhere.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength was even above Sunset City Lord. If Chu Yunfan wanted to lead Windy City to fight everywhere, he would probably cause even greater harm than Sunset City Lord.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to be too interested in this. After pacifying Sunset City, he immediately entered seclusion.","In the blink of an eye, a year had passed!","After a year of reorganization, Windy City had already swallowed up the territories and forces of the original cities, and its strength had undergone earth-shattering changes.","However, everyone knew that this was all because of Chu Yunfan!","Without Chu Yunfan, such a large territory would collapse in the shortest time possible.","Only a half-Emperor could defend such a territory!","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t do anything else after that.","He entered secluded cultivation in Windy City.","Without Chu Yunfan’s support, it would be impossible for Windy City to continue expanding.","Without Chu Yunfan’s support, Windy City would not have an overwhelming advantage.","It seemed that someone was maintaining the balance between the cities in this area, preventing any faction from becoming too powerful and causing the balance in this area to be lost.","Even if the upper echelons of the major forces weren’t half-Emperors, they were all chosen at once.","Many people could not break through not necessarily because they did not have enough talent. To a large extent, it was because they did not have a cultivation technique that could be cultivated further.","This was also why the top experts were often from the ten great forces. It was because they had ten Emperors standing behind them, who could provide them with a complete set of cultivation methods.","That was why those peak Kings could break through to the half-Emperor Stage!","Although there were countless experts in Windy City, and its city lord, Zhao Junchen, was a peak King, in the eyes of the top ten factions, he could only be considered an itinerant cultivator.","Chu Yunfan was undoubtedly an expert among the itinerant cultivators.","On this day, a tall middle-aged man in battle robes arrived in Windy City.","Windy City’s City Lord, Zhao Junchen, came to welcome him immediately. He said respectfully, “Greetings, Lord War Magus!”","After the middle-aged man glanced at Zhao Junchen, he went straight to the main seat.","Even as the city lord, Zhao Junchen could only sit on the side. There was only one reason. This War Magus was a half-Emperor. He had a powerful force behind him, Magi Circle.","To be more precise, it was a powerful race, the magi!","This race was already a very powerful race in the distant past. Now, it was one of the ten great factions in the Ancient Realm.","Not to mention Magi Circle, even War Magus himself could easily wipe out the entire Windy City by himself.","“May I know why you have come this time, Lord War Magus?” Zhao Junchen quickly asked.","As the city lord of Windy City, who had to struggle to survive between Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle, Zhao Junchen was already used to all of this.","Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed were two behemoths that could crush Windy City with just a finger.","“Cut the crap. I won’t beat around the bush with you. I heard that Windy City invited a self-proclaimed half-Emperor?” War Magus said.","He didn’t think that there was anything strange about ancient self-sealing. In fact, such things were often self-sealed in the Ancient Realm.","If one day, he felt that there was little hope for him to advance further, but he did not want to die of old age, the probability of him choosing to self-seal was very high.","Under such circumstances, he naturally did not find Chu Yunfan’s words strange.","“Yes, that’s our Elder Chu!” Zhao Junchen quickly said.","“I don’t care who he is. I only have one thing to tell you. Now, Magi Circle wants to recruit your Elder Chu! You don’t have any objections, right?” War Magus said calmly. He glanced at Zhao Junchen, and Zhao Junchen felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave.","He knew that if he said no, he would probably die at the hands of the War Magus.","The difference in status and strength between the two sides was too great!","Zhao Junchen could not help but smile bitterly. As expected, the rumors were true.","There was a legend among the many forces in this area that this area was a buffer zone specially set aside by Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle to prevent a violent conflict between the two sides.","The two forces were also well aware of this and absolutely prohibited anyone from changing the status quo of this area.","Every time a half-Emperor appeared here, after a period of time, that half-Emperor would mysteriously disappear, or join Evil Gods Creed or the Magi Circle, or disappear without a trace.","All the forces knew about this news. The reason for this outcome was obviously the result of the interference of the two major forces.","They had always controlled the highest martial strength in this area to be at the peak of the King Stage.","However, a half-Emperor had obviously broken the balance. A half-Emperor could rule the entire region. Although it was still insignificant compared to the two behemoths, it was still an ant that could be crushed with a finger.","However, this ant already had the ability to bite them.","Thus, taking precautions before they could take action had become the common choice of the two forces.","Previously, Sunset City Lord had just broken through not long ago. Before he could wreak havoc, he was annihilated by Chu Yunfan.","That was why he was not recruited by the two major forces.","Windy City had never had a half-Emperor before, so the rumors were just rumors.","Now, he finally confirmed that the rumors were true.","No wonder those old forces didn’t have a single half-Emperor...","On the contrary, it was the newly rising forces like Sunset City and Windy City that would have a half-Emperor.","Presumably, they had already known about it long ago.","He thought about the legend he had heard before. It seemed that the top experts of those old forces would leave this area when they had a chance to break through.","This was because there was no place for a half-Emperor in this area.","This fragile balance was thus preserved.","He could imagine that without Chu Yunfan, Windy City would not have been able to defend such a large territory. The final result would have been a wanton plunder, and then they would have retreated from the few cities they had occupied.","The area would then return to its original calm!"]},{"number":2476,"title":"Chapter 2476: Breakthrough, the Fourth Half-Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2476: Breakthrough, the Fourth Half-Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For countless years, this had become a hidden rule.","The two forces didn’t even need to do anything. They only needed to recruit or kill the half-Emperors who suddenly appeared to restore peace in the region.","Without Chu Yunfan, even if Windy City was unwilling to withdraw from the other cities, they still had the ability to resist the counterattack of the other forces and the forces of these cities. It was estimated that the two forces would intervene at the right time.","Mediate!","The final result was the same. Whether they were willing or not, they could only withdraw in the end. Whether they wanted to or not, the final result was the same. There was no difference.","Under the watchful eyes of the two monster forces, they had no choice at all!","Even the occasional appearance of one or two half-Emperors wasn’t enough to break the peace!","For so many years, in the Ancient Realm, other than the top ten forces, there was no other force that could be compared to them. The people did not even dare to think about the reason. As long as they thought about it, their entire body could not help but tremble.","It was as if there was a mastermind behind the scenes that enveloped the entire Ancient Realm. No, to be precise, there were ten masterminds.","Together, they controlled the entire Ancient Realm.","Zhao Junchen quickly understood Magi Circle’s plan. He nodded and said, “We don’t dare to object to this matter. However, we can’t make a decision about Elder Chu. He’s a half-Emperor. We have to report to him first!”","War Magus didn’t turn hostile. He knew how ridiculous it was for a King to order a half-Emperor.","Even he didn’t dare to order Chu Yunfan around without knowing his identity and strength.","Otherwise, if Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above his, if Chu Yunfan defeated him and fled from this area, it would be useless for him to cry to anyone.","After all, Chu Yunfan wasn’t a native born and raised here. He was an old fellow who had sealed himself up until now.","If he defeated someone, fled, and joined the other ten great factions, even Magi Circle would not be able to deal with him.","“In that case, go and tell him that I will wait here for three days!” War Magus said.","In the depths of Windy City, outside a secret enchantment, Zhao Junchen quietly arrived and sent a signal inside.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who was in the enchantment, received the signal.","At this moment, all kinds of terrifying divine power surged around Chu Yunfan’s body, forming various phenomena behind him.","Boom!","Finally, Chu Yunfan couldn’t control these strange phenomena and directly exploded. However, before the shock wave formed by the divine power could be released, it was compressed by Chu Yunfan’s body.","“I’ve finally broken through to the fourth half-Emperor Stage!”","Chu Yunfan felt better than ever.","His cultivation base had changed drastically. He had broken through to the fourth half-Emperor Stage, which meant that he had become a first-class expert among the half-Emperors that ordinary people could see.","After all, the existences above the seventh half-Emperor Stage were basically in deep seclusion and would not show up easily.","As far as he knew, the sect leader who was in charge of Evil Gods Creed was only a seventh half-Emperor. There were definitely stronger experts in Evil Gods Creed, but they were all unwilling to come out and handle miscellaneous matters.","“I can break through to the fifth level of the half-Emperor Stage in one go!”","Chu Yunfan intended to break through to the fifth level half-Emperor Stage in one go. This was not impossible for him.","During this period of time, he had an endless supply of cultivation resources from Windy City.","It could be said that 70% of the resources that Windy City had obtained from pacifying the various regions had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s pocket.","The cultivation of a half-Emperor was like a black hole that sucked all the resources.","Because of this, he decided to rely on Windy City.","After all, it was not a long-term path for an itinerant cultivator to walk without the support of a faction.","He provided protection for Windy City, and Windy City provided him with the resources he needed for his cultivation. It could be said that they both benefited.","However, even Windy City couldn’t provide him with more cultivation resources. If he wanted to break through to the fifth half-Emperor Stage from the fourth half-Emperor Stage, the resources he needed would be massive.","Unless Windy City could unify this region, it would be possible.","However, according to his observations during this period of time, the possibility was not high.","It was as if a huge hand was maintaining the peace of this area, preventing external forces from changing the situation in this area.","According to Chu Yunfan’s guess, it was not Evil Gods Creed, but Magi Circle.","This place should also be a place where the two forces had specially left behind to maintain peace between each other and not fight.","Although it might be a small conflict in the beginning, the small conflict would eventually evolve into a big conflict, war, and even mutual destruction.","This was inevitable!","This was the reason why the five great forces of the AD era never dared to fight directly.","Just as Chu Yunfan was thinking about the relationship behind this, Zhao Junchen’s message came from outside.","Chu Yunfan pondered for a moment and found that this was completely in line with his previous guess.","All of this was just as he had guessed. Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed were behind this.","However, he had never expected Magi Circle to arrive so quickly. It had only been a year, but they had already reacted.","Of course, Chu Yunfan understood that if he agreed to go to Magi Circle and responded to Magi Circle’s recruitment, the consequences would naturally be unimaginable.","As far as he knew, those half-Emperors who eventually joined Magi Circle would often die without knowing why. They would often die on the frontlines.","Although it was done very secretly, there were all kinds of legitimate reasons every time.","However, the more he tried, the more he would find a blockade.","After all, he was not one of them. If such a person stayed by his side, it would be a huge hidden danger!","If Chu Yunfan chose to join Magi Circle, the final result might be to encounter all kinds of unknown dangers and then die in a mission.","Then, it would end quietly, and no one would remember anything related to him.","“What a headache. Magi Circle, Magi Circle. I definitely can’t rely on them, but at the same time, I can’t turn against them. Otherwise, Magi Circle is enough to make me die without a burial place!”","Chu Yunfan was having a headache. Even if he knew Magi Circle’s plan, he had no way to resist it.","Magi Circle was still a little too powerful for him at the moment.","However, he was confident that he could leave this place and go somewhere else. Although Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed were both very powerful, they did not have the ability to cover the sky with one hand.","“I have an idea!” Suddenly, Chu Yunfan thought of something. In the next moment, he disappeared from the enchantment."]},{"number":2477,"title":"Chapter 2477: Crushed and Beaten","paragraphs":["Chapter 2477: Crushed and Beaten","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Chu Yunfan reappeared, he was in a hall in Windy City.","War Magus suddenly opened his eyes and saw a figure appear in front of him.","“Who are you?” War Magus stared at Chu Yunfan and said warily.","“Didn’t you want to find me?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You are King Chu?” War Magus looked at Chu Yunfan and immediately let down his guard. Since he knew it was Chu Yunfan, there was nothing to be afraid of.","Would Chu Yunfan dare to attack him here? He was surely afraid of being hunted down by Magi Circle.","“Not bad!” Chu Yunfan found a chair and sat down.","“Since you have appeared here, you should know the purpose of my visit?” War Magus said. “Such a small place isn’t suitable for a half-Emperor to show off their talent. You won’t have any future. As long as you follow Magi Circle, you’ll be able to reach your peak!”","“And then die in all kinds of traps, right?” Chu Yunfan smiled and said.","War Magus’s expression immediately darkened, and he no longer had that forced smile on his face.","“Really, why don’t you just die!” War Magus immediately shook off that hypocritical smile. “Itinerant cultivators like you think that you have jumped out of the river of fate, but you are just small fish that have jumped out of the river. Your targets are more conspicuous, and you can be killed easily with a grab!” he grinned.","Although they were both half-Emperors, he had an Emperor backing him up. His psychological advantage was too great.","Under normal circumstances, even a half-Emperor of the same level would have a huge difference in their foundation.","With his inheritance, he could fight several people of the same level.","Even if he were to face a higher-level half-Emperor, he still had a chance of winning!","This was the difference between itinerant cultivators and cultivators with legacies and roots!","Therefore, he didn’t put Chu Yunfan in his eyes at all. Although it was rumored that Chu Yunfan had killed Sunset City Lord with a single sword strike, it was nothing.","Sunset City Lord was nothing. He was just a rookie who had just entered the half-Emperor Stage. If it were him, he could easily kill him with a single strike.","Killing Sunset City Lord didn’t show how powerful Chu Yunfan was. It only showed that Sunset City Lord was useless.","Originally, he didn’t want to use such a rough method. After all, a half-Emperor was a good fighting force.","Before he was set to die in an accident, Chu Yunfan could still do many things for Magi Circle.","After all, even the powerful Magi Circle couldn’t have as many half-Emperors as they wanted.","However, since Chu Yunfan already knew this and even wanted to take the initiative to point it out, there was no point in staying.","Such a person must die!","Even if this secret was a well-known secret, the so-called secret was a secret that could not be put on the table.","Whoever broke it would face a backlash!","Now that Chu Yunfan had broken it, he would have to face a backlash.","“Since that’s the case, then you can die!”","War Magus attacked without any restraint. He did not have to worry about others finding out, nor did he have to worry about Windy City collapsing. To Magi Circle, this was nothing.","However, when he wanted to circulate the divine power in his body, he realized that it was very difficult and sluggish to circulate his power. It was as if he had fallen into a swamp.","“How could this be?”","The divine power on the Wizard Warrior’s body could not even leave the surface of his body.","At this moment, he realized that the entire hall had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s domain and silently surrounded him.","That was to integrate his domain into the surrounding world instead of choosing to isolate it.","This was something that could only be done by someone above the seventh half-Emperor Stage!","‘Is he really an old monster?’ War Magus’s eyes flashed with shock.","If it was really as he had guessed, then he had really kicked a hornet’s nest this time.","He immediately realized that something was wrong because he realized that Chu Yunfan’s divine power was far less terrifying than that of a seventh half-Emperor.","To put it simply, Chu Yunfan was like a freak who had the knowledge of a seventh half-Emperor, but he couldn’t fully display his strength.","He was already able to do some things that only a seventh half-Emperor could do!","What a terrifying old monster.","He was actually able to completely suppress himself with his domain. His domain was trapped in his body and could not even expand slightly.","This also meant that he was completely surrounded by Chu Yunfan’s domain and was in someone else’s territory.","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was far above his, and might even surpass the current leader of Magi Circle.","What a terrifying existence!","There shouldn’t be such a monster among itinerant cultivators. Usually, only geniuses with inheritances could understand the world far more than their own strength.","The comprehension of the Great Dao was the understanding of the world. Generally, itinerant cultivators’ comprehension of the Great Dao was often weaker than their strength.","This was why there was almost no way for these itinerant cultivators to break through in the later stages. Their basic understanding of the world was too far apart.","The strength of a domain was built on one’s understanding of the world. The deeper one’s understanding of the world, the more powerful the domain would be.","To be able to easily seal War Magus’s domain and prevent it from even extending out of his body, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the world must have reached an astonishing level.","“No matter how you did it, the people of Magi Circle have never relied on domains to survive!” War Magus roared and decided to attack first.","Although his domain was suppressed, his martial will was extremely powerful, and it actually evolved between heaven and earth.","A terrifying huge shadow swept toward Chu Yunfan as if it intended to shatter everything with a punch.","Wherever the fist passed, the domain shattered, forming a raging tide that swept over and swallowed everything.","Chu Yunfan only sneered as he watched War Magus’s punch shatter the domain he had constructed.","A punch from a half-Emperor could even shatter the world, let alone a small domain.","Clang!","This punch seemed to have hit a piece of metal, and a sound of metal colliding erupted. The terrifying shockwave that spread out shattered the domain, but in the next moment, it was repaired as if it had never been shattered.","And this punch was simply blocked by a finger."]},{"number":2478,"title":"Chapter 2478: Slaying War Magus, Framing the Blame","paragraphs":["Chapter 2478: Slaying War Magus, Framing the Blame","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan only used one finger to block all of the War Magus’s attacks.","That devastating punch was completely blocked by a simple finger.","This scene completely overturned War Magus’s knowledge.","Although War Magus had thought that Chu Yunfan might use all kinds of methods to block his punch.","However, he had never thought that it would be such a simple finger.","As a member of Magi Circle, his power came from his own strength.","Even if his domain was completely sealed, he could still unleash at least 80% of his strength.","Therefore, he was not afraid at all. Everyone knew that the physical bodies of the people in Magi Circle were powerful.","His punch was as powerful as a half-Emperor artifact!","But now, he couldn’t even break Chu Yunfan’s finger. What kind of terrifying ability was this?","Logically speaking, Chu Yunfan’s entire arm should have exploded.","He could sense that Chu Yunfan had only used his physical strength.","But he was above him?","“Are you kidding me? In terms of physical bodies, we magi are invincible!” War Magus roared in rage. His loud and clear voice resounded throughout the entire hall, but he was unable to cause any abnormal phenomenon.","It was completely sealed by Chu Yunfan’s domain.","“Invincible?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Indeed, in ancient times, the magi were a very terrifying race. They fought against the heavens and the earth and were invincible. However, it was a little too much to say that their physical bodies were invincible.","There were only invincible people, not invincible martial arts or divine arts.","“Just like you said before, why don’t you just die in peace!” Chu Yunfan said.","War Magus’s strength was definitely at the third half-Emperor Stage. If it was the Chu Yunfan from before, he would definitely be able to kill War Magus.","However, it was impossible to remain so calm without alerting the people outside.","This was the earth-shattering change in strength brought about by the jump in cultivation level.","“What a joke!” War Magus roared, his face filled with anger.","Two large axes appeared in his hands. These two axes flickered with a brass luster. There was a terrifying light circulating within them. It was the light after the Great Dao laws were condensed.","The two axes smashed down fiercely, shattering all the domains around Chu Yunfan and arriving in front of him.","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally attacked. He punched out, and eight gods appeared behind him, turning into a terrifying attack torrent, causing the small world to tremble violently.","Bam!","Bam!","The two axes were directly hit and instantly turned into fragments that filled the sky.","The half-Emperor artifact that War Magus was so proud of was completely useless in front of Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan’s fist force did not decrease and pierced through him with one punch.","Spurt!","War Magus spat out a mouthful of blood, and his entire body was sent flying, crashing into the wall of the hall.","Under the effect of the domain, he did not fly out of the hall directly. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan’s punch would have sent him flying for at least ten thousand kilometers.","After sliding down the wall, War Magus spat out another mouthful of blood. His eyes widened as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Why didn’t you kill me? That punch of yours could have killed me!” War Magus roared.","He felt like he was being played by Chu Yunfan like a clown.","Only he knew how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s punch was. Even a fourth half-Emperor would be severely injured, let alone a third half-Emperor like him.","Chu Yunfan looked young. But in War Magus’s eyes, he was a monster.","However, this punch unexpectedly didn’t kill him. There was only one possibility. Chu Yunfan held back and didn’t use his full strength, which led to this.","Only then did he feel that being played by Chu Yunfan was as simple as a cat playing with a toy mouse.","“Because the one who wants to kill you is not me!”","Chu Yunfan smiled and waved his hand. A figure filled with evil aura appeared between the two of them.","“An Evil God!”","War Magus immediately recognized the evil figure in front of him.","It was the special existence of Evil Gods Creed, the Evil Gods.","Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed had fought for thousands of years, so they were all too familiar with Evil Gods Creed’s special combat strength.","Each of these specially modified existences gave Magi Circle a huge headache. The weak ones were at the peak of the King Stage, and the strong ones were even comparable to half-Emperors.","“Are you from Evil Gods Creed?” War Magus’s first reaction was that Chu Yunfan was a spy from Evil Gods Creed.","An old monster who had sealed himself for many years, an itinerant cultivator who had suddenly appeared.","So, Chu Yunfan was from Evil Gods Creed!","“No, you’re not from Evil Gods Creed!” War Magus immediately overturned his previous judgment.","Because if it was Evil Gods Creed, they would definitely not expose themselves.","Although there were conflicts between the two sides, they were only limited to the experts below the half-Emperor Stage. They rarely attacked half-Emperors.","Even if they did, they would try not to leave any traces.","Not to mention that Evil Gods Creed had been exposed even though he could have easily killed him.","It was meaningless!","However, before he could continue to think about Chu Yunfan’s plans, the Evil God moved. It used an evil technique and its evil aura swept toward War Magus.","In an instant, all the life force on War Magus’s body was sucked dry.","In just a moment, War Magus had already lost his life and was sucked into a dried corpse!","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the Evil God was immediately sucked into the Mountain River Diagram.","“Fortunately, there was an Evil God that I didn’t kill!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Back then, there were Evil Gods that fell into his hands. After some refinement, they became his puppets. He originally wanted to study the secrets of the Evil Gods and fight against the mastermind.","However, he did not expect it to be useful here.","Evil Gods were experts unique to Evil Gods Creed. They weren’t even formed through normal cultivation, but through special secret methods.","Even if an outsider wanted to imitate it, they would not be able to do so unless they had Chu Yunfan’s means to capture it and refine it for their own use.","“This time, Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle should be in a mess. They won’t shift their attention to me anymore!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Then, his figure disappeared from the hall and reappeared in the seclusion area.","He did not go to see Zhao Junchen. He only left a message for Zhao Junchen and went out to travel.","Half a day later, a shocking piece of news came from Windy City.","The grand elder of Magi Circle, War Magus, had died tragically in Windy City. The person who had done it might have been Evil Gods Creed."]},{"number":2479,"title":"Chapter 2479: Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed Start a War","paragraphs":["Chapter 2479: Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed Start a War","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This news had just spread and it shook the entire Windy City. Even the dozens of cities in the entire region were in an uproar.","Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle were two behemoths that shrouded this region.","Usually, the two forces would restrain each other in this area. Even if they fought, they would not deliberately choose a balanced place in this area.","But now, a high-ranking member of Magi Circle, War Magus, had died tragically in Windy City and even died in the hands of an Evil God.","In order to investigate this matter, Magi Circle quickly sent out a large team to Windy City to investigate the cause of War Magus’s death.","In the main hall where War Magus lived, Zhao Junchen looked respectfully at the group of martial arts masters from Magi Circle who had come to investigate. The weakest among them was a King. They were a group of peak Kings like Zhao Junchen.","The leader of the group was a grand elder of Magi Circle who was at the fourth half-Emperor Stage.","Sky Cloak Magus!","The group of Magi Circle elders and grand elders did not care about Zhao Junchen who was at the side and began to examine War Magus’s corpse.","“It was indeed an evil technique that the Evil Gods used to absorb life force. It’s a technique unique to their lineage that others couldn’t imitate!” an elder of Magi Circle said with a solemn expression.","Everyone else nodded. Not everyone in Evil Gods Creed was an Evil God. Instead of saying that they were cultivators, it was more appropriate to say that they were a special existence.","It was a creature refined from a secret technique unique to Evil Gods Creed!","There were many unique abilities that outsiders could not imitate.","Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed had fought for so many years, so they naturally had a considerable understanding of this old rival.","Moreover, the Evil Gods were refined using a special secret technique, so there was no possibility of betrayal. Once it had any thoughts of betrayal, it would self-destruct.","Normally, these Evil Gods were acting under orders and wouldn’t act on their own.","The result was obvious. With War Magus’s strength, the person who could have killed him effortlessly would have to be at least at the sixth half-Emperor Stage. An expert at that level was basically second only to the leader of Evil Gods Creed. He was one of the highest-ranking grand elders.","Although they couldn’t figure out Evil Gods Creed’s motive for doing so, all sorts of possibilities pointed to Evil Gods Creed. After eliminating all the impossible things, no matter how unbelievable the remaining things were, they were the truth.","“No matter what Evil Gods Creed’s goal is, we can’t let this matter go. We can now confirm that War Magus died in the hands of an Evil God. Just based on this point, Evil Gods Creed will give us an explanation!” Sky Cloak Magus said coldly.","The death of a half-Emperor grand elder was something that no major force could ignore.","“They can’t just give an explanation. This is a declaration of war!” one of Magi Circle’s elders roared.","“That’s right, we’re declaring war!” another Magi Circle elder roared.","“We definitely can’t let this matter with Evil Gods Creed rest!”","The Magi Circle elders roared. To them, this was no different from declaring war.","The people of Magi Circle had a fiery temper to begin with. Now that they saw War Magus being killed, they were even more furious.","They only felt that they had been greatly provoked!","They were not afraid of Evil Gods Creed. The strength of Magi Circle behind them was not inferior to Evil Gods Creed at all.","“We have to go back and find the leader for this matter. The leader will give the order!”","Sky Cloak Magus still knew how big this matter was. This was the key to whether the two giants would start a war.","“But that King Chu who suddenly appeared is a little suspicious!” Sky Cloak Magus suspected that this matter had something to do with Chu Yunfan, the person who had suddenly appeared out of nowhere.","Now, after such a great battle, War Magus died in battle, but Chu Yunfan had disappeared.","Although it was difficult to point to Chu Yunfan from the evidence, it was still enough to make him suspicious.","“Where did King Chu go?” Sky Cloak Magus asked Zhao Junchen who was standing beside him.","“Elder Chu left a note,” Zhao Junchen said. “He said that he went on a trip. We don’t know where he went either!”","“Is that so? “Contact him as soon as possible. Regardless of whether he’s a suspect or not, he has to report to Magi Circle. He’s already been recruited by our Magi Circle. If he doesn’t appear after the time limit, don’t blame us for putting him on the wanted list!” Sky Cloak Magus said directly.","“Yes, we will definitely find a way to inform Elder Chu!” Zhao Junchen said hurriedly. He felt that this was an undeserved disaster that involved Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle.","If they didn’t find out that it was the Evil God’s doing, the entire Windy City would have been destroyed.","A mere Windy City did not have the ability to bear the wrath of Magi Circle.","Even if they destroyed Windy City, it was actually just a casual act.","Windy City had no room to resist at all!","All of a sudden, a telepathic thought flashed in front of Sky Cloak Magus. Sky Cloak Magus sensed it and said, “We have to go back and prepare for the war. Just now, Master has asked Emperor Magus for instructions. Emperor Magus has personally divined it with the divination skill. The one who killed War Magus is indeed an Evil God. It’s accurate!”","The elders of Magi Circle immediately had a cold expression on their faces. Based on this, the probability of the final battle was almost 100%.","Magi Circle was known for powerful physiques and ability to fight against the Heavens and Earth. It was also famous for its divination skills.","Among the various forces, there were very few existences that could be compared to them.","Emperor Magus would not attack easily, and his real body was in a deep sleep. However, even if it was just a wisp of primordial spirit outside, it could be said to be foolproof in making a divination. It was impossible for him to fail.","Under such circumstances, if Evil Gods Creed could not give a reasonable explanation, a war between the two sides would probably be unavoidable.","“I heard that Evil Gods Creed seems to be organizing a group of people to go on an expedition to the outer realms. Hmph, we must not let them succeed. Otherwise, if they take down another world, wouldn’t their strength be even greater?” Sky Cloak Magus snorted coldly.","“Let’s go back and prepare for battle!” Sky Cloak Magus said.","Then, he led the Magi Circle experts to cut open the space and jump away.","With Sky Cloak Magus’ departure, Magi Circle entered a state of preparation for war. The news that an Evil God of Evil Gods Creed had killed a grand elder of Magi Circle was finally confirmed.","Magi Circle even sent people to Evil Gods Creed to question them.","Evil Gods Creed, who had done nothing, naturally denied it and refused to admit that this matter had anything to do with them.","Magi Circle was even more furious. They were certain that Evil Gods Creed was deliberately hiding the truth.","For a time, the two forces were mobilizing their forces. At the intersection of the two forces, all kinds of friction began to rise.","A great battle was about to break out!"]},{"number":2480,"title":"Chapter 2480: Temporarily Joining Magi Circle","paragraphs":["Chapter 2480: Temporarily Joining Magi Circle","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The collision of the two behemoths made the various forces surrounding the two behemoths nervous.","For both sides, it might just be an ordinary friction, but for ordinary small forces, it could be a disaster.","No one knew the root cause of this matter. Only Chu Yunfan knew.","Chu Yunfan, who had found a place to hide, soon found out that because of his plan, Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed had started fighting.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan rubbed his chin.","“They started fighting so easily?”","Chu Yunfan rubbed his chin. Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle were more likely to have a big battle than he had imagined.","According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, after killing War Magus, it would at most cause some conflict between Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle.","Then, he asked them to shift their attention away from him.","However, he did not expect that these two behemoths would actually erupt into a great battle just like that.","Chu Yunfan didn’t think that War Magus would have such a big influence. The only possibility was that the two sides had already reached the point where they had to fight.","And Chu Yunfan’s killing of War Magus was likely a fuse.","Chu Yunfan had also received a letter from Zhao Junchen. Magi Circle had directly recruited him to join Magi Circle.","If he refused, Chu Yunfan might not be able to show his true face in this area.","Otherwise, he would face the pursuit of Magi Circle!","He did not doubt Magi Circle’s determination to remove the sudden nail he was.","However, it was also because of this that Chu Yunfan’s determination was strengthened.","“I absolutely can’t let Evil Gods Creed free up their hands!”","Chu Yunfan almost immediately made a judgment. If Evil Gods Creed was free, the consequences would be unimaginable.","This was because Evil Gods Creed had the ability to go on expeditions into the starry skies, and it would pose a huge threat to the Central Plains.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan had an idea.","“Since Magi Circle wants to recruit me, I’ll let them recruit me openly!”","“It’s just nice. I can also use the power of Magi Circle to do something!”","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes.","He knew that Magi Circle would definitely not let him live in the end.","However, before that, Magi Circle would definitely need to use his strength, especially now that Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle were at war.","It was a time when people were needed. A half-Emperor was not easy to find!","He had just received a shocking piece of news from Zhao Junchen. Evil Gods Creed was preparing to send troops to the starry sky. Although Chu Yunfan was not 100% sure, he had a hunch that they were definitely heading for the Central Plains.","Evil Gods Creed’s many years of planning in the Central Plains had been uprooted by Chu Yunfan.","The Evil God they had sent to deal with it was killed by Chu Yunfan.","Evil Gods Creed would definitely not let this go!","Even when the two behemoths were about to fight, they did not plan to recall this expedition army.","Clearly, a battle of this level was not enough to shake Evil Gods Creed’s foundation.","As long as Evil Gods Creed’s Emperor Evil was still alive, Evil Gods Creed’s foundation would be as stable as Mount Tai.","Chu Yunfan decided that he had to find something for Evil Gods Creed to do.","The place where Magi Circle was located was not like Windy City, which was directly in the Ancient Realm.","On the contrary, it was in a small world called the Magi Realm.","This world, which was filled with all kinds of barriers and array formations, was the headquarters of the entire Magi Circle.","As soon as he stepped into the Magi Realm, Chu Yunfan immediately felt a strong pressure pressing down on him.","This was not targeted at him. All cultivators who were not members of Magi Circle and did not cultivate magic would be strongly rejected or even suppressed.","Only if one’s cultivation base could reach the level of Emperor Magus, or even beyond that, could one be immune to the suppression of the Magi Realm.","This was also Magi Circle’s final base camp. If they were attacked here, Magi Circle would not be long from its final collapse.","Chu Yunfan saw the endless army of Magi Circle being mobilized from the depths of the Magi Realm. Then, they went into the distance to attack, and one by one, they disappeared in a teleportation array.","Even Chu Yunfan was amazed by Magi Circle’s terrifying strength.","As a behemoth that had survived since ancient times and had an Emperor overseeing it, the strength that Magi Circle possessed far exceeded the limits that others could imagine.","If the Central Plains were to face such an attack, it would be impossible for them to hold out.","How terrifying was a force that had been developing since ancient times? Just the part that Chu Yunfan could sense was already very shocking.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He just followed the person who introduced him to the depths of the Magi Realm and met Magi Circle’s leader, Sun Scorch Magus.","Just like his name, Sun Scorch Magus looked like a sun that was soaring through the sky.","Sitting deep in the clouds, he was tall and revealed an astonishing body that was more than 10,000 feet tall.","Sun Scorch Magus looked down at Chu Yunfan and narrowed his eyes. Lightning was surging in his eyes.","He realized that he couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan’s background. Even if he used the divinations of Magi Circle, he couldn’t tell anything.","This meant that Chu Yunfan might have some kind of artifact that concealed his secrets, so he couldn’t calculate it.","With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, there was nothing he could hide from Sun Scorch Magus. It was enough to show that Chu Yunfan’s artifact was of a very high grade.","However, Chu Yunfan was just an itinerant cultivator. Sun Scorch Magus didn’t know how many years ago Chu Yunfan had sealed himself up until now, so he didn’t take it to heart.","In this world, the older the better. Speaking of ancient, there were a few forces in the world that could be compared to Magi Circle.","“Greetings, leader of Magi Circle!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Greetings, Elder Chu!” Sun Scorch Magus’s expression remained unchanged as he spoke. “From today onwards, we can be considered a family. On behalf of Magi Circle, I’ve invited you to be our Magi Circle’s Guest Elder, the same rank as an elder! As long as you make enough contributions to Magi Circle, we will never mistreat those who have made contributions. We will also not let you die, Elder Chu!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. His expression was calm, but he was sneering in his heart. The greater the contribution he made, the more miserable his death would be.","Magi Circle would not allow him to grow. When he was no longer of value, the first person they would make a move on would probably be him, Sun Scorch Magus.","“Understood!” Chu Yunfan said. “I’ve just entered Magi Circle. I haven’t made any sizeable achievements yet, but I get to enjoy the position of a Guest Elder. I feel a little ashamed. However, there’s an opportunity right now. I wonder if you’d be interested, sir?”"]},{"number":2481,"title":"Chapter 2481: Are You Attacking Alone or as a Group?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2481: Are You Attacking Alone or as a Group?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Oh? What opportunity?” Sun Scorch Magus looked at Chu Yunfan with a faint smile.","“I heard that Evil Gods Creed is planning to send an expedition army to another world outside the starry sky. If Evil Gods Creed succeeds, the strength of Evil Gods Creed will definitely increase by a lot. At that time, it will be even more difficult. Why don’t we destroy this army?” Chu Yunfan said.","Sun Scorch Magus thought for a moment. Actually, he did not take Evil Gods Creed’s army seriously.","Although that army was not small and was a disaster for ordinary worlds, it was not a big deal for Magi Circle.","Even if that world was conquered by Evil Gods Creed, the increase in their strength was a matter of the future. Even if they had it, it would not be enough for Evil Gods Creed to suppress Magi Circle.","It wasn’t a big deal, at least it wasn’t in his priority list.","Even when Evil Gods Creed was facing a great war, they did not recall this army because neither side thought it was a big deal.","However, just as Chu Yunfan said, this was a good opportunity.","“I sealed myself to this era, and I was invited by Magi Circle to become a Guest Elder. As the saying goes, no merit, no reward. I can help Magi Circle destroy this Evil Gods Creed army to repay Magi Circle’s invitation to me!” Chu Yunfan spoke frankly.","Sun Scorch Magus seriously considered Chu Yunfan’s words. He did not have any doubts.","Magi Circle’s investigation did not find any records of Chu Yunfan.","It was normal for ordinary forces to not know Chu Yunfan’s background.","After all, after a long period of time, many forces would be replaced every once in a while.","However, Magi Circle had existed since the beginning of the Ancient Realm, even before the Ancient Realm was stabilized.","It had existed for countless years. If there was a half-Emperor in the Ancient Realm, the possibility of it not being recorded was very small.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance was so sudden that some people even guessed that it was very likely that he had appeared before the Ancient Realm.","In other words, Chu Yunfan had sealed himself from the antiquity era until now.","However, it was not strange that Chu Yunfan wanted to integrate into the Magi Circle. He had sealed himself from such a distant past until now, and he had no family.","It was normal for a half-Emperor to have a backer.","In fact, he had seen more than one or two people who had similar thoughts. Even if some people heard the news, they would still be lucky and think that they were eliminated by Magi Circle because they did not work hard for it.","That was because it was really too difficult for itinerant cultivators to survive in this world. Ordinary Kings were fine because they were just ants. They did not even have the qualifications to see the real world.","Therefore, there would be no pain, because it was not their turn to suffer.","If he really offended someone he couldn’t afford to offend, death was the only destination.","On the contrary, it was the half-Emperor who was the beginning of the real pain.","This was because they had realized the existence of the ceiling, but they had no way to solve it.","Joining a force like Magi Circle was their only way.","Sun Scorch Magus had seen many people like this, so he did not doubt it.","Moreover, although he did not care much about that army, if he could get rid of it, it would undoubtedly be very good.","“Very well, Chu Yunfan. It’s very good that you’re willing to work for Magi Circle. As long as you’re willing, I can even apply with Emperor Magus to guide you in your cultivation!” Sun Scorch Magus nodded, and a smile that he thought was very warm appeared on his face.","To those half-Emperors, there was nothing more important than the guidance of an Emperor.","In his opinion, this must be what Chu Yunfan wanted the most.","“Thank you, Lord Sun Scorch Magus!” Chu Yunfan pretended to be surprised.","For ordinary half-Emperors, this was what they were looking forward to the most.","However, for Chu Yunfan, it was just so-so. Anyway, he didn’t have any expectations.","“I’ll immediately get someone to organize a large army under your command. We must get rid of Evil Gods Creed’s expeditionary army!” Sun Scorch Magus said.","In the depths of Magi Circle, a large army had gathered together at an astonishing speed. This was an elite army of Magi Circle.","This elite army had gathered together, and there were even a few half-Emperors in the lead.","They looked at each other and didn’t understand. The battle was clearly before them, and they were all elite experts. Why would they be mobilized here?","What puzzled the other experts even more was that they were told that they had another mission this time, and their leader was a new Guest Elder.","They didn’t have a good impression of itinerant cultivators to begin with, and they looked down on them even more. Now, the higher-ups actually wanted them to be led by an itinerant cultivator.","They were dissatisfied and puzzled.","Soon, their eyes fell on Chu Yunfan, who had rushed over.","“You are that itinerant cultivator?” At this moment, a young and majestic half-Emperor stepped forward.","“I am Chu Yunfan. Who are you?” Chu Yunfan glanced over.","“I am Hero Magus!” the half-Emperor of Magi Circle said.","Chu Yunfan recalled who this Hero Magus was.","Back in Windy City, he had consciously asked Zhao Junchen to gather information on Evil Gods Creed and Magi Circle for him.","Windy City had been collecting information in this area all these years. After all, the existence of these two big shots was related to the life and death of Windy City.","Of course, he couldn’t get too detailed information, but he could get a glimpse of some basic information.","He had a rough idea of the number of half-Emperors on both sides.","Hero Magus was a rising genius in Magi Circle. He was a proud genius. He had been cultivating for less than a thousand years and was already a half-Emperor.","He was even hailed as a powerful candidate to be the next leader of Magi Circle.","With Magi Circle’s system, as long as there was a sufficiently powerful successor, Sun Scorch Magus would probably hand over Magi Circle as soon as possible.","“So it’s you. I’ve heard of you. You’re known as one of the top geniuses in Magi Circle in recent years. I wonder what you’re trying to do by jumping out. Are you not convinced by me?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“That’s right, I’m not convinced by you. Who do you think you are? You’re just a foreign Guest Elder, and you actually want to lead us? I don’t know what the leader is thinking, but I don’t approve of it!” Hero Magus shook his head.","Although the other half-Emperors didn’t say anything, they all had similar thoughts.","A mere foreign Guest Elder actually wanted them to be his subordinates. He was simply thinking too much.","“I see!” Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “It seems that we have to spar. Just attack me. Are you attacking alone or as a group?”"]},{"number":2482,"title":"Chapter 2482: Gaining Control of Magi Circle’s Expeditionary Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 2482: Gaining Control of Magi Circle’s Expeditionary Army","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked at these half-Emperors with a smile. If it were other itinerant cultivators, they would not dare to offend these half-Emperors from the orthodox Magi Circle. After all, they would still have to beg for food in Magi Circle in the future. If they fell out, they would still be put in a difficult position in the end.","However, Chu Yunfan did not care about this. He had no intention of staying in Magi Circle for long.","As long as he could use Magi Circle to eradicate Evil Gods Creed’s expedition to the starry sky, it would be fine!","This was his biggest goal!","Growing in chaos!","That was his true goal!","Although the fourth half-Emperor Stage was not bad, it was still far from what he wanted to achieve!","What Chu Yunfan lacked the most now was time. As long as he had enough time, he believed that with his ability, he could break through to the seventh half-Emperor Stage in a short time.","He was a true first-rate expert in this world!","“How dare you!” Hero Magus was furious.","Even though he could not see through Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was confident that the practices of Magi Circle was far superior to the techniques of itinerant cultivators.","Even if their level was inferior, their battle prowess might not be that bad.","Hero Magus wielded his axes and slashed at Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The axes shattered the sky. The attack of a half-Emperor, even if it was just a simple weapon, had great power.","This was the fighting technique of Magi Circle. No matter what divine powers or magical weapons they used, they could dominate the world by relying on their physical bodies and divine weapons.","Their bodies were their strongest trump card!","However, when his attack landed on Chu Yunfan, it failed to break through Chu Yunfan’s defensive barrier.","Chu Yunfan simply waved his hand, and Hero Magus’ entire body flew out as if he had been hit hard. All kinds of Chu Yunfan’s laws also took the opportunity to pour into Hero Magus’ body.","Spurt!","Hero Magus spat out blood as his body was slammed onto the ground.","He wanted to struggle to get up, but he saw a huge foot falling from the sky and landing on his body, severely injuring him.","He was stomped into the ground!","Chu Yunfan stepped on Hero Magus with one foot and looked at the other half-Emperors. “Do you plan to attack one by one or all at once?”","These half-Emperors exchanged glances with each other, feeling both angry and resentful.","If it was any other time, they would have charged up long ago and would not be so apprehensive.","However, they were really frightened by Chu Yunfan’s imposing manner. With just a wave of his hand, Hero Magus was sent flying, heavily injured.","In their eyes, such combat strength was simply unfathomable.","At this moment, everyone looked at a well-built old man with white hair and a youthful face.","The old man was wearing a long robe of the magi. However, unlike ordinary people, he had four hands.","Each of his hand held a weapon, and his aura was shocking. He was many times stronger than Hero Magus.","A fourth half-Emperor!","He was a fourth half-Emperor and one of the best among the half-Emperors in Magi Circle.","It was precisely because of this that everyone looked at him.","“King Chu? I, Kid Magus, will come and experience your brilliant moves. Although you defeated Hero Magus, don’t think that it’s because our Magi Circle is weak and that magic is not good. It’s just that he’s not proficient in it!” the old half-Emperor of Magi Circle said.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “Of course. I’m not arrogant enough to think that Mgi Circle is weak. Magic is also one of the great ways of Heaven and Earth. There are only invincible people, not invincible techniques!”","“Alright, then I won’t stand on ceremony!”","Kid Magus roared, and his entire body swelled up with the wind. In an instant, he had grown into a giant that was over 10,000 feet tall.","Golden light erupted from his body, and one could only vaguely see a pair of extremely terrifying eyes.","Boom!","The four hands struck out at the same time. In an instant, thousands of changes were performed, turning into a light screen that covered the sky and rushed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","The terrifying surging energy on his body swept out like a bloody cloud.","Chu Yunfan made his move. Even if he wasn’t afraid of fourth half-Emperor, he couldn’t do what he did to Hero Magus, sending his opponent flying with a casual blow.","At the same time, he threw a punch, going head-to-head with his opponent’s myriad transformations.","To break the complexity with simplicity, to break the surface with a point!","With just a simple punch, he turned into eight gods and faced them head-on.","Boom!","The two sides collided fiercely. This terrifying fist force swept out. Wherever it passed, it scattered the light that filled the sky.","There were no more fancy moves. It was just a punch!","Victory was decided!","Kid Magus grunted and flew backward. He kept coughing up blood and hastily regained his footing.","He did not take any further action. He only looked at Chu Yunfan for a long time before saying, “Thank you for showing mercy. I have no objections to you leading the army this time. However, please let go of Hero Magus immediately. The dignity of Magi Circle cannot be insulted like this!”","The group of half-Emperors did not object to Kid Magus’ words because they knew very well that even the strongest among them, Kid Magus, could not withstand Chu Yunfan’s punch and was defeated.","What else could they say?","This time, they could not compete with Chu Yunfan, but they could argue with Chu Yunfan in the future.","“Since there are no objections, then listen to my orders and set off!” Chu Yunfan said and then let go of Hero Magus.","Hero Magus scrambled to the side, his expression extremely ferocious.","He had never suffered such a huge loss since his debut. Moreover, the other party was only an itinerant cultivator. This was a great humiliation.","However, he knew that he had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan. He could only temporarily endure his rage and suppress it.","‘Just you wait. Sooner or later, you’ll die in my hands. When you’re no longer useful, I’ll definitely apply to kill you myself!’ Hero Magus thought coldly.","He knew Magi Circle’s attitude toward these foreign itinerant cultivators. As long as they were of no use to them or their strength had increased to a certain level, they would be dealt with. They definitely could not stay and threaten Magi Circle’s rule.","Under Chu Yunfan’s command, the army quickly set off toward the starry sky outside the Ancient Realm.","Chu Yunfan had led armies for a long time, so he was no stranger to this.","Under his lead, the millions of elite soldiers and elites of Magi Circle quickly entered the endless starry sky above the Ancient Realm.","Soon, they disappeared into the endless starry sky.","A month later, the army that Evil Gods Creed had prepared for a long time finally set off, heading toward the ancient path of outer space.","When they arrived at a border, a huge array suddenly appeared around them.","“We’re being ambushed!”","The expression of the leader of Evil Gods Creed army changed.","“It’s the Twelve Capital Sky Great Array!”"]},{"number":2483,"title":"Chapter 2483: Massacre","paragraphs":["Chapter 2483: Massacre","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The army of Evil Gods Creed saw the huge array and the 12 golden men that were 10,000 feet tall surrounding them.","They immediately recognized that this was Magi Circle’s Twelve Capital Sky Great Array!","They were considered old rivals of Magi Circle, so they naturally knew the name of Magi Circle’s Twelve Capital Sky Great Array.","It could almost be said that this was the most famous array formation in Magi Circle.","It was also one of the most top-notch formations in the world.","As long as there were twelve people in Magi Circle, they could set up such a battle formation, which could greatly increase the strength of Magi Circle’s army.","It was just that the scale was different, and the strength was different. The Twelve Capital Sky Great Array that was set up was also completely different.","The Twelve Capital Sky Great Array before them was obviously huge in scale and was also extremely powerful.","“Initiate the Evil God Great Array!” a supreme expert from Evil Gods Creed’s army immediately shouted.","In response to Magi Circle’s Twelve Capital Sky Great Array, Evil Gods Creed had developed the Evil God Great Array, which was also an extremely impressive formation.","Of course, compared to the Twelve Capital Sky Great Array, which was considered one of the best formations even in ancient times, it was still incomparable.","However, if they could form a formation, it would be much better than not having a formation at all.","Without the formation, they could only allow Magi Circle’s army to surround them. However, with the Evil God Great Array, they could buy time and not be defeated immediately.","They could delay until Evil Gods Creed’s reinforcements arrived.","Looking down from the sky, one could see that the two formations of the two sides had collided fiercely. It was like two huge flesh and blood grinders that continued to fight. Every minute and every second, countless elite soldiers were crushed and killed by these two huge flesh and blood grinders.","As time passed, more and more experts joined the battle. First, it was the half-Kings, then Kings, and then even the half-Emperors.","Chu Yunfan had been in Magi Circle’s battle formation the entire time and had not made a move.","They saw Magi Circle’s experts join the battlefield and fight against Evil Gods Creed’s experts.","Hero Magus, who was previously defeated by Chu Yunfan, was being suppressed by an Evil Gods Creed expert.","Previously, he was defeated by Chu Yunfan with a snap of his fingers. It was not because he was too weak, but because Chu Yunfan’s strength was too far from his.","Both sides soon suffered heavy casualties. Whether it was Evil Gods Creed or Magi Circle, their strength was about the same. However, in general, Magi Circle had the upper hand.","After all, Evil Gods Creed had only come to conquer a low-level world in their eyes, while Magi Circle had come specifically to ambush and kill them.","The different targets at the beginning led to the different sizes of the troops dispatched.","But even so, it was extremely difficult to defeat Evil Gods Creed!","Magi Circle’s Twelve Capital Sky Great Array was not able to easily defeat Evil Gods Creed’s Evil God Great Array.","Chu Yunfan watched from the side for a while. If this was just a head-on battlefield, Chu Yunfan did not mind expending some of the strength of Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed.","Anyway, it was a dogfight!","But now it was different. Chu Yunfan had no time to delay. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be long before Evil Gods Creed’s reinforcements arrived.","“I can’t drag this on any longer. It’s time to end this!”","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. His body swayed, and the space in front of him was torn apart.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan charged into the battlefield.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan crashed into the Evil God Great Array. The terrifying impact created a huge hole in the Evil God Great Array.","Chu Yunfan charged into the crowd. The power of lightning in his hand transformed into a long sword and swept out.","In an instant, it transformed into a huge sword that was ten thousand feet long.","The giant sword swept across half of the battlefield, and countless Evil Gods Creed soldiers who could not escape in time were killed.","After Chu Yunfan’s attack succeeded, he didn’t hesitate and chased after an Evil God that was fighting Hero Magus.","This Evil God was at the peak of the first half-Emperor Stage and was even one step away from the second level.","But Hero Magus was able to fight the other party to the death!","It was enough to show that Hero Magus’s potential was indeed very impressive!","Swish!","Hero Magus was focused on fighting the Evil God in front of him but he didn’t expect that a shocking sword light would shatter the domain that he and the Evil God were fighting for.","The Evil God that fought with him was killed in one strike.","It was just a simple sword move without any extra fancy movements. It was extremely simple, but there was an extreme beauty to it.","In the next moment, he realized that Chu Yunfan had attacked. It was just a simple attack, but he had already killed the opponent that he felt was very difficult to deal with.","Without a doubt, this was a true expert!","When Chu Yunfan dealt with him previously, he had indeed shown mercy.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care what Hero Magus was thinking. After killing the Evil God, he immediately went to find the other Evil Gods Creed experts.","Evil Gods Creed’s half-Emperors were mostly Evil Gods, but not all of them were Evil Gods.","These people were very brave and good at fighting.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, who had an overwhelming advantage in strength, it was useless.","After crushing them all the way, he finally arrived before the commander of the Evil Gods Creed army.","The eyes of Evil Gods Creed commander had already turned red as he watched Chu Yunfan go on a killing spree.","Evil Gods Creed’s losses in this battle were simply too great.","“Roar!”","The Evil God roared and blasted Kid Magus away. Kid Magus, who was fighting with it, flew toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge, instead, he threw a punch.","The punch broke through the Evil God’s domain like paper.","It wasn’t forcefully broken through with brute strength, but as if Chu Yunfan had grasped the laws and rules and easily broke through the Evil God’s defense and struck it.","“As expected!” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","No matter how strong the Evil Gods were, they were all carved from the same mold.","Chu Yunfan, who had thoroughly studied the Evil Gods, easily found its weakness and broke its domain. It was not difficult at all.","The Evil God was struck in the chest and it screamed as it flew tens of thousands of miles away.","A bloody hole appeared in his chest, and his life force was rapidly draining away.","Chu Yunfan chased after it. With a set of Nine Netherworld Stomps, he easily took the life of this Evil God.","As the half-Emperors were slaughtered, Evil Gods Creed’s army was also collapsing at an alarming rate.","Especially those Kings and half-Emperors from Magi Circle, they all attacked."]},{"number":2484,"title":"Chapter 2484: Harvest, Fifth Half-Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2484: Harvest, Fifth Half-Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were many spells in Magi Circle that required blood essence to cultivate. To these Kings and half-Emperors, the remaining hundreds of thousands of Evil Gods of Evil Gods Creed were like cabbages on the roadside that were directly cut off.","Of course, they only acted after confirming that Chu Yunfan had no intention of fighting anymore.","After all, no matter how proud they were of their status and felt that they were more noble than Chu Yunfan, they could not do such a shameless thing.","After all, no matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan played a decisive role in the smooth elimination of Evil Gods Creed’s expeditionary army.","Of course, Chu Yunfan had also gained something. The half-Emperor Evil Gods Creed experts and Evil Gods that he had killed all fell into his hands.","In the end, they were all fed to the Brahma Tree.","Soon, the entire battlefield turned into hell. Magi Circle’s army started a brutal massacre, and everyone looked as if it was only natural. If Magi Circle’s army had been defeated today, the outcome would not have been any better.","Several hours later, Evil Gods Creed’s reinforcements finally arrived. However, they were unable to save this expeditionary army.","The entire galaxy had turned into a battlefield, but not a single bone or blood remained. All the bones and blood had been taken away and became the foundation of Magi Circle’s cultivation.","“Well done, Chu Yunfan!” Sun Scorch Magus laughed heartily in the depths of the Magi Realm. “Even Emperor Magus praised you for your good work!”","Chu Yunfan was the one who was attacking. He looked at the lofty, giant-like Sun Scorch Magus and felt a little strange.","Did Emperor Magus know about this too?","Generally speaking, these Emperors should be in a state of deep sleep. Unless it threatened the survival of their respective inheritances, they would not wake up.","Most of the matters in Magi Circle should be decided by Sun Scorch Magus.","Chu Yunfan felt that something was not right. However, he did not show it on his face. He said, “It’s just a small amount of effort!”","“This time,” Sun Scorch Magus said, “even Emperor Magus has noticed you. This is your reward!”","Sun Scorch Magus flicked his finger, and a stream of wood origin energy fell into Chu Yunfan’s body.","‘Such pure wood energy!’","Chu Yunfan immediately felt a huge amount of vitality surging into his body. Every inch and every cell was bursting with powerful vitality.","Among the five elements, wood energy was the source of life, and this ball of wood origin energy was straight from the source of wood energy.","Chu Yunfan knew from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that origin energy of the five elements was very rare.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he could easily refine the power of the five elements from the spirit energy of heaven and earth. However, it was impossible to extract the origin energy from the power of the five elements.","Only when one reached the Emperor Stage and had a shocking insight into the laws would it be possible to continuously absorb the origin energy from the nature’s spirit energy.","The cultivation of Emperors was essentially the cultivation of origin energy!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly emitted a huge life force, which gushed out from every pore. His level suddenly broke through from the original fourth half-Emperor Stage to the fifth half-Emperor Stage.","Chu Yunfan felt that every cell in his body was undergoing a transformation, an earth-shattering change.","This was a transformation of the essence of life. Every cell in Chu Yunfan’s body was like a ferocious beast that had been starved for countless years. He desperately absorbed the wood origin energy, instantly increasing his cultivation by another level.","When Sun Scorch Magus saw this scene, he could not help but be surprised. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to absorb it so quickly.","Although it was just a small ball of wood origin enetgy, the amount of life force contained in it was unimaginable. Even a seventh half-Emperor like him would need a long time to absorb it.","In fact, even if one’s life force was slightly stronger after absorbing it, one might not be able to break through at all.","After reaching the half-Emperor Stage, the speed of cultivation was determined by the understanding of the world and the comprehension of the Great Path.","The deeper one’s comprehension of the Great Path, the faster one’s cultivation speed.","He was stuck on the comprehension of the Great Path. Otherwise, with the resources of Magi Circle, he could easily reach the ninth half-Emperor Stage with just a casual use of resources.","He had once read ancient books. In ancient times, there was no such thing as half-Emperors among the Emperors because their comprehension of the Great Path had reached an extremely shocking level.","Therefore, their cultivation in this level would often advance by leaps and bounds. In just a few years or decades, they would cultivate to the Emperor Stage.","After Chu Yunfan had easily absorbed the wood origin energy, he reached the fifth half-Emperor Stage without any difficulty.","It was not difficult for Sun Scorch Magus to guess that Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of the Great Path was far from the fourth half-Emperor Stage that he had shown before. It might even be more than the fifth level.","This matched Chu Yunfan’s identity as an old monster that he had sealed himself for many years.","Only those old monsters who had sealed themselves for many years could have such a situation.","“Thank you, Lord Sun Scorch Magus! Thank you, Your Majesty!” Chu Yunfan said after a while.","Chu Yunfan tried his best to look grateful as if he had joined Magi Circle to seek improvement in his strength.","Sun Scorch Magus nodded. Chu Yunfan’s appearance was expected.","“As long as you work hard for Magi Circle, this bit of wood origin energy is nothing!” Sun Scorch Magus said calmly.","He indeed did not think much of wood origin energy. For Magi Circle, which had endless resources and a deep foundation, although wood origin energy was precious, it was not completely impossible to see it.","“Thank you, sir!” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","After leaving the Magi Realm, Chu Yunfan received another call not long after.","Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed were at war.","This sudden change disrupted almost everyone’s rhythm, making everyone dumbfounded.","This time, Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed were not like what many people thought. It was not just a simple conflict of interest.","Such a thing was not rare in the entire history of the Ancient Realm.","However, an all-out war was something that no one had expected.","A tragic battle was about to break out. The collision of the two behemoths that had ruled the Ancient World for countless years caused Kings to die almost every day.","Every once in a while, a half-Emperor would die on the battlefield."]},{"number":2485,"title":"Chapter 2485: Three Years, Sixth Half-Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2485: Three Years, Sixth Half-Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The all-out war between the two behemoths affected the entire Ancient Realm.","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed.","For three years, the flames of war had spread throughout the areas controlled by Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed.","For the two forces that could tear space, there was almost no stable rear.","They would often teleport to an area controlled by the other party.","Of course, these two forces could be said to have reached a peak in their local operations.","Each region had a barrier and array that stabilized space. It was not easy to tear through space and rush to the rear.","However, there were always a few times where they succeeded, and it was enough to make a mess of the other party.","Therefore, the main battlefield was still at the border between the two sides, which was originally a no-man’s land. This was a battle zone drawn by both sides.","In the Magi Realm, in a grotto-heaven that had been opened up by a divine mountain, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the Mountain River Diagram.","He was cultivating with his eyes closed. Behind him, countless Dharma Idols appeared, forming a small world.","His domain had materialized.","In these three years, Chu Yunfan had not only consolidated his cultivation in the fifth half-Emperor Stage, but he had also broken through to the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","He was only a step away from reaching the true seventh half-Emperor Stage.","In just three years, Chu Yunfan had improved. Other than his own talent, the biggest reason was, of course, the continuous battle.","After joining Magi Circle, Chu Yunfan had gained a wealth of experience from fighting the war with Evil Gods Creed.","Especially since Chu Yunfan was not a direct descendant, he was arranged to be on the front line. He was often surrounded by several half-Emperors with similar cultivation levels. Ambushes were commonplace.","In the past three years, Chu Yunfan had encountered at least a dozen battles. This was a very high frequency for a battle between half-Emperors.","Several times, Chu Yunfan had even attracted the attention of the terrifying seventh half-Emperors. Several half-Emperors had joined forces to attack him, and even Chu Yunfan had been severely injured.","If he hadn’t used the Mountain River Diagram to escape, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","After that incident, he was rewarded by Magi Circle for his meritorious service. His cultivation improved further and reached the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","This time, he had cultivated to the peak of the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","Suddenly, a thought fluctuation came from outside.","It was an order from the higher-ups of Magi Circle!","Chu Yunfan quickly analyzed the meaning of the thought. Magi Circle’s higher-ups were preparing to organize a surprise attack on the rear of Evil Gods Creed. In that city, there was a large amount of war resources hoarded by Evil Gods Creed.","They demanded that the war resources be destroyed!","“A mission to attack the rear?” Chu Yunfan rubbed his chin and said. “The higher-ups of Magi Circle have indeed lost all their patience and want me to die!”","Chu Yunfan calculated for a moment and immediately understood Magi Circle’s intention. They wanted to use Evil Gods Creed’s power to eliminate him.","They could also use this method to exhaust Evil Gods Creed’s strength.","According to Chu Yunfan’s observations over the past few years, there were very few foreign Guest Elders among the top combat forces in Magi Circle. Almost all of them were direct descendants personally nurtured by Magi Circle.","Most of them were at the fifth or sixth level of the half-Emperor Stage. As for the top experts who had reached the seventh half-Emperor Stage, Chu Yunfan had only caught a glimpse of them. They were all talents cultivated by Magi Circle.","Correspondingly, the top experts of Evil Gods Creed were either Evil Gods or Evil Gods Creed’s own top experts.","It was no different from Magi Circle.","Chu Yunfan was able to escape after being surrounded several times. This was largely because his understanding of the Evil Gods had reached the peak.","Even if the enemy’s cultivation level was far higher than Chu Yunfan’s, they would inevitably suffer a huge loss at his hands.","Logically speaking, it was impossible for there to be no peerless geniuses among itinerant cultivators.","The difference between itinerant cultivators and legacy cultivators was not the difference in talent. There were often outstanding itinerant cultivators, and the difference between them was largely due to the difference in legacies and resources.","Itinerant cultivators who could cultivate to the half-Emperor Stage were the best among the itinerant cultivators. Their talent was not inferior to those legacy cultivators. In terms of talent, they might not be inferior to the Emperors of the antiquity era.","However, none of the half-Emperor itinerant cultivators had surpassed level seven.","It was possible that Chu Yunfan hadn’t been here for long, so he hadn’t seen them. After all, most of the experts above the seventh half-Emperor Stage were desperately cultivating in order to break through.","They were only a step away from becoming an Emperor, so who would be willing to give up hope?","Now, both sides were fighting with each other, and it wasn’t the first time that seventh half-Emperor Stage and above experts had appeared on the battlefield.","Under such circumstances, if Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed really had Guest Elders at the seventh half-Emperor Stage or above, they would be sent to the front lines as cannon fodder.","It was impossible to let the direct descendants risk their lives and let the foreign dignitaries sit and enjoy peace.","Therefore, it was not difficult for Chu Yunfan to guess that there were probably no Guest Elders above the seventh half-Emperor Stage in these two sects.","Thinking about it carefully, Chu Yunfan had already reached this standard.","It was obvious that he had changed from a convenient tool to an object that needed to be cleaned up.","Attacking Evil Gods Creed’s rear could be said to have no chance of winning. Even the survival rate was less than 10%.","However, Chu Yunfan had no other choice. He could feel a powerful spiritual force sweeping back and forth above his cave abode. If Chu Yunfan refused, there was no doubt that the master behind these powerful spiritual forces would immediately kill him.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid because he had prepared for this for several years.","Of course, he knew that Magi Circle harbored ill intentions. However, Magi Circle had underestimated his ability. It was impossible for them to send him to his death.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the agreed place, he found that he was not the only one present. There were hundreds of thousands of people.","To be precise, other than a bachelor like him, every itinerant cultivator basically had their own direct descendants.","This time, they were sent as well.","And Windy City, which should have belonged to Chu Yunfan’s direct line of descent, had already been conquered by Evil Gods Creed in a battle a year ago. Since then, Windy City’s countless years of inheritance had been lost.","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t save them in time. Once Evil Gods Creed made up their mind, Windy City was taken down in an instant. There was no difficulty at all.","However, this time, all the experts’ expressions were extremely ugly. It was obvious that they knew that there was almost no chance of victory in this surprise attack. They might even be completely wiped out.","However, they had no choice but to come."]},{"number":2486,"title":"Chapter 2486: A Successful Ambush","paragraphs":["Chapter 2486: A Successful Ambush","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It couldn’t even be said that it was a matter of winning. To be precise, it was a matter of survival!","In such a surprise attack, they had almost no chance of surviving!","However, they had to come. If they didn’t come, they would die immediately. If they went, they might still have a chance of winning!","However, no one had expected that more than one half-Emperor from Magi Circle would personally take part in this seemingly suicidal mission.","More than ten half-Emperors of Magi Circle formed this small team.","“This ambush? Don’t tell me...” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. When he saw the group of half-Emperors, he instinctively realized that something was wrong.","Chu Yunfan sighed. These people were outsiders in Magi Circle. There were many things that would not be announced to them. They were basically deaf and mute.","Most of the information could only be obtained through hearsay.","The truly important information would not be revealed to them.","Many experts gathered, but the scene was silent. Everyone shut their mouths.","There were only waves of divine wills. No one spoke. They were all communicating through divine wills.","Of course, with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, these divine wills were no different from talking directly in front of him.","Everyone was extremely worried about this mission.","Suddenly, after a ripple in the void, Sun Scorch Magus appeared in front of everyone.","“Greetings, Lord!” Everyone said in unison.","Sun Scorch Magus nodded and said, “This operation is very important to Magi Circle. It was not easy for us to pinpoint their coordinates. You only have one mission. Destroy the first city you see. That’s their supply point! As for the resources seized from it, you don’t have to hand them over!”","Sun Scorch Magus’ words would have made everyone very excited if it had been any other time. However, now, everyone had a cold expression on their faces. It sounded like if they could break through that supply point, there was no doubt that they would be able to obtain huge gains. However, they had to be alive to spend it.","Chu Yunfan rubbed his chin. He didn’t know the true purpose of Magi Circle’s operation this time, but it was impossible for them to simply send them to their deaths.","Firstly, it would be too obvious, and secondly, it would be meaningless.","Magi Circle had been tolerating these itinerant cultivators to the sixth half-Emperor Stage all this time, wasn’t it to make the best use of them?","As long as he wasn’t directly sent to his death, Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid.","Sun Scorch Magus was not interested in talking to these people. The surrounding group of peak King array masters began to construct an array.","Slowly, a teleportation portal appeared in front of everyone. They could vaguely see that on the other side of the teleportation portal was a city filled with evil energy.","Even the laws were distorted into evil energy!","It was just like Magi Circle, where magic energy soared into the sky.","After everyone entered the teleportation portal, they felt their vision blur. Then, a terrifying pressure almost tore them apart.","This was the Evil Realm of Evil Gods Creed rejecting them and not allowing them to use the teleportation portal to teleport in.","Layers and layers of barriers were set up in the Evil Realm, constantly consolidating the world barrier in the Evil Realm, preventing others from easily breaking through.","The half-Emperors formed barriers to protect their descendants, but Chu Yunfan had it much easier. He was alone and had nothing to protect.","A moment later, everyone’s eyes lit up again and they appeared in the Evil Realm.","Chu Yunfan immediately felt that the rejection from this world far exceeded the rejection from the Magi Realm.","Although the Magi Realm would have a certain degree of rejection toward people who were not from Magi Circle, it was not that serious.","In the Evil Realm, almost all cultivators who did not cultivate evil energy were rejected.","It was as if a heavy burden had been placed on an ordinary person’s body. It could be said that their cultivation had been greatly suppressed.","Under such circumstances, everyone circulated their own laws to resist the influence of the Evil Realm, especially the half-Emperors. Their understanding of the laws of heaven and earth had reached an astonishing level, and they quickly circulated their laws to resist the suppression of the laws of the Evil Realm.","Chu Yunfan instantly adjusted himself.","However, unlike ordinary people, he did not use his laws to resist the laws of the Evil Realm. Instead, he fused them together.","His body faintly emitted a kind of evil aura that covered the surface of his body.","In an instant, he could no longer feel the suppression from the Evil Realm. On the contrary, he felt like he was in perfect harmony with the Evil Realm.","This was what he had created by imitating the evil energy of the Evil Gods.","He had thoroughly studied the many mysteries of the Evil Gods. With the help of the godhead, all the mysteries of the Evil Gods were in his mind.","Therefore, he could easily convert his divine power into evil energy. He had the same source as the Evil Gods and would not be rejected at all.","If someone were to pay attention to Chu Yunfan at this time, they would probably be able to immediately see that Chu Yunfan was acting strangely.","However, at this time, no one really cared about Chu Yunfan. In their opinion, whether he could survive or not was the most important thing.","“Everyone, attack! Break through the city!”","A half-Emperor from Magi Circle shouted and everyone began to attack the city in front of them.","Rumble!","Almost instantly, huge mushroom clouds appeared above the city, swallowing everything and destroying everything.","Although the city was covered with layers of barriers, they were useless. Under the attacks of many half-Emperors, it was broken on the spot.","Countless armies surged in.","Chu Yunfan paid special attention to the half-Emperors. After seeing these people break through the city, they did not stay any longer and turned into flying lights into the distance.","It seemed like they had other motives!","Chu Yunfan immediately understood that Magi Circle was using them as bait, hoping that they could attract the attention of the main force of Evil Gods Creed in the Evil Realm and buy enough time for this half-Emperor team.","The other half-Emperors weren’t fools either. They understood this point almost instantly. It was completely conceivable that it wouldn’t be long before the abnormal movements here would attract Evil Gods Creed’s encirclement.","If they stayed, they would probably be surrounded immediately!","“Escape!”","Everyone made a decision immediately. After breaking through this city of Evil Gods Creed, they immediately turned around and led their army to escape into the distance.","A moment later, only Chu Yunfan was left, looking at the city that had been slaughtered."]},{"number":2487,"title":"Chapter 2487: Getting Rich and Preparing to Break Through","paragraphs":["Chapter 2487: Getting Rich and Preparing to Break Through","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All Evil Gods Creed experts in the city had been killed. Although there was a half-Emperor guarding the city, facing a group of half-Emperors, this half-Emperor was undoubtedly dead. He didn’t even have time to escape before he was killed.","The rest of Evil Gods Creed’s elite troops also met the same fate. They were all killed cleanly.","Only a small portion of the treasure vaults in the city had been snatched away.","These half-Emperors who were sent to attract Evil Gods Creed’s main force were not stupid. None of them wanted to stay here and wait for death.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have so many thoughts. His eyes lit up, and a big hand appeared. It broke the barriers of the treasure vaults, and then grabbed all the resources that were used to prepare for war.","It had to be said that Evil Gods Creed’s foundation was truly astonishing, far from what the Central Plains could compare to. Just the various war resources prepared in this city could be compared to the treasury of the Central Plains’ Grand Xia Empire.","Chu Yunfan had taken away more than a trillion top-grade spirit stones, as well as all kinds of elixirs used to increase one’s cultivation, recovery elixirs, and various weapons and armor.","Chu Yunfan robbed everything clean.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s speed, it took him more than two hours to break through these treasure vaults and plunder the wealth stored in them.","Most importantly, Chu Yunfan found 100,000 Origin Yang Pills in it.","These Origin Yang Pills could only be concocted by experts above the seventh half-Emperor Stage. Origin Yang Pills were medicinal pills that were directly extracted from the world according to the laws of heaven and earth.","To put it simply, it was to make the spirit energy of heaven and earth into pills!","And the one who developed this kind of medicinal pill was none other than an Alchemy Emperor!","When one’s cultivation reached the level of Alchemy Emperor, one’s understanding of the alchemy path could be said to have reached an astonishing level.","He had long known that no matter what kind of heavenly and earthly treasures it was, it was essentially evolved by being contaminated with the most original energy in the world.","Therefore, if he could skip this step and directly extract the energy he needed from heaven and earth to make pills, he would be able to obtain the energy he needed.","After all, for a half-Emperor, there were too many impurities in the spirit energy contained in a supreme-grade spirit stone. It had to be further purified for them to absorb it.","However, he could absorb the essence in the Origin Yang Pills directly. What he absorbed was the purest origin energy of the world and the laws of the world.","However, although those above the seventh half-Emperor Stage could make these, the success rate was generally not very high. Only true Emperors could refine it in large quantities.","However, it was not a big problem for Chu Yunfan. With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, as long as he had the ability to make the pills, he could easily refine a large number of Origin Yang Pills.","At that time, he would truly be free from the limitations of ordinary wealth. Cultivation relied on all kinds of resources, but those resources were all in the hands of various giants.","There were many precious resources that could not be bought even with spirit stones.","They could only be exchanged with Origin Yang Pills, and Origin Yang Pills could be extracted from the world at any time. This was an endless resource.","Only by mastering this method could Chu Yunfan truly have the possibility of becoming an Emperor without relying on any forces.","Since ancient times, only the Alchemy Emperor back then had done it. The various Emperors were either of noble birth, mysterious origins, or had strong roots, each having their own formidable aspects.","But the Alchemy Emperor was different. Alchemy Emperor’s family background was not considered an ordinary family. It was considered a well-known family clan in alchemy.","However, compared to the other Emperors, the difference was too great.","When the Alchemy Emperor cultivated to the later stages, he practically relied on his own strength to successfully reach the Emperor Stage. The Origin Yang Pill was a medicinal pill that was developed under that kind of extremely tight financial situation.","At this point, the Alchemy Emperor completely got rid of the problem of resources, directly ascending to the blue sky, vindicating his dao and becoming an Emperor that swept away all obstacles.","Not long after Chu Yunfan plundered all the resources here, a shocking aura approached at lightning speed.","Chu Yunfan knew that Evil Gods Creed’s experts had rushed over after receiving the news.","Even though they had been completely exterminated by Magi Circle’s experts and the news had not been sent out in time, Evil Gods Creed had still noticed the changes in this place in a short period of time.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared from where he was, appearing in the Mountain River Diagram.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Even in the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan could still feel the aura of two powerful Evil Gods covering the entire city.","When these Evil Gods Creed experts saw the tragic situation here, they all let out angry roars.","“After them! We can’t let those magi run amok!” an Evil God hiding in the void ordered.","“A seventh half-Emperor!” Chu Yunfan hid in the dark and felt the Evil God’s aura.","The terrifying aura shook the heavens and earth.","The aura of his spiritual force constantly swept back and forth in the entire city, shaking the void and even sweeping into every inch of space in the void.","He swept his gaze onto the Mountain River Diagram several times, but he did not find anything.","As Chu Yunfan’s cultivation became more and more profound, he became more and more proficient in controlling the Mountain River Diagram.","Even a half-Emperor who was stronger than him would not be able to find Chu Yunfan in the Mountain River Diagram unless he encountered an Emperor.","Only then would he be able to discover Chu Yunfan, who was hiding in the space crack.","However, Chu Yunfan did not care about the Evil God at this time. He immediately sat cross-legged and began to break through.","He had been stuck at the sixth half-Emperor Stage for a long time. Now that he had collected a batch of Origin Yang Pills, he could break through to the seventh level in one go.","The sixth half-Emperor Stage and the seventh half-Emperor Stage were two completely different concepts.","A seventh half-Emperor was already close to being a first-class expert.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged. Behind him, many phenomena appeared. Many martial arts and laws appeared in an instant, turning into a small world around him.","At the same time, the trillions of supreme-grade spirit stones that had been plundered this time directly poured into the herb mountain. Countless top-grade medicinal herbs in the mountain matured in the shortest time possible.","Under the control of Chu Yunfan’s will, the Origin Yang Pills turned into energy that filled the sky. It carried traces of law light and fused into Chu Yunfan’s body.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan could feel every cell in his body cleansing his meridians and marrow. Under the cleansing of his meridians and marrow by the higher-level Origin Yang Pills, he felt his body transforming crazily."]},{"number":2488,"title":"Chapter 2488: Seventh Half-Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2488: Seventh Half-Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Bit by bit, every cell in Chu Yunfan’s body was transforming and being cleansed.","The powerful energy continued to pour into him, making him feel that there was a powerful energy boiling in his body.","Every cell in Chu Yunfan’s body was boiling. Together with the laws of heaven and earth, they surged into his body.","It would promote his transformation.","After an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan finally opened his eyes. The aura on his body had risen to a whole new level.","The domain formed by his laws instantly expanded by 30%.","Compared to his original strength, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had doubled, and his combat strength had increased by several times.","The changes in each of the nine levels of the half-Emperor Stage were like the difference between heaven and earth.","This was only the process of advancing from the peak King Stage to the Emperor Stage.","In the past, there was no such thing as the so-called nine levels of the half-Emperor Stage. One had directly broken through from the peak of the King Stage to the Emperor Stage.","One could imagine how terrifying the Emperor Stage was.","Compared to the peak King Stage, the half-Emperor Stage was already very terrifying. It was a terrifying existence that could not be resisted.","However, in front of an Emperor, there was no way to resist at all.","Crossing over, or not crossing over, was like the difference between heaven and earth, incomparable.","Chu Yunfan could feel the immense power in his body!","“As expected, no true dragon can be raised in shallow water. Only in a world like the Ancient Realm can there be a wide enough space to break through!”","Previously, in the Central Plains, Chu Yunfan’s strength had been completely suppressed at the third half-Emperor Stage. He had no way of breaking through.","However, after reaching the Ancient Realm, he could easily break through to the seventh half-Emperor Stage in a few years.","This was the importance of different environments!","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed, and he appeared outside the Mountain River Diagram. At this time, Evil Gods Creed experts who had rushed over had already left, heading to various parts of the Evil Realm to hunt down Magi Circle’s experts who had broken in.","Clang!","Clang!","Clang!","Loud bells rang throughout the entire Evil Realm.","The sound of the bell turned into a huge sound wave that was invisible to the naked eye.","“This bell? Is it the sound of an emergency mobilization?” Chu Yunfan was able to distinguish some of Evil Gods Creed’s communication methods. In the past few years of war, he had seen a lot.","Could it be that the small team from Magi Circle had taken effect?","However, with that small team from Magi Circle, even a team formed by half-Emperors was not enough to make Evil Gods Creed so nervous.","Suddenly, the space fluctuated violently, and a figure appeared.","“As expected, there are still people who haven’t left!”","Accompanied by an extremely cold voice, Chu Yunfan suddenly felt a domain enveloping him, instantly blocking all his escape routes.","In the void, an Evil God appeared. It had a strange appearance and carried an extremely terrifying aura. It locked onto Chu Yunfan.","When he saw Chu Yunfan, a cruel smile appeared on his face.","Chu Yunfan looked at this Evil God. He didn’t know what went wrong with him, but he had seen through it.","However, Chu Yunfan immediately understood. This Evil God must have guessed that someone hadn’t left and had been guarding this place.","This Evil God had been waiting for the rabbit!","Unexpectedly, he happened to see Chu Yunfan appear!","“Trash from Magi Circle, you really have guts to barge into my Evil Realm and wreak havoc!” The Evil God sneered and looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was looking at a pig or a dog.","“Your leader is summoning you to gather. Aren’t you going?” Chu Yunfan was not nervous at all as he said calmly.","If it was before, a seventh half-Emperor would have been enough to make him feel threatened. However, he didn’t feel threatened anymore.","Everything about the Evil Gods was no longer a secret to him. This was a huge advantage.","Now that his cultivation was not any weaker than this Evil God, he naturally didn’t care.","“I’ll kill you first and then gather. There’s still time!” the Evil God sneered and said.","“Kill me before gathering? Hahahahaha! Who do you think I am?” Chu Yunfan laughed. “Kill me before gathering? Today is your death!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the Evil God and knew that he didn’t have much time left because they were in Evil Gods Creed’s territory.","If the battle dragged on for too long, it would probably attract the support of other experts from Evil Gods Creed. At that time, it would be truly endless trouble.","Boom!","At that moment, a powerful aura burst out from the Evil God’s body. A big hand turned into a divine mountain and grabbed toward Chu Yunfan. It didn’t take Chu Yunfan seriously at all and wanted to break him in one move.","This palm easily pierced through the sky and landed before Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally moved. He waved his fist.","A punch was thrown out, and the golden and brilliant fist force dyed the entire sky. As soon as he broke through, an unprecedented terrifying fist force erupted. With a punch, it shattered the palm that was like a divine mountain and turned it into a cloud of blood mist.","“Arghhh!” the Evil God screamed and let out a series of shrill cries. His entire arm was shattered by this terrifying force.","If he hadn’t cut off one of his arms in time, this huge force would have shattered his entire body along with his arm.","In the next moment, his arm grew back, but he did not dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan anymore. This punch had truly frightened him.","The terrifying power that erupted from the fist force made him unable to help but look sideways.","“The seventh half-Emperor Stage!”","It was only then that the Evil God realized that he had made a mistake in his estimation of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","He had thought that Chu Yunfan was only at the sixth half-Emperor Stage. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was actually at the seventh half-Emperor Stage?","This was the most terrifying part.","“A mere seventh half-Emperor Stage Evil God dares to say he wants to kill me? You?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. In his body, countless lightning powers boiled into an ocean, making him look like a legendary god that suppressed the ten heavenly gods.","Chu Yunfan’s domain easily broke through the Evil God’s domain. The terrifying domain swept toward the Evil God like a tidal wave.","The Evil God was terrified. Chu Yunfan was stronger than he had imagined. Chu Yunfan attacked in an instant.","Another punch was thrown out, and the world shook. Endless golden light swept out along with the laws of the Great Path.","The punch landed on the Evil God’s body."]},{"number":2489,"title":"Chapter 2489: Killing a Seventh Half-Emperor Evil God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2489: Killing a Seventh Half-Emperor Evil God","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This punch was like a hot knife through butter, directly blasting into the Evil God’s chest.","Spurt!","The Evil God coughed up blood and retreated. He didn’t expect to be so easily pushed back.","Chu Yunfan’s laws were wreaking havoc in his chest. There was a faint sound of thunder rolling in his chest, and the laws of thunder turned into a thunder symbol.","The lightning word flashed and exploded like a bomb, hitting the Evil God’s chest.","The sky was about to explode.","“Roar!”","The Evil God roared crazily. He was actually injured by a guy he had looked down on.","Powerful dark energy surged out of the Evil God’s body.","In a moment, all the injuries on his body were healed.","The Evil God recovered to its peak state in just a moment. It was like a demon god that had been awakened from chaos.","A long saber appeared in his hand. As this saber slashed down, the laws of the saber path boiled. It was incomparable and shook the heavens. With just one saber, it tore open the space of the Evil Realm.","Chu Yunfan spread his hands and released a shocking power of lightning. Runes appeared one after another, communicating with the powerful power in the world.","With his understanding of the Evil Gods, the energy in them no longer rejected him. On the contrary, they would be used by him.","A terrifying force formed a seal, and then it emitted a terrifying light that welcomed the saber.","Boom!","The law turned into a sky full of light and boiled. Between the two, a dazzling and intense light was set off. The terrifying law turned into a tidal wave that swept in all directions.","This was a battle between two experts who had reached the seventh half-Emperor Stage.","The Evil God didn’t hold back. He used all his strength and the blade turned into evil energy that filled the sky, but it didn’t land on Chu Yunfan. The terrifying scene made people shudder.","Chu Yunfan’s energy and blood gushed out crazily, shaking the world and sending the blade flying.","What happened next was even more shocking. Chu Yunfan made a move. After knocking away the long blade, he clenched his fist and punched the Evil God.","Spurt!","The Evil God was hit again. The Evil God laws protecting him were useless. All the mysteries were seen through by Chu Yunfan. The mysteries of the Evil God Domain were seen through. How could it stop Chu Yunfan’s punch?","The Evil God spat out blood again, but this time, it was ten times more terrifying than before. This punch directly pierced through him!","There was a big hole in his chest. Even though he was a terrifying existence above the seventh half-Emperor Stage and his body had an amazing recovery ability, he still couldn’t withstand such a terrifying attack.","This punch directly took away a large amount of his vitality and heavily injured him.","The battle between the two sides was decided in an instant. Based on Chu Yunfan’s understanding of Evil Gods, unless these Evil Gods were much higher in level than Chu Yunfan, it was as if Chu Yunfan had caught them by their tails.","He would be easily defeated by him.","Chu Yunfan launched another attack. The Evil God let out an angry roar. It staggered in the air and stabilized its body. Blood kept dripping from the corner of its mouth.","The Evil God roared. In an instant, everything in the world froze.","This was his special divine power. It could easily freeze Chu Yunfan, making him feel as if he had fallen into a quagmire and encountered a big problem.","Chu Yunfan was not afraid at all. He grabbed the Mountain River Cauldron with one hand and smashed it down in the direction of the Evil God.","Boom!","The Mountain River Cauldron smashed into the Evil God, causing sparks to fly and the sound of metal clashing.","The Evil God’s skin began to crack inch by inch, and he coughed up large mouthfuls of blood.","He suffered a great loss in the collision with Chu Yunfan. Blood sprayed out like a torrential rain.","In the sky, it was a shocking sight.","He was not convinced. Why was this d*mned human so powerful?","He had been repeatedly injured by Chu Yunfan. What kind of encounter was this? How could he accept this?","“Since you’re here today, don’t even think about leaving!” the Evil God roared.","The Evil God knew that what Chu Yunfan lacked the most was time. Once the time was up and the other Evil Gods and Evil Gods Creed experts arrived, it would be Chu Yunfan’s death.","After all, this was the Evil Realm. Although he didn’t know why Chu Yunfan wasn’t suppressed by the Evil Realm, he knew one thing. Whether Chu Yunfan was afraid of the Evil Realm’s suppression or not, as long as his reinforcements arrived, it would be Chu Yunfan’s turn to die.","Chu Yunfan also saw the Evil God’s goal. It was obvious that he wanted to drag him to death here.","Of course, he would not let the other party get what he wanted.","The Evil God’s face revealed a ferocious and terrifying smile. Since he had already made up his mind, there was nothing to hesitate about. The blood and energy in his body began to burn fiercely, resonating with the Great Path.","That was the legendary Great Path!","In an instant, the vibration of the Great Path turned into a raging tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. He threw a backhand punch, which exploded in the sky and blocked the roar of the Great Path.","The Evil God didn’t stop at all. He kept burning the blood and energy in his body. To be precise, he was burning his life force and shattering the sky, trying to stop Chu Yunfan’s actions.","This would undoubtedly cause both sides to suffer losses. It could even hurt the enemy by a hundred and himself by a thousand. After a long time, even if Chu Yunfan didn’t fight, he would directly die because his vitality was exhausted.","However, if it was just to stall for time, Chu Yunfan felt that it was a bit troublesome.","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar and punched the sky. In an instant, thousands of astonishing fist forces blasted out in the sky. Then, these fist forces caused the roar of the Great Path and turned into eight gods.","The figures of the eight gods covered the sky and swept toward the Evil God.","The Evil God let out a miserable cry. He couldn’t withstand so many fist forces at all. All of his methods had been seen through by Chu Yunfan and could be easily broken.","After a simple punch, it was followed by an overwhelming attack.","Rumble!","The Evil God’s body suffered countless attacks in an instant, and the laws that supported his body collapsed.","His entire body was blasted apart by Chu Yunfan, and the sky was torn apart.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back.","“No matter what methods you have, you’re an Evil God. You will die today!” Chu Yunfan thundered."]},{"number":2490,"title":"Chapter 2490: All-Out War, the Emergence of Emperor Evil","paragraphs":["Chapter 2490: All-Out War, the Emergence of Emperor Evil","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Evil God’s body was blasted apart, and the primordial spirit hidden in his body was also destroyed by such a destructive attack.","The aftermath of the explosion spread out in all directions like a tsunami.","Chu Yunfan, who was in the center, stood with his hands behind his back and watched the tide spread in all directions.","He had finally killed this Evil God.","The seventh half-Emperor Stage was a level that he had never been able to reach.","Now, they could be easily destroyed.","Although it was because the other party was an Evil God and all the secrets were controlled by Chu Yunfan, it was especially easy to destroy it.","However, it was enough to prove that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had indeed undergone earth-shaking changes during this period of time.","The millions of Origin Yang Pills had also been completely consumed by Chu Yunfan.","He had also used up all of his billions of spirit stones.","By burning these 10,000 spirit stones, Chu Yunfan’s control over the Mountain River Diagram had also increased to a higher level. To be precise, he had allowed the Mountain River Diagram to truly unleash the true power of a flawless Emperor weapon that it was.","Chu Yunfan believed that under the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, even a true Emperor would find it difficult to find him.","Originally, his control over the Mountain River Diagram wasn’t so shocking. If he hid in the Mountain River Diagram in front of an Emperor, he would definitely be discovered.","In fact, if there was a ninth half-Emperor, there was a certain chance that he would discover Chu Yunfan.","Now, all possibilities of being discovered had been completely erased.","For the current Chu Yunfan, his safety had been greatly improved.","Of course, this was mainly due to the ability of the Mountain River Diagram itself, not Chu Yunfan’s strength. Chu Yunfan had only successfully raised the control of the Mountain River Diagram to a new level after burning trillions of supreme-grade spirit stones.","He had dug out the ability of the Mountain River Diagram!","After all, the Mountain River Diagram had taken away the godhead right under the noses of many Emperors. If one didn’t have the ability to hide, how could one escape from the siege of so many Emperors?","Although the Alchemy Emperor died in that battle, the Mountain River Diagram escaped with the godhead. In the end, after hundreds of millions of years, it fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This was the ability that Chu Yunfan needed the most right now. If he wanted to move around in the Evil Realm, it was equivalent to moving under Emperor Evil’s nose. He could be discovered at any time.","Although he had a body full of evil energy and made the Evil Realm no longer reject him, that was under the situation where no one was paying attention to him.","If Emperor Evil was alerted, then any disguise would be useless. The so-called Evil Realm was essentially Emperor Evil’s domain. As long as Emperor Evil was conscious, he could easily figure out who had intruded into his domain.","Clang, clang, clang!","In the sky, the loud bell chimes continued to spread. From afar, the bell chimes turned into ripples that cut through the sky and crossed the entire Evil Realm.","“What happened in the Evil Realm?” Chu Yunfan frowned.","Clearly, something big had happened in the Evil Realm. Otherwise, it would not have caused the alarm bells in the Evil Realm to ring continuously.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was thinking, a huge hand appeared in the sky. This hand turned into a divine mountain and blasted a huge hole in the sky.","Boom!","A huge hole appeared in the sky, and endless evil energy swept out.","It surged straight into the endless primordial chaos.","The Evil Realm was not completely in the Ancient World, but a small world that originated from the Ancient World and Chaos.","At this moment, the small world was broken. Endless evil energy formed a tide and rushed out of the hole.","“Oh d*mn!” Chu Yunfan looked at the huge hand in the sky in shock. He couldn’t believe it.","Who was it that could easily break through the Evil Realm?","This was Emperor Evil’s domain. Even with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, he could only break through a small portion of the space before it completely recovered in the next second.","To put it simply, Chu Yunfan didn’t have the ability to break through the Evil Realm.","“An Emperor! An Emperor has made his move!”","Chu Yunfan immediately judged that there must be an Emperor who attacked the Evil Realm. That was why a slap had created a huge hole in the Evil Realm.","This reminded Chu Yunfan of Magi Circle’s strange actions. That small group of half-Emperors probably didn’t just want to harass the Evil Realm and delay Evil Gods Creed’s actions.","It was a real big move!","“An all-out war!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with shock, because he knew that the battle had reached this point, and it was already a battle to the death.","Evil Gods Creed had been bullied, and a huge hole had been broken in the Evil Realm.","It would be strange if Evil Gods Creed could tolerate it. This was no longer a battle of interests. A battle of interests could still be compromised, because a battle of interests still depended on whether it was worthwhile or not.","But now, it had already threatened Evil Gods Creed’s survival.","Clearly, Magi Circle’s actions had broken the tacit understanding that had existed in the Ancient Realm for thousands of years. The ten great gods would not meet their king and would not confront each other directly.","At most, they would support some small forces and fight some wars of agents.","Although he didn’t know what kind of deep reason was involved, the more ruthless the fight was, the better it was for Chu Yunfan.","Evil Gods Creed’s deep foundation was fully displayed at this moment.","Chu Yunfan saw elite troops rise into the sky. Powerful auras, peak Kings and half-Emperors, all flew into the sky.","There were at least 300 of them who were above the seventh half-Emperor Stage.","Many of them were old monsters who had been sealed for many years. It was obvious that they had just been unsealed in a hurry and joined the battle.","At the same time, in the huge hole above the Evil Realm, the light of the teleportation portal kept flashing, and powerful armies of Magi Circle appeared above the hole.","Similarly, there were countless Kings, half-Emperors, and even seventh half-Emperors. They were not inferior to Evil Gods Creed at all, and were even slightly stronger.","Evil Gods Creed was already fighting to the death, and Magi Circle had even come out in full force.","This was a life-and-death battle that would decide the fate of two behemoths!","At this moment, no one had the time to search for Chu Yunfan!","Suddenly, an angry roar came from the depths of the Evil Realm.","“Emperor Magus, how dare you!”","Following this furious roar, an overwhelming pressure pressed down like a tsunami.","Chu Yunfan instantly felt a powerful force pressing down on him, forcing him to kneel."]},{"number":2491,"title":"Chapter 2491: The Conspiracy Appears, the Four Great Emperors’ Besiege","paragraphs":["Chapter 2491: The Conspiracy Appears, the Four Great Emperors’ Besiege","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","An Emperor!","An Emperor had appeared!","Chu Yunfan reacted immediately!","That mighty evil aura!","When that voice appeared, almost the entire Evil Realm turned upside down.","He was the master of the entire Evil Realm and the strongest existence in the Evil Realm to date.","In the sky, a figure as tall as a mountain flew out.","That figure was filled with evil energy. To be precise, the evil energy on his body had already turned into laws, automatically forming a small world around him.","It was completely different from a domain.","The domain was only a half-formed small world, but the small world around this figure was completely formed. It was a small world with the same nature as the ancient world.","It was just that its level was not as high as the Ancient Realm.","This was the biggest difference between an Emperor and a half-Emperor. No matter how strong a half-Emperor was, he couldn’t defeat an Emperor.","This was because the Emperor was standing in their own world.","In this world, they were the only ruler. All the rules and everything were under their control.","Unless it was another Emperor who could fight against it, once they entered that small world, they would be courting death.","They would be instantly killed!","To be precise, the Evil Realm was also an extension of this small world.","The nature was the same!","However, the most important part was Emperor Evil’s own pocket world!","Everyone in Evil Gods Creed was overjoyed to see Emperor Evil. In their impression, as long as Emperor Evil appeared, even if there was a huge problem, there would be a way to solve it.","“Emperor Evil, if you don’t want your Evil Realm to be destroyed, then come out and fight!”","A middle-aged man’s indifferent voice came from outside the hole in the sky.","“Alright, Emperor Magus, let me see how much progress you’ve made over the years!” Emperor Evil’s enormous body disappeared in an instant, leaving the Evil Realm.","After Emperor Evil left, the Emperor pressure finally dissipated, and Chu Yunfan could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","Chu Yunfan was already having a hard time resisting the pressure of the Emperor path. He couldn’t imagine how terrifying it would be if he had to face Emperor Evil directly.","Fortunately, he did not plan to deal with Evil Gods Creed directly from the beginning. Instead, he borrowed the power of Magi Circle.","Although he didn’t know why Magi Circle was so understanding, it was a great thing for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan saw the armies of Magi Circle and Evil Gods Creed colliding in the sky. It was like two tsunamis crashing into each other.","Every minute and every second, a large number of corpses fell like a rainstorm.","This was the result of the collision between the two giants. At this point, it was no longer a battle of interests. It was a battle of life and death.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Suddenly, at this moment, a few more loud sounds came from the world. The Evil Realm, which already had a big hole, had several more big holes. Countless armies swarmed out of these big holes.","These armies were not Magi Circle’s armies, but several completely different factions.","Vaguely, Chu Yunfan could feel the looming pressure of the Emperor Path.","It was an Emperor-level expert!","Chu Yunfan immediately made the judgment. In fact, he didn’t need to make a judgment because the Evil Realm was the source world of Emperor Evil. Only an Emperor level existence could break through the Evil Realm.","Chu Yunfan sucked in a breath of cold air. More than one Emperor had attacked, and it was far from just Emperor Magus.","There were also several other Emperors who took action. According to the calculation of one Emperor per hole in the sky, there were at least four Emperors.","“Emperor Skyquake Monster, Emperor Stone, Emperor Elements. How dare you!” Emperor Evil’s furious voice came from the primordial chaos.","Sure enough, in response to Chu Yunfan’s guess, other than Emperor Magus, three other Emperors had also taken action.","Emperor Skyquake Monster, Emperor Stone, and Emperor Elements. Any one of these three could be said to be famous throughout the ages.","Just like Emperor Magus and Emperor Evil, they were ancient Emperors who had ruled the Ancient Realm for countless years.","They were known as the Ten Great Emperors, and the forces they founded were the Ten Great Forces.","Right now, almost half of the Ten Great Forces were involved in this matter.","“I see, I understand now!” Chu Yunfan instantly understood. He originally thought that Magi Circle had simply set up a trap that caused the group of seventh half-Emperors to fight against Evil Gods Creed.","Now that he thought about it, it was really ridiculous. With his cultivation at that time, he was only involved with an Evil God and a half-Emperor Grand Elder of Magi Circle. How could he make the two behemoths fight to the death?","Now that he thought about it, it was really ridiculous!","It was Emperor Magus, Emperor Skyquake Monster, Emperor Stone, and Emperor Elements who had long wanted to deal with Emperor Evil.","And Chu Yunfan had just happened to give them the right excuse. What he had done just happened to become an excuse for Magi Circle to launch an attack on Evil Gods Creed.","“All of this was just to numb Emperor Evil’s nerves and make him think that this was just a small fight!” Chu Yunfan’s mind flashed and he understood everything.","Although Emperors had long lifespans, they had a limit. These Emperors had survived since ancient times by relying on the tortoise’s hibernation and self-sealing techniques.","Even so, the lifespan of these Emperors would not be very long. Therefore, if it was not a major matter, these Emperors would not easily unseal themselves and come out to make a move.","In the eyes of the Emperors, major events was the appearance of other Emperors. Otherwise, even if the two factions fought with each other and suffered countless casualties, even if more than half of the higher-ups were killed or injured, to an Emperor, that was a small matter!","Even if Evil Gods Creed lost all its territory and the other party invaded the Evil Realm, Emperor Evil could easily defeat the invading enemy.","If it wasn’t for an Emperor, there wouldn’t be any major issues!","Emperor Magus hadn’t shown up much since the beginning of the battle, just to make Emperor Evil think that this was nothing more than child’s play.","In the eyes of Emperors, a battle that did not involve Emperors was indeed just child’s play.","It was like two groups of ants breaking a dog’s head and hitting its brain. It did not matter to humans.","“The main purpose is to lure Emperor Evil out? How great is the hatred!” Chu Yunfan didn’t dare to imagine how much hatred Emperor Magus had for Emperor Evil. He was determined to kill Emperor Evil even if it cost him his life.","There was no doubt that if Emperor Magus, Emperor Skyquake Monster, Emperor Stone, and Emperor Elements showed up, Emperor Evil would take the Evil Realm and escape into the void of the universe."]},{"number":2492,"title":"Chapter 2492: The Strength to Challenge an Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2492: The Strength to Challenge an Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Evil Realm was essentially a small world that had evolved from Emperor Evil’s domain.","Therefore, Emperor Evil could strip this Evil Realm from the Ancient World at any time and escape into the chaos of the universe.","At that time, it would really be too late to catch up!","No one knew if there was a difference in strength among the ten Emperors. Even if there was, no one knew because they had not fought for many years.","However, if Emperor Evil wanted to escape, he could do so.","Hiding in the Evil Realm, with Emperor Evil’s own support, even the combined attacks of the four Emperors would not be able to break through the Evil Realm in a short time.","That was enough time for Emperor Evil to escape into the void.","Then, the four Emperors would have to face the endless revenge of Emperor Evil!","An Emperor who had no foundation and no scruples would take revenge continuously. There was no need to doubt how terrifying it was.","Only a thousand days to be a thief, how can there be a thousand days to guard against thieves?","To deal with an existence of this level, it was naturally not something that could be done with just a thought. It had to be planned properly.","They had spent several years just to get the Evil Gods to act, and the planning had probably taken even longer.","It was obvious that they had their eyes on Emperor Evil!","However, what made Chu Yunfan even more curious was why these Emperors would target Emperor Evil.","After all, to deal with a single Emperor, even if the four Emperors attacked together, it was hard to say if they had the confidence to win. Even if they won, they would have to pay a considerable price.","There must be a huge reason behind this.","However, Chu Yunfan’s level was still far from these Emperors, so there was no way to figure it out.","However, with the addition of the armies under the command of the other three Emperors, Evil Gods Creed’s defense line could be said to have collapsed in an instant.","Originally, it was not difficult to fight against Magi Circle’s army. After all, they were in the Evil Realm.","Once Magi Circle’s army entered, they would be suppressed by the Evil Realm, and they would not be able to use their full strength. Even if Emperor Magus had cast a spell beforehand, he would be able to offset the suppression of the Evil Realm to a certain extent.","However, compared to the experts of Evil Gods Creed, they still did not have the upper hand. After all, one side’s combat strength was suppressed, and the other side’s combat strength was high because they were in the Evil Realm.","Under the situation of rising and falling, Magi Circle’s army actually did not make much progress.","This was also why the various factions were very afraid of each other’s source worlds and would not attack them casually.","Even if they had double the number of troops, they would only be able to hold out for a while. Once the other party’s Emperor awakened, then no matter how many troops they had, they would not be enough to send them to their deaths.","However, as the armies under the other Emperors joined the battle, Evil Gods Creed could no longer hold on, and all sorts of defensive lines collapsed.","Chu Yunfan could see from afar that ancient Evil Gods were awakened one after another. They flew into the sky and joined the battle.","Evil Gods Creed’s foundation was very deep. Just that little battle just now was not enough to force out all of Evil Gods Creed’s foundation.","Powerful half-Emperors joined the battle one after another. For a time, they actually blocked the siege of the four forces.","Both sides were in a stalemate!","The corpses of powerful experts fell to the ground at every moment. Blood sprayed everywhere as if a storm had descended.","Evil Gods Creed had gone all out. They knew that they could not retreat this time, and there was no way out. Once the Evil Realm was breached, Evil Gods Creed would become a rootless duckweed, and they would die.","Therefore, this time, Evil Gods Creed did not hold back. All the experts of the ancient Evil Gods Creed who had sealed themselves for many years, as well as the Evil Gods, all erupted.","Many of them were already old and didn’t have long to live. Now, they were completely crazy.","All kinds of reckless fighting methods erupted. For a moment, it actually frightened the various large factions.","Although the two sides fought very fiercely and directly hit each other’s heads, they still had some idea in their hearts. They naturally understood that the true winner was the battle between the Emperors who had entered the chaos.","If the four Emperors won, then all the resistance of Evil Gods Creed would be a joke. On the other hand, if Evil Gods Creed escaped, even if it was just a little faster, it would be enough to cripple the alliance army of various forces and then carry the Evil Realm away.","As for the Evil Gods defeating the four Emperors, no one had ever thought of that. It was too much of a fantasy.","Or rather, it was something impossible!","If it was a one-on-one fight, they might still have a chance of winning. If it was a one-on-four fight, they would be lucky if they weren’t killed.","“This is a good opportunity!” Chu Yunfan looked at the blood essence that was crazily falling from the sky. He immediately released the Brahma Tree. At this stage of cultivation, the Brahma Tree also had various special abilities and divine powers. If it had not been refined by Chu Yunfan, it would not have recognized him as its master.","At this time, the Brahma Tree should have transformed long ago. At the very least, it would be a half-Emperor, let alone giving Chu Yunfan the Brahma Fruits that it had painstakingly grown.","The growth of the Brahma Tree would devour almost all the energy. It was not difficult to kill a half-Emperor, but killing a few more would immediately cause a commotion in this area.","However, in this situation, not to mention Kings falling like rain, even the corpses of half-Emperors kept falling.","All of them became nutrients for the Brahma Tree.","The Brahma Tree was only a step away from maturing.","Chu Yunfan also did not expect that when he first obtained the Brahma Tree that he could raise the Brahma Tree to the point where it was about to mature.","He knew from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that it was extremely difficult to raise the Brahma Tree until it matured. There was once a sect that had been protecting the Brahma Tree ever since they started to establish their sect. Then, all the way until the sect was destroyed, the Brahma Tree did not survive the growth period.","It was not something that ordinary people could accomplish.","At that time, Chu Yufan could only dream of having the Brahma Tree produce Brahma Fruits for him to increase his cultivation.","However, after reaching this stage, a mature Brahma Tree was another matter altogether.","Chu Yunfan could even rely on fusing with the Brahma Tree to fight with the Emperor.","After all, in theory, a fully matured Brahma Tree was of the same grade as an Emperor.","The Brahma Fruits that grew out of it could greatly increase one’s cultivation even if an Emperor consumed it.","The Brahma Tree’s trunk was so tough that even an Emperor would find it difficult to destroy it.","If Chu Yunfan could fuse with the Brahma Tree, then even if he hadn’t stepped into the Emperor Stage, he would have the strength to challenge an Emperor.","Even if it was just a temporary challenge, he was the only one among the half-Emperors."]},{"number":2493,"title":"Chapter 2493: Sweeping Evil Gods Creed’s Wealth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2493: Sweeping Evil Gods Creed’s Wealth","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan and the Brahma Tree split up. The Brahma Tree was in the ground below the battlefield, crazily absorbing the corpses of various top-notch experts.","In the beginning, he didn’t care about the level of absorption. Later, he simply stared at the bones of the half-Emperor Stage experts that fell from the sky.","Otherwise, it would be a waste of time.","Only the bones of the half-Emperors were valuable enough to be absorbed.","The Brahma Tree seemed to be starving, and it crazily sucked out the essence of these half-Emperors.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan was approaching the core of the Evil Realm, the rumored palace of Emperor Evil.","Looking from afar, an evil palace appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. Rather than calling it a palace, it was more like a huge city.","This incomparably huge city was the core of the entire Evil Realm. Usually, even ordinary Evil Gods and Evil Gods Creed experts were not allowed to approach it without being summoned.","Usually, there were experts like clouds and guards like rain. It was impossible to get close to them.","However, at this moment, all Evil Gods Creed’s experts had gone to resist the various forces alliance army.","Everywhere was empty!","Chu Yunfan barged into the city. Without Emperor Evil, even if there was a certain amount of pressure, it would not be enough to pose a threat to Chu Yunfan.","‘The four Emperors are attacking Emperor Evil. Even if Emperor Evil can hold out, he won’t be able to hold out for long. I don’t have much time left!’ Chu Yunfan thought. In the sky, he could still feel the pressure of the Emperor path from time to time, reminding him that time was running out.","Emperor Evil’s palace was the core of the entire Evil Realm, and it was densely covered with barriers.","Behind the barrier were small planes.","The small plane contained Evil Gods Creed’s accumulation over the years.","Chu Yunfan broke through a barrier. Although the small world behind the barrier was hidden very well, it naturally could not hide from Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","A small world appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. It was an endless treasure vault with all kinds of treasures. Many of them were treasures that even half-Emperors coveted.","If Chu Yunfan were to search for it, he would not be able to obtain even one-tenth of the treasures in his entire life. One person’s strength was really too limited.","This was also the reason why the Emperors wanted to establish their own forces.","Chu Yunfan casually glanced at it and scanned it with his divine will. There were at least a trillion supreme-grade spirit stones.","The supreme-grade spirit stones he had obtained from breaking through Evil Gods Creed’s supply point previously paled in comparison to this place.","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram flew out and expanded with the wind. It grew bigger and bigger, and in a moment, it was as big as the small world. In an instant, it took away all the supreme-grade spirit stones.","Then, Chu Yunfan immediately turned to the other small worlds and crazily plundered Evil Gods Creed’s hundreds of millions of years of accumulation.","“No, this speed is not enough!”","Chu Yunfan saw that the speed of collecting one small world after another was still not enough, so he directly formed a seal and split into thousands of clones.","These clones could not be compared to the real body in terms of strength. At most, they could be used as a smokescreen in battle, but at this time, they could help Chu Yunfan absorb the essence of Evil Gods Creed’s countless years of accumulation.","After Chu Yunfan broke through the barrier, countless heavenly and earthly treasures turned into long dragons and surged into the Mountain River Diagram at the top of Emperor Evil’s palace.","There were countless billions of supreme-grade spirit stones, as well as all kinds of rare top-grade heavenly treasures. There were also all kinds of cultivation manuals and handwritten notes that Evil Gods Creed had collected over the years.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, these were even more precious than these resources. They were the steps he needed to step onto the path of an Emperor.","He did not want to walk the path of an Alchemy Emperor. He wanted to walk his own path. Then naturally, these books could have the effect of having stones from other mountains to polish jade for him.","In addition, there was also a huge amount of Origin Yang Pills. At a glance, there were at least ten billion Origin Yang Pills, all of which had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Compared to this, Chu Yunfan’s previous gains were nothing.","With so many Origin Yang Pills, it could be said that Chu Yunfan’s problem of cultivating resources had been solved in an instant. He had suddenly become rich.","What surprised Chu Yunfan even more was that in the deepest part of Emperor Evil’s palace, there were many imperial ingredients that even Emperors would covet.","The so-called Emperor material was the material used by Emperors to refine Emperor artifacts.","In the future, if Chu Yunfan wanted to refine his own Emperor weapon, then these Emperor materials were essential.","Originally, if Chu Yunfan did not obtain these Emperor materials, even if he became an Emperor, it would take him a long time to refine his own Emperor weapon.","Although the Mountain River Diagram wasn’t bad, it wasn’t his own Emperor artifact after all. There was no way to truly connect their minds. Without an Emperor artifact in hand, the combat strength of an Emperor would be greatly reduced.","Now, the existence of these materials had saved Chu Yunfan at least a thousand years of time.","“Brilliant Sulfur Immortal Gold, Heaven Mending Strange Stone, Chaos Divine Wood’s withered branch...” The more Chu Yunfan looked at it, the more overjoyed he was. He had really made a killing this time. He had swept away Evil Gods Creed’s foundation almost in an instant.","At least 20 pieces of Emperor materials had greatly strengthened Chu Yunfan’s foundation.","After another hour, Chu Yunfan finally broke through all the barriers. Thousands of clones attacked at the same time and finally took away the good things in Emperor Evil’s palace.","Although this wasn’t all the good things that Evil Gods Creed had accumulated over the countless years, it probably occupied at least seven layers of high-end collections. As for the rest, he would let the various factions divide them up.","Chu Yunfan chuckled and took away the Mountain River Diagram.","Then, his body paused and he entered the Mountain River Diagram.","After he had plundered the entire palace, Chu Yunfan finally had time to take stock of his gains. His gains had already reached an unimaginable level.","“Since I don’t have a problem with cultivation resources, I’ll take this opportunity to reach the eighth half-Emperor Stage!”","Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the half-Emperor Stage had reached the peak. What he lacked now was the accumulation of these cultivation resources.","This trip to the Evil Realm had made up for his last shortcoming, allowing him to prepare for a breakthrough in peace. When he reappeared, it was enough to shock the world.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he was waiting for the Brahma Tree to absorb the corpses of those experts and complete the final transformation, he would have left long ago. This place was really too dangerous.","The Emperors could come here at any time, but wealth came from danger. Chu Yunfan had no other choice!"]},{"number":2494,"title":"Chapter 2494: Eighth Half-Emperor Stage, Meeting Sun Scorch Magus","paragraphs":["Chapter 2494: Eighth Half-Emperor Stage, Meeting Sun Scorch Magus","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Within the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged once again!","Although he had just broken through to the seventh half-Emperor Stage, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to the eighth level.","His comprehension of nature’s laws had long surpassed the half-Emperor Stage. The only reason he couldn’t break through was because of the difference in resources.","Countless Origin Yang Pills surged into Chu Yunfan’s body and turned into powerful energy, causing every cell in his body to continuously break through and undergo changes.","The ninth half-Emperor Stage was a level that soared into the sky. Every transformation was like ascending to the heavens.","Only then could the difference between the peak King Stage and the Emperor Stage be smoothed out.","The difference between the peak King Stage and the Emperor Stage was no longer the difference between heaven and earth, but the difference between different spaces.","Every step required the awareness of ascending to the heavens, and the gap between each step was as great as ascending to the heavens!","With each breakthrough, Chu Yunfan could feel that he was at least several times stronger.","There was an earth-shattering change!","Originally, this was a painstaking effort, but the influx of countless Origin Yang Pills shortened this time and smoothed out the difference in time.","There were Emperors who were able to become Emperors in just a few decades. They had used endless resources to do so.","Chu Yunfan had spent far more time than that, because he didn’t have so many resources to accumulate, nor did he have countless powerful peers to compete with.","In ancient times, there were even some ancient bloodlines left behind. Countless existences had once shaken an era and shone through the starry sky.","That era was far worse than the current environment, but for the strong, it was the best environment. It was like raising Gu worms. The strongest King Gu worm would become the Emperor.","Now that he had plundered the wealth of Evil Gods Creed, Chu Yunfan’s last shortcoming had been made up for, and he could rush to a higher level.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s Celestial Devouring Art played an unimaginable role.","Countless Origin Yang Pills turned into dense origin Yang energy, bringing with them a huge power of laws as they surged into Chu Yunfan’s body. Every cell was churning.","Countless laws formed around Chu Yunfan, turning into a domain!","However, compared to an ordinary domain, it had gradually evolved into a small world.","Unlike the Emperor Era, where people broke through to become an Emperor in one go, Chu Yunfan chose a more stable method, one step at a time!","This was also the mainstream cultivation method now. Times were different, so it was naturally different.","Because that era no longer existed!","After an unknown period of time, when Chu Yunfan opened his eyes again, all the strange phenomena on his body had disappeared without a trace.","“I’m finally at the eighth half-Emperor Stage!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Chu Yunfan clearly felt that his strength had increased by several times.","“As expected, the ninth half-Emperor Stage. With my current strength, I can defeat at least ten of my previous self!”","Chu Yunfan sensed that the Brahma Tree had already absorbed the corpses of various half-Emperors. It was now in a saturated state. After the final transformation, it would greatly increase Chu Yunfan’s combat strength.","According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, even if he hadn’t broken through to the mature stage, after he completely fused with it, he could even fight against ninth half-Emperors.","At that time, Chu Yunfan would have nothing to be afraid of unless an Emperor personally made a move.","Up until now, there were only ten Emperors in the world. After today, there would probably be one less.","In other words, at this moment, there were fewer and fewer people in the world who could pose a threat to him.","Basically, they were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Other than those Emperors who were in eternal slumber, it was very difficult for others to pose any threat to him.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared from where he was.","When he appeared outside again, Evil Gods Creed’s defense line was already on the verge of collapse. To be precise, several huge holes had already been pierced through, forming a leaky spoon.","Many powerful half-Emperors used these loopholes to kill their way into the Evil Realm.","There weren’t many of them, but each one of them had great destructive power.","Chu Yunfan’s heart tightened. He had to speed up the growth of the Brahma Tree. Otherwise, if he was discovered by a half-Emperor, it would be a big problem.","At that time, no half-Emperor would let the Brahma Tree go!","It might even attract the attention of the Emperor. The rarity of the Brahma Tree was something that even Emperors would be envious of.","Therefore, there was not much time left for Chu Yunfan. It was a very risky move for him to stay here.","Because once the battle between Emperor Evil and the four Emperors ended, the four Emperors would descend into the Evil Realm.","At that time, the chances of Chu Yunfan being discovered would greatly increase.","Even though Chu Yunfan’s control of the Mountain River Diagram had reached its peak, his own cultivation was limited. In front of the Emperor, he was not enough. There was still a high possibility that he would be discovered.","“I have to meet back up with the Brahma Tree as soon as possible!” Chu Yunfan said.","Once he merged with the Brahma Tree, his combat strength would increase by several times. He could even fight against ninth half-Emperors.","“Chu Yunfan, you didn’t die?” Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to leave, a few figures appeared not far away.","They were a few half-Emperors from Magi Circle. The person leading them was none other than the leader of Magi Circle, Sun Scorch Magus.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. If it was before, Sun Scorch Magus alone was enough to make him feel like he was facing a great enemy.","Sun Scorch Magus’s strength was already at the seventh half-Emperor Stage. The people behind him were all stronger than Sun Scorch Magus. There was even an eight half-Emperor among them.","His status was probably not inferior to Sun Scorch Magus’s.","This was because there were Emperors among the behemoths which were the Ten Great Forces. Therefore, even the leader of Magi Circle was not a supreme existence.","In fact, other than the benefits of gathering resources, not everyone was willing to be the leader of Magi Circle.","Many people even felt that after choosing to become the leader, they would be dragged down in their cultivation progress.","“Why? Do you really wish for me to die, Lord Sun Scorch Magus?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Today, his cultivation was no longer the same as when he had just joined Magi Circle.","If he had faced such a situation back then, he would have probably thought of a way to escape. It would have been very difficult for him to escape.","But now, he was completely fearless!","Times have changed!","“Or did you want to kill me from the beginning?”"]},{"number":2495,"title":"Chapter 2495: Falling Out, Slaughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 2495: Falling Out, Slaughter","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hearing this, Sun Scorch Magus’s expression completely changed!","Even the half-Emperors behind Sun Scorch Magus had changed their appearances.","“What’s the point of talking to such an itinerant cultivator? Since he’s unwilling to die obediently, we’ll send him on his way!”","At this moment, an expert from Magi Circle walked out from behind Sun Scorch Magus. His slender and strong body contained a terrifying aura that made people tremble in fear. His eyes were sharp and carried a shocking killing intent.","In an instant, he tore through space and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. He roared and a dense aura of blood erupted from his body, soaring into the sky.","His eyes were like two stars.","It was clearly a body of flesh and blood, but it was like a star. Every move it made was enough to make the world tremble.","This was the terrifying strength of a seventh half-Emperor!","“Magic Emperor Punch!”","The half-Emperor of Magi Circle punched out. In an instant, the fist force swept across everything. The laws instantly spread out and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. To be precise, it landed on the surface of his body, but it could go no further.","The terrifying fist shattered everything, but it failed to shatter Chu Yunfan’s protective barrier.","An even more terrifying energy and blood surged out of Chu Yunfan’s body. In an instant, it bounced back and hit the arm of Magi Circle’s half-Emperor.","Crack!","A crisp sound of bones breaking was heard, followed by a spurt of blood.","Magi Circle’s half-Emperor retreated and looked at Chu Yunfan in shock as if he was looking at a monster.","His entire arm was shattered in an instant!","Not only was his attack reflected back, but an even more terrifying force from Chu Yunfan’s body also reversed and hit him.","It shattered his entire arm. If he had not decisively cut off his entire arm, it would not have been just his arm that had been shattered. His body would have been shattered.","“How is that possible? How is that possible?!” the half-Emperor of Magi Circle said with his mouth agape.","He felt a terrifying aura from Chu Yunfan, far beyond his imagination.","“Aren’t you at the sixth half-Emperor Stage?” the half-Emperor of Magi Circle said with his mouth agape.","According to the information provided by Sun Scorch Magus, Chu Yunfan was at most at the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","This was not long ago.","It was because Sun Scorch Magus had sensed that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had reached the limit that Magi Circle could tolerate, which was the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","If Chu Yunfan took another step forward, his cultivation could even be on par with his.","The key was that all of this was done in a few years, which made him even more afraid of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, who claimed to be an old monster who had sealed himself many years ago, had broken through to this level not long after he was unsealed.","It was as if he was riding a rocket.","If this continued, it would be difficult to deal with him sooner or later!","Smart itinerant cultivators should learn to hide their strength. Many half-Emperors only cultivated to the fifth half-Emperor Stage in order to save their lives. They didn’t touch the bottom line of Magi Circle.","Magi Circle would turn a blind eye to these people, and these people would avoid being eliminated.","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing growth speed had clearly far exceeded the limits that Magi Circle could tolerate.","Even so, Magi Circle had never taken him seriously. Even if he grew to the ninth half-Emperor Stage, it was nothing to Magi Circle.","In front of Emperor Magus, the ninth half-Emperor Stage was meaningless.","The difference between a half-Emperor and an Emperor was so great that it could be completely ignored.","Getting rid of Chu Yunfan, who was a threat, was just a precaution.","There had never been an accident since the implementation of this policy. Magi Circle did not care about the fighting power of the itinerant cultivators. The half-Emperor among the itinerant cultivators was useless against the ten forces.","However, Chu Yunfan was obviously the first exception.","The terror of this exception was far beyond their imagination.","“Magi Circle’s half-Emperor is only at this level?” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “I’ve really been indebted to your Magi Circle for taking care of me during this period of time. Originally, I didn’t want to have to fight like this. However, since you insist on killing me and keep chasing me, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","“Even if you hurt me, it doesn’t mean that my people can’t do it!” the half-Emperor magus stared at Chu Yunfan and said.","“I’m not looking down on your Magi Circle. No matter what, Emperor Magus is a rare talent since ancient times. However, there are only invincible people, not invincible techniques. The same technique is invincible in the hands of Emperor Magus, but in your hands, it can’t even withstand a single blow!” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","Chu Yunfan’s words had clearly angered these half-Emperors of Magi Circle. His attitude of not putting them in his eyes at all had completely infuriated them.","They all had an invincible heart, and at this moment, it completely exploded.","“Are you going to attack one by one or all at once?” Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and said indifferently.","His body emitted a faint dangerous aura. The aura of his domain was gradually released, turning into a chaotic mist. Chu Yunfan’s body was faintly discernible in this mist.","Magi Circle’s half-Emperor’s arm grew, and then he instantly attacked Chu Yunfan again. This time, he wasn’t as careless as before.","The half-Emperor Stage was released, and the barrier swept out as he punched out.","This punch was thrown out, but he was sent flying back at an even more astonishing speed.","This time, his entire arm and half of his body were smashed.","Chu Yunfan’s punch had unimaginable power.","It was just a simple punch without anything else mixed in.","However, Chu Yunfan was too strong. He had completely crushed this seventh half-Emperor.","With a heavy blow, Chu Yunfan gave chase again.","Without any suspense, Chu Yunfan easily stepped on his body.","The half-Emperor of Magi Circle screamed as his chest was crushed. Even his primordial spirit was crushed.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it ended in an instant.","Chu Yunfan had killed a seventh-stage half-Emperor in an instant.","“You’re courting death. You don’t know what kind of existence you’ve provoked!” another half-Emperor roared. “Magi Circle will never let you go. No matter what trump card you have, you won’t be able to withstand a single blow from Emperor Magus. You’re dead!”"]},{"number":2496,"title":"Chapter 2496: Kill All of Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 2496: Kill All of Them","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Magus was the source of Magi Circle’s unbridled confidence!","Each of the ten forces was more arrogant than the last!","They didn’t put these itinerant cultivators in their eyes at all. They even killed them as they pleased. The fundamental reason was that they an Emperor behind them.","Otherwise, even the stupidest person would know how to win people’s hearts. Those who had the way would have more help, and those who had lost the way would have little help.","This logic was applicable everywhere except in the Ancient Realm!","Even if you managed to rope in a hundred or a thousand half-Emperors, it would only be a matter of a slap against an Emperor.","It was meaningless!","To put it simply, things like paying three visits to the thatched cottage and treating the virtuous with courtesy were just fancy and useless in the eyes of Magi Circle and the other top ten forces!","If these itinerant cultivators were obedient, it would have been fine. But if they had any disloyalty, they would be directly slapped to death!","Anyway, the ten forces all had the same idea. They would not allow any existence that could threaten the ten Emperors to appear.","Chu Yunfan was not tolerated by Magi Circle. It would be the same if he went to other forces. There would be no difference.","There was no place for them in the world.","If it was any other ordinary half-Emperor, they wouldn’t even dare to think about it!","However, Chu Yunfan dared to think about it and did it!","“We still don’t know who will die today!” Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid.","He opened his eyes wide, and golden light flickered all over his body, revealing his muscular and slender body.","Compared to the physical body of the magi, he was only stronger!","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made his move. He came directly in front of Magi Circle’s half-Emperor.","He punched out!","Bam, bam, bam!","In an instant, the two sides exchanged dozens of blows. Magi Circle’s half-Emperor was sent flying. His entire arm and the right half of his body were shattered.","His Dao heart had been shattered by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan chased after him, netherworld water gathered under his foot, and he stomped down.","In an instant, the half-Emperor’s body was crushed into pieces. The half-Emperor of Magi Circle was trampled to death in an instant.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it happened in an instant. It was so fast that the half-Emperors of Magi Circle could not stop it in time.","“Kill him!”","Chu Yunfan’s actions had clearly infuriated these top experts of Magi Circle.","These top-notch experts of Magi Circle were completely furious and attacked instantly.","In an instant, energy and blood rushed into the sky. The entire world seemed to have turned into a world of energy and blood. Then, countless ripples swept out and instantly covered Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. His blood essence also erupted, and he could actually fight against them.","To be able to fight against a group of half-Emperors from Magi Circle by himself was extremely terrifying.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","All kinds of explosions sounded out as an unprecedented battle erupted. Everyone’s speed was very fast, and they disappeared from where they were in an instant. They even tore through space and used all kinds of methods to launch shocking attacks at the other party.","Bam!","A figure was sent flying out. A half-Emperor of Magi Circle was sent flying out of the high-speed battle. He spat out a mouthful of blood. In an instant, his physical body was torn apart, and his primordial spirit was shattered.","All of this was actually completed long ago. It was just that after he was blasted to death, he no longer had that kind of super speed, which was why his physical body collapsed.","Boom!","After another loud bang, another half-Emperor of Magi Circle was blasted out of the battle.","Immediately after, these half-Emperors of Magi Circle were blasted out of the super speed battle one after another. Each of them was punched in the chest, and their bodies were torn into pieces on the spot.","There was no doubt about the difference in strength between them and Chu Yunfan.","The difference between the strength of an ordinary seventh half-Emperor and an eighth half-Emperor was already very shocking, let alone the difference between their strength and Chu Yunfan’s.","The figures fighting in the sky became fewer and fewer, and the faintly visible figures also became fewer and fewer.","Spurt!","Another figure fell out and spat out a mouthful of blood. It was none other than Sun Scorch Magus.","Sun Scorch Magus’ eyes flashed with regret. He never expected that Chu Yunfan would become so strong in just a few years.","He was originally a low-level half-Emperor that he didn’t even care about, but now he could kill him with a single punch.","“I can’t accept this!” Sun Scorch Magus spat out another mouthful of blood. After a loud roar, his physical body was torn into pieces, and even his primordial spirit was shattered.","At this moment, there were only two figures left in the battlefield.","Other than Chu Yunfan, there was only the strongest half-Emperor in Magi Circle.","Magi Circle’s half-Emperor stared at Chu Yunfan. Seeing his companions being killed one by one, the anger in his heart became even more uncontrollable. He roared, “Chu Yunfan, do you only know how to run? Do you dare to fight me?”","Chu Yunfan kept dodging, but he didn’t fight him directly. Instead, he took the opportunity to kill all his companions.","In just a moment, they were all killed!","This made his anger explode instantly.","“Don’t worry, you’re the last one. It’s your turn!” Chu Yunfan was expressionless. Even though he was facing a powerful half-Emperor, his expression did not change at all.","“I’m going to kill you!” Magi Circle’s half-Emperor roared. Rays of light rushed out of his body, and the blood essence in his body surged out. His eyes were like two huge stars, releasing terrifying power.","Boom!","He moved, and a long saber appeared in his hand. This saber cut through the sky and shattered space. Even the space in the Evil Realm, which was more stable than the Ancient Realm, was shattered by his saber.","One could imagine how powerful his saber was.","The saber slashed down like a silver river, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","The powerful saber light shattered the nearby space.","The power of this saber was simply unstoppable!","Chu Yunfan’s reaction was even faster. He simply threw a punch.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, Chu Yunfan attacked. His fist directly hit the saber light.","Bam!","With a loud explosion, the area between the thumb and forefinger of Magi Circle’s half-Emperor first cracked open, and then his entire palm exploded.","The half-Emperor of Magi Circle was shocked and retreated. His right hand was almost blown into pieces and was covered in blood.","He had almost died at Chu Yunfan’s hands!","“Impossible! How can your strength be so powerful?!” Magi Circle’s half-Emperor roared."]},{"number":2497,"title":"Chapter 2497: Killing an Eighth Half-Emperor, Elements Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 2497: Killing an Eighth Half-Emperor, Elements Sect","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Magi Circle’s half-Emperor was stunned by Chu Yunfan’s strength!","He was already an old master of the eight half-Emperor Stage. Chu Yunfan had only appeared a few years ago, but now Chu Yunfan was able to match him. No, to be precise, Chu Yunfan was even stronger than him. What kind of strength was this? It was simply shocking.","He did not believe that such a thing could happen!","He was unwilling to believe that Chu Yunfan could be so powerful!","This was completely against his understanding!","“If you think it’s impossible, then you’re too narrow-minded!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","He felt that the current half-Emperor of Magi Circle was so laughable that it was like a joke.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was still gradually becoming stronger. After his breakthrough, he continued to absorb Origin Yang Pills.","This was something that he could not have done before because it was too extravagant.","But now, Chu Yunfan could easily increase his strength.","He was absorbing the Origin Yang Pills at all times, and his cultivation speed was at least ten thousand times faster than absorbing the spirit energy of heaven and earth.","Without such a method, even a half-Emperor wouldn’t be able to reach the Emperor Stage.","Opposite him, Magi Circle’s half-Emperor was still in a state of extreme shock.","His cultivation had already reached the peak, but Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was still increasing.","This was the most terrifying thing. One was constantly weakening, while the other was constantly getting stronger.","“No, this is impossible. A half-Emperor of Magi Circle can’t be defeated by someone in the same level. It’s impossible!” the eyes of Magi Circle’s half-Emperor flashed with killing intent as he roared angrily.","“Magi Circle’s half-Emperor? This is obviously a scam, and you’ve been deceived!” Chu Yunfan sneered, “At least you can’t beat me!”","Chu Yunfan’s strength was still increasing, but there was a hint of anxiety in his eyes. In the sky, the battle had entered a white-hot stage.","More and more experts broke through Evil Gods Creed’s defense line and appeared in the Evil Realm.","There wasn’t much time left for Chu Yunfan.","Opposite him, Magi Circle’s half-Emperor was also very anxious. He didn’t have much time left.","Because if this continued, Chu Yunfan’s strength would only get stronger and stronger. At that time, how would he defeat Chu Yunfan?","Even if he knew that as time passed, the probability of him getting reinforcements was very high, but the probability of him being killed by Chu Yunfan was even higher. He could not take the risk. He could not take this risk, so he had no choice.","“I’ll kill you!” the half-Emperor of Magi Circle roared.","He could not stand being looked down upon like this. He burned his lifespan and raised the limit of what he could achieve in the shortest amount of time.","His palm also recovered!","He had an invincible divine might and an invincible heart.","Every member of Magi Circle was an expert, especially the half-Emperors of Magi Circle. Each of them was stronger than the last.","Boom!","This time, he directly launched an attack with his fist. This punch pierced through the world and shattered the mountains. This punch was extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying. His aura completely suppressed this half-Emperor of Magi Circle. He attacked directly and punched out. The force of his fist shattered the sky.","This punch directly shattered everything about Magi Circle’s half-Emperor!","With just one punch, the victor was decided.","Even though this half-Emperor of Magi Circle had burned his lifespan and raised his strength to the peak, he still had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","His entire arm had been smashed into pieces.","Blood spurted out!","He was dejected. How could this be? He had lost in a battle of the same level. He had completely lost.","This was something that he had never thought of before. The pride of Magi Circle, the pride of being a half-Emperor, had actually been shattered in such a confrontation. He had failed.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was emitting immortal light. He looked like a living god.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, with his black hair draped over his shoulders, looked terrifying. He was like a demon god walking between heaven and earth.","“Who exactly are you? Impossible... It’s impossible for a figure like you to be born in the world!” Magi Circle’s half-Emperor was completely hysterical. He couldn’t believe it.","“You don’t have to know!” Chu Yunfan conjured his domain and instantly enveloped the half-Emperor of Magi Circle.","At the same time, Magi Circle’s half-Emperor also unleashed his domain, wanting to resist Chu Yunfan’s domain. However, he was no match for Chu Yunfan at all. His domain was crushed.","Blood sprayed out, emitting a crystalline light. It was no longer ordinary blood. It was all treasures, treasures born from the heavens.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s fist pierced through the sky like a spear. Then, his fist pierced through the chest of the half-Emperor of Magi Circle.","His heart was crushed by the punch.","Even the powerful half-Emperor of Magi Circle couldn’t withstand such injuries. His primordial spirit was shattered and he died on the spot!","Chu Yunfan let out a sigh of relief and collected the corpses of these half-Emperors. They were all very important nutrients.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan sensed the existence of the Brahma Tree.","However, at this moment, the Brahma Tree’s situation was very bad.","Because there was a powerful existence chasing after it...","The Brahma Tree was discovered by an expert. Even though the Brahma Tree had left the battlefield using the Earth Evasion Technique and was rushing toward Chu Yunfan, it was discovered by a powerful expert mid-way.","Through his connection with the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan discovered that it was a muscular middle-aged man.","Behind this middle-aged man, there were five pearls. These five pearls contained the power of the five elements, corresponding to metal, wood, water, fire, and earth.","This was the symbol of an expert of Elements Sect.","Elements Sect was a sect founded by the Emperor Elements. All the experts in the sect cultivated the great elements law.","Chu Yunfan had discovered the cultivation method of the great elements law from the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. First, one would cultivate one of the elements, and then one would deduce the other cultivation methods based on the principle of mutual promotion and restriction.","Finally, one would reach the supreme realm of combining the five elements.","So far, the only person who had truly achieved the great elements unification was Emperor Elements.","He was a terrifying existence who had truly fused the power of the five elements into one and turned them into chaos.","As for the other half-Emperors, they were just a breath away from turning into chaos."]},{"number":2498,"title":"Chapter 2498: Comparable to a Ninth Half-Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2498: Comparable to a Ninth Half-Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although it was just the last step, that last step was like the difference between heaven and earth. The final result was the difference between a half-Emperor and a true Emperor.","The difference was simply too great!","The half-Emperor of Elements Sect was at the ninth half-Emperor Stage!","It could be said that he had cultivated the great elements law to the extreme. He should be an existence second only to Emperor Elements in Elements Sect.","If not for the cultivation of the great elements law, he would not have been able to use the Brahma Tree.","As soon as he found the Brahma Tree, the half-Emperor of Elements Sect abandoned his opponent and chased after the tree.","Ordinary people might not know much about the wonders of the Brahma Tree, but all the half-Emperors knew about it.","No one would give up on a Brahma Tree so easily.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a somewhat anxious expression. The Brahma Tree was directly related to his subsequent arrangements. He could not afford to lose it.","“A Brahma Tree! Hahahaha, what a great fortune!” In the sky of the Evil Realm, the half-Emperor of Elements Sect laughed. He locked onto the Brahma Tree that was using the Earth Evasion and plunged into the ground.","He was also very good at earth-type spells. In terms of speed, he was not the slightest bit slower than the Brahma Tree earth sprite.","Elements Sect itself focused on the cultivation of the power of the five elements. Although he did not major in the laws of the earth element at the beginning, his research on the laws of the earth element was not bad at all.","In the end, if Elements Sect wanted to turn into chaos, they could not be biased. All the cultivation levels of the five elements were the same in order to achieve the balance of the five elements.","The balance of the five elements was the key to breaking through from the peak of the King Stage to the half-Emperor Stage.","From the balance of the five elements, he had to reunite the power of the five elements into one, and finally complete the Emperor path.","If he could obtain the Brahma Tree, there was no doubt that his understanding of the five elements would be greatly improved.","He was already at the ninth half-Emperor Stage. If he could improve further, he might be able to become the second Emperor in Elements Sect after Emperor Elements.","He kept chasing after the Brahma Tree and kept using earth attribute divine arts, trying to stop the Brahma Tree from advancing.","However, the speed of the Brahma Tree’s Earth Evasion was extremely fast. Every second, it traveled a million miles.","Its speed surpassed the speed of light!","Suddenly, at this moment, he sensed an aura rushing over at an astonishing speed not far away.","All of a sudden, he saw a large hand grabbing toward the ground. Its target was the Brahma Tree.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me!” The half-Emperor of Elements Sect sneered. With his cultivation, he was invincible in the world.","It could be said that other than the ten Emperors, he had no one to fear.","The five pearls on his back flew out and turned into a torrent, directly destroying the big hand.","However, taking advantage of this time, the Brahma Tree suddenly broke out of the ground and flew into the sky.","“Trying to escape?” The half-Emperor of Elements Sect sneered and immediately chased after the tree.","The metal law under his feet turned into a flying sword. The flying sword was extremely fast and swept across the sky in an instant.","Suddenly, he saw something that shocked him. The huge body of the Brahma Tree shrank and soon became the size of a human figure.","A figure broke through the void at lightning speed and then collided with the Brahma Tree.","The Brahma Tree disappeared without a trace in an instant, leaving only the black-robed young man in green.","“How dare you steal my things!” The half-Emperor of Elements Sect sneered.","This man was Divine Lord Flame, a well-known existence in Elements Sect and even in the whole world. No one could snatch something from him.","“Divine Lord Flame? So it’s you!”","After Chu Yunfan was stunned, he immediately remembered who Divine Lord Flame was. The latter was a top expert in Elements Sect, and his cultivation was so powerful that it was unimaginable.","According to the information distributed by Magi Circle, his strength could definitely rank in the top ten of Elements Sect.","It was just that they didn’t see him often. He was mostly in seclusion.","In the information distributed by Magi Circle, there was a special explanation that if one encountered an existence like Divine Lord Flame, they could immediately give up on any mission.","He was definitely one of the few top existences in the entire world.","Chu Yunfan did not expect to meet Divine Lord Flame here.","However, Chu Yunfan did not think too much about it because there was no time to think. While he was thinking, Divine Lord Flame had already pounced on him.","The terrifying aura, which was only a step away from becoming an Emperor, suddenly spread out and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","“Elements Palm!” Divine Lord Flame roared and attacked mercilessly.","He slapped out his palm, and the power of the five elements transformed into a five elements mountain.","The five elements mountain pressed down on Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, the sky was suppressed until it shattered. All kinds of terrifying phenomena evolved, looking extremely terrifying.","All kinds of lights boiled in an instant, directly slapping Chu Yunfan to death.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. His domain also burst forth. At the same time, he clenched his fist and punched toward the mountain.","Rumble!","The five-colored divine light formed by the five elements mountain and the terrifying torrent formed by the eight Heavenly Dragons collided in an instant.","It was hard to tell who was stronger!","Chu Yunfan and Divine Lord Flame’s attack came to a draw. Before Divine Lord Flame’s terrifying attack landed on Chu Yunfan, it was turned into nothingness by the Brahma Tree and directly digested.","At the same time, the eight gods transformed from the eight heavenly dragons that Chu Yunfan had blasted out were faintly flickering with the light of wood power. The emerald green color illuminated the heavens.","This was the Brahma Tree increasing Chu Yunfan’s strength in both attack and defense.","It allowed Chu Yunfan’s combat strength to surpass the eighth half-Emperor Stage and reach the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","“Damn it, how did your strength increase all of a sudden?” Divine Lord Flame was a little puzzled.","The aura that he had caught at the beginning told him that Chu Yunfan’s strength should only be at the eighth half-Emperor Stage.","Although it was a little tricky, it was just a little tricky.","However, when he fought Chu Yunfan, he realized that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was on par with his."]},{"number":2499,"title":"Chapter 2499: Emperor Evil Was Defeated and Devoured by the Other Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2499: Emperor Evil Was Defeated and Devoured by the Other Emperors","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was beyond his expectations. In his imagination, this was something that was impossible!","However, the impossible still happened!","Chu Yunfan’s strength instantly increased by a level!","However, at this level, his combat strength would increase by at least several times!","The most shocking thing was that he was able to compete with a ninth half-Emperor like him!","“It’s the Brahma Tree. You’ve merged with the Brahma Tree!” Divine Lord Flame reacted immediately as a burning and greedy look flashed across his eyes.","Chu Yunfan was only an eight half-Emperor. He could stand shoulder to shoulder with the Brahma Tree. If it was him, he might be able to fight with the Emperors.","He had already cultivated to his level. It would be a lie to say that he did not have any desire to reach the Emperor Stage.","That was simply impossible!","It could even be said to be an incomparable desire!","Although he was already one of the top ten figures in Elements Sect, he was no match for the true ruler of Elements Sect, Emperor Elements.","Emperor Elements could easily kill him with a slap.","He was not a match at all!","However, if he had the Brahma Tree, he would not be completely defeated in front of the Emperors.","At the very least, his combat strength would increase by a lot. He would go from being an ordinary existence in the ninth half-Emperor Stage to a true elite.","No matter what, there were too many benefits. He definitely could not let it go so easily!","At the thought of this, a terrifying killing intent flashed across his eyes.","In an instant, endless elemental divine light was released, filling this world.","The power of the five elements instantly transformed into an azure dragon that roamed the sky, a white tiger that pounced on the galaxy, a black tortoise that swam in the universe, a vermilion bird that was reborn in the flames, and the golden qilin that guarded the origin of all things.","The phenomena of these five divine beasts were all released in an instant!","These five divine beasts had already existed in the immemorial era before the antiquity era. They had long been existences at the Emperor level.","Each of them grasped a law and could be said to be an earth-shattering existence.","Emperor Elements referred to the laws of these five divine beasts and deduced the great elements law. He then relied on the great elements law to achieve Dao.","Now, the five divine beasts all flew toward Chu Yunfan in an instant.","The world was filled with the power of the five elements. All kinds of terrifying lights erupted, erupting with the most terrifying energy, causing the entire world to tremble.","Chu Yunfan punched out again and again. The fist force transformed into eight gods that guarded this world, preventing the five divine beasts from destroying the stability of this world.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared from where he was.","“Let’s go!” Chu Yunfan made a decision in an instant.","His strength was now comparable to that of Divine Lord Flame and was enough for him to stand shoulder to shoulder. They could even fight for decades without either showing any signs of defeat. But time was not on his side.","As time dragged on, the situation here would only attract more and more attention from the half-Emperors. There would definitely be some ninth half-Emperors among them.","Once they found out that he had the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan could completely imagine that he would be hunted down by a group of ninth half-Emperors.","There was no doubt about the value of the Brahma Tree. Even if it was not as valuable as the experts of Elements Sect, it was still of great use to other experts.","Chu Yunfan didn’t dare to stay.","“You want to leave? How is that possible?” Divine Lord Flame roared. The five divine beasts under his feet flew directly in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Chu Yunfan did not stop at all and quickly flew out of the Evil Realm.","At this moment, he no longer cared about the remaining wealth in the Evil Realm. He just wanted to leave this battlefield and find a place where there was no one to prepare to break through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","At that time, not only would he be able to easily dominate the ninth half-Emperor Stage, but he would also be able to fight against an Emperor.","Suddenly, at this moment, an incomparably loud roar came from the sky. An angry roar came from the hole that had been beaten out of chaos.","It was none other than Emperor Evil’s roar.","Emperor Evil roared!","“The four of you, just you wait. Don’t let me find an opportunity. Otherwise, I’ll kill you all!” Emperor Evil roared, but his voice grew softer and softer as his aura weakened.","Everyone sensed that Emperor Evil was escaping.","He actually managed to kill his way out of the hands of the four great experts.","However, many people saw through their divine will that although Emperor Evil had fought his way out, most of his body had been torn apart. To be more precise, only his head and half of his upper body had escaped. The rest of his body had been torn apart.","It could be said that he had paid a huge price to finally escape from the attacks of the four Emperors.","Basically, he had deliberately given up half of his body in exchange for that chance of survival.","Emperor Evil burned all his blood essence and tore a hole in the chaos before disappearing.","The four Emperors couldn’t catch up to Emperor Evil, so they had no choice but to give up on Emperor Evil and split up half of his body.","Chu Yunfan clearly saw the four Emperors opening their mouths and swallowing the half of Emperor Evil’s body.","After absorbing half of Emperor Evil’s body, Chu Yunfan could feel that the four Emperors had become younger.","To be precise, they had become younger. The somewhat aging aura on their body had been suppressed and they had actually recovered a little.","Although they had only recovered a small portion of their lifespan, it was still a very long period of time for Emperors with long lifespans.","‘I understand now!’ Chu Yunfan suddenly realized why the four Emperors had worked together to attack Emperor Evil.","It turned out that it wasn’t because of any personal grudge. It wasn’t even because of Evil Gods Creed, which Chu Yunfan seemed to be in high demand.","This kind of thing was not very meaningful to an Emperor. It was not even worth looking at.","What truly caught their attention was Emperor Evil himself!","They had devoured Emperor Evil’s Emperor essence to fight against aging!","Chu Yunfan instantly understood everything!","No wonder the four Emperors would attack together!","This was something that could not have happened in the antiquity era!"]},{"number":2500,"title":"Chapter 2500: The Evil Realm Collapses, Fleeing","paragraphs":["Chapter 2500: The Evil Realm Collapses, Fleeing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The lifespan of the Emperors was very long, but it was not truly longevity!","Even the Emperors would face the situation of dying of old age.","In ancient times, all kinds of methods to extend one’s lifespan were invented. Some used pills to extend one’s lifespan, some used divine arts to extend one’s lifespan, and some used devouring origin energy to extend one’s lifespan.","It was just that Emperors were too powerful, so powerful that it was useless if one did not have the same level of Emperor essence.","This was because the life essence of Emperors was already close to the level of laws. Ordinary flesh and blood creatures were meaningless to them.","To devour live longer, they had to devour the same level of Emperor essence!","However, in ancient times, this was simply impossible!","Firstly, it was because in ancient times, all Emperors were born in that era. They were relatively young. Other than a small number, most of them did not really face death. They could even rely on self-sealing to continuously extend their lifespan.","Moreover, there were too many Emperors in that era, and this kind of thing was too taboo.","If there were four Emperors hunting down one Emperor in ancient times, these four people might have to face the pursuit of forty Emperors.","It was useless to escape to the heavens or the earth!","Because no Emperor wanted to become someone else’s prey!","They had always been the hunters, and others were their prey. Now, someone was treating them as prey. With the pride of the Emperors, they would definitely not be able to tolerate it.","With the number of Emperors back then, it was easy to find ten times the number of Emperors to counterattack.","However, in this era, even if the other five Emperors collectively opposed it, they might not be able to do anything to the four Emperors.","The difference in numbers was not that obvious. There was already no one who could stop these Emperors!","That was why these Emperors had teamed up so strangely this time.","Chu Yunfan also realized that these Emperors had probably really entered their old age. Moreover, they might have truly felt the threat of death, which was why they were so unscrupulous in wanting to prolong their lives.","Clearly, the four Emperors had reaped a great harvest from this attack on Emperor Evil!","It could extend one’s lifespan for a long time!","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but sigh. For the sake of longevity, even the Emperors would risk their lives.","There was a great terror between life and death. No one could truly see through it. The so-called seeing through was just a choice that could only be made by self-deception.","This was because ordinary people did not have the chance to choose or struggle. They could only deceive themselves and choose to accept it.","But Emperors could struggle! They could risk their lives!","However, Chu Yunfan also knew that after this incident, the other Emperors would also go all out. There would probably be no more trust between them.","But now, all of this had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan. He was running for his life.","Behind him, Divine Lord Flame was chasing after him frantically. He had transformed into a ball of Divine Fire and was shuttling through space at an extremely fast speed, following closely behind.","“Stop him!” Divine Lord Flame roared. He was pleasantly surprised to find that in front of Chu Yunfan was an Elements Sect team.","This troop of Elements Sect was led by a half-Emperor.","After hearing Divine Lord Flame’s words, he instantly reacted and formed a large array in front of Chu Yunfan, trying to stop him from advancing.","However, how could this stop Chu Yunfan’s speed? Chu Yunfan grabbed at the void and a ball of lightning energy grabbed in his hand, turning into a long sword.","The long sword became thousands of feet long and instantly slashed down.","Boom!","A terrifying scene happened. The tens of thousands of Elements Sect troops, which were originally a huge area, blocked the sky endlessly.","However, it was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Blood mist filled the sky!","Tens of thousands of elite troops were killed along with the half-Emperor of Elements Sect.","They couldn’t even resist!","Chu Yunfan’s strength was far from theirs. Even that low-level half-Emperor was worlds apart from Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan formed a large hand of spirit energy and grabbed all the blood essence to water the Brahma Tree.","Chu Yunfan’s vision cleared and he sped up his escape from the Evil Realm.","Suddenly, he realized that the entire Evil Realm was collapsing inch by inch!","“The Evil Realm is collapsing?” Chu Yunfan was dumbfounded. This was the first time he had seen a world collapse.","Although it was only a small world, the collapse of the Evil Realm still made Chu Yunfan feel like it was the end of the world.","Cracks appeared in the world. The sky was like a broken mirror, densely covered in cracks.","Everyone was frantically fleeing for their lives, not daring to stay for even a moment.","At this time, the armies of the various large factions no longer had the mood to encircle and annihilate Evil Gods Creed’s army.","Whether it was Evil Gods Creed’s experts or the experts of the various factions, all of them were fleeing frantically.","The world was collapsing. This was different from a landslide and tsunami. The entire world was collapsing from the perspective of laws.","‘Emperor Evil probably won’t have a future even if he doesn’t die!’ Chu Yunfan immediately understood that the Evil Realm was a world evolved from Emperor Evil’s domain.","Basically, it depended on Emperor Evil to maintain it!","Now that the Evil Realm had collapsed, it meant that Emperor Evil didn’t have the power to maintain it.","Of course, it was also possible that Emperor Evil had lost the will to maintain the Evil Realm when he saw that it was about to fall to the head of the other major forces.","However, the resources and wealth in the Evil Realm would probably be completely destroyed. They would either be destroyed along with the collapse of the world or completely fall into chaos.","This was the wealth that Evil Gods Creed had accumulated over countless years. Chu Yunfan could not help but feel a little regretful!","However, he did not have the time to care about that. After he rushed out of the Evil Realm, Divine Lord Flame behind him was still chasing after him.","Behind him, the five divine beasts kept roaring at Chu Yunfan.","“Now that the Evil Realm has collapsed and your Elements Sect army is about to suffer heavy losses. You still want to chase me?” Chu Yunfan said.","When the Evil Realm collapsed, no one could resist the collapse of the world except for the experts above the half-Emperor Stage.","Unless they could escape, they would be torn apart on the spot. It was unknown how many people would die in the collapse of the Evil Realm.","“How many of those ants are dead or injured has nothing to do with me. Unless you hand over the Brahma Tree and obediently accept your death!” Divine Lord Flame sneered.","He did not care about the casualties of these ordinary elites and ordinary experts at all. He only had Chu Yunfan in his eyes.","Killing intent filled the air!"]}]);
